window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3301,"title":"Chapter 3301: Chapter 3300 The Weavings of the Omnifather! II","paragraphs":["Another Antediluvian Leviathan.","This one had their entire body seemingly raging with pure destiny and destiny alone as the level of power they radiated was terrifying!","Thereafter, more and more figures began to appear.","More Simians.","More humanoid Antediluvian Leviathans.","And then others of even grander varieties!","Noah saw the appearance of an entity burning with blue flames- their bodies reminiscent of a mythical phoenix.","In another direction, a long purple serpent with the head of a dragon appeared, clouds forming below it as it emanated Great mystique.","In another area, a humanoid entity with crimson skin and nine horns on his head appeared, devilish brilliance surging around him.","In another area, the bellow of a Whale like entity bloomed as more and more entities of different varieties came one after another!","But as Noah looked at all of them, he came to a single shocking conclusion.","Each one held extremely complex weavings.","Each one should have been an entity who had Transcended their weavings of existence!","He did not doubt that Imperium came into the white portal, and yet he was nowhere near.","He felt like he had arrived in an area filled with shockingly powerful giants, and the surprises only became more prominent as in one direction, he recognized the terrifying weavings of someone he had met before as when he looked over...","...!","The visage of Old Man Eudemus, who was looking around with extreme caution like all others, appeared.","Even he was cautious.","And how could he not be when in the surroundings, there were so many terrifying auras?","Most astonishing of all the auras here though, were those of the entities who were ten or twenty times larger than everyone else here.","The Antediluvian Leviathans.","Each one emanated much more potent waves of power as each one...only held a singular quality that represented them.","Some were wreathed in regal purple violet flames like the one Noah had met first.","Others were wreathed in crimson flames as they pulsed with waves of destruction!","Some...shone with the same color as the blue sea below them as they radiated pure Mana!","When Old Man Eudemus looked and saw these beings, his eyes lit up in shock as if he recognized them, and he was forced to become even more cautious.","Around him, Simians naturally recognized him and gathered.","They were the first arrivals, but it seemed many more would come.","In the midst of all of this contention and caution...","HUUM!","The endlessly empty skies above trembled as an intent formed in gold for all of them to interpret.","[After countless Eons, the Tresorverse of the Omnifather has opened to all those affiliated with Matter.]","...!","The Tresorverse of the Omnifather.","Not a Universe, Hyperverse, or Omniverse- but a Tresorverse!","This intent shone with grandiose golden grandeur in the skies as when it did appear, Noah noticed that on the bodies of the Antediluvian Leviathans, gazing of reverence and respect arose.","They knew of or had prior knowledge regarding this event or this Omnifather.","This was the conclusion Noah arrived at as now the main question was...what exactly did this Tresorverse of the Omnifather hold in store?","In the skies, silent waves radiated yet another intent for any who came here to grasp.","[The Tresorverse of the Omnifather is a Bridge that can take one from where they stand to merely a step away from the Wheel of Existence. Ascend the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, and you shall be prepared.]","...!","Ascend the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, and you shall be prepared?","Prepared for what exactly?","And what tree was this intent speaking of when all around, there was an endless expanse of sea and skies?","As Noah thought of this, he couldn't help but remember the weavings of the entity known as Bob who led him to the Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the gains he had made there.","Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree. Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","What connection lay there, if any?","There were too many questions to try and grasp what was going on, but before any answers could be made clear...","BOOOM!","The skies above cracked and splintered.","Heavy waves of haki and complex vibrations of existence cascaded down from the shattered skies- multicolored radiance shining down as there...across all of these endlessly vast breaking skies...were the roots.","Roots of a tree.","They shone with multicolored radiance as multiple roots stretched out, each one having no end as they stretched out across the breaking sky while the trunk they were connected to ascended upwards to the extent that they couldn't even see its end.","The Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence!","The mere appearance of this tree caused Noah's existence to tremble with greed- a shocking pull extending itself to him as his very being felt like it was screaming for him to jump on the roots of this tree and climb up!","A tree that could take one a step away from the Wheel of Existence.","Something laid out by the Omnifather! But who even was this being?!","|By the grace of the Omnifather...|","In the midst of the shock and stupor of many, the Antediluvian Leviathans exploded with terrifying waves of power as their bodies began to rise towards the shattered skies.","The one who had spoken to Noah initially was surrounded by unfathomably potent tendrils of Entropy as he turned into a lightning bolt that shot up.","These entities knew far more than them as seeing them shoot upwards, all others scrambled as they felt like they would be missing something tremendous if they didn't do so!","Even Noah's weavings of existence were buzzing as he stepped off the blue waters he was on, his figure also shooting up towards the skies amidst this flood of extremely powerful entities!","At the same time.","Within Omniverse X-999.","SAA!","Around the square white portal, waves of mass teleportations echoed out as the figure of Imperium, who seemed to be in a stupor, woke up and turned towards them.","There, he saw another one of Noah's bodies as around him, a few hundred figures followed!","Closest to him were Henry, Barbatos, Adelaide, Sona, and many others.","The figures of Dr. Hall, Lilith, Erickson, and even more renowned entities of the Infinite Omniverse were there!","Without so much as a delay, Noah's bright eyes flung his hand forward as if he were in a hurry.","\"Go!\"","...!","Imperium did not stop them. He couldn't stop them.","He still seemed to be adapting to a great level of shock as he turned towards Noah's figure while his people surged towards the square white portal.","|Are you in the same place?|","Was he in the same place as Imperium.","Someone who had yet to Transcend their existence.","The answer was no as Noah wondered...where would those who have not transcended their existence be sent?!","This was just one among far too many questions.","The main one that remained in Noah's mind...was who the fuck was the Omnifather?!"]},{"number":3302,"title":"Chapter 3302: Chapter 3301 The Weavings of the Omnifather! III","paragraphs":["A great deal of questions, and yet no viable answers!","It meant that they had to be unearthed for themselves as Noah went ahead to do just this.","He sent his people into the square white portal as his will lay within all of them.","It coursed through their blood.","At this moment, the Blood of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer burned within his son as whatever Henry could see...so could he!","A distortion of weavings of existence later, his son and others very quickly came to as they opened their eyes.","And all around them... were incandescent, sparkling, cerulean waves of water.","They were underwater entirely, but everything was extremely lit up and clear as these waters did not show an end in sight!","Around them, figures of entities from a variety of races and lineages stood, with Humans, Simians, Antediluvian Leviathans, and Draconic Entities making up the vast majority. All of them ranged within the Existential Dominium Realm...all the way to the Omniversal Realm.","But undoubtedly, nobody within these waters had Transcended their own weavings of existence.","In here, Noah's will located Imperium who was gazing above at dazzling golden words that shone brilliantly above the surrounding waters.","[After countless Eons, the Tresorverse of the Omnifather has opened to all those affiliated with Matter.]","[The Tresorverse of the Omnifather is a Bridge that can take one from where they stand to merely a step away from the Wheel of Existence. Wade across the Tresorverse Primalwater used to nurture the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, and you will gain the capability to ascend the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence itself.]","...!","The words were only slightly different from the ones that appeared within the part of the Tresorverse of the Omnifather that Noah and other powerful entities appeared in.","The Primalwater utilized to nurture the Primaltree of Existence itself!","Just by standing within these waters, Noah could feel the blood within his son and others begin to burn with activity.","Their existence passively began to increase in complexity while their Extremes surged with ever greater intensity.","And in the midst of all of this...","BOOM!","A commotion broke out below as heavy weavings of combat echoed out.","When they looked below, the extremely clear waters showed sparse globules of radiant light that were stretched out across the distant waters, and an Antediluvian Leviathan that was much smaller than those Noah had come across could be seen holding a Royal Existential Omniversal Simian in his hands.","The body of this Antediluvian Leviathan was humanoid and simmering with dazzling tendrils of blue lightning, his very skin crackling with waves of lightning as the shattered golden wheel that had initially attacked him lay broken!","The Omniversal Stage Simian within his hands struggled with terror as never in his life would he have believed that his power- the System of Existence of Kuklos, would fail against mere Lightning.","But this lightning seemed to carry such unfathomable complexity that it even overcame the weavings of his Wheel, and at this moment...","|Spare-|","BOOM!","A clap of thunder and lightning boomed out as the hand of the Antediluvian Leviathan closed fully.","The Fabled Omniverse of the Simian was scorched by trillions of complex lightning bolts that seemed to carry their own omniversal authority- the faint makeup of an illusory omniverse made of pure blue lightning briefly flashing on the Antediluvian Leviathan as he turned his eyes back on the globe of radiant light before him- grasping it and bringing it to his mouth right away!","...!","The globe was devoured entirely as moments later, the power of this Antediluvian Leviathan began to rise up with shocking speed, their existence becoming increasingly complex.","This...","All those who watched this scene instantly looked towards the distant globes within this sea below them with boundless greed, their bodies shooting out in different directions as chaos ensued!","|Move together, and steer clear of others!|","Henry's intent echoed out commandingly as the entities of the Infinite Omniverse moved as a singular group, delving into the waters below as around them, more and more figures were teleported in!","They were among the weakest.","Most of them weren't even at the Autarchical Stage!","And here, they had just seen an Omniversal Stage Entity perish.","In an area of shocking mystery, a mad scramble began as very few actually knew what was happening!","—","In a Sector unmapped by the Cartographer of Existence.","A white robed man sat calmly as hundreds of Omniverses had stably stopped spinning, and there were floating like dazzling stars around him as his gaze was that of utmost calmness.","\"The Omnifather spoke of the methods of the Great Beyonder that were invoked early and allowed the Morphons to advance greatly over the past cycles. Over all these Cycles, the mechanisms he put in space have collected and concentrated great deals of wonder from the Expanse in one place...but will it be enough? Neither the Great Beyonder nor the Omnifather knew what that Entity from the Megalos Nihilos had planned...\"","...!","The mechanisms that the Omnifather had put in place for eons!","They had been harvesting and concentrating countless unknown wonders by means that even this entity did not understand.","He only followed the weavings of the Omnifather to trigger everything when the time was ready.","When the Wheel made a certain turn.","As for what results would come from it all...","\"Will it be enough?\"","With hundreds of Omniverses filled with ancient Antediluvian Leviathans and other Lineages calmly floating around him, this entity turned his head up and gazed at the endless dark waves of the Megalos Ynnere.","His gaze carried ancientness. His gaze carried interminable power and complexity.","His gaze carried longing.","His gaze carried a yearning as he thought of the Omnifather.","Why did he not take me, he wanted to ask.","Why allow things to play out this way?","He had many questions too, but he would follow the Will of the Omnifather regardless.","For he was the Watchman of the Megalos Ynnere.","And his purpose was a heavy, heavy ordeal!"]},{"number":3303,"title":"Chapter 3303: Chapter 3302 The Weavings of the Omnifather! IV","paragraphs":["Past the square white portals.","Within the Tresorverse of the Omnifather.","The moment that the terrifying Entities across the myriad of Omniverses shot towards the skies like twinkling stars, they came to land on the roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence as an undeniable force crushed down from above that prevented them from rising any further!","They had to go through the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence itself.","Old Man Eudemus landed on the roots of this massive tree that seemed to be tens of times larger than any Omniverse, the roots alone occupying everything they could see along with the multicolored trunk.","He landed on a golden-colored root, and the moment he did so, he felt unique changes that caused his eyes to shine brightly.","He felt his authority slowly begin to be used up as it felt like...it was being challenged.","As if his weavings of Existence themselves were being challenged constantly, and only if he proved himself and what his weavings stood for could he move forward!","He took a step forward, and his gaze became even more astonished.","He had seen a great number of things within the Expanse over the years, even as many of his bodies within had gotten destroyed by terrifying oddities.","But he had never come across something like this.","|The Roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence challenge your weavings of existence constantly. To keep moving, a constant flow of your weavings have to be released as they are broken down naturally, and then small wisps are returned to you as they actually hold slightly greater waves of complexity! Just walking across the roots of this tree will require a great deal of effort and usage of authority, but this alone will elevate your weavings of existence!|","...!","He passed this intent to the Protectors following behind him who landed one by one.","His other body within the Omniverse of the Protectors outside of this place was also notifying the Sword of the Commonwealth and the Viceroy!","|Conserve your authority as you move. You will likely be knocked out the moment your reserves of authority can no longer keep up, and the natural drain of your weavings of existence will likely increase the higher up you go. Proceed carefully...|","The intent of Old Man Eudemus echoed out in the minds of the Protectors as moments later...","|But sir...look at them...| An Omniversal Stage Simian gritting his teeth while pointing a mile or two away from them where the titanic figure of a verdant Antediluvian Leviathan could be seen.","He was taking steady steps as tendrils of green light emanating nothing but Life flowed from him and into the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, and every time he lifted his foot...even purer waves of verdant light returned to him as by simply walking up steadily, his power seemed to be rising.","His complexity seemed to be increasing!","Old Man Eudemus shook his head at this as he replied.","|Focus on yourselves first. This ordeal only makes it more paramount to have purity of existence. A singular Ordinance to define oneself. Those Entities...we faced them briefly during the founding of the Commonwealth as they are some of the purest existences in terms of weavings they follow. Even what we follow is still outside of us, but they....|","What they followed was outside of them.","The Wheel of Existence.","It was grandiose.","It was unfathomable.","It was a pure source for them to follow as they built up a wheel within their own existence, but in terms of purity...","It could not beat the existence of something that defined and lived by weavings Innate to themselves.","|That one there strictly follows the weavings of Life and nothing else. The complexity of his weavings of Life alone can decimate and overpower your weavings of Kuklos as their whole body has been structured and reforged under Life to the utmost extreme. If he has attained the Third State of Existence...his power would be something even I would have to be careful about contending with. Ah, let us not worry about others who may forge ahead. Focus on controlling the usage of your weavings of existence first. Those who rush ahead and come to realize how more and more weavings will be required from them will be knocked out the quickest. And we don't know if we can even get back on these roots if we are knocked out. This...will be an ordeal to manage one's weavings of existence while elevating their complexity steadily. After all, nobody's weavings are infinite.|","...!","His words were akin to cardinal laws as the Protectors nodded sternly while moving forward.","Within their existence, golden wheels spun as their weavings became slightly more potent with every step, but more of the reserves of their authorities were also fading away!","They would have to adapt to their increasing complexity and even likely rest to recover their authority as they proceeded forward.","But already, their hearts pulsed with joy at the advancement their Weavings of Existence were feeling.","They had to go higher on this Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, and they had to get the wonders on it before others could!","Such feelings abundantly rose in the minds of many as their numbers within this place only increased.","But the roots of the massive tree were far too massive and far too many.","Those who knew each other grouped up, those who didn't spread out to seek their own opportunity.","In another part of the golden colored root that covered most of the skies nearby, and the one most entities got on quickly.","The figure of Noah could be seen standing still on the surface of the massive tree root, his figure leaning down and touching its surface as he found that the Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence could not flow into these roots!","It seemed to seek a singular, pure authority as the one from any of his Systems of Existence flowed down and allowed him to come to a conclusion on a few things."]},{"number":3304,"title":"Chapter 3304: Chapter 3303 Terrific! I","paragraphs":["The conclusions Noah came to were many as they were broken down by his System.","|Authority of a single Source will naturally be drawn out from one's body and into the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.|","|A hundredth of the same authority will be returned into one's body, with its complexity being higher than before as it can naturally aid in the elevation of the complexity of one's existence after it has been assimilated back in.|","|Any movement made while on the Tresorverse Primaltree will drain even more waves of authority, with the higher up one goes increasing the output of the drain.|","|One can actively increase the output of authority being increased at any time, which will increase the respective Elevated Authority that is returned.|","|The purer the released authority, the purer and more potent the returned Elevated Authority.|","|Beginning tests of releasing an output of pure, single concepts by themselves.|","...!","He was releasing the authority of his First System of Existence that contained all of his concepts, and he had even tested out the release of the Authority of Kuklos and Ingeniare!","But the output of a pure, single source seemed to be paramount as at this moment, Noah tried Quintessence.","HUUM!","The output of Quintessence caused vibrant colorless light to sink into the golden surface of the root he was on, and the reaction was even more potent as the returned elevated authority was also purer.","What was returned was even more complex as Noah's Quintessential Fabled Omniverse radiated an even grander luster.","Purer, single sources of authority gave back even more complex boons of existence!","\"The purity of existence is what keeps the wheel turning...\"","Noah spoke such words as his figure rose up from its kneeling position.","He looked ahead at the massive figures of Antediluvian Leviathans who were painted with a singular light of extremity.","A single definition of their existence!","The purple violet Leviathan had already pulled ahead greatly as everytime his foot arose from the root to step ahead, extremely complex weavings of Entropy returned to him.","The higher one rose, the more their authority would be used, the more complexity of existence they could gain back.","At a certain point, it would likely become very hard to take even a single step as this would require immense reserves of authority.","At the end of the day, everything would come down to how complex and potent one's authority was...and its reserves.","Its reserves.","Since...nobody had limitless reserves of their authority.","\"...\"","As he thought of this, an utterly devilish smile began to form on Noah's face.","Devilish.","Incandescent!","Quintessential!","|Cheats rises with anticipation.|","|Loot burns with anticipation.|","|Protagonist looks towards a certain direction.|","|Relativity looks towards a certain direction.|","|Quintessence looks towards a certain direction.|","They all gazed towards one place.","Towards one weaving!","It was unfathomably blue, and it radiated waves of authority that seemed endless.","All eyes looked towards Mana.","All eyes went towards Infinity.","All eyes went towards Manadynamics.","Dead paths.","Impossible paths to traverse to the ends of- and difficult to even bring to Extremity!","HUUM!","Noah stood on the golden roots and stared at the terrifying entities around and ahead of him.","There were vast stretches of distances, but all of these Entities had likely explored the Expanse far longer than him since they had transcended their weavings of existence many years ago.","Their states of Existence were likely more advanced than his!","Their complexity...was definitely much greater than his.","The Protectors of the Commonwealth fit this bracket, but the Antediluvian Leviathans were even more terrifying.","He had never heard of them before, but the behavior of Old Man Eudemus and other Protectors showed that they knew of them- and they even gazed towards them with scrutiny and tension!","It was another force across these Omniverses- something utterly unfathomable that even the Commonwealth feared.","Most of the entities here were more complex than he was, but he had a single thing that none of them could claim!","Something he had built up since he was absolutely nobody and cemented as a fact truly without a shadow of a doubt.","He had...","\"Mana.\"","He called out lightly.","HUUM!","His feet pulsed as they gushed out seas of Mana.","Between him and the connected golden root below, a glow of serene blue bloomed!","The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Infinity and Manadynamics flowed out ceaselessly as they carried with them the singular weaving of Mana!","At this moment, Noah chose the single, pure aspect of the Infinity of Mana.","One of the purest authorities there could be in existence as this type of authority was interchangeable with all other authorities.","After all, energy was neither created nor destroyed, only transformed into a different form- with this more closely aligning with Manadynamics than Infinity.","And one of the most basal forms of energy was...Mana!","BOOM!","The moment his feet began to unleash waves of mana, all of them were soaked into the golden surface of the root as if it were an endless desert, and thereafter- even more complex tendrils of mana were returned to him.","A shade of blue darker.","Its potency and complexity were a few times greater.","Within the First Mundi of Power, Quintessence was the single largest body as it was many times greater in size, and had even forged its Quintessential Fabled Omniverse.","At this moment, Infinity began to bubble with activity as its conceptual body began to expand rapidly- devouring the more complex weavings of Mana that were being returned as a terrifying process began!","Alongside it, even though it didn't take center focus, Manadynamics still played a truly critical component as it also rose alongside the returned complex weavings of Mana.","Time felt like it was moving in slow motion.","All across this golden root that took nearly all the immediate skies above them and on far away distant roots carrying other colors, powerful entities had already figured out how the weavings of the Roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence worked as they steadily walked upwards.","With every passing second, their bodies emanated slightly more powerful waves of complexity.","If they could have numbers shown above their heads, they would show additions of hundreds and thousands constantly to the values of their Echelons of Existence!","But the one singular reality that remained was that every single one...walked up steadily!"]},{"number":3305,"title":"Chapter 3305: Chapter 3304 Terrific! II","paragraphs":["The vast array of entities were walking across the roots steadily.","One man had been still this whole time as at this moment, as waves of endless blue light gushed below his feet, his body got into a sprinting stance as he breathed out.","His eyes flashed with cerulean radiance.","On his back, a pair of wings unfolded as even they began to buzz with gorgeous blue radiance!","On his face, a devilish smile was fully unfolded as this being knew...he was about to fuck a lot of shit up!","Across the roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","Those with terrifying waves of Complexity were faster, their strides longer as they had already pulled far ahead.","At all times, their auras and wills were spread out across the surroundings as they also monitored other Entities around them!","There were too many entities here, each with unknown levels of power.","So far, no clashes of conflict or battles had bloomed, and everyone was watching closely.","They were watching each other and their surroundings even more as they also sought to figure out the mysteries of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","Any oddity would be sensed by those nearby.","And at this moment, an oddity bloomed.","Having been still this whole time, a man whose body now pulsed all around with waves of blue brilliance did not simply take a step forward.","He didn't walk.","He didn't run.","He sprinted!","PAH!","The sound was akin to a clap of thunder that drew in many observant wills that were already looking at the surroundings.","But when they honed in on the source of the sound, they didn't see anything there but a glimmer of blue light!","A light that, when followed, allowed them to finally see a figure sprinting across the surface of a golden root at full speed.","With every step taken, more and more authority would be drained from one's existence.","And the further up they went, the greater concentrations of authority that would be drawn out!","To sprint like this, one would have to brazenly be releasing their authority without any reservation as likely, within a matter of seconds, they would be spent!","It was an alarming scene to see, but these extremely powerful beings weren't dazed by it as some even shook their heads.","They looked towards this entity wrapped by tendrils of blue light as a momentary showoff.","One that in the next few seconds would be entirely drained of their reserves of usable existence as after that...well, at least they would be able to observe what would happen on the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence when one no longer had any weavings of existence to be drained!","One that in the next few seconds would be entirely drained of their reserves of usable existence as after that...well, at least they would be able to observe what would happen on the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence when one no longer had any weavings of existence to be drained!","So many wills still remained observing the sprinting figure that was irresponsibly releasing their authority.","Around his body, due to him unleashing such reckless waves of his weavings, he got back equally more condensed and more complex waves of existence as he accepted them all rapidly.","Pure, compressed, and intricately complex waves of mana returned as for the most part, they flowed back into Infinity.","A large part also flowed into Manadynamics itself as two cerulean bodies expanded rapidly!","In the span of a few seconds...this rapid expansion stopped as it began to be compressed into an infinitely small point.","A point that was filled with countless spinning Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrinos!","|Countless records are converging under Infinity.|","|Countless records are converging under Manadynamics.|","It was too quick.","The waves of complexity being returned were too potent and endlessly vast in volume!","They allowed for a terrifyingly rapid process to unfold as in a matter of seconds, countless fundamental particles were condensed into a single point!","And from this single point...","|A Quintus Core of Existence has been successfully formed.|","|The Basis of the Infinity Fabled Omniverse has been stabilized.|","|A Quintus Core of Existence has been successfully formed.|","|The Basis of the Manadynamics Fabled Omniverse has been stabilized.|","...!","From the Cores, an explosive wave of blue erupted out as alongside it, the illusory flames of two circular Fabled Omniverses circled around Noah!","|The Second Fabled Omniverse within the Conceptual System of Existence is blooming.|","|The Third Fabled Omniverse within the Conceptual System of Existence is blooming.|","Simultaneously, two Fabled Omniverses bloomed as the raging waves of mana around Noah became that much more potent!","His sprinting figure looked encased with circular waves of mana as the moment they formed, they sank into the golden floor of the root he was on.","And even more potent waves of Mana were returned in a maddening cycle as while Noah went further up the root where even more reserves of authority were required, he gave it even more.","Instead of his figure slowing down, he actually accelerated!","SAA! Like a flash of cerulean lightning.","He passed Entities who had glorious Eyes of Existence shining above them as they moved upwards rapidly.","He was catching up to the distant shadows of terrifyingly powerful Antediluvian Leviathans!","Those observing and waiting for his eventual slowdown and burnoff had their gazes change finally as their weavings became hurried.","Due to the actions of this being, a number of powerful entities began to radiate even more reserves of their weavings of existence as they took large strides forward!","Unknown secrets lay ahead in this Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","They couldn't fall behind!","Noah's single action caused a change in those nearby as it was akin to a chain reaction.","As more entities began to take faster strides forward, others followed.","As if it were a race as nobody knew what lay ahead, but they wanted to be first!","The one who had spurred this whole action continued forward as his devilish smile only became more pronounced, his flashing figure landing in the eyes of many as on a distant root...an Antediluvian Leviathan turned his head towards him.","This Antediluvian Leviathan was crackling with blue lightning all over his titanic body, his skin also painted with a cerulean hue along with all other parts of his body!","Around him, extremely pure Manna surged with wild abandon.","Manna.","Another variation of the same thing- Mana!","This being's entire existence was based on this as at this moment, its eyes shone brightly while gazing at Noah.","Its mouth opened as it voiced out silently.","And in the next moment, on the root Noah was on, the far ahead figure of the entity wreathed in violet purple flames of Entropy turned around and locked onto Noah's figure that was rapidly approaching his current position!"]},{"number":3306,"title":"Chapter 3306: Chapter 3305 Terrific! III","paragraphs":["An entity burning with glorious Entropy.","He had spoken to Noah once before as after being prompted by another Antediluvian Leviathan in the far distance, this being sent his intent towards Noah's figure that was blazing across the golden root and getting ever closer to his current position!","|Why are you in such a hurry with such pure weavings of Existence, young friend? Pace yourself, and you will enjoy the grace of the Omnifather even more.|","...!","The intent was extremely quick.","At this stage of power, entire conversations could take place within the span of an instant as the exchange of thoughts was that quick.","In this span of an instant, Noah's currently burning blue eyes glanced up towards this being and smiled.","|I know nothing of the grace of the Omnifather, so I must struggle and hurry ahead to understand. Are you able to tell me what we can expect ahead?|","The Antediluvian Leviathans!","Entities who seemed to know about the owner of this Tresorverse as they moved with terrifying power and calmness- and a level of fervent light Noah had only seen among Morphons when they spoke of the Great Beyonder.","The entity burning with Entropy chuckled at Noah's words as his strides pulled ever further ahead as he replied.","|I know a little. I reach out to you because the purity of your mana has resonated with a brother of mine a distance from here. He is sentimental of those similar to us in purity as he has asked me to look out for you. Pacing yourself is one such advice as if you are drained and can no longer interact with the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence with your weavings of existence, you will lose all your progress.|","...!","When the constant drain of authority could not be met, one could no longer stand on the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence as they would fall off.","The Antediluvian Leviathan brimming with Entropy said such things as Noah nodded towards this being and smiled.","|Thanks for the heads up, Brother Leviathan. And give my thanks to the other Brother Leviathan as well. Say, what is your name? You can refer to me as Engineer Osmont.|","He was holding this conversation seamlessly without stopping as an instant passed, and...","SAA!","He continued surging forward with what seemed to be incrementally increasing speed and even more output of his weavings of Existence as he never stopped!","Around him, the illusion of two blue Fabled Omniverses bloomed as they looked like two clear cerulean boundaries.","But with the passage of time, these boundaries seemed to gain more and more lines of weavings as they became more intricate.","More complex.","It was the product of the much more complex weavings of authority returning to Noah!","|The Infinity Fabled Omniverse and Manadynamics Fabled Omniverse are growing with exponential complexity.|","This prompt flashed wondrously as Nkah didn't hold back.","He continued forward like a bolt of lightning as by the time that the Antediluvian Leviathans burning with Entropy replied to him...Noah was a few miles away from this titanic entity!","This entity who gazed at Noah inexplicably as he replied.","|I come from the Primal Family of Epimetheus- I am Arguros. Engineer Osmont, I do not think you are stupid, but you do not seem to be heeding my advice even a little.|","...!","Arguros.","His words carried majesty and intrigue as they emanated out.","By the time the words of Arguros finished, Noah had shockingly come to be beside him.","Side by side with the terrifying titan whose strides alone covered tremendous distance, and calm waves of Entropy steadily left him while even more complex ones returned to him!","The scene of Noah being right next to Arguros astonished those who were keeping an eye on him due to his flashy movements, many changing their gazes from ones that were looking at a fool to ones that were looking at another possible powerful contender.","Above Arguros, they could see the illusion of an utterly radiant purple violet Eye of Existence that seemed to be discerning everything and allowing for wondrous interactions of existence.","But above Noah's figure...they didn't see any such thing as it either meant he was someone weak who had not even reached the State of Eye of Existence, or he didn't feel the need to utilize it now even as he wildly let his authority out!","The former possibility didn't make sense, and the latter seemed even more off.","Many kept their gazes on the leading figures of Noah and Arguros as they also expended more of their authority to pull forward faster.","Standing side by side with the giant, Noah felt the glimpses of Entropy closely from this being as he nodded towards him.","|It is not that I am ignoring your words, Brother Arguros, but that I am confident in what I am doing. I am very curious about the Antediluvian Leviathans though. Your connection to the Omnifather...and even who the Omnifather is.|","He effortlessly held the conversation as he kept pace with this leading titan!","Arguros turned his head down towards the figure beside him that looked like a small blue point of light compared to him who was a blinding violet purple sun, his flaming brows rising with even greater intrigue as he opened his mouth and gushed out tendrils of Entropy.","|We existed long before others. We were there to witness the glory of the Omnifather as he collected hundreds of Omniverses and ushered in an era of prosperity. The Antediluvian Leviathans...are composed of four Primal Families that have been secluded since the Omnifather left us. The time for our seclusion to end was when the weavings of the Omnifather began to spin again, and they have. And so, here we are following his weavings once more. For us, traversing this Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence is an honor. Our existence was meant to thrive on it.|","...!","Their existence was meant to thrive on the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence!"]},{"number":3307,"title":"Chapter 3307: Chapter 3306 Terrific! IV","paragraphs":["|Your existence...it is Entropy, is it not? All parts of you are aligned with this?|","Hearing the words of Arguros, Noah asked thoughtfully as he also digested the idea of Antediluvian Leviathans and four Primal Families.","|Entropy...|","Arguros raised his hand and let out a rare smile towards Noah for knowing the identity of his weavings.","His levels of power were unfathomable as he looked like an elder passing down his knowledge to the next generation.","Yet...his strides were getting a little faster as he found that Noah's figure continued to increase in speed!","|I am Entropy. I live and breathe Entropy. My thoughts, records, and very existence are only held together by endless disorder. Only after you leave everything else behind and let the flow of Entropy take over...can you truly understand it.|","His booming voice filled with regality echoed out as Noah's eyes turned into crescent smiles.","|Entropy, huh?|","Brilliance flashed in his eyes.","The pure, blue mana that coursed to make the Manadynamics Fabled Omniverse began to pulse uniquely as soon enough, it began to change color.","|The weavings of the existence of Manadynamics have reached a critical level.|","|Many more possibilities are now inevitabilities.|","...!","The blue mana burned.","Mana could neither be created nor destroyed.","It could only be transformed.","At this moment...","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Cheats begins to sound the drums of war.|","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of the Protagonist says to be ready!|","The purer blue mana began to change.","As if the very fundamental makeup of these endless waves of energy were something else to begin with.","A violet purple hue began to shine below Noah's feet as instead of the endless sea of blue gushing below him...pristine waves of Entropy began to gush out instead.","A seamless transformation.","As if it was always the authority of Entropy to begin with!","BOOM!","Seas of Entropy fervor gushed down from Noah as in the next moment, even more complex waves of Entropy returned to him from the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence as the small body of Entropy within his First Mundi of Power...instantly began to explode in size and complexity!","|Brother Arguros, how does my Entropy compare in terms of purity?|","He seemed to be asking purely out of curiosity.","Besides Noah, Arguros became stern at such a scene as the flames of Entropy around him burned with even greater brilliance.","| The purity of a single Source is critical- and the reason why the Antediluvian Leviathans can be so powerful. We follow the edicts of the Omnifather as he advised one to focus all their weavings on a single Source. Only through this path can one have the straightest shot toward the utmost complexity. But if there are too many sources...the level of complexity required will be forever out of reach as one may find themselves never reaching a certain height of Existence even after eons passed. While following a single pure source, you will attain oneness with Existence faster. Open your Eye of Existence faster...and even have a pathway to establish your Ordinance with more ease.|","...!","Purity.","Purity in the focus of only a single Source of Existence!","Noah smiled at such a reply as his figure was entirely encased in a chaotic violet purple light at this moment, the hues of the blue Fabled Omniverses still remaining as at this moment, he looked like a miniature version of the titan beside him.","|Mana is the ultimate form of energy. The ultimate source of energy. Naturally, it can become other forms and sources of energy. Is this not still pure, Brother Arguros? This Entropy...can be seen as Mana in a different form.|","...!","He radiated an intensity that caused the ancient eyes of Arguros to pulse with an interminable light.","At the same time, within his First Mundi of Power, great changes continued!","|Countless records are converging under Entropy.|","An expanding singularity became condensed rapidly.","So rapid that in a short instant, a Quintus Core of Existence was formed, and from this core...","|The Basis of the Fabled Omniverse of Entropy has been stabilized.|","|The Fourth Fabled Omniverse within the Conceptual System of Existence is blooming.|","First, it was Quintessence.","Infinity and Manadynamics followed as the fourth came out to be Entropy!","And his figure...continued to get ever faster as at this moment, his figure pulled slightly ahead of Arguros who gazed at him while replying to his question regarding the source of mana and its transformation into other forms of authority.","|That is too difficult to do, Engineer Osmont. It is feasible to transform the most fundamental source of existence into other forms, but the cost of this cannot be so easily covered. For anyone to grasp onto such weavings, they would need things that only the greatest among us can attain. Qualities present in beings who moved within the era of the Omnifather...or even in the distant lands of the Megalos Beyond, those who moved with the Great Beyonder.|","A clear rebuttal from the Antediluvian Leviathan.","He stated that a terrifying quality that nobody could easily grasp was a prerequisite to even thinking about successfully doing what Noah proposed.","And yet Noah knew he held this along with much more.","The seas of Mana within him continued to surge out even more as they transformed into Entropy, and a violet-purple outline of Fabled Omniverse bloomed.","With bright eyes, he released a shocking statement as he...pulled ahead of the Antediluvian Leviathan.","|Brother Arguros...what if I have such a profound quality that makes the impossible a reality?|","SAA!","His figure was visibly ahead.","It was a scene that caused alarm in many of those observing as Arguros himself stared sternly at Noah's figure!","He didn't reply as he seemed to be thinking of many things, but ultimately...his body began to leak out a maddening amount of disorder.","He looked at the distance Noah was creating as he pulled ahead, and this Antediluvian Leviathan blinked with ancientness.","As if he could allow a junior of his to pull ahead.","HUUUM!","Swirling violet purple flames gathered as if trillions of singularities pulled upon them.","Above Arguros, a banner manifested and began to burn bright.","It was a banner that held a rune burning with the grandiosity that read...ENTROPY.","It was...an Ordinance of Entropy.","Slightly ahead, Noah felt his weavings of Entropy pulsing in resonance as he was about to turn around to gaze at Arguros, but his gaze couldn't do it all the way.","Because in the next moment...","SAA!","A bolt of violet purple light passed him and forged ahead with unfathomable speed!","Atop this flash, a glorious banner was unfolding- one that nobody could deny!"]},{"number":3308,"title":"Chapter 3308: Chapter 3307 What Lies Ahead! I","paragraphs":["Ordinance.","A form of declaration of one's existence.","After establishing that they were One With Existence and opening the Eye of Existence, one had to build up a great deal of complexity until their Ordinance could be formed!","Until it was said loud and clear across all weavings of existence that a singular, pure thing defined that person.","For the Antediluvian Leviathan Arguros, it was Entropy.","The moment that the banner rose above him, his body now longer seemed like anything else other than Entropy as the surrounding weavings of Existence also fell into this state.","The area around him turned violet purple as tendrils of flames spread out where he passed that were forever changed!","Instantly, he took the lead across many of those traversing the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence and pulled ahead- rivers of extremely pure, potent, and complex waves of Entropy being returned to him as his titanic figure became utterly thrumming with power.","In the far distance, one could see the beginning of the huge outline of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence itself as they had been rushing forward for quite some time.","They were powerful entities as all were moving faster than the speed of light at this moment, and yet many were still traversing on one different colored root.","But for Arguros and a few other select entities, they could finally see the ends of the root of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence they were on...and the beginning of the trunk.","In the distance, the commotion between Arguros and Noah had drawn many more eyes as the Simians were drawn over as well, with the perceptive visage of the Shield of the Commonwealth having his pupils constrict at the sight of Noah!","|Osmont?|","The Protector from Omniverse X-999.","A just recently discovered Omniverse as those within it didn't hold much power, but this Protector Osmont was unique as he was able to unravel the weavings of Agents of Anti-Life!","He would have been a good weapon to begin cleansing the decayed roots within the Commonwealth as Old Man Eudemus had already received word that the Equestris Protectors were on their way back to the Omniverse of the Protectors after accomplishing their mission.","But...","His power was at the stage where he had already attained the Eye of Existence? And what quality did he have that was currently causing him to senselessly release his authority and rapidly traverse upwards to be far ahead of most of the powerful entities here?!","'Did I miss something?|","Old Man Eudemus wondered.","But for others, seeing the scene of Arguros and Noah, their hearts only felt like they had to go ever faster or they would lose something as they burned their reserves of authority ever faster!","BOOM!","On the golden surface of the root, Noah stared at the distant figure of Arguros that was pulling away faster and faster as all around him, existence itself had turned into pure storms of Entropy.","|A new form of Entropy has been discovered.|","A prompt rose within his mind as his speed also became even faster because of this change of existence brought about due to Arguros displaying his Ordinance.","|The potency of Entropy in the surrounding field of existence has been increased by an unquantifiable amount.|","|The usage of any other authorities apart from Entropy will find it hard to display even a fraction of their potency.|","...!","Why were those who had reached the Ordinance of Existence so powerful?","Existence itself would undeniably become part of their Ordinance as going against it...was akin to going against existence itself!","Impossible.","But since Noah was already wreathed in Entropy, his figure became even faster while he analyzed the variation of this authority from another.","The extremely pure waves of authority being returned to him were currently being stored across various parts of his existence as apart from the authorities that had already formed their Fabled Omniverses, the others slowly began to increase in the breadth of their complexity.","As parts of Noah rose higher, other parts followed!","In the far distance as he neared the multicolored trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, the intent of Arguros flowed back towards Noah as his booming voice filled with ancientness and wisdom continued.","|Engineer Osmont, if you truly have something special similar to the giants of eons ago that have come and gone, then that is all the better for Megalos Ynnere. But it also means that it is even more critical for you to stick to a single, pure path. This...is strictly because of what comes next as your power elevates.|","WUU!","Around him, only Entropy reigned as the voice of Arguros seemed to be coming right beside him.","And truly...amidst the flaming storms of violet purple flames that seemed like they would never burn out, an illusory figure of Arguros formed as he looked towards Noah sternly!","|One With Existence. Eye of Existence. Ordinance of Existence. Do you not know what comes after that, Engineer Osmont? It would be enough to deter anyone from following anything more than a single, pure, path. The next stages of Existence can distinguish you from others in an unfathomable way, and they are also the stages where powerful entities who have formed their Ordinance...have the highest rate of Mortality.|","....!","The highest rate of mortality for entities who had forged their Ordinance.","What!","An Existence at the Existential Dominium Realm alone could live for billions of years- entire cycles and eons as their existence and records wouldn't yet perish.","And yet...death- a high chance of it at that, occurred in these grander stages of power?","Noah continued shooting across like a bolt of lightning as the illusory construct of Arguros kept pace with him calmly.","|After one declares their Ordinance, they have to then merge with it, and it alone. All of their existence has to be wholly dedicated to it as if there is even a small part of them that holds attachments to other weavings not part of their Ordinance...their very existence will break down and shatter! But if successful, they would have stepped onto the state of existence known as...Ordinance Amalgamation.|","...!"]},{"number":3309,"title":"Chapter 3309: Chapter 3308 What Lies Ahead! II","paragraphs":["Ordinance Amalgamation!","Every part of one's existence merged and fully inline with their Ordinance and nothing else.","If there was even a glimpse of hesitation.","A sliver of a doubt or attachment to other weavings.","Ordinance Amalgamation would fail as the rejection was one that would cause the collapse of every single part of one's weavings!","Noah heard these words from the Antediluvian Leviathan Arguros who seemed to be trying to help him, but the light within his eyes didn't change.","Quintessence.","Infinity.","Protagonist.","Loot.","There were too many things that defined him as he didn't want to leave any of them behind.","His resolute gaze was observed by Arguros as this Leviathan gazed at Noah calmly before he continued.","|At Ordinance Amalgamation, one can traverse the Expanse without expending one of their bodies to die ever so often. You will have a heavy weight that your existence carries as for others to deny your Ordinance of Existence and erase it...they would need an equally powerful Ordinance or one that opposes it entirely. This stage of existence lets it be known that truly, one's focus can only be a single thing. The Wheel of Existence thrives on purity. One's existence thrives on purity. But if that wasn't enough, there is what comes after Ordinance Amalgamation.|","...!","The stage of Existential Dominium Realms and what they were broken down into became left behind as at this moment, Noah felt like he was getting knowledge on the overarching stages of power of the Omniversal Realm.","How levels of power generally went for others- one aspect of it anyways.","The aspect of States of Existence.","One With Existence, Eye of Existence, Ordinance of Existence, Ordinance Amalgamation.","What came next?","HUUM!","His body endlessly gushed out Entropy as the concentration of what was returned to him was reaching critical junctures.","Around him, another layer of the Fabled Omniverse of Entropy burned into existence as in the next few moments, more and more layers began to appear!","|Entropy has exceeded the parameters of concentration of authority within a single Fabled Omniverse. More Fabled Omniverses of Entropy are being constructed and overlapped on the original Fabled Omniverse of Entropy.|","...!","Pure waves of wonder seethed within him as multiple layers of Fabled Omniverses began to bloom.","And at this time, the deep voice of Arguros reached him again.","|After one steps into Ordinance Amalgamation, they through a long, long period of accumulation to increase the complexity of their existence that is now amalgamated with their Ordinance. Those with Ordinances that have great weight and distinction may be fortunate enough to proceed ahead, while those with weak ordinances will forever be stuck at this stage. If you happen to have a profound enough Ordinance, you will reach a critical ceiling where you cannot proceed any further in complexity. Where existence itself seems to have arrived at a cap in terms of complexity. No matter what you do, your complexity of existence will not increase any further as at this stage...one must sever existence itself to forge ahead.|","BOOM!","|Existence Severing. This is the stage that comes after Ordinance Amalgamation, and those who die trying to sever who they are from Existence itself...are too many.|","The Severing of Existence itself!","When Arguros spoke of this, there was a tremor in his intent as if he was thinking of something truly terrifying.","Something even he feared!","|It is such a perilous process that across the Megalos of Existence, Across the Expanse, most deaths over the countless cycles can be attributed to the process of Existence Severing- Ordinance Amalgamation only coming close second.|","...!","The intent of Arguros carried with it an extremely heavy tone.","One that seemed to express immense reverence and fear of this stage of power at the same time!","Noah internalized all of these new waves of information as he became stern.","But as he and Arguros exchanged these intents, the situation in the surroundings was changing drastically as the body of Arguros seemed to get ever closer towards the starting point of the trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","On other roots, unique entities with terrifying Banners of Ordinances above their heads were also catching up and forging forward at this moment!","Noah was triggered for Arguros.","Arguros acted as the trigger for others.","All around this root and the roots nearby...","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","Shocking banners unfolded.","Multiple Ordinances were laid out!","Fantastical beams of light shot forward!","There were too many existences who had lived for an extremely long period of time over the past eons.","Some had forged the complexity of their existence to an unfathomable level as they had fully attained their Ordinance of Existence.","Now, they put it all to use in order to grasp this shocking opportunity laid out before them!","In the distance, the visage of the Shield of the Commonwealth sighed as his look of an old man faded.","Golden light began to gather around him as moments later...","BOOM!","A glorious golden banner erupted.","The Ordinance of Kuklos.","The Ordinance of the Wheel!","He was the one who was telling others to preserve their authority as they proceeded forward, but even he couldn't stop himself from joining all other truly powerful entities at this moment.","His figure shot out like a speeding bullet across the surface of the root he was on as his gaze was far, far ahead!","And somehow, in a field of entities who had already declared the Ordinances of their Existence, Noah was ahead of most of them.","At this moment, he received the intent of Arguros for the last time.","|Think of it very carefully, Engineer Osmont. Do not be among those who fail to even Amalgamate their Ordinance and perish. For the future that the Omnifather had envisioned is far too grand...and we should all be able to enjoy it.|","...!","A dazzling intent.","The moment it was finished, all observing wills saw the visage of Arguros reached the multicolored trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence as he didn't slow down at all, becoming even faster as he smashed into the surface of the trunk!","And...","PAH!","His figure disappeared entirely.","As if he was drawn into the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence itself!"]},{"number":3310,"title":"Chapter 3310: Chapter 3309 The Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence! I","paragraphs":["The moment that Arguros smashed into the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, a few other observable entities on other roots did the same.","But...the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence was vast as those in this space couldn't even observe the other side of this massive tree.","And even if they could...would they have been able to even observe entities who had exceeded the stage of Ordinance of Existence and were already in the stage of Ordinance Amalgamation?","It could not be said with surety that Arguros was the first to enter the trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","A distance away, Noah also closed in as he broke down bundles of information that this Antediluvian Leviathan released.","Ordinance Amalgamation. Existence Severing.","Once complexity arrived at a critical enough juncture, one had to cut themselves away from Existence entirely- they had to Sever!","Yet the fatalities for this and the stage before it were high as the most critical thing was a single, pure source for one to rely on.","Noah...was taking a different route entirely as he had his Atlas of Existence.","Nine different Sources of Existence could fill it as within his first System of Existence, he had the overarching umbrella of concepts as within it- hundreds of concepts mixed in!","Purity of sources was not under his banner. But even after hearing all the things that Arguros stated, his heart never faltered regarding the path he was taking!","Not a single thing would be left behind.","Not Infinity.","Not Tyranny.","Not Quintessence.","He didn't just want a single source, he wanted them all!","HUUM!","His very existence vibrated as if it were agreeing with these thoughts, his figure becoming a pure blur of light as within moments, the trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence was before his eyes as well.","PAH!","His figure felt like it smashed into a comfortable body of plasma and not the solid exterior of a tree, disappearing into it entirely as he...was among the first set of Entities to step into the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence!","Alongside those who had formed their Ordinances- and theoretically, some who had even Amalgamated it.","It was unknown just what level of power was the highest among those who had entered the square white portals that appeared within the vast stretches of the Megalos Ynnere.","The moment that Noah stepped into the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, his figure found itself transported across...a string.","A string reminiscent of the countless golden strings within the Expanse- but this string was verdant in color as he crossed uncountable distances to finally arrive...in a small domain that was surrounded by 9 circular layers of verdant rings of light.","The rings were spinning calmly around each other, the largest one occupying the most space on the outside as there were smaller rings towards the center.","And Noah appeared in the very center as not too far from him was a flickering golden star.","This star was radiating an intent that bloomed into understandable words soon after.","[You have stepped onto the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence and accessed the Tresorverse Sacred Domain that was sculpted by the Omnifather from a segment of the Expanse and the Megalos Ynnere.]","...!","[The Tresorverse Sacred Domain has its own Existential Continuum, with no entry allowed for any Entity unless it is through the possession and assimilation of the existence of those already living within it.]","[The lifeforms within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain are unique entities that only existed for a few cycles many eons ago within the Expanse, their Weavings of Existence being so potent that they could smoothly traverse across the States of Existence in an extremely short period of time. Known as the Sacred Primal Megalonians, the potency of their weavings of existence also made them targets as when devoured by others, tremendous levels of complexity of existence can be gained that make it easy to attain the more intricate latter states of Existence and even greater weavings of complexity.]","[These Sacred Primal Megalonians were hunted, eradicated, and devoured entirely the moment that the potency of their existence was discovered by others, never gaining the chance to illuminate across the Expanse. The Omnifather has pulled onto unfathomable weavings to reconstruct the existence of these lifeforms within this Tresorverse Sacred Domain, and you can possess and assimilate a random Sacred Primal Megalonian depending on your level of complexity of existence.]","[In the time it takes for this dying star to fade, release as much of your complexity of existence into this isolated domain, and depending on the quantity and quality of complexity, you will be granted the possession and assimilation of an Average Sacred Primal Megalonian, a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian, a Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian, or even an Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. Depending on which Megalonian you assimilate while entering the Tresorverse Sacred Domain, the level of talent and true source of the reconstructed Megalonian will vary tremendously.]","[The timeline of the Tresorverse Sacred Domain is set, the events to play out within are set, and the eventual destruction of the Sacred Primal Megalonians is set. The gains made in complexity and states of Existence will be retained once the set events have come to pass, and the pathway up the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence will open up once more.]","...!","A flood of waves of information surged out from the dazzling star, Noah processing it extremely quickly as great surprise reverberated through him!","A domain with a set timeline, set events, and set entities.","Accessible only by possession and assimilation, but the gains to be made within were tremendous as they were based on...what type of entity you could possess.","An Average Sacred Primal Megalonian, a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian, a Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian, or even an Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","And the selection of such an entity was based on the complexity and amount of existence one could release within this space filled with 9 rings of verdant light!"]},{"number":3311,"title":"Chapter 3311: Chapter 3310 The Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence! II","paragraphs":["For the entrants who had just arrived at the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, the reserves of their weavings of existence should already be greatly used up, especially if they rapidly released everything to climb up the roots even faster.","In the amount of time it took for the light of the dying star ahead to fade, they may not be able to fill up much of this space with their remaining weavings as their possible chance of attaining an extremely rare possession of a Megalonian...would be very low!","How quickly one went from the Root to the Trunk mattered.","Quantity mattered.","But so did quality.","For extremely powerful beings like Arguros, even if they had spent a significant percentage of their authority to quickly arrive at the Trunk, they would likely still get a rare Megalonian to possess as their complexity and power were much greater!","And there may also be entities who would be entirely spent if they hurried here without any reservation for their authority, and they wouldn't be able to release much before the dying star faded- and they would only possess an average Megalonian.","Then...there was Noah.","\"...\"","His eyes were luminously bright as the moment that the words of the dying star stated one had to release the weavings of their existence; his body had already begun to maddeningly radiate Mana all around!","The mana...flourished into many different forms.","Entropy.","Quintessence.","Infinity.","Manadynamics.","Cheats!","Quantity.","Quality.","Complexity!","Out of all beings, he decimated them all when it came to quantity.","And even though his existence was not as complex as entities like Arguros...he had multiple different weavings of existence!","So he let it all out.","And even though his existence was not as complex as entities like Arguros...he had multiple different weavings of existence!","So he let it all out.","His very existence vibrated as pure blue Mana leaked out of him in endless tides, and a few inches from his body, it would simultaneously transform into different weavings of existence.","It was taxing.","It required his existence to ensure everything was going smoothly with these constant transformations!","But he did it all regardless as infinite waves of mana tumbled out.","In front of him, a star was dimming rapidly, but before even 80% of its radiance was lost- 6 of the Nine verdant rings in this space were already filled with multicolored weavings of Existence!","It was a reality that foretold shocking things to come.","In another isolated space.","The massive body of The Antediluvian Leviathan, Arguros, sat with blazing Entropy which leaked out all around him with complexity.","In front of him, the light of a dying star was only left with a shred of itself remaining.","In his surroundings, 5 rings that were circling this isolated domain were filled with violet purple flames of Entropy, only four exterior rings not being filled as the tongues of flames now reached out towards the sixth ring.","As he experienced this phenomenon and even recalled the legends of the Sacred Primal Megalonians, he shook his head while thinking of Engineer Osmont.","To arrive here so quickly, he would likely only have a shred of his reserves of existence available.","|With only a sliver remaining after you used so much...an Average Megalonian possession is the furthest you will be granted...ah! Missed opportunity. Missed opportunity!|","Arguros shook his head as even he had only heard a little of the legends of a lineage within the Expanse that did not live for long before they were extinguished entirely due to the composition of their existence.","Had they been given even another Cycle or two to thrive, they may have become the most powerful Entities across the Megalos and the Expanse.","That was how intricately built their existences were.","They were anomalies of nature that were devoured absolutely, with their destruction giving rise to some of the most powerful Entities across the Expanse and Megalos!","This was one of the chances that the Omnifather provided within this Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","But who could tremendously benefit from it?","|Ah...|","Arguros shook his head again as he gave one last thought of pity towards Engineer Osmont, and he then focused on himself entirely as his complex weavings of existence burned brightly, the light of the dying star entirely fading as everything became frozen thereafter.","HUUM!","As if everything was being measured.","And within moments...the dead star let out one last intent.","[According to the quantity, complexity, and speed of arrival, you have been granted the possession and assimilation of a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian- Hayashi.]","...!","|What!|","Arguros' gaze changed.","His complexity of existence. The amount of weavings he was able to release...all of it only granted a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian?!","In his shock, a blinding green light flashed as he disappeared.","In another isolated space.","A massive Omniversal Dragoserpent radiated tendrils of golden Dignity all around him that managed to fill four rings of the nine contained in this space, an Ordinance of Dignity blazing above him as the light of a dying star disappeared before him!","[According to the quantity, complexity, and speed of arrival, you have been granted the possession and assimilation of an Average Sacred Primal Megalonian- Todo.]","...!","The eyes of the Omniversal Dragoserpent that had already declared its Ordinance nearly popped out in dismay.","In another area.","Weavings of golden wheel spun gloriously as they filled up six rings of the isolated space, the Shield of the Commonwealth, Old Man Eudemus- gazing ahead with shining eyes as the light of a dying star flickered out of existence!","And...","[According to the quantity, complexity, and speed of arrival, you have been granted the possession and assimilation of a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian- Ceseius.]","...!","The pupils of this old man opened wide as he disappeared in the next moment.","One by one, entities arrived.","One by one, they were transported to a fantastical place.","But without a doubt, every one of them was shocked at the results they obtained for their possession!","But in one isolated space.","Nine verdant rings were filled to the brim with countless multicolored lights, with their edges actually creaking as if they couldn't contain too much more of the expressed authority!","A dying star still had 20% of its light remaining, but it seemed nervous and distraught at this moment as it urged its light to die out even faster!"]},{"number":3312,"title":"Chapter 3312: Chapter 3311 Dominance!","paragraphs":["Others arrived into the isolated domain with a fraction of their authority remaining within them as half of the nine rings of glorious verdant light were filled as a dying star flickered out of existence and disappeared forever.","But for Noah, waves of complexity flooded out from him as all nine verdant rings were filled to the brim, with these rings shaking as if they were about to break at any moment!","The dying star trembled with anxiety when it saw this scene as it no longer waited for its light to die out naturally, its complexity actively moving to snuff itself out as within an instant, the remaining glow of 20% disappeared.","...!","A star snuffed itself out of existence since it looked like things were about to break!","HUUUM!","Everything trembled with majesty thereafter as...","[...]","A clear demarcation seemingly could not be made.","Soon after, a blinding verdant light of immense power flashed in as if it was required to make the determination, and a message flashed by Noah's eyes briefly before he felt his existence sucked towards an unknown place!","[According to the quantity, complexity, and speed of arrival, you have been granted the possession and assimilation of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- Pyrrhus.]","Words that caused Noah's brilliance to shine ever more, and then everything went dark.","—","In another part of the Tresorverse of the Omnifather.","Within the Tresorverse Primalwater that was used to nurture the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","All of those who had not transcended their existence were sent to these waters, with those most perceptive noticing radiant globes of light across the depths of the blue waters all around them.","One's very weavings of Existence felt a tug towards any of these globes as multiple deaths had occurred to obtain them.","At this moment.","Henry and the few hundred entities from the Infinite Omniverse moved as a single unit as they were truly far too weak in this landscape, but they came across a dazzling golden globe of light that had nobody else near, with Henry going forward and getting his hands on it right away!","Henry and the few hundred entities from the Infinite Omniverse moved as a single unit as they were truly far too weak in this landscape, but they came across a dazzling golden globe of light that had nobody else near, with Henry going forward and getting his hands on it right away!","But at that moment...","BZZT!","A golden wheel flashed above them as a Simian floated over with a sharp gaze, a Fabled Omniverse swirling around him as he radiated an oppressive pressure while voicing out commandingly- his eyes on the golden globe of brilliance.","|Give it.|","...!","Two words.","Ones that emanated profound tyranny as if they didn't get what they asked for in the next moment, they let it be known what would happen as a terrifying pressure cascaded down.","Someone who had enacted a Fabled Omniverse!","Henry's gaze was cold towards this being that none of them could stand against, and yet...he gazed up fearlessly.","|There are many more out there, and we obtained this first. Do not force us!|","...! His gaze was calm and filled with regality as if he were a young prince from ancient times!","He spoke domineeringly towards an Omniversal Realm entity who didn't bother to speak another word to them, scoffing with coldness as he made a move.","But...Henry truly did not fear this enemy.","After all, who was he?","|Nepotism radiates a gaze of arrogance and majesty.|","One of the core concepts within him bubbled forth.","Who was he? He was the son of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer.","He waved his hands as instantly, two golden statues of a Fat Monkey bloomed and shot out like speeding bullets- their complexity weavings actually making them faster than any Autarch as they pulsed unstable with Matter and Dark Matter!","New and improved Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction.","Weapons holdings within them artificially unstable weavings of Matter and Dark Matter that would act to unravel and disrupt all weavings of existence- their potency being a tremendous level above what was used previously by Noah.","Their speed was a testament to this as Noah modified them to be usable with anyone he trusted enough, with their burst speed going from the owner to the target in an extremely short period of time!","By the time that the Omniversal Stage Simian changed his gaze as his existence felt unprecedented danger and the Golden wheels bloomed around him, the Fat Monkeys were only meters away.","They were truly fat- their bellies being made wide as their faces were devilish ones that were smiling.","The moment they detonated, their bellies turned crimson hot as their expressions deteriorated from a smile and into a rageful glare.","And...","BOOM! BOOM!","Murky obsidian radiance followed by waves of scorching crimson light radiated outwards, the wills of many existences gazing over this direction in shock as even those who were far away felt their existences tremble with instability!","Almost as if their very makeup was shaken and wanted to break down just from the residual waves of disruption they could feel from afar.","As for the entity that was dead center?","|...!|","In the blue waters, churning and chaotic waves roared as when the scene cleared, torn and deteriorated weavings of existence were the only things left behind.","The Omniversal Realm Entity...less than 10% of his body remained as a wailing remnant will within a deteriorating Fabled Omniverse was all that was left behind!","It was a shocking scene.","Henry gazed all around him coldly as he held the golden globe in his hands freely- but this time, not a single person showed a greedy light as everyone scattered towards other directions!","|...|","Silence reigned.","But not too long as...","\"Well damn, what was that?\" Erikson had his slippers already in his hands for a fight as he looked between Henry and the deadly explosion ahead of them.","Henry only grasped the golden aurora in his hands tightly as his Bloodline churned while he replied.","\"Just something father gave in case of emergencies.\"","With a glimmer of brilliance, bundles of information bloomed in Henry's eyes that his father was also using to observe everything occurring within this space of the Tresorverse Primalwater.","[Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitation.]","...!"]},{"number":3313,"title":"Chapter 3313: Chapter 3312 Pyrrhus! I","paragraphs":["Inside the Tresorverse Primalwater that was used to nurture the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, there were actually Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitations laid out for entities to build up their complexity.","With them, they could quickly escape the Existential Dominium Realm and build enough complexity to step into the Omniversal Realm, and if they were lucky enough...even possibly attain the first State of Existence!","Without a delay, Henry threw the Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitation into his mouth and devoured it entirely, his whole body beginning to radiate a golden glow as nearby, Barbatos stepped forward and voiced out with excitement.","|Alright y'all, Little Fish has distributed those weapons over to some of you through your Lineage. Those chosen...led a team of a dozen others and spread out across this Tresorverse Primalwater- obtain as many of these golden globes as you can!|","A command was given.","Very quickly, Sona, the Sanctus Autarch, Lilith, Kazuhiko, and a few others took the lead while a dozen entities lined up behind them- and they then shot out across the blue waters with fervor.","It was the start of the dominance of a group of beings that began extremely weak, and yet in their hands...utterly terrifying tools of mass destruction that could be unleashed at any moment would come to teach a few entities irreversible lessons!","—","Within the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","Inside a Tresorverse Sacred Domain.","Its timeline was set in stone, and so were the events that would play out along with the eventual destruction of all Sacred Primal Megalonians.","It was so special that one couldn't even enter this terrifying Tresorverse Sacred Domain, where even with the shocking capabilities of the Omnifather who recreated all of these weavings- only possession and assimilation could be done as one attained another identity entirely!","The entities who reached the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence all came to possess different Megalonians, but only those with tremendous complexity of existence or other unique methods would be able to get a truly special identity.","At this moment, within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain, an existence opened his eyes.","|Ah...|","And the first thing he felt...was just how bright everything was.","He seemed to be receiving information from every possible source of existence all around him, with his gaze capable of observing things to their fundamental levels!","When he blinked, he saw hazy skies above filled with golden clouds.","He saw purple and gold rivers flowing serenely with the golden clouds, with drops of Hearthraes dangling in the skies freely as they lit everything up with brightness.","On the earth where he was on, vibrant halcyon grasslands covered vast landscapes filled with vegetation and rising gold green mountains- each of these mountains connected by white stairs leading to the other.","On some of these mountains, grand celestial structures were enacted as the clamor of laughter and power spread out, millions of auras of existences stretched out across this landscape!","'Megalonians.'","The entity who opened his eyes thought this as he observed everything...far too clearly?","He could see not just this domain that was filled with mountains and grand constructs as he realized he could easily and seamlessly expand his vision even further.","He came to learn that the land he stood on was as vast as an Omniverse- and it was actually shaped like one massive gold mountain!","Its weavings caused this entity to tremble as on this whole mountain, he felt like he could see quintillions of strings coming together to form it- and it wasn't alone.","When his gaze further expanded, he came to discover that massive white chains extended from this Omniversal sized mountain to other ones.","Some were purple. Some were green. Some red.","But shockingly, he found that he could observe 81 of these mountains in total connected to each other.","81 massive Mountains that were the size of an Omniverse each!","Dazzling mountains the size of Omniverses connected by massive white chains stretched out, and this being who just opened his eyes was shocked to find that his gaze...could continue to spread out and distinctly observe all of these Mountains effortlessly!","What did this mean?","It meant that his sight alone could cover the vastness of 81 Omniverses and even focus on a single one to observe the Megalonians living within them- or even the waving golden grass on their landscapes.","This...how was this possible?","Noah- no, the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- Pyrrhus, found himself questioning as he quickly realized something.","He blinked.","He wasn't viewing all of these grandiose mountains just now with his eyes.","His vision shifted as he blinked and then looked above, noticing a regal, fantastical, iridescent golden eye above him that radiated such magisterial tyranny that even the surrounding existence was shuddering!","\"Haha, Young Master Pyrrhus, only a day after your body formed, and you already awakened your Sacred Primal Eye of Existence. Those old fogeys were surprised that you became One With Existence at birth, but they will be even more surprised to know you have already attained your Eye a day later! And it seems to be a special one too...\"","A voice filled with pride echoed out to his right.","Above the calmly waving golden grass, Pyrrhus turned to see a humanoid entity whose body seemed to be made of pure white astral radiance.","His limbs faded into golden waves of plasma as behind his back, an Expanse of white astral wings that could blot out the skies were shining.","This was...","\"Caretaker Nazal...\" Pyrrhus said these foreign words with clarity as his memories flowed freely.","\"Mmm, you seem to have taken in a great deal of information all at once, Young Master. Let us head to the Sacred Primal Sea for your daily baptism. Those old fogeys won't be able to deny this at all after this.\"","...!","The memories fully came into place.","Yes.","He was Pyrrhus.","He was also Noah Osmont.","He was also Ozymandias!","He knew who he was and why he came here, but he was clear about one thing.","All of this...was very, very real.","It was not some Dream. It was not some illusory reconstruction. It was something irrevocably real as the moment he entered and possessed this Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, he attained the state of the Eye of Existence!","And it seemed that there were many more shocking things in store as this...was just the beginning."]},{"number":3314,"title":"Chapter 3314: Chapter 3313 Pyrrhus! II","paragraphs":["Serene golden clouds above.","Rivers of golden and purple waters swam gleefully like spirit snakes between these golden clouds that overlooked a vibrant earth that seemed like an endless paradisiacal landscape.","In a small part of this, above swaying golden grass, Pyrrhus stared at a humanoid entity whose body seemed to be made of pure white astral radiance.","An aurora of golden astral wings stretched out behind him as when Pyrrhus stared at him closely, the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence above him radiated a flash of light.","It was an Eye of Existence, but it wasn't just any Eye of Existence.","It was a unique type full of unfathomable wonder as at this moment, it caused the distinction of the Weaver of Existence and Weaver of Extremity to undergo fundamental changes!","Just by staring at this Megalonian before him, waves of weavings were presented before his eyes.","[Rare Megalonian Nazal]:: State of Existence- Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- 1 Megalos Cycle/1,000 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","...!","Waves of information came that caused the heart of Pyrrhus to fluctuate!","Details freely and without a delay came- details so extensive that he had never come across them before.","A single gaze at an entity that was no doubt many times more powerful than him garnered a tremendous set of records regarding their existence.","Caretaker Nazal before him was an entity that had already undergone the Amalgamation of their Ordinance, and even this being was only his Caretaker.","Seeing his blank gaze, Caretaker Nazal smiled while walking closer to Pyrrhus.","\"Young Master, is it okay if we go to the Sacred Primal Sea? We have to strike while the iron is still hot from your enlightenment for the best results.\"","His voice was a serene one as Pyrrhus nodded while rising from the golden earth below him.","Him.","He gazed at his own body as he saw...countless golden strings gathered together to form who he was.","His form was humanoid, with the golden strings making his body look like a golden astral amalgamation of light as his limbs diverted to form waves of plasma, and his head was akin to a burning golden astral flame that had two white points of light!","A head that was a golden astral flame that seemed like it would burn endlessly.","His eyes were two blazing white singularities as above him, the illusory golden Sacred Primal Eye of Existence only shone brighter with his gaze.","[Origin Megalonian Pyrrhus]:: State of Existence- A Type of Sacred Primal Eye of Existence. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- An Insignificant Fraction of a Megalos Cycle/ Undefined Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","...!","Under Caretaker Nazal, he was able to see his level of power, his Source of Existence, and even his lifespan.","How long an entity could live before their Existence broke down!","It was terrifying that he would even have access to such information, with Caretaker Nazal having a maximum lifespan of 1,000 Megalos Cycles.","As for how many billions of years this was equivalent to? He didn't know.","Seeing the state of his own body, Pyrrhus floated up while nodding to Caretaker Nazal beside him.","\"Let's go.\"","His voice was magnetic and filled with a terrifying weight of command, and it seemed to come naturally as even this powerful entity at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage bent his head to acknowledge it!","A golden barrier of light erupted around Nazal that wrapped around both of them as they disappeared.","When they reappeared, they were at the very peak of a flattened mountain that shone with iridescent golden light, a golden singularity the size of a universe filled with a shocking concentration of existence spinning above this flattened mountain peak as, below it, a golden sea tens of times larger than a universe bubbled.","Wisps of golden waters would rise from the golden sea below and fuse into the spinning golden singularity as moments later, even more potent tendrils of light returned down into the golden sea as it became even more radiant.","Around this sea, rings of purple and golden light surrounded it protectively, with the auras of hundreds of thousands of Megalonians peacefully surrounding it as they interacted with each other and elevated their weavings of Existence.","Apart from them, there were 9 thrones of multicolored radiance that floated at the edges of the purple and gold rings, with the auras of powerful Megalonians seated atop these thrones!","Caretaker Nazal and Pyrrhus appeared not too far away from this region as the moment they arrived, Nazal floated across the pristine skies and spoke towards the 9 Thrones.","\"Honored Sirs, I bring the one whose birth yesterday caused the auspicious signs to bloom. Today...he has attained his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence.\"","...!","His voice was calm yet loud, echoing out in the surroundings as those on the nine thrones floating in the skies and even the Megalonian talking amongst themselves and cultivating around the golden sea that radiated intense waves of complexity nearby rose their heads to see.","The Honored Megalonian sitting on the nine thrones had their eyes light up as they came to stare at Pyrrhus, and he stared back at them as their bodies radiated terrifying waves of complexity of existence!","[Rare Megalonian Astrid]:: State of Existence- Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- 3 Megalos Cycle/3,000 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","[Rare Megalonian Salazar]:: State of Existence- Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- 4 Megalos Cycle/3,100 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","The vast majority of the 9 were at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage, and yet their complexity felt multiple times more potent than Caretaker Nazal.","As if a single one of them could press down and those weaker at the same stage as them would instantly be defeated.","It seemed that there was a vast discrepancy of power within the same state of Existence, with this discrepancy being even more exaggerated in these higher stages of power!","It was a terrific reality of existence to experience firsthand."]},{"number":3315,"title":"Chapter 3315: Chapter 3314 Pyrrhus! III","paragraphs":["Just because one attained an Eye of Existence, it did not mean they could stand against another entity who had also attained an Eye of Existence.","Their complexity of existence could be many times higher!","That was the terrifying air of power the entities of the throne released, but one of them utterly encompassed all others as her body shone with the singular astral light of crimson radiance.","Her head was a flicker of a burning astral crimson flame that seemed to contain countless cosmos within it, and her weavings of existence...had far exceeded the Ordinance Amalgamation Stage!","An entity that had exceeded the Ordinance Amalgamation stage.","Pyrrhus stared at her closely as within his white pupils of singularities, a faint illusory golden eye was reflected.","[Quintessential Megalonian Nu]:: State of Existence- Existence Severing(Proto). Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- 2 Megalos Cycle/10,000 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","...!","She had lived much less than even the Rare Megalonians, and yet she was successful in Severing existence itself!","Her gaze was a profound one as she stared at Pyrrhus with authority and wonder.","\"Oh? The little pup formed from a dying singularity turns out to be so obscene? For you to bring him here, you wish to have him undergo a baptism in the Sacred Primal Sea?\"","As she spoke, her astral crimson head gazed towards the terrifyingly potent golden sea that stretched out for light years on this massive mountain that was even larger.","Caretaker Nazal smiled with his eyes and nodded as he replied.","\"Yes. But not just today- every day from now. My weavings tell me that Young Master Pyrrhus may be the One That Was Promised. To be his Caretaker and watch him grow would be the honor of countless Cycles.\"","HUUM!","His words caused a blaze of authorities nearby as those on the Nine Thrones became unfathomably serious.","The One That Was Promised!","Over the past few cycles since the Megalonians had come to exist, a few Megalonians were put forward as such a being.","Their weavings of existence were too profound.","They crossed the states of Existence unfathomably quickly.","Their bodies held a sense of reality and royalty that others couldn't match.","But each of them, undoubtedly and without fail, ended up failing either at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage or while trying to Sever Existence itself.","Nobody knew why.","But the most illustrious of the Megalonians who progressed the quickest, the ones that others would look up to with hope...were not able to live up to this high state as their Existence eventually broke down and perished.","It got to the point that any genuine Megalonian being theorized as the One That Was Promised was akin to a death sentence!","It was heavy.","The Existence Severing entity, Nu, sat carefully on her throne as she looked between Caretaker Nazal, who had his head bowed down, and Pyrrhus.","At this moment, time seemed to come to a slowdown until ultimately, everything froze.","The only ones moving and capable of thought were Pyrrhus...and the terrifying Existence Severing entity on the central throne ahead!","Her astral eyes seemed to be flickering with cognizance and thought as a pained expression showed in her eyes- eyes that looked at Pyrrhus bitterly as she voiced out.","\"You are not the One That Was Promised.\"","WAA!","\"You are not Pyrrhus...\"","...!","The eyes of Pyrrhus flashed with surprised brilliance.","Deep within them, the will of Noah that had assimilated into this Megalonian was shocked as the being ahead of him...seemed to be cognizant of three intricacies of what was occurring?!","Seeing the immense pain within her eyes, the bitterness and endless anger within...it was as if she knew of the fate that would befall the Megalonians.","She looked at Pyrrhus' figure as if she could see the visage of Noah within clearly, as if with but a thought, she could sever Noah's existence entirely!","But a moment later, her bitter gaze flickered as she shook her head.","\"I will play along. Just...do not taint the memory of Pyrrhus. Everything we have has already been destroyed, the least you all could do is let our memories rest...\"","HUUM!","Her words were filled with endless agony.","But...","Existence buzzed and began to flow once more.","Noah's Will observed all of this with alarm and scrutiny as all of this...was a reconstruction of the weavings of the Megalonians by the Omnifather.","But they were truly far too real. To the extent that the truly powerful entities within this Reconstruction...seemed to wake with part of their Egos as they understood what was happening.","How terrifying were the Megalonians? What would have happened if their Lineage were actually allowed to thrive and grow?","It was a question that didn't have an answer.","Weavings of Existence flowed once more.","The bitterness and agony within Quintessential Megalonian Nu faded as she seemed to smile with astonishment.","\"Caretaker Nazal...half a cycle has gone by without the declaration of the One That Was Promised. For you to bring it to our young star here...\"","\"Is because I am confident.\"","...!","There was no hesitation in the eyes of Nazal.","On the other eight thrones, the Ordinance Amalgamation Megalonians turned towards the only Existence Severing Megalonian on this Mountain as if they were awaiting her decision.","Down below, a bustle of conversations exploded out as Megalonians looked at the scene above with awe.","It was only after a few seconds that the Quintessential Megalonian Nu sighed while pointing ahead.","\"Very well. He shall follow the same weavings of Inheritance as the ones before him. The baptism of the Sacred Primal Sea is granted.\"","...!","A right was given.","Once it was, there were many astonished gazes, and Noah even felt waves of jealousy down below!","Jealousy? This didn't seem like the weavings of the Megalonians!","Noah's will gazed at the masses of Megalonians down below who were increasing the complexity of their existence near the rings of the unfathomable sea.","He quickly located the intents of Jealousy as his eyes soon shone with understanding.","He found Megalonians who were undoubtedly possessed by others like him, but their statuses were much, much lower!"]},{"number":3316,"title":"Chapter 3316: Chapter 3315 The Rich and the Poor! I","paragraphs":["Around the vibrant rings of the Sacred Primal Sea.","A Megalonian had a gaze of pure joy as they felt the shocking waves of the complexity of existence around them, as well as the rapid progression of their existence!","It was a few hundred times more than their own bodies in Megalos Ynnere.","And in front of them...was a boundless golden sea that seemed to have a million times more concentration of existence than the area they were in.","Around them, other Megalonians were seated in meditative positions as their bodies seemed to be made of pure astral brilliance that increased their complexity in fantastical ways!","The senses of Megalonians were attuned tremendously, and they were able to feel glows of power that far exceeded them overseeing everything on this mountain that was many times larger than even a common universe.","These glows of power...they threateningly came from nine thrones floating in the distant skies as the Possessed Megalonian raised their gaze up and shuddered.","'The means of the Omnifather are too profound...'","The Will within the Megalonian spoke out as it was one of the Antediluvian Leviathans that had entered after Arguros.","They didn't have much complexity of existence to unleash after their reserves were cut off greatly just getting to the Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence!","Thus, they only possessed an Average Sacred Primal Megalonian.","This constricted their movements greatly as in the memories of their Possessed, they knew and understood everything occurring nearby- along with the fact that the Sacred Primal Sea ahead of them was something they could only cultivate around the periphery of.","It was reserved to be used by those who held extremely high positions within the Sacred Primal Megalonians, and even then- its usage was rare on any of the 81 Sacred Megalos Mountains!","'Ah...'","This Possessed Megalonian shook their head with regret as when they gazed around, they felt a unique resonance in another area nearby.","When they turned to look past the fantastical golden green trees stretched out in the periphery of the Sacred Primal Sea, their gaze came to lock on to another Megalonian who seemed to have discovered them at the same time.","There was a sense of resonance as their eyes...held the same light of awakening. The same light of Possessed Megalonians!","They could recognize each other as those who weren't truly part of this unfathomable reconstruction of weavings.","The two who just discovered each other smiled wryly with self-depreciation as both of them were Average Sacred Primal Megalonians, and even though this alone was a terrifying boon with them already feeling their shocking increase in complexity...they knew that there were a hundred, or even a thousand times more boons if they had more unique identities!","Oh well.","Thru couldn't wallow in what they couldn't change as for now, they wanted to remain here for as long as possible.","They broke their gazes and turned to look at the protective rings surrounding the distant golden sea.","It was so close, and yet so far away as from their memories, they would never be able to lay their hands on it. But then.","Above them.","HUUM!","A commotion broke out!","Waves of weavings gradually reached those who were nearby as Megalonians talked amongst each other.","\"Another possible One That Was Promised!\"","\"What?!\"","One weaving after another cascaded down.","All of it culminated to...","|The baptism of the Sacred Primal Sea is granted.|","...!","It was a voice that became an intent that spread out all around!","A Megalonian would get the rare chance to be baptized in the Sacred Primal Sea! Who?","The eyes of the Possessed Megalonian flashed with longing as their memories told them how truly fantastical a baptism on this Sea would be!","Who gained this chance?","Their searching gazes went up.","Before the dazzling nine thrones of the Honored Megalonians.","They saw a pure white astral Megalonian vibrating with immense power, and behind him, the one who would get the rare chance to undergo the baptism of the Sacred Primal Sea...","An entity made of pure golden astral light as his flaming head turned to look at them at the same time they saw him.","And...!","They saw the same light of cognizance in his eyes as theirs.","He...wasn't part of the reconstruction.","He was just like them- someone who had possessed a Megalonian!","'What?!'","How...how were they able to gain such an identity?","The bustling weavings of the One That Was Promised were ringing out in their hearts as they felt like they were sitting in desolate slumps of existence- poor and impoverished, while the one in front of the nine thrones far above them was sitting on mountains of golden waves of existence. This wasn't all.","When they gazed at him, their very existence as Megalonians felt reverence and trepidation as if they were looking at something exalted within their own Lineage!","When they looked too deeply into his eyes, they felt boundless majesty that caused their very existences to feel so much smaller!","This...","Their faces became extremely unsightly as they felt that they couldn't even hold their gazes with this being for too long.","The other Possessed Megalonians nearby who had been waking up one after questioned.","Who the hell was that up there that managed to obtain such a shocking identity?!","One Possessed Megalonian thought of the violet purple flames of Entropy that covered the Antediluvian Leviathan and wondered- was it him?","But no answer came.","—","[Average Megalonian Tijus(Possessed by the Existence of Batiatus, from the Antediluvian Leviathan Primal Family of Oceanetheus)]:: State of Existence- Eye of Existence. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- Half a Megalos Cycle/50 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","[Average Megalonian Tijus(Possessed by the Existence of Kajol, from the Mythical Omniversal Serpent Turtle Lineage)]:: State of Existence- Eye of Existence. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- Half a Megalos Cycle/60 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","[Average Megalonian Valas(Possessed by the Existence of Ceasar, from the Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Lineage)]:: State of Existence- Ordinance of Existence. Source of Existence- Megalos. Lifespan- 1 Megalos Cycle/80 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings-...","His eyes shone over multiple Possessed Megalonians nearby as their information in this fantastical reconstruction and even their identities before it were visible to him.","It was utterly terrifying!"]},{"number":3317,"title":"Chapter 3317: Chapter 3316 The Rich and the Poor! II","paragraphs":["A terrifying Eye of Existence.","One that others would find impossible to even imagine, and yet this unfathomable Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian held it.","Origin.","It placed itself above even Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian- of which the only one that Noah had met so far being the Existence Severing Honored Megalonian who stood over this Megalos Mountain.","Who truly understood the secrets of such an entity? The more he assimilated with them, Noah could feel his state of mind gradually being affected by a heavy sense of majesty and dignity- one that almost exceeded his old self!","It seemed to be a type of dignity deeply ingrained in the very type of existence he was.","Not all beings were equal.","Not all beings were born equal.","The day that the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian Pyrrhus was born, he already attained the state of One With Existence.","What did this mean? That his complexity was already at the level of or exceeding someone that had exceeded the Existential Dominium Realm and had a complex enough existence to form a Fabled Omniverse!","Others spent millions of years just to reach there.","Others were untalented enough as it took them an entire cycle or two.","And then, there was Pyrrhus.","One With Existence at birth, and a unique Eye of Existence a day later!","Where would he be a few days later? What would Noah be able to obtain a week later?","The answer was unknown as, at this moment, quietness settled into this expansive mountain as the throne that the Existence Severing Honored Megalonian sat on radiated a blinding wave of light.","From her, a voice filled with unfathomable complexity echoed out.","\"The Sacred Primal Sea is the condensation of Cycles of Existence on every single Sacred Megalos Mountain. Rarely are any Megalonians permitted baptism on it, but when truly exceptional Megalonians do arise, they will enjoy baptism on it endlessly- all for the sake of Megalonians!\"","...!","OOOH!","Booming waves of affirmation echoed out from all Megalonians.","They were a tight-knit group of entities.","Their weavings were aligned as they were cognizant of their existence, and what qualities they represented.","They knew that to defend themselves from Outsiders, they had to have strong defenders.","So when exceptional Megalonians arose, they were given resources and supported by all Sacred Megalos Mountains fully!","The Sacred Primal Sea was kept flowing and with ever greater concentrations by Existence Severing Megalonians, and every other Megalonian who cultivated near it...contributed their complexity every single day.","This was how harmonious the Megalonians were.","How united they were!","Through this method, they were able to produce Entities who could attain Ordinance Amalgamation at high rates, and eventually, even Existence Severing entities rose among them.","Unity.","A rare quality to find in any Bloodline, and the Sacred Primal Megalonians had it.","Around the golden sea, all Megalonians cheered with unity as the only ones who didn't truly have this intent...were those currently possessing and assimilating Megalonians.","In their eyes, sharp lights of envy shone as after the introduction from the Honored Megalonian, a set of astral white staircases appeared before Pyrrhus- and they led all the way towards the center of the Sacred Primal Sea.","\"The one to undergo baptism today and for the coming future is Pyrrhus. From the recommendation of Caretaker Nazal, he is put forward as the One That Was Promised! As Megalonians, we all hope for him to live up to such a distinction.\"","\"OOOH!\"","\"PYRRHUS!\"","Across the golden sea.","\"PYRRHUS!\"","Chants began to resound.","There was no disharmony as they knew.","His elevation and strength would be the elevation and strength of all Megalonians. So they would only look forward to it.","\"PYRRHUS!\"","The chants were resonant as under them, Pyrrhus turned towards Caretaker Nazal, who smiled with acknowledgment towards him, and he then stepped on the white set of stairs as his figure was rapidly taken towards the center of the Sacred Primal Sea.","—","The timeline of the Tresorverse Sacred Domain was set.","The events to play out within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain were set.","The eventual destruction of the Sacred Primal Megalonians was set!","The means of the Omnifather were unfathomable with this reconstruction, but it was stated clearly along with those edicts that...the gains made in complexity and states of Existence would be retained once the set events came to pass, and the pathway up the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence would open up once more thereafter.","This was stated.","This was inviolable.","And yet...","BOOM!","Outside of the Tresorverse designed by the Omnifather.","Within the bounds of Omniverse X-999.","Inside of the Infinite Omniverse that was finishing assimilating a Dark Matter Core and the remaining weavings of a Half Tainted Omniverse!","An explosive boom of incomprehensible weavings of existence erupted from Noah's main body seated atop his multicolored throne.","His face was facing up unnaturally as his forehead split open, a blinding golden singularity blooming from his forehead as an instant later...it began to radiate the wondrous form of an Eye!","An Eye.","It...had not even been a full day since the Omniversal Archontes Engineer attained the state of One With Existence.","Not even a full day.","And yet inexplicably, at this moment, a gloriously golden eye that was far too similar to the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence arose.","The eye that only the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- Pyrrhus, held!","The reconstruction of the Omnifather had only just begun for Noah, and yet he was already beginning to inherit the boons within it.","It was an utterly enigmatic phenomenon as his forehead rapidly healed and above him, a gloriously gold eye opened.","Intricate weavings and lines wrapped around it as the moment it flung open, waves of information flowed into Noah!","His distinction as the Weaver broke through any possible limitations.","His standing and complexity of Existence rose to even greater heights!","A body of his that was within an isolated cut-off section of the Dream Aletheian Haven gazed at the reconstructed body of Savitar.","A so called Great One.","And yet under his gaze, bountiful details of him began to spill out as if they weren't his to begin with!"]},{"number":3318,"title":"Chapter 3318: Chapter 3317 What an Eye! I","paragraphs":["[Seventh Body of Savitar]:: State of Existence- Quasi-Eye of Existence. Source of Existence- Outerversal. Lifespan- 18 Megalos Cycle/70 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- The Seventh Body of Savitar that was reconstructed through the hands of a great being. Its power exceeds any of its other bodies apart from the Main One....","...!","An extrapolation of records of Savitar unfolded under Noah's gaze as his weavings underwent a tremendous change!","He looked at the obsidian golden skeleton visage of Savitar who currently had a dark expression as he uttered out.","|White doorways have appeared within all the Tainted Omniverses I oversee...and likely here as well. But these gateways reject anything relating to Outerversal Authority!|","His voice carried great frustration with it as he looked towards Noah inquisitively as if he was seeking for more information.","And Noah laughed lightly as he waved his hands.","\"It's not an opportunity for the Outerversal Morphons. We had the weavings of the Great Beyonder stretch out and empower us; the white portals are simply an opportunity that someone of equivalent power, if not greater than the Great Beyonder, had placed for the masses of the Megalos Ynnere.\"","...!","His words caused the flames within Savitar to blaze heavily as he asked in a low tone.","|Were you successful in taking a Delegatus across it? The Outerversal Authority within them was masked?|","The One Who Walks asked some critical questions that Noah did not answer.","He only waved his hands dismissively.","\"Who knows. Forget about that. You've actually lived for 18 Megalos Cycles, and you've only attained this stage of power? Even the Eye of Existence, you have only stepped into it halfway? Just what exactly designated you to be a Great One?\"","...!","Word after word that caused the flames within Savitar to flicker in shock and then subsequent horror echoed out.","|You...you...!| He was too baffled by the things Noah knew!","How could he know how many cycles he had been alive? How could he know his exact state of power?!","HUUM!","\"Let's see...\"","Noah went even further as above him, a terrifying golden eye opened.","Along with it, prompts cascaded down.","|The Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, has turned its gaze onto the target before it.|","|The weavings of the selected target are laid bare.|","Savitar trembled as he felt like a terrifying gaze had landed on him, and everything about him turned extremely clear as if it was all beings perused!","And he...couldn't do anything to stop it.","\"Born near the Megalos Pantheon of Zeitland, you were only a little cub all those cycles ago. But look at you now...\"","WAA!","His voice seemed to hold traces of interminable power.","His mere voice caused Savitar, a supposed Great One, to shudder as he felt like if he kept listening, his whole history- all of his records would be told right in front of him!","|Who...no, what are you? What do you really want?!|","Savitar asked with a sense of trepidation as he realized he truly didn't understand this entity before him.","Looking at the terrifying golden Eye of Existence that caused his very weavings to shudder with pressure, he realized that he truly knew too little about him!","At this moment, the golden eye of this being pressed its heavy pressure on him as his voice echoed out passively.","\"I don't need partners. Only followers. You, O One Who Walks, get to decide at this moment whether you wish to be a follower.\"","The power within his voice was potent.","But it was that eye.","That terrifying golden Eye!","That was the thing that caused Savitar the most fear as he felt like everything about him would be discovered sooner or later.","|I...I don't...|","\"DECIDE!\"","A single word boomed out as shockingly, the illusory golden eye above Noah's head opened its pupils wider than ever before golden lightning moving many times faster than the speed of light smashing into Savitar instantly as his figure froze.","|The Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, has imposed one of its capabilities on the target named Savitar.|","|Existence Suppression has been utilized for the first time.|","|Due to their lower complexity of existence and state of being compared to you, the target before you was not able to evade the effects of Existence Suppression. You can now choose to seal the complexity of Existence of this body of the selected target, and establish a link towards other parts of its weavings. If your gaze lands on their other Records as well, the effects of Existence Suppression can be applied freely.|","...!","The...sealing of the complexity of existence?","Sealing.","Sealing!","It was too profound to see as Noah couldn't help but wish to give it a go!","Instantly, Savitar felt his existence...begin to forcefully shrink.","His power.","His weavings. His records.","His Outerversal Authority.","Everything about him felt like it was becoming smaller- as if it was being shut behind a door he could never open no matter how he wished to in the future!","He looked around him in sheer terror as he noticed the weight of an undeniable golden light- a light that didn't just affect this body, but could eventually go on to affect all his other bodies- even his main one.","...!","And his existence inherently felt the end result of all this would be...his entire weavings of existence sealed to the point that he would be even more powerless than the day he was born.","He would be like the entities here considered less than nothing- the tiny humans who lived within the depths of Cosmos and Universes who didn't even know how to wield authority!","This...this filled him with such terror that couldn't even be brought by death as his golden obsidian body instantly bent itself down.","His aurora of wings that had recently sprouted behind him and his thousands of limbs all bent down in sheer terror as his voice groveled out!","|Follower! I will be a follower!|","HUUM!","With a face filled with terror, a Great One yelled out."]},{"number":3319,"title":"Chapter 3319: Chapter 3318 What an Eye! II","paragraphs":["A Great One.","The One Who Walks.","He may have garnered a great deal of titles and power over the cycles that he lived, and yet at this moment, he bent himself towards another.","Towards a great being that looked towards him with a single cold illusory eye as after confirming the ridiculous effects of Existence Suppression, he began to slowly reverse its effects on Savitar.","If someone held less complexity than him and made themselves his enemy, their fate would be an extremely dismal one.","\"Present your very Megalos Regnum forward.\"","...!","An Outerversal Morphons' power stemmed from their Outerversal Physiology and their Megalos Regnum.","Their very will- across all their bodies.","At this moment, from Savitar, billowing obsidian waves of light flowed from him and coalesced into an Obsidian Crown that floated towards Noah.","A Representation of the Megalos Regnum.","The Megalos Regnum Crown of a Great One!","It was represented to Noah at this moment as he beckoned towards it, his hand coming to grasp it as his illusory golden eye flashed.","The terrifying light of the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, wrapped around this crown as a golden string passed through it.","This golden string closed in on itself and came to wrap around Noah's neck like a necklace- a chain that had the aura of a Great One's Megalos Regnum Crown leaking from it akin to a prize!","A single obsidian crown was adorned on this golden necklace.","When Savitar saw this, he shuddered further as if he could see this being declaring that in the future, many more crowns of Great Ones would fall into that golden necklace!","Reigning in his fear, he bowed down even further and spoke out.","|Your Follower greets you, O Dreamer of the Megalos.|","He called him with the distinction he introduced himself with.","He didn't dare say his actual name.","The One Who Walks, on this day, found himself with absolutely no place to walk to but a single one.","\"Rise, and let us pay a visit to your Tainted Omniverses- nay, Our Tainted Omniverses.\"","...!","Savitar trembled, and yet said absolutely nothing apart from nodding vehemently.","All of this...came with the simple usage and eruption of an Eye.","An Eye of Existence.","What an Eye of Existence it was as it seemed its usage was slowly being unearthed!","At the same time that Noah's grandiose actions unfolded, his distinction as the Cartographer of Existence buzzed.","Where his gaze could reach...should be tremendously expanded.","How seamlessly he could traverse across Megalos Ynnere should be even more elevated.","So he knew as the Cartographer that it was time he paid visits to other Omniverses.","Undoubtedly, those with Complex weavings of existence would already be converging towards the Tresorverse of the Omnifather.","And the Omniverses that were Tainted and filled with Dark Matter Cores? His Infinite Omniverse was inexplicably hungry for them- starting with those Savitar had been sitting over.","A terrific power flowed into Noah from the weavings of a long extinct race.","It was before the reconstruction of events even ended as it caused questions to arise as to what surprises and anomalies lay ahead.","But for now, he needed to understand the extent of what the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, could truly see.","He also had to grasp the intricacies of the Sacred Primal Megalonians themselves as the Reconstruction of the weavings of the most terrifying race across the Megalos continued to unfold!","—","Amidst chants of his name.","Pyrrhus turned into a streak of vibrant light across the steps constructed by the Quintessential Megalonian Nu as he arrived above the center of the massive Sacred Primal Sea.","He looked down within its depths as he felt the core of his being vibrating.","His Source of Existence.","The System of Existence for all Megalonians...was the Megalos.","But what did it truly stand for?","Covered by tendrils of Existential waves of light, his golden body floated down serenely as if he were performing some sort of ancient ceremony.","And the core of his being...started to pulsate with unique vibrations.","His whole body entirely was made up of countless strings of astral radiance, its composition, and complexity allowing for the terrifying methodology of cultivation that the Megalonian carried out!","It was a complex system of existence, but the bulk of it came down...to choices and possibilities.","Any possible choice one made would lead to a different outcome.","A different path, and a weaving of oneself.","Making one choice could lead one to death. Making another choice could lead to a fortuitous encounter.","Making one choice could lead to enmity forming with one group, or becoming allies with another group!","All of them...were possibilities.","Possible weavings.","The Sacred Primal Megalonians...pulled upon all possible versions of their weavings as if they were pulling upon countless parallel lives!","All paradoxical and uncertain versions of themselves that theoretically could have become an eventuality- they pulled upon their weavings.","When they increased their complexity of existence, their progression was based on the cultivation of every single one of the countless possible versions of themselves that could have walked across the Megalos.","...!","To an extent.","With some limitations.","But this source of Existence alone was utterly terrifying!","Noah's will within Pyrrhus took a deep breath of absolute amazement as after the strings that made his existence vibrated to a unique frequency, an explosion of golden brilliance unfolded.","It was around the same time that his body touched the surface of the Sacred Primal Sea.","With the explosion of golden brilliance, illusory bodies that looked extremely similar to him began to manifest all around him.","Possible versions of him born from different choices.","Possible parallel weavings across the Megalos.","Their illusory figures all increased as their faces were cloudy, but their very being across the Megalos seemed to be looking at him as their bodies began to radiate light!","Tendrils of golden brilliance began to rise from the golden sea and into the body of Pyrrhus.","At the same time, the ever increasing illusory possible versions of himself that continued to increase all around had tendrils of light arc across their bodies.","They increased their complexity of existence.","But the gains were not for them.","All of it...surged like a billowing tide towards the singular version of himself that represented the accumulation of all choices and possibilities across the Megalos!","This...was the terrifying Source of Existence of the Sacred Primal Megalonians!"]},{"number":3320,"title":"Chapter 3320: Chapter 3319 The Trigger of Destruction! I","paragraphs":["Sacred Primal Megalonians.","Entities that only managed to live for a few cycles, and yet even within these cycles, they produced multiple entities at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage and even those who had managed to sever existence.","The reason for their rise was the shocking composition of their very being that led them to develop means of increasing their complexity that others could never follow, nor even have the chance to study and follow.","A single Megalonian elevating their complexity was akin to countless others increasing their complexity for them!","|Incredible...|","Within the reconstruction, on one of the other 81 Megalos Mountains that Noah had yet to turn his gaze towards.","Near another buzzing Sacred Primal Sea, a small house was built in extremely close proximity to the sea as such a lodging was something very few Megalonians could achieve- with most only gaining access a few light years around the periphery of the sea.","The small house looked like it was made of stellar purple blocks of light as standing next to it was Possessed Megalonian who held the will of three Antediluvian Leviathan- Arguros!","A Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian.","And yet their position was a high one as at this place, Arguros could see the tendrils of the raging gold sea right up close, the intense waves of complexity booming from them being used by him as he had long since begun cultivating.","Even though he didn't obtain a Quintessential or an Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, he felt like even this Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian was something others could only dream of as this whole opportunity...would tremendously aid him and any others who even arrived here tremendously.","He could say this with surety as he turned his head to see tens of thousands of illusory copies of himself.","Possible weavings of himself across the Megalos.","All of them...were increasing their complexity as the boons all stacked and were granted to himself.","|O Entropy...|","Arguros spoke with tremendous emotions as he felt the Ordinance of Entropy he had declared for himself years ago.","He declared it.","He sought its unfathomable wonders that exceeded the most boundless possible extremes as his entire being was dedicated to it.","As his complexity of existence rapidly increased with the shocking means of the Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian, he could say with surety that by the end of this, he should be entirely amalgamated with Entropy.","He should step into the state of existence known as Ordinance Amalgamation, or at the very least be at its doors!","This, he knew in his heart.","As purple violet flames raged around him and tens of thousands of other illusory selves from possible weavings, Arguros wondered.","'Will the rest of the Antediluvian Leviathans benefit as much as me? I know the Esteemed Elder Titans above me will make the most of the boons the Omnifather has left behind for us...'","...!","The Esteemed Elder Titans.","They all entered the Tresorverse of the Omnifather as what height did they reach? Which Megalonian did they possess? And what level of power would they reach at the end of it all? Arguros did not know!","On another Megalos Mountain.","A Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian stood up on his throne as he stared at the Sacred Primal Sea in the distance.","The eight other thrones beside him all had looks of confusion as they stared towards him, and his domineering voice filled with coldness and command leaked out.","|I shall undergo baptism in the Sacred Primal Sea for the foreseeable future...I sense a breakthrough at hand.|","...!","He held a large amount of influence, reign, and control over the decisions of this mountain.","To use it for himself would be more than fine so long as he gave enough of a reason to!","The unity of Megalonians made it so that if it was to elevate their strength and increase the power of the lineage as a whole, it was more than sufficient.","The other thrones had no reason to deny the words of the Honored Megalonian as they watched him float serenely towards the Sacred Primal Sea.","Around his body, an Ordinance that looked to be half a step into Amalgamation began to meld with him seamlessly, making it clear that when he left this reconstruction, he would be deeply entranced in the Ordinance Amalgamation stage.","Survival was the only option.","He could not fail his full Amalgamation that he was fearing for all these past cycles!","The eyes of the Quintessential Megalonian burned with a cold light that could only belong to a single being- and it was none other than the Sword of the Commonwealth!","One by one, entities across the Megalos Ynnere delved into the Tresorverse of the Omnifather and arrived at a profound reconstruction- taking on the bodies of Megalonians as if they made advancements in this space...it was bound be to the safest in all of existence.","Those fearing a collapse of their existence during the progression from Ordinance of Existence to Ordinance Amalgamation moved forward fearlessly.","They felt like this reconstruction was profoundly perfect for this as where else would they be able to advance in the bodies of others?!","With profound fervor and haste, they moved.","Because during all of this, in the back of their minds, nobody knew when this reconstruction would come to an end.","The events to play out were set.","The destruction of the Megalonians was set.","The only thing to make sure of was for them to obtain as much as they could before the destruction came!","This was the thought ringing out and resonating within many weavings of existence.","Many.","But not all.","In one particular weaving- in the body of the only Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, the will inside it looked at the ridiculous pace of progression brought about due to the terrifying System of Existence as he had but a single thought.","He thought that there was no way he would be leaving this Reconstruction without the terrifying system of existence of the Megalonians!"]},{"number":3321,"title":"Chapter 3321: Chapter 3320 The Trigger of Destruction! II","paragraphs":["With a radiant gold Megalos Mountain.","Inside its depths, on the peak of the mountain holding the only Sacred Primal Sea, Pyrrhus had descended onto the gold waters of the golden sea and become submerged in it as he was bombarded with endless waves of complexity.","Ones that were undoubtedly hundreds of times more potent than even those received as the feedback from traversing on the Roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","And this was further amplified by the System of Existence of the Megalonians themselves as all around, the illusory possibilities of Pyrrhus across the Megalos all increased the complexity of Existence concurrently while it all went towards a single source!","Pyrrhus.","Himself.","Noah!","At this moment, it wasn't just Quintessence, Infinity, Manadynamics, or Entropy that had been propelled up enough to form Fabled Omniverses of their own.","Every single core of Noah- every part of his concepts within the First Mundi of Power were propelled to a terrifying enough level that they began to seamlessly form their own Fabled Omniverses.","Fabled Omniverse of Cheats.","Fabled Omniverse of the Protagonist.","Fabled Omniverses of Loot, Continuity, Relativity, Uncertainty, Tyranny, Medicine, and more!","One by one, dozens of singular concepts that could each be taken to define a single being...were all given focus and elevated simultaneously.","Mana acted as the pathway to seamlessly transform into every single one of these concepts as Infinity and Manadynamics were surging exponentially, along with a singular concept that was showing the extent of Noah's actions.","How everything he was doing right...was Quintessential!","Quintessence itself rose maddeningly as through an endless dream, weavings of its Ordinance were already whispering to Noah.","At this moment, they only became clearer.","Nothing prevented other Sources of Existence from being expressed within this Reconstruction as the weavings of Kuklos and Ingeniare were also facing a bombardment of an increase in complexity.","Everything was bound to form a Fabled Omniverse in this Reconstruction.","The only question was how many would declare their Ordinance...and exactly how Noah would navigate the declaration of his existence with a specific Ordinance, or even Amalgamate with it later on without failing and collapsing his existence.","The words of caution from Arguros rang in his mind still.","And yet he forged ahead without fail, his will feeling the brilliance of his Atlas of Existence for an answer!","In the midst of all this...","BOOM!","An explosive sound echoed out as a rift in space appeared far above the golden clouds of this Megalos Mountain.","The Quintessential Megalonian Nu gazed above with a tight gaze along with all other megalonians as from above, the figure of an astral green Megalonian could be seen- vibrant astral wings extending behind her as they cradled a weakening weaving of existence.","One that belonged to...an Antediluvian Leviathan whose body shone weakly with a multicolored light!","His very weavings of Existence were fading apart as his Amalgamation seemed to be unstable and near the point of rejection- his weavings of existence far too scattered as he seemed to be at death's door!","Yet when Quintessential Megalonian Nu gazed above and saw this scene, her eyes became utterly enraged as she bellowed out.","|Vayan! You dared to bring an outsider to our home?! This is the only Inviolable Decree we have! You...!|","She could see despair and hesitation on the face of the verdant astral Megalonian who came down regardless, her figure making a beeline towards the Sacred Primal Sea as her words echoed out defiantly amidst tears.","|He failed to Sever Existence! He will die if what is left of him is not stabilized. He will die! The Sacred Primal Sea is the only thing that could possibly hold him together. Please, Esteemed Overseer Nu- just until his existence is stabilized!|","The verdant astral Megalonian, Vayan, cried out while arriving above the waters of the Sacred Primal Sea- a distance away from Noah, as she carefully placed the body of the multicolored Antediluvian Leviathan on its surface.","The body of this massive entity emanated terrifying age and power that seemed to be rapidly fading away at this moment, Noah gazing at it with scrutiny as all of this...were part of the events set to unfold within this Reconstruction.","He and many others always wondered.","How had the Megalonians perished?","How had entities discovered their terrifying composition of existence and hunted them all to extinction?","Standing in the midst of this reconstruction, the beginnings of the answer began to unfold at this moment.","A Megalonian...had brought in an Outsider into their home.","Someone who had failed Existence Severing as everything about them was collapsing!","The mere fact that he was still alive was a terrifying oddity as failure of Existence Severing meant instantaneous death and collapse of existence.","Yet this being held on.","And even at this moment, His body began to naturally absorb the waters of the Sacred Primal Sea hungrily as the moment that the verdant Megalonian who was frantic saw this, her eyes beamed with happiness as she cradled the head of the Antediluvian Leviathan in her astral thighs and stroked his head that was wincing in extreme pain tenderly.","|It's okay...|","Seeing this scene, the Quintessential Megalonian Nu burned with rage as her terrifying power cascaded out, causing everything nearby to shudder.","|PREPOSTEROUS!|","BOOM!","|You would disobey the one cardinal rule of our Lineage for an outsider?! You would put us all at risk for...for what?!|","Her eyes burned with tremendous anger.","At this moment, her power permeated everywhere as with but a thought, she could sever the very existence of Vayan and even the Outsider she brought with her!","And yet the verdant astral Megalonian shook her head wistfully as she only cradled the head of the Antediluvian Leviathan, more and more waves of the golden sea surging into him.","Noah observed the increasing rage of the Quintessential Megalonian Nu, but his vibrant Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, observed another shocking fact.","On the bodies of some of the Possessed Megalonians that had the wills of Antediluvian Leviathans within them, their weavings were chaotic and filled with immeasurable shock as they gazed at the bloody body in the middle of the Sacred Primal Sea.","The entity that had failed at Existence Severing.","They gazed towards him with shock and adulation as they called out under their breath...","|Omnifather...?|","|Omnifather!|","Shock.","Disbelief.","Incredulity.","It all buzzed vibrantly in the weavings of the Antediluvian Leviathans as they came to witness the first trigger of the event that would lead to the downfall of the Megalonians.","The arrival of a dying entity who had absolutely failed in Existence Severing and should have perished...the Omnifather!"]},{"number":3322,"title":"Chapter 3322: Chapter 3321 Set in Stone! I","paragraphs":["An Antediluvian Leviathan shining with multicolored grandeur was the first outsider to arrive within the dominions of the Sacred Primal Megalonians!","Since their very early beginnings, they decreed sets of rules to be followed as one of the more inviolable ones...was no outsiders within their home.","Inviolable.","It had never before been broken, nor did anyone plan to break it.","Until that day.","The verdant astral Megalonian brought down a near-death Antediluvian Leviathan who had just failed Existence Severing- his body being bathed by the grandiose light of this sea as around it, Noah was looking at something else that was even more profound.","The looks of the Possessed Megalonians that held the wills of Antediluvian Leviathans were showing shock and disbelief as they even uttered out the word of a single being!","Someone they idolized.","The Omnifather!","'Really?'","Noah stared at the distant figure being cradled on the thighs of a verdant astral entity as he wondered.","The Omnifather actually had a hand in the destruction of the Megalonians? Either way, he seemed to have been involved as after the heavy commotion of shock where bountiful tendrils of golden brilliance surged into him, within seconds...","BOOM!","He opened his eyes!","It was akin to an ancient entity waking.","He felt the hands of his beloved on his head, and he saw her face as he smiled weakly.","With the opening of his eyes, everything began to shake tumultuously as if a terrifying existence was waking up, this entity looking around him as his expression gradually changed!","\"No, Vayan...what did you do?!\"","His multicolored face gradually lost color as he rose.","He felt the golden sea surging into him as he rose up, and the verdant astral Megalonian that brought him here only smiled happily as she shook her head.","\"I thought I would lose you. I couldn't...I couldn't!\"","...!","The scene was utterly ridiculous.","As if they were watching some melodrama!","Quintessential Megalonian Nu found it utterly unforgivable that they had such a deep connection in the first place, and even more unforgivable that this Outsider was here.","Her weavings began to move as she raised her hand and brought it down with unfathomable brilliance.","|No Outsiders are permitted in our homes...this, I will ensure!|","An Existence Severing entity moved.","When her hand arose, it seemed like everything lost its texture as all weavings of existence nearby fell under her control.","Above the shimmering golden sea, an unforgiving illusory face formed and opened its eyes as it gazed down callously- this face seeming to bear the endless weight of existence as its eyes and mouth opened to release apocalyptic existence severing golden beams of light!","Any Entity that these existence severing golden beams of light touched would undoubtedly perish.","Vayan had her gaze changed drastically at such a reality as beside her, the existence who had failed Existence Severing sighed while his injured body raised his hand.","\"Ashes to ashes.\"","HUUM!","\"Dust to dust.\"","...!","All beams of that would extinguish any existence they touched vanished before they reached them.","The face in the skies flickered before it also turned into flickers of brilliance and vanished, the figure of Quintessential Megalonian Nu showing extreme astonishment as she locked onto the existence down below.","He had failed Existence Severing.","And yet...he extinguished the inviolable power of an Existence Severing entity as if it were nothing?!","The scene was one that could induce utter horror as this being sighed again and began to rise up.","\"I will leave, it may not be too late. The fewer complexities we have between us, the better. Vayan...\"","He turned to stare at the woman who looked dazedly at him on the surface of the golden sea, his face showing endlessly affection as he whispered something only she could hear.","And after that...","SAA!","His figure turned into a flicker of light- at a speed that even caused the gaze of the Quintessential Megalonian Nu to change as he only left behind a voice!","|I hope...it is not too late.|","A few words.","The entity had appeared in such a short period of time in the home of the Megalonians, and yet he left rapidly as he purposefully did not look at anything within.","He left in a hurry as if him simply being here was already causing irreversible damage!","And in a glimmer...he was gone. Quintessential Megalonian Nu gazed towards Vayan with rage as she waved her hands, a wind picking her up as the both of them disappeared.","They only left behind panicked Possessed Megalonians who were gazing up where the Omnifather had been with reverence and confusion, the questions inside their hearts being too many.","Noah observed all of this playing out as his existence continued the baptism within the Sacred Primal Sea, many possible weavings surging around him as he calculated many things!","Gradually, the Megalos Mountain retained its calmness as if nothing had happened.","But in the back of everyone's minds, the words of the Omnifather continued to ring out.","He stated twice how he hoped that it wasn't too late.","But Noah and a few others knew...that it was.","Whatever had happened, whatever mechanisms were set into place- it was all too late.","The eventual destruction of the Sacred Primal Megalonians...was now set!","'Ah...'","Noah shook his head and focused on himself as he felt something he had known in the back of his mind coming while he bathed in the Sacred Primal Sea.","At the edges of the cloud of possible weavings of himself cultivating all around him, one by one, they began to flicker and disappear.","A limitation in the System of Existence of the Megalonians.","They could carry out their terrifying methodology of cultivation, but it was not something that was so obscene and overpowered.","It had its limitations as one of the major ones...was that after a certain time, the endless possible versions of oneself called upon to stack their increasing complexity of existence onto a single self began to disappear.","As if they could not exist in this weaving of existence that was never theirs for too long!"]},{"number":3323,"title":"Chapter 3323: Chapter 3322 Set in Stone! II","paragraphs":["Within moments, every single one of them disappeared until the sea around Noah retained its calmness.","He would not be able to call upon any possible versions of himself again until after a certain amount of time passed.","'Within a day? Less?'","He ponderingly dug into the memories of Pyrrhus as he let the waves of the golden sea wash over him.","In a vision only he could see, a few thousand layers of Fabled Omniverses now rotated around him as they represented vibrant concepts within his First Mundi of Power, as well as the intricate weavings of Ingeniare and Kuklos that throbbed with vibrant light all around him!","He felt like he had stably propelled himself onto a terrifying level of power, the decree of an Ordinance not too far away as within this Tresorverse Sacred Domain...they should have a few days.","Before whatever events were set to play out unfolded, he should be able to make terrifying gains!","—","Around Omniverse X-999.","Indeterminate light years away, a loud of darkness was throbbing with weavings of Outerversal Authority as it sought to obtain any wisps of information regarding what was happening within, but any tendrils of information were hard to come by!","The Great Ponderor had been seeking to understand his enemy more through Savitar, but this fool had turned out to be useless as now, he wasn't any closer to understanding his enemy.","At a certain point in time though.","'Huh?'","The massive Eye of Existence within the obsidian murky veiled area vibrated and became stern as moments later...","WAP!","It disappeared rapidly.","Quickly!","It was such a rapid retreat, but it was done by the Great Ponderor regardless as he trusted in his senses more than anything else.","Senses he had honed over cycles!","Seconds after he was gone...","WU!","A terrifying wave of golden light passed over this area.","And moments later, a figure adorned in golden robes and emanating terrifying waves of majesty appeared.","It was none other than Noah, with a terrifying golden eye blazing with flames above him as he had radiated a scan all around Omniverse X-999 without abandon!","He hones in on this area with fading Outerversal Authority, his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence being so obscene that even the waves of the tendrils of Outerversal Authority nearby had little arrows and words pop over them.","[Wisps of the residual authority of an Outerversal Morphon. 99% chance of the target to be the one distinguished as the Great Ponderor.]","...!","The enemy had run away.","They weren't even there, and yet he had been able to identify wisps of their authority!","The capabilities of the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence continued to be terrifying as Noah grasped the tendrils of remnant Outerversal Authority within thought as he also turned around to look at the seemingly endless expanse that represented Omniverse X-999.","He didn't like that his enemy knew where one of his bases was.","He remembered the weavings of a certain Dream of the Megalos where he had moved with the Commonwealth for hundreds of years as within it, Omniverse X-999 had disappeared to never be found.","It was a dream.","And yet...","'Might as well...'","His eyes radiated a terrifying level of light as he began to tug on the distinction of the Cartographer of Existence!","This distinction had stated something simple- their details rising up before Noah's eyes again.","|On Omniverses where your weavings are present, the Cartographer's Gateways can be formed, with each one laid down in an Omniverse allowing instantaneous passage to all other connected Omniverses.|","|As the Cartographer of Existence, the Existential Displacement of Omniverses of other bodies of existence at a similar level is possible for an extremely high cost that your weavings of Existence will have to bear.|","Existential Displacement.","It had become something possible for him, even though he didn't know how great the cost would be as it wasn't set!","But...","HUUUM!","His body began to vibrate with power as a few hundred layers of Fabled Omniverses were already emerging around him- the gains made in the reconstruction of the Tresorverse Sacred Domain being synchronized with his Existence out here even though the set events had yet to end!","Noah attributed this terrifying capability to nothing else but the identity of Pyrrhus- An Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian whose distinction far outstripped all others.","Of course, it could just be his own uniqueness since he did hold the distinctions of the Protagonist and Cheats that were currently burning with layers of Fabled Omniverses!","With such thoughts swirling in his mind...","|Existential Displacement.|","HUUM!","He called out.","And immense waves of authority instantly gathered around him as behind him...white brilliance flourished.","It did so with grandiosity as within moments, a terrifying white wheel emerged as it screamed out ancientness and age!","A white wheel.","So pristinely white, and yet its brilliance was directed towards a single Omniverse at this moment as prompts rose before Noah's eyes.","|An Omniverse has been made the target of Existential Displacement.|","|The map of the explored Sectors of the Megalos Ynnere is open for the Cartographer of Existence to choose the area of Displacement.|","|The farther the distance, the greater the required authority.|","Noah's vision saw multiple layers of existence.","He saw what his eyes observed ahead of him, and he also saw a fantastical map that showed where he and Omniverse X-999 currently were compared to the Sector of the Megalos Ynnere he had expanded his vision to.","He perused across this area of the Megalos Ynnere like a map as within moments, he chose exactly where he wanted Omniverse X-999 to be displaced towards!","And...","HUUM!","The white wheel behind him began to spin.","His Atlas of Existence began to spin.","Waves of utmost complexity weavings of Existence began to leak out of Noah as within moments, he couldn't help but smile.","Because he found that the level of weavings of existence he had right now...a percentage of them were more than enough to empower this action of Existential Displacement.","He had come truly far!","Within the emergence of a blinding white light, all of Omniverse X-999 became wrapped with brilliance as a terrifying action was about to take place!"]},{"number":3324,"title":"Chapter 3324: Chapter 3323 Existential Displacement!","paragraphs":["Within Omniverse X-999.","Inside a sea of golden brilliance, Imperium had a gaze of fervor as with his power, he had already attained three Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitations that he devoured- and he could feel that a Fabled Omniverse was not too far away!","It was a fantastic boon for him to enjoy, but in the back of his mind, he continued to wonder.","He entered with Osmont, and yet he never came across him again.","Were they in different places? And the power this being expressed, truly, what was his identity?","He, as the Omniversal Ankyra, actually didn't know nor could he comprehend much regarding an existence that lived in this Omniverse!","It was hard to grasp as in the midst of all this...","HUUM!","Imperium felt a tremor.","A tremor that seemed to spread out across the whole Omniverse as an utterly terrifying authority wrapped around it, Imperium connecting to the Autarchical Omniversal Authorities that governed the weavings of this Omniverse as...the answer he got was an astonishing one.","The Autarchical Omniversal Authorities told him that...the whole Omniverse was shifting!","Shifting.","Becoming displaced!","It was an unreal phenomenon that Imperium instantly sought to seek the source of, but before anything could be achieved...","WAP!","Imperium felt a flash of white light.","And thereafter, everything settled.","Rapid. Efficient. Seamless!","Whatever Displacement had just occurred, these were the words that Imperium would use to describe it!","Displacement.","Did this mean that their Omniverse was no longer in a location that the Commonwealth could locate?","As for what could be responsible for this...","Imperium closed his eyes as thought about the one entity that Autarchical Omniversal Authorities could tell him nothing about.","'Is it you?' His gaze was difficult.","He looked at the connection and authority he held over the weavings of this Omniverse as at this moment, he truly pondered.","Was he...truly the Omniversal Ankyra?","It was a question he never had to ask himself, but he found it popping up more and more whenever he compared himself to Osmont!","—","A successful Existential Displacement that took Omniverse X-999 to a place where the Commonwealth nor the Great Ponderor could easily find inside Sector 1.","Noah conducted such an action seamlessly.","His Sacred Primal Eye of Existence then waded across Omniverse X-999 to confirm no issues occurred, and during this sweep...","'Hmm?'","He found the Worms of Existence that had buried deep into this Omniverse due to their fear of the Protectors of the Commonwealth.","But even more accurately, he found their...shells.","WAP!","One of Noah's figures crossed untold distances to appear in front of a veil of darkness all around with wisps of auroras of purple weaving around.","He waved his hands sideways as if he was cutting something, and a rip appeared in the space before him, and from it...spilled out thousands of obsidian Worms of Existence!","But, they were lifeless.","No movement.","Nothing.","They seemed like husks that were just floating there as Noah looked at them closely- focusing on the biggest one that should have been the Source Worm!","|Remnant Dredge of Anti-Matter|:: An empty husk that used to house a Source of Existence belonging to Anti-Matter. Its source has since been burned and used up by the Great Usurper in an effort to return back to its true source-outside of Megalos Ynnere and into Megalos Nihilos...","Wisps of information flowed into his mind as his gaze became sharp, his senses sweeping out towards Cappadocia where the weavings of Eckert were, and here...","...!","Wisps of information flowed into his mind as his gaze became sharp, his senses sweeping out towards Cappadocia where the weavings of Eckert were, and here...","Was silence!","The visage of Eckert could not be found.","Noah weaved across space to teleport in front of An Imperium Knight that should have been subjugated by Eckert, but the gaze of this entity was blank and returning to its old self as if it had lost something.","|Knight Rigo|:: A Follower of the Imperium whose Source of Existence is returning back to what it once was after the influence of the Great Usurper was lifted...","...!","Gone.","All weavings of the Great Usurper, Noah Eckert, were gone within Omniverse X-999!","Silently, this being had found a way across the Megalos as his departure was so quiet that even Noah did not know about it!","Megalos Ynnere. Megalos Beyond. Megalos Nihilos.","Three Bodies occupied the same space.","A Problem nobody could solve as Noah felt like it was an absolute limit for him to even delve into and exert himself into two of these bodies.","Matter and Dark Matter had a sense of balance with him currently through Psioneutrino Particles, and he felt like if he tried to add something else into the mix in addition to all this, the instability brought forth would not be something he could currently overcome.","So he didn't spread himself out thin as he kept his focus on what he already had.","He glanced at what used to be the weavings of a friend one last time before he disappeared, wondering just what wonders the Great Usurper would experience in the Megalos Nihilos.","The Megalos Beyond had the Great Beyonder and the weavings he laid down.","The Megalos Ynnere had the Omnifather who had just begun to spread his weavings.","What exactly did the Megalos Nihilos have?","It was a question without answers as after ascertaining the weavings of an old friend, Noah appeared in front of the Wheel of Weavings that the Commonwealth had set up, his power sweeping towards it as he would erase any inkling of foreign influences within this Omniverse and ensure that they wouldn't be capable of easily finding it again!","At the same time as he took actions to displace and take Omniverse X-999 off the map of others, another body of his was arriving in another Omniverse within the Megalos Ynnere.","One that was tenebrous in color and filled with tendrils of Outerversal Authority- with Reapers of Existence running rampant as Noah arrived there with an obsidian gold body of a subservient Savitar.","On the periphery of this Omniverse, they were welcomed by another body of Savitar- this one burning with purple flames in its Sockets as it bowed towards Noah's visage.","|This...Follower welcomes the Dreamer of the Megalos into this Tainted Omniverse.|","...!"]},{"number":3325,"title":"Chapter 3325: Chapter 3324 A Sacred Eye Opens in the Megalos Beyond! I","paragraphs":["As Savitar spoke, he couldn't help but glance at the necklace around the neck of the golden robed Noah, seeing the single obsidian crown on the golden necklace that represented his Megalos Regnum as his flickering eyes bent further down!","He could have no grand dreams about himself from now on.","Due to the schemes of the Great Ponderor, he had rammed into something he could not handle as now, he was paying the price for it.","It was a heavy one as he lost his freedom, and it seemed like in the foreseeable future, he was about to lose his Tainted Omniverses, too.","The hatred Savitar felt towards the Great Ponderor was not something that could be put into words!","Noah nodded towards his newest follower as his Eye already flashed above him and swept across this Tainted Omniverse, his figure quickly disappearing before it reappeared within its depths.","Within a place where all of its weavings had been forcefully converged to form...a Dark Matter Core.","HUUUM!","It pulsed with extremely concentrated waves of Dark Matter- this being a tool that Outerversal Morphons used to further refine their Outerversal Physiologies and further elevate their own power!","But for Noah, this would be a delicacy meant for a single construct.","\"Eat up.\"","His fingers tapped out as a multicolored singularity appeared right between him and the Dark Matter Core, a terrifying gravitational force erupting from it that began sucking everything in!","Near the Dark Matter Core were High ranking Delegatus of Savitar and Reapers of Existence, all of them being aroused at this moment as they felt a terrifying force pulling towards a singularity that seemed like it was eating up everything nearby.","...!","Their hearts leaped out in terror as they called out.","|Master!|","|Great Savitar!|","|O One Who Walks!|","Cries boomed out, but they received no answers.","The quintillions who perished within this Omniverse before they were pulled to become Reapers of Existence could take recompense in the deaths of all those residing within their altered Omniverse at the very least!","Cries boomed out, but they received no answers.","The quintillions who perished within this Omniverse before they were pulled to become Reapers of Existence could take recompense in the deaths of all those residing within their altered Omniverse at the very least!","Noah's body was unbound by the terrifying pressure of the singularity eating up everything, his figure disappearing and appearing beside the two bodies of Savitar who had stayed put where they were, ignoring the cries of his forces down there as when Noah reappeared...","|I shall take Master to another one of my Tainted Omniverses...|","Savitar swallowed any feeling in the depths of his heart as his fear of this being who held control of his very Megalos Regnum was far too deep, making him not have even an ounce of rebellion as, at this moment, the target of his hatred remained the Great Ponderor!","\"Let's go.\"","Noah nodded towards his new follower as their figures flickered away- about to go door to door within Tainted Omniverses and have them devoured and assimilated by the Infinite Omniverse.","All Sources of his existence apart from Outerversal Authority were rising rapidly- with this power resuming its speedy advancement as well through the recent actions of the Infinite Omniverse, as well as...Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias who was moving valiantly to further cement the role of the Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of- and to make sure that he went to obtain all the possible boons from whatever the Great Beyonder left behind!","—","Across the weavings of Existence.","Within the Megalos Beyond.","Inside the Pantheon of Umbra!","Ozymandias rose up, the illusory screens showing his figure within the Crucible of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos beginning to flicker and fade away as within moments...","HUUM!","His glorious stellar obsidian body was taken out of the Crucible entirely to appear in the dreary skies of the Pantheon of Umbra.","The figure of Little Aspasia clasped her hands with fervor as her voice echoed out.","|As deemed by the commands of the Great Mother, I truly present to you all the Instrument of the Beyonder- returning victorious from his first entry into a Crucible of the Beyonder!|","The name of the Great Mother who kept Heretical Morphons at bay was mentioned.","The honor of the Instrument was further expressed as...the deep voice of none other than the Great Wheel boomed out.","|Haha, yes! The Pantheon of Umbra shall joyfully celebrate the emergence of the Instrument of the Beyonder. When our forces are sufficient, we can start heading to other Pantheons to challenge the other Crucibles of the Beyonder. For now...a celebration!|","The Great Wheel.","Countless intricate tentacles made this being as when Ozymandias came out, his aura was still rapidly rising in power as his Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum were also affected by the extensive rise of existence of his other self in the Megalos Ynnere.","States of Existence were unique.","They didn't discriminate between whatever Source of Existence one was cultivating- whether they were from the Megalos Ynnere, Megalos Beyond, or Megalos Nihilos- the States of Existence seemed to be the only similarity!","Ozymandias could think along this line of thought with confidence as he had closely experienced the lives of both an entity living alongside Matter and Dark Matter.","'Maybe herein lay a possible solution to the Three Body Problem...'","He had this thought in passing as he smiled, but essentially, due to the uniqueness of States of Existence- Ozymandias himself could enjoy the ridiculous boons of the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus!","But...how different would it be when expressed by an Outerversal Morphon?","With but a thought, his rising complexity that the hundreds of thousands of nearby Morphons were mistaking due to the gains made in the Crucible and the first Amarantos Dream...it all spilled out at this moment to coalesce above him.","...!","In an instant, an obsidian singularity emerged that quickly became a stellar obsidian eye that opened its lids with fervor!","BOOM!","The weavings of the surrounding Megalos turned tumultuous at such an action, obsidian rivers of brilliance stretching down from all around as if they had to aid in the formation of this glorious Eye.","And by the time it fully formed...","|Ah...|","Even Little Aspasia was stupefied as she looked towards Ozymandias blankly.","She was following the will of the Great Mother even though she had her own doubts, but at this moment, she couldn't help but become dumbfounded as she was effectively watching a newly born Morphon who had just attained the state of One With Existence...also attain the Eye of Existence right after.","The Eye of the Megalos!","Even the intricate Great Wheel became stern at the formation of this eye as it looked too intricate compared to many he had seen...or even his own.","And the moment it formed, Ozymandias domineering swept its gaze across the Pantheon of Umbra.","Far from here, Savitar had told him how the Great Ponderor had one of his bodies on the Pantheon of Umbra.","Could he discover and glance upon this being with his current eyes?","It was a bold action to take with his identity as Ozymandias, and he did it regardless as waves of information began to enter his weavings.","Information about the Great Wheel.","Information on the bodies of abstruse Great Ones currently present in this Pantheon of Umbra!","A stellar obsidian eye opened as it sought to understand everything around it- and the very Megalos trembled as if they were helping achieve this!"]},{"number":3326,"title":"Chapter 3326: Chapter 3325 A Sacred Eye Opens in the Megalos Beyond! II","paragraphs":["An eye inherited from an Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","Its capabilities were already shown to be utterly disastrous when Noah utilized it within the Megalos Ynnere, but what about its usage in the Megalos Beyond?","With the eye opening, Noah felt like his vision was permeating across all the folds of the Pantheon of Umbra as nothing could escape his sight.","The stellar skies. The dark earth. The tall mountains. The horror inducing structures erected throughout it. The tentacles and fur of countless Outerversal Morphons.","Every single thing fell into his eyes as an inflow of information only kept coming in en masse, with his focus being the closest ones here!","[Aspasia]:: State of Existence- One With Existence. Source of Existence- Outerversal. Lifespan- 2 Megalos Cycle/90 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- An entity in tune with the weavings of the Great Beyonder at a higher level than most since she was born from threads of a Source of a Crucible...","[Third Body of the Great Wheel]:: State of Existence- Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Outerversal. Lifespan- 44 Megalos Cycle/110 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- Some limitations arise in attaining the more closed off records of this entity due to the disparity inside complexity...","...!","The eye was utterly terrifying.","It showed the weavings of Aspasia before they flowed towards The Great Wheel- with this entity actually having passed the state of declaring his Ordinance of Existence as, at this moment, he had already begun his Amalgamation.","If he failed, there was the collapse of his existence.","If he passes, he could spend the next cycles increasing his complexity and seeing whether Existence Severing would be something he could reach in his lifetime!","But there seemed to be a theme as many powerful entities...were held at the Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation as they didn't fully take that last step.","They were afraid to proceed ahead as the results of failure were truly too cataclysmic!","Ozymandias nodded as his gaze continued to pierce across the Pantheon of Umbra.","His eyes caught three other Outerversal Morphons who had brought their Outerversal Physiology and Regnum to Echelon 7- distinguishing them as other Great Ones, but they had only been able to declare their Ordinance of Existence.","But soon enough...","\"Hmm?\"","His eyes shone as on the other side of Umbra, within the depths of obsidian earth that showed a collection of caves.","A veiled Outerversal Morphon that seemed to be brooding fell under his gaze.","[False Body of Nietzsche, the Great Ponderor]:: State of Existence- Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Outerversal. Lifespan- 51 Megalos Cycle/180 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- The False Body of Nietzsche is used for everyday purposes. Some limitations arise in attaining the more closed off records of this entity due to the disparity inside complexity...","The enemy that had been targeting him appeared.","Their maximum possible lifespan was grander than most he had seen as he had lived for a truly long time.","They had also declared their Ordinance of Existence and had already taken the steps towards Amalgamation similar to the Great Wheel!","Due to the complexity of existence, Noah wasn't able to utilize the feature of Existence Suppression, nor was he able to track where the other bodies of Nietzsche were.","But at the very least, he had honed in on his current enemy as all that was left after that...was to ensure their defeat!","His eyes flashed with a chilling light as in front of Ozymandias, the Tentacles of the Great Wheel throbbed with jubilancy, his followers and other Morphons clamoring with a myriad of emotions as the Great Wheel himself spoke out.","|Exquisite...I cannot see anything but grandiosity in the future as the Great Beyonder promised. Come, you shall rest in my domain while we await for the Great Mother and the Observer of Old and Young!|","The ancient voice of the Great Wheel boomed out as among the throngs of Outerversal Morphons, those who did not believe only wonder and expansion were coming for the Megalos Beyond watched coldly.","The Heretical Morphons could not yet make a move as they only watched, but many of them felt a prickling on their Megalos Regnum- as if the massive illusory obsidian eye that had opened above the Instrument was gazing at them with coldness at this moment!","In a hidden section of the Pantheon of Umbra.","Another Heretical Morphon was veiled by a cloud of dark brilliance as at this moment, his expression was even more clouded than before.","Around him, tenebrous tendrils of Outerversal Authority seethed as they faintly fused together into a terrifying decree.","The Great Ponderor.","Nietzsche!","He always planned and planned before making any moves, even more so when it came to unknown enemies!","And yet, there were very few times in the past when he was preparing for an unknown enemy that he had received a premonition of danger.","And none that was as intense as the one he felt with one of his bodies in the Megalos Ynnere!","Danger for him was defined differently from others.","Danger to him didn't represent someone who could stand on equal power- it stood for someone who was capable of finding out information about him and his records.","His records were the most important thing.","His weavings were of paramount importance as if ever they were about to get uncovered or becoming uncovered by an enemy, this was what set off his sense of danger more than anything else!","And his sense of danger had been buzzing chaotically since that time, and had only continued to ring ever louder since then.","This wasn't good.","As a schemer, being learned of and schemed against was never something he would stand for!","So, what he had to do now...was entirely change his perspective of his enemy.","This enemy would now be designated as the highest risk that Nietzsche had ever faced, and if he continued to feel this same sense of danger- he had to approach the weavings of the one known as Protector Osmont carefully..."]},{"number":3327,"title":"Chapter 3327: Chapter 3326 Possibilities! I","paragraphs":["There were many ways to defeat an enemy.","At this moment, an Outerversal Morphon of great stature was in a terrifying bind as more often than not, he never made a direct move against his enemies.","He wasn't defeated!","And yet within this cycle of his life, he may just come to find that defeat...could also be achieved even without making a move.","Such a thought was truly terrifying as in his weavings, Nietzsche wondered.","He wouldn't truly be defeated by his enemy before they even made a move, right?","—","Ozymandias was doing well.","Noah had such thoughts as he sat on his multicolored throne within the Infinite Omniverse, the visage of the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse itself floating before him.","Ozymandias had a unique position in the Megalos Beyond as he was a central figure wrapped in a belief left behind by the Great Beyonder.","As long as he continued on this path and overcame the remaining Crucibles of the Beyonder, his power and complexity would continue to reach even grander levels!","He thought of the many possibilities that lay ahead before he focused on the visage of the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse before him.","|We have only just begun the assimilation of Omniverses and Dark Matter Cores into the Infinite Omniverse, but the direction ahead...a pathway for it is becoming clearer as it requires your guidance.|","The Infinite Omniverse came to him as it found something unfathomable.","This was all occurring amidst many great changes within the Infinite Omniverse itself as those within it were becoming increasingly complex.","His son took the lead in the Primalwater of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence as he obtained multiple Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitations, and he pushed his weavings within the Existential Dominium Realm to the peak as by placing a singular focus on Destiny...he was about to form his first Fabled Omniverse!","Barbatos, Athena, and Sona were close seconds in their rise in power even though they had not obtained as many Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitations, with their power coming from a change due to Noah himself.","The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Harems.","It seemed to be scaling its capabilities in ridiculous ways as it formed its own Fabled Omniverses, with those it was connected to having the complexity of their existence passively pushed upwards at a terrifying rate.","Those within his Harem were benefitting at an even greater rate due to his own elevation, and this wasn't to mention the constant resonance of weavings that Cheats had begun to emanate since it formed its Fabled Omniverses!","Something was being prepared as Noah currently only had an inkling as to what it could be.","And in the middle of all this, his Infinite Omniverse came to him and stated such words!","\"What is becoming clearer?\"","What could cause the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse to look so serious?","|The continued assimilation of both Matter and Dark Matter in extremely pure form is not only changing the nature of the Infinite Omniverse itself but scaling its complexity to be far past any Omniverse within the Megalos Ynnere or Pantheon within the Megalos Beyond. This increasing complexity...is the root cause.|","...!","The intermixing of Matter and Dark Matter seamlessly in a single Omniverse.","The product was something that didn't exist in any Megalos out there.","When Outerversal Morphons descended into the Megalos Ynnere and Tainted its Omniverses, they were entirely transformed into Tainted Omniverses with pure Dark Matter that had eaten up weavings of Matter entirely.","They did not assimilate.","And in the Megalos Beyond, there were no powerhouses from the Megalos Ynnere transforming the Pantheons within!","What Noah did was connect the weavings from both of these Megalos of Existence and have them seamlessly assimilate into a single thing, thereby bringing to fruition a product with a unique complexity.","But what did this all lead to?","This complexity...what did the Infinite Omniverse get from it?","Noah stared at the Manifestation with bright eyes as he waited for its answer.","And it was a terrifying one.","|I feel as if with this type of increasing complexity...I may be able to 'jump' from here and into the Expanse.|","...!","BOOM!","Countless weavings erupted and roiled around Noah.","He looked at the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse, and it looked back at him!","|...!|","An Omniverse...transcending its weavings due to complexities brought to fruition by two Megalos.","It was terrifying to think about as what exactly would the result be?","Noah had no idea as he asked the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse vibrantly.","\"How...far off are you?\"","|With the stable Terraforming and continued presence of Matter, along with another two or three Tainted Omniverses and the constant inflow of the weavings of the Megalos Beyond itself through Ozymandias...the possibility should arise. Complexity should reach a sufficient enough level, but of course, I can always continue increasing the level of complexity even further to ensure chances of success if this is attempted.|","...!","The possibilities were grand.","The Expanse was a terrifying landscape where even now, Noah was only just finishing the consumption of Hearthraes in the white space that Bob left him in!","He had explored very little of this space where powerhouses could be encountered at any moment.","After ascertaining the words of the Infinite Omniverse, he rose up from his throne with a serious expression.","Behind him, Invictus Maximus expanded out as the countless possibilities and causalities were looked at and discerned!","All of this began in a small Beast World.","All of it began with a floating Spiritual Land- a grandiose floating island!","At this moment, after many transformations and elevations, this past floating island was telling him it could possibly transcend itself.","He had always theorized where it would end up in the future- whether it could be something as vast as the Megalos Beyond or Megalos Ynnere or Megalos Nihilos.","He had theorized many possible routes, but some things could not be theorized.","Nor could they be prepared for!","\"Very well.\"","HUUM!","But he wouldn't cower back with whatever was to come, as he moved decisively.","Three more of his bodies left the Infinite Omniverse as they would rapidly ensure more of himself would arrive at the remaining Tainted Omniverses under the banner of Savitar.","He would prepare sufficiently.","The greater the complexity, the better!","He wanted to see with his own eyes what would happen with the small floating island all those months ago- just what precipice it could reach!"]},{"number":3328,"title":"Chapter 3328: Chapter 3327 Possibilities! II","paragraphs":["Complexity.","How could such a thing be truly and accurately measured?","For the most part, there was the reliance on Echelons to demarcate different levels of Complexity, with there being Nine Echelons for Sources of Existence.","Entities like Savitar, who barely qualified with the distinction of a Great One, had reached the Seventh Echelon of Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum.","Inside the Pantheon of Umbra alone, Ozymandias had observed multiple Entities who could hold the distinctions of Great Ones by having either Outerversal Physiology or Megalos Regnum at the Seventh Echelon already.","It gave a glimpse of how much more advanced the Outerversal Morphons had become as they had been enjoying the boons that the Great Beyonder left behind for multiple Cycles now.","The boons of the Omnifather had just begun to grace Megalos Ynnere, and they were extremely terrifying as just the glimpse of the Tresorverse of the Omnifather that Noah had observed so far already expressed its ridiculous boons.","It would no doubt allow the inhabitants of Megalos Ynnere to quickly bridge the power gap that seemed to exist against those in the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Nihilos- with the Echelons of their Sources of Existence rising rapidly.","Entities like Command Protector Valeria had reached the Fifth Echelon in their System of Kuklos, and Protector Lucretia reached the same Echelon in regards to her status as a Delegatus.","Old Man Eudemus...was likely about to exceed the Seventh Echelon of Kuklos as Noah didn't know where entities like the Sword of the Commonwealth were. He knew much less regarding the recently risen Antediluvian Leviathans who seemed to have much more power than those within the Commonwealth!","The followers of the Omnifather.","With the Omnifather being an Antediluvian Leviathan himself, his Lineage should have been untouchable over the cycles, and their strength showed this.","So why did they sit back and allow the Commonwealth to take the lead in ruling over these past cycles?","There were many mysteries as Noah thought about how many sides looked at the complexity of existence.","These were Echelons.","But they were far too broad.","They didn't fully encompass things like the States of Existence into account as well, and these played a Paramount factor in one's strength.","Noah was a prime example of this.","His base complexity had not reached the higher Echelons like Savitar and Nietzsche, and yet he could already overcome Savitar due to his unique Eye of Existence.","\"The measurement of complexity has to be more comprehensive...\"","Noah uttered such words as he spread out his senses, the golden eye above his head opening ever wider as it felt the countless changes of the Aletheian Havens and the Extremity Vein that acted as the center of this grandiose Construct.","It had begun to course with and radiate a terrifying light of both Matter and Dark Matter at this moment as it released low hums of resonance, terrifying levels of energy that no entity could ever contain coursing through it.","This would be one of the keys if the actions of the Infinite Omniverse were to succeed.","Noah's senses permeated across all of it as he prepared.","But no matter how much one prepared, they would always feel like it wasn't enough!","For Noah, the words of the even grander mystery that had recently appeared, Bob, reverberated in his mind.","Over the cycles, countless entities across the Megalos Beyond, Megalos Ynnere, and Megalos Nihilos had arrived in the Expanse. Over the past eons, they had sensed things. They knew that something was coming as they began gathering themselves together- thinking of strength in numbers!","But Bob stated that even this would not be enough.","That even numbers will not hold a candle for what was coming, only one's own existence being the thing to rely on the most!","This was what Bob had stated before he left, telling Noah that the white space surrounded by entity red strings he had brought him in could be used as some form of a refuge.","His words revealed many things- showing that there was some form of organization and order across the Expanse where different entities across the Megalos gathered.","But the dangers were just as vibrant.","And something that nobody was truly ready for was coming!","\"Why can't it be that no grandiose or apocalyptic changes occur while I'm moving?\"","Noah smiled as he sensed the continued waves of complexity around him.","\"If you all just give me a few months- not even years, much less even a single cycle, with no massive major existence altering events...\"","...!","If he just had months of peace.","He didn't even need years!","He didn't need Cycles!","Just months, and he could probably attain a level of power that could surpass these creatures who had been training for whole cycles.","But no.","Whether the weavings of the Protagonist were just that powerful, or by the means of Causality, massive events continued to occur as he rose up.","\"Hmm...\"","But Noah innately knew.","He himself was the root cause for at least some of these things.","Causality continued to dance from one event to another.","He made a single choice here, and it led to the eruption of many more choices thereafter!","For example, what he was doing now with the Infinite Omniverse.","Just what effects would he inadvertently bring forth if the Infinite Omniverse was successful in transcending its weavings of existence and arriving within the Expanse?","\"...\"","He couldn't say for sure.","All he knew was that he could keep moving forward.","Regardless of what massive events occurred around him.","Regardless of what effects his actions would have.","He had to keep moving forward; otherwise, if he stalled, he would be stepped on by another and die without even understanding why!","\"Let's do it boldly and without fail.\"","...!","|Yes, Master.|","He spoke, and the Infinite Omniverse affirmed.","Its complexity was reaching a critical juncture.","It seemed that within the day, the event that could change many things would be carried out!"]},{"number":3329,"title":"Chapter 3329: Chapter 3328 Refuge! I","paragraphs":["Before this change came, Noah had to understand a bit more regarding the Expanse.","His eyes twinkled as the scene of another one of his bodies observed in the Expanse became clear.","Within that white space that Bob had teleported them into.","It was a perfect white circular space surrounded by the countless tendrils of golden strings, with Noah swallowing the last golden dew drops of the Hearthraes as above him, an illusory Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree gushed down waves of complexity while below him, a Primordial Mountain of the Expanse erupted with waves of brilliance that encircled his body.","He felt like his existence had gained a sense of exalted dignity far exceeding his previous self after devouring all these Hearthraes, to the extent that he even felt a sense of closeness and familiarity with this blank space around him!","Bob called it a refuge, why was this?","One of the more actualized gains was the fact that his body that felt radiated a translucent golden glow truly felt an unshakable connection with this white space- as if it were an anchor within the Expanse that he could always find.","Noah blinked and looked around him, gazing at the distant outlines of golden strings outside of this white space as his body floated towards them while remembering that with a single tug from Bob, these strings had transported them towards the Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and with another tug, into this white domain.","If Noah could also learn how to utilize them...","He was about to reach out to a nearby golden string just to study it.","About to step out from the white space he was currently in.","When...","...!","His hands stopped inches away. His heart felt heavy waves of trepidation!","And he looked out into the golden expanse of strings as he backed away and came towards the center of the white space once more.","Trepidation.","What could give someone like him trepidation?","He stared out into the expanse of golden strings as everything looked utterly calm and serene, but his Existence continued buzzing and wouldn't lie to him as he looked out before voicing old coldly.","|Why not show yourself? Hiding in the dark doesn't suit you.| HUUM!","He spoke such words while his weavings buzzed and he looked out into the expanse of golden strings, and there was only silence!","But his gaze remained coldly staring out.","Above him, authority began to gather as his terrifying eye was about to open!","In such a deafening silence...","|Interesting.|","...!","An ancient voice that could cause one's skin to crawl boomed out from all around.","Thereafter, in the empty direction filled with golden strings where Noah was gazing at, eyes without pupils opened.","Thousands of eyes as each one radiated a horrific obsidian brilliance that felt like it could devour everything!","Such eyes were connected to the hardened silver skin of a massive spider, its body flashing with translucent radiance as more and more of it became visible.","Over nine thousand spiked silver limbs emerged from its body as they entirely surrounded the white space Noah was in, with the closest ones being inches away from the golden string Noah was just about to touch on the periphery of the white space!","A massive, silver-furred spider with thousands of eyes and limbs, its whole existence emanating pure dread as the weavings of...","\"Anti-Matter...\"","Noah's heart beat just a little faster as he uttered out while gazing at this creature.","It didn't take a single step into the white space as it seemed to be waiting. As it seemed like...it couldn't take any steps into this white space!","Its eyes stared at Noah with such a vile cold light of devouring and destruction as its intent echoed out again.","|How did a weak thing like you find and bind an Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain? With your flimsy grasp of Existence, there should have been no way for you to even know how to mix your complexity in to bind it...so what happened, little thing?|","WAA!","Its words were like trillions of knives constantly cutting each other.","Inside its questions were many answers as Noah looked around the white space that Bob left him in and remembered his words!","A refuge.","But this terrifying spider that encompassed everything all around called it an Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain. That someone of Noah's power shouldn't have even been able to bind it, nor even know how to do so with his level of complexity!","So why?","The sensation of connection he felt with this white space instantly fell into place as he recalled all the Hearthraes he had devoured in this space.","He hadn't paid attention to this feeling of closeness, but he paid attention to it now fully as above him, a glorious golden eye opened.","Waves of information began to surge out from all around.","Noah felt the hazy connection of an Entanglement his existence had with and surrounding space, where weavings of his complexity had been entrenched within it entirely as he gained a form of understanding and control over it!","Alongside these findings, prompts began to cascade over his eyes.","[You have attained Existential Entanglement with a unique domain in the Expanse that will at this moment be distinguished as an Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain.]","[So far, the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain has been identified to be a space with an absolute set of decrees that cannot be violated, and one of these decrees is the entrance into this domain. Unless permitted by the one who is currently entangled with it, nobody else can enter or affect anything within this domain.]","[Any other possible functions are currently still being analyzed.]","...!","Bob had called it a refuge.","This was the reason why!","It was a refuge within the Expanse for terrifying entities like the one that Noah was staring at right now.","Entities who could meld with the surrounding weavings without others knowing they were even there.","Entities that at this moment, even the one that Noah was staring at alone...held shocking power not at the level of an Eye of Existence or Ordinance of Existence, but they were at Ordinance Amalgamation!","Such an entity was actually camping for Noah while remaining invisible as a single wrong move meant destruction!"]},{"number":3330,"title":"Chapter 3330: Chapter 3329 Refuge! II","paragraphs":["Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Refuge!","As Noah began to learn more about it, his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence- Pyrrhus, had opened with shocking grandeur as it gazed at everything.","The pupil within this golden eye couldn't be clearly discerned as, at this moment, in addition to the vibrant white space around it- its power also landed on the silver spider creature outside of it.","[Ancient Phrike, Vujun]:: State of Existence- Ordinance Amalgamation. Source of Existence- Annihilare. Lifespan- 130 Megalos Cycle/210 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- A creature that has lived for an extremely long period of time and perfected its arts. It's its perfection, it has also not been able to move forward as even after 130 Cycles of the Megalos, its existence remains in the Ordinance Amalgamation stage. Steeped in the weavings of Anti-Matter, this Ancient Phrike, Vujun, had waded across the Megalos Nihilos for dozens of Cycles and gained many distinctions for itself. Due to the disparity in power, a limited amount of records can be observed about this being...","...!","Noah continued to be utterly dumbfounded by how far the power of the Weaver of Existence and Weaver of Extremity had become under the banner of the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence.","Because at this moment, he was able to gain details of shocking proportions on enemies who were much more powerful than him, and even all these details...were still limited in nature!","Nobody should be able to seamlessly observe the details of an Ordinance of Existence or Ordinance Amalgamation entities if they weren't even in these stages already.","And yet...Noah stared at the details of this terrifying creature ahead of him that had an extremely long life span as he spoke out.","\"How long have you been staying out there waiting, exactly?\"","Its thousands of obsidian eyes and silvery fur could cause one's trepidation, the spiked legs of the spider being even more terrifying as this creature focused on Noah before its intent calmly weaved out again.","|I sensed the reverberations of a fearsome explosion of existence, so I sent a trace of myself here to see. But for me to come across a Blancverse Domain that has just been occupied by a weak chick...that is truly a cruel twist of fate that I cannot accept.|","...!","HUUM!","Existence began to tremble after its intent.","The surrounding golden string shockingly bent towards its body, it's rotund lower half pulsing as from an obsidian singularity at the end of its body- dense silver webs instantly shot out to paint everything!","Webs!","Millions of them!","And yet they held a penetrative light that could skewer any Entity even at the Ordinance of Existence stage as they came to wrap around the Blancverse Domain like a cacoon.","|Some Blancverse Domains are weak and average in their authority as they can eventually be broken. Some are spaces that even Existence Severing entities cannot touch. I refuse to believe any weakling like you could bind the latter...no, it must be a weak domain. Come on out for me. Come on out!|","Its ancient voice was grating and held calmness initially, but it turned more and more vile while pulsing with crazed madness thereafter as, by the end, it was shouting!","It came out with more details about this place of refuge that Bob had taken Noah to that he was also studying and understanding its weavings at this very moment.","This Ancient Phrike, Vujun, was likely attracted here by the ridiculously vibrant absorption of Hearthraes that Noah was doing- an action that caused the illusory appearance of the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree that gushed down waves of complexity above, while below him, a Primordial Mountain of the Expanse did the same.","This drew the creature in.","And now, its terrifying webs wrapped around the exterior of the Blancverse Domain like an egg as the webs squeezed down, but absolutely nothing occurred!","Either a weak Blancverse Domain that could eventually be broken into, or a strong one that even Existence Severing entities could not enter.","Seeing the urgency and madness within the voice of the Ancient Phrike, Vujun, it seemed that any Blancverse Domain was a shocking rarity.","At this moment, as his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence studied the closeness and connection Noah's weavings held with this space, more details unfolded.","[The level of Existential Entanglement is currently at the very basic level, your complexity of existence only supporting it to a level that will be distinguished as the Basal Control of the Blancverse Domain. With the Basal Control of the Blancverse Domain, a few weavings are possible for you to tap into.]","This refuge.","This space.","As Noah became more in tune with it to understand it, weavings of information finally returned back to him as they were grandiose!","[The space within the Blancverse Domain can be increased or decreased in a limited fashion.]","[The location of the Blancverse Domain can be changed randomly within the Expanse.]","[Within the Blancverse Domain, weavings are extremely conducive to the growth of Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree or other unique plants like it, allowing for an alteration of their maturity in a short period of time.]","[Within the Blancverse Domain, structures and topography can be built by utilizing the Pillars of Existence within the Expanse or other forms of pure authority for those with sufficient enough complexity to do such a thing.]","...!","One weaving after another came to Noah as his eyes began to shine more and more, his singular Sacred Primal Eye of Existence focusing on one particular weaving while looking at the maddening power of the Ordinance Amalgamation entity outside of this space!","[The location of the Blancverse Domain can be changed randomly within the Expanse.]","Location.","Noah couldn't touch this being at his current stage of Ordinance Amalgamation, and he did not want to continue waiting for it to test its theory on exactly what type of a Blancverse Domain this was.","So Noah temporarily tuned out everything else as he focused on the weavings of location.","The location of the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain.","HUUM!","Within the white space, Noah's weavings spread out madly as he sought for the Existential Entanglement.","What he had inherently become entangled with not too long ago!","He sought for it, locking onto a unique sensation as thereafter hundreds of illusory layers of Fabled Omniverses began rotating around him!","And waves of energy in such high volume and concentration began to leak out of him.","More volume and concentration than anything he had to spend his weavings activating in the past!"]},{"number":3331,"title":"Chapter 3331: Chapter 3330 Refuge! III","paragraphs":["The pure white space of the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain was shaking.","Seas of authority from Noah gushed out, but because of the low level of complexity of this authority, much more of it was needed for what he wanted to do!","The Existential Entanglement he was holding onto received his thoughts on what he wanted to accomplish.","And a feedback was returned to Noah once just how much such an action would cost.","It was massive.","So massive that no entity at the stage of Eye of Existence could pay!","But Noah wasn't just some entity.","His body gushed out waves of brilliance as outside of the Blancverse Domain...","|Hey, what are you doing?|","The Ancient Phrike, Vujun, was seeking to break into it and felt the changes as its grating voice echoed out.","Its weavings began to feel a sense of urgency as if a grown entity and a child came across an extremely treasured pot of gold, and the child who could barely lift this pot was walking away with it while the grown entity could only watch.","It was a stifling feeling that just didn't sit right!","|OOOH!|","Above its silvery fur figure, a shocking banner began to unfold.","An Ordinance.","But he didn't just declare it, he had already successfully overcome the threat of the collapse of his existence to amalgamate with it.","No part of his existence was out of tune with it as he became one of this Ordinance truly!","Annihilare!","HUUUM!","The golden strings nearby began to twist and distort, this creature radiating terrifying power as his voice bellowed out.","|Break for me!|","Before it was gone.","Before something happened that took away this prized thing before it!","But...","BOOM!","Space began to distort around the white Blancverse as it ignored absolutely everything- the weavings of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer filling it to the brim as moments later, he opened his eyes and stared directly into the thousands of obsidian eyes of the Ordinance Amalgamation entity amidst the waves of webs.","\"I'll come find you, O Ancient Phrike, Vujun.\"","...!","The entirely obsidian eyes of the massive spider entity shrunk at such words.","Its actions halted.","How did this weak creature know its name?","\"You have been alive for over 130 Megalos Cycles, and you still haven't learned that you shouldn't make enemies of those you aren't entirely sure about? Very well, I have marked you. Just wait for me.\"","WAA","Words that caused the Ancient Phrike to pull back echoed out as it gazed forth into the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain with alarm!","But moments later, a flicker of radiance unfolded.","Pure white blazed.","And in a glimmer of brilliance, the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain disappeared.","...!","Where it used to be, golden strings surged to fill in the space as around, countless spiderwebs floated horrifically as the eyes of an Ancient Phrike...began to blaze with madness and a tinge of worry.","How the fuck had that weak creature known its name and even how long it had waded across existence so far?","There was no answer.","It only looked around maddeningly before its aura began to recede, its figure shooting out toward the distance as it gradually became invisible.","Within moments, it entirely disappeared while moving rapidly across the Expanse as even it knew that anything could happen here.","If it was unlucky, it could meet an Existence Severing entity that was just roving about, even in this corner of emptiness.","Even someone at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage...had to be careful while moving across the Expanse!","—","WAP!","Golden strings became twisted and distorted.","As if they were being squeezed apart, something circular bloomed with shocking force as in an instant, a dazzling white domain appeared!","Noah's Sacred Primal Eye of Existence was bright as he gazed around, finding himself in a region that had the same endless white strings stretching out endlessly, with a few variations.","He turned around towards a far distance behind him.","There, the outline of an illusory purple mountain could be seen stretching out, its brilliance heavy as its complexity of existence felt suffocating.","It was extremely far away, and yet Noah could already see an outline of its base this far away!","He didn't focus on it too much at this moment as he continued to supply his complexity through the Existential Entanglement he held with the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain, this time sending a different intent through.","Seas of authority gushed out from him as, in the next moment, the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain began to reduce in size rapidly, miniaturizing in such a way that within moments, it twisted down to the extent that its circular outline merely pushed away two golden strings in between.","And it shrank even further from here as the round protrusion between the two golden strings disappeared, the white space of the Blancverse Domain becoming unfathomably small until it barely became an indistinguishable dot of white light that was covered by the golden glow of white strings!","Only then did Noah stop.","His waves of energy stopped as he let out a breath while looking around him, seeing the radiance of this intact space as its weavings finally settled and communicated with him again.","He had only just utilized a few of its features, yet it already showed how terrifying this refuge that Bob had brought him to was!","Blancverse.","Empty.","Blank.","It was a type of a Verse as when Noah thought about it, he also thought of the Tresorverse of the Omnifather, Omniverses, Universes, and other similar wonders.","With how pure white and blank it was, and the weavings he had already uncovered about it with the Basal Control, it seemed like a type of a sandbox.","Something that could be altered and filled with an unknown number of things...so long as he held sufficient authority.","Authority that at first, it seemed to seek the Pillars of Existence within the Expanse! Would these not be the countless golden strings moving throughout? The same ones that Bob tugged on to move across the Expanse?","The ideas and possibilities were many as Noah came across these shocking findings, but his mind was already going towards a certain direction as he thought about the Blancverse.","That direction...was the Infinite Omniverse that was about to attempt making a jump that would transcend its very weavings!"]},{"number":3332,"title":"Chapter 3332: Chapter 3331 Blanc!","paragraphs":["The sensation was utterly unique.","Since coming to the Expanse, this could be considered the largest gain that Noah had made as the first thing were the Hearthraes he plucked, and the second was this Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain!","Both were gained with causality being twisted by Bob.","Bob!","As Noah secured a hidden area in between countless golden strings, he thought of this being more and more and what could be in store based on his words.","His power and status.","When Noah thought of him, the sensation he recalled based on sheer complexity...exceeded even the sensation he felt when he looked at Quintessential Megalonian Nu or even the injured Omnifather in the Tresorverse Sacred Domain.","This meant that the sensation of power he felt exceeded Existence Severing.","Why was an Entity like that running around an Expanse and doing what he did?","There was no answer to be obtained currently, and so Noah could only focus on the task at hand.","Currently, it remained understanding how to truly manipulate the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain, and how great his Complexity had to be in order to exceed the Basal Control level.","He did all of this while the Infinite Omniverse prepared for its own advancement- more and more Dark Matter Cores and entire Tainted Omniverses being sent to it to be assimilated while the connection with Ozymandias continued to allow for the inflow of Dark Matter into it. It was one of the paramount projects Noah was undertaking all at once, as this period of accumulation would not be so quick to pass.","Time was actually required for it.","But it was time that Noah had.","His actual eyes closed as the only thing that remained open was his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence.","It was in tune with everything occurring across different weavings of Existence- even though different parts of Noah were utilizing it simultaneously!","One in the Expanse. One in the Megalos Ynnere, and One in the Megalos Beyond.","Then, there was also where this eye stemmed from- the Tresorverse Sacred Domain where a shocking reconstruction continued!","—","Within a Reconstruction of the Weavings of Megalonians. |Young Master Pyrrhus, I never thought you would be so curious about the other Megalos Mountains. Have they satisfied you so far?|","Caretaker Nazal radiated a profound aurora of power as he spoke with a smile, looking back to see the graceful figure of Pyrrhus that was walking behind him on one of the massive golden chains joining the Megalos Mountains.","Nearly a day had passed as Noah moved across the reconstruction, with the time coming when he would be able to activate the Source of Existence within Pyrrhus to cultivate once more and call upon the countless possible versions of himself across the Megalos in increasing his complexity!","\"Mmm, let's head back to the Sacred Primal Sea for another baptism.\"","And so he nodded towards Caretaker Nazal who smiled while wrapping both of their figures in an aurora of light.","This whole time, Pyrrhus continued to watch for any changes that could give a gauge on just how long this reconstruction would continue, but no answer came as after the brief appearance by the injured Omnifather and his lover- nothing else had occurred so far. Within moments, they were back above a mountain that held a radiant golden sea, the throne of the Quintessential Megalonian Nu still being empty at this moment as it seemed she was still dealing with the fallout of Vayan and her actions of bringing in an outsider.","Caretaker Nazal only nodded towards the other Honored Megalonians as they gave their permission, and Pyrrhus once more floated towards the center of the Sacred Primal Sea much to the envy and dismay of other Possed Megalonians!","Over the past few days, more and more had increased in numbers as it made one thing very clear.","Everyone joined the same reconstruction.","If they joined late, it was hard to say if they would benefit from much, and whether another reconstruction would even be viable or occur after this one ended!","Could it be so easy to reconstruct the shocking weavings of Megalonians in a domain, allow one to cultivate like they once did, and even take such boons back towards their own bodies after the set events came to pass?","Noah did not think the power of the Omnifather would be so obscene as to allow this to happen again and again as the fruits of this Reconstruction seemed to be first come first served.","HUUM!","All of this passed in the back of his mind though.","He came to sink in the golden sea as around him, hundreds of illusory versions of Pyrrhus appeared and only increased as they began to elevate their complexity of existence- all of it going into Noah as it caused his Sources of Existence to reach critical levels.","He felt like he was knocking on the doors to declare an Ordinance soon- and a choice had to be made within this declaration and decree- and how he would prevent the collapse of his Existence when the time came to undergo the Amalgamation of his Ordinance.","If just a single part of him did not agree...there would be failure.","There would be the collapse of Existence.","Or so Arguros had warned.","With heavy steps, Noah forged ahead!","Meanwhile.","Within the Megalos Ynnere.","Inside the Omniverse of the Protectors.","Another one of Noah's bodies was seated in the Library within the Obelisk of the Protectors, continuing to devour cycles of knowledge from the Commonwealth when...","BZZT!","His surroundings buzzed as the many floating bookshelves surrounded by auroras of golden brilliance disappeared.","Only the book he held in his hands remained as around him, space twisted and changed as a clear blue water formed beneath him, an island erupting from it as it had the visage of an old man!","An old man who was looking at a white board that had three singularities rotating around each other chaotically.","It was Old Man Eudemus.","The Shield of the Commonwealth!"]},{"number":3333,"title":"Chapter 3333: Chapter 3332 The Warden!","paragraphs":["His power seemed to be brimming with brilliance as he stroked his beard and smiled while looking towards Noah.","\"I watched you this past day, and you truly didn't even make an attempt to leave or dissipate this...clone? But I have received the news that where the Commonwealth recorded your Omniverse X-999 to be has disappeared within its point in the Megalos Ynnere. We're these your actions? You seem to be keeping your secrecy, yet you do not run.\"","...!","He spoke while scratching his beard, his eyes focused on the three chaotic singularities on the white board!","Noah smiled at Old Man Eudemus who couldn't help himself but come as he closed the book he was reading and replied succinctly.","\"Why would I run from allies? I am, after all, a Protector of Megalos Ynnere.\"","\"Oh? I thought I decreed you a Protector of the Commonwealth?\"","...!","The two exchanged words rapidly as Noah floated onto the island swimming on the blue waters, sitting opposite Old Man Eudemus who finally raised his eyes from his board and onto him.","\"You also weren't entirely honest regarding your power. You were at the forefront on the Roots of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence...who knows which Megalonian you were lucky enough to possess.\"","The eyes of Old Man Eudemus seemed to contain endless depth as he looked at Noah who shook his head calmly.","\"I never lied regarding my power.\"","He never lied.","Truly.","When he met Old Man Eudemus, he had yet to form any Fabled Omniverses, nor did he attain his current State of Existence!","He smiled at how much had changed in a matter of days as he continued.","\"As for Omniverse X-999...who wouldn't want some secrecy in these Megalos? A power I'd never heard of suddenly came and imposed new rules of existence in the Omniverse I knew. I had to at least understand what I was dealing with, yes.\"","\"Mmm...you had to first know who you were dealing with.\" Old Man Eudemus nodded, and his gaze turned back to the whiteboard showing chaotic movements of three singularities rotating around each other as he continued.","\"You now know of the Commonwealth and the surface of its forces, and from this, you were confident enough to move Omniverse X-999 and even stay here freely. You did not consider the Commonwealth to be a threat to you.\"","...!","His confidence?","Noah smiled at this and replied while also focusing on the three bodies of singularity on the white board.","\"We are all on the side of Matter. On the side of Megalos Ynnere. At the end of the day, are not all allies? Was your call for me not one to root out Agents of Anti-Life? It was all for the sake of the Megalos Ynnere.\"","No for the Commonwealth.","Not for the Simians.","But for Matter!","For the Megalos Ynnere!","\"...\"","Old Man Eudemus gazed at Noah with profundity at such words as Noah continued.","\"As allies, we share information. I have a great deal of information so far regarding the Weavings of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence and the Reconstruction of the Megalonians. I'm curious whether you would also be willing to share something with me?\"","WAA!","\"I am curious about the Antediluvian Leviathans. The Commonwealth seems to share a history with them?\"","The Antediluvian Leviathans that seemed to have first risen within the Tresorverse of the Omnifather!","But they were always here, and the Commonwealth seemed to have been tangled with them.","Old Man Eudemus looked at Noah silently after his questions as moments later, he sighed and looked at the auroras of gold and blue around them as if he were recalling a truly ancient time.","\"They are a group we do not fully understand to this day. Antediluvian Leviathans...we came across them in the early days of the Commonwealth, and of course, we sought to incorporate them into our forces. But their resistance was heavy and swift. When the Commonwealth exerted more force, we came to realize the extent of their power as even though our forces were localized to target Antediluvians within a single Omniverse, Other Antediluvian Leviathans appeared right at that moment who could have entirely eclipsed our deployed power. And yet...nobody was destroyed. They simply let our people go.\"","...!","The Antediluvian Leviathans!","\"We realized that they must have been much earlier at consolidating power than us, with an untold number of Omniverses under them. But...the Commonwealth could not be deterred, and so it sought to fight a battle that would determine who would rule and oversee the vastness of the Megalos Ynnere. It was bound to be a grand battle stretching across multiple Omniverses, with heavy casualties expected and nobody being the wiser on who the Victor would be. But as the forces of the Commonwealth gathered and was about to begin a multi-pronged siege...all the Omniverse under the banner of the Antediluvian Leviathans disappeared.\"","The gaze of Old Man Eudemus was hazy.","As if he were recollecting some ancient history!","\"Nothing about them could be found, until one day, a single Entity was found in the vastness of the Megalos Ynnere...surrounded by hundreds of miniaturized Omniverses. The Omniverse of the Antediluvian Leviathans. He had them rotating around him as if they were stars within a small domain, and all of our forces encircled him to force his hand. But...\"","Old Man Eudemus shook his head and smiled with self-depreciation.","A single entity.","Against the Commonwealth.","\"Nothing mattered. The strongest within the Commonwealth at that time attacked. The Viceroy. The Shield. The Sword. The Star. The Shadow. The Light. Everyone collectively attacked...and nobody could even pierce the domain surrounding that one man. Around him, a prison was built, and yet he was no prisoner. He stayed within that domain for cycles until just recently, right before white portals began appearing within every observable Omniverse within the Megalos Ynnere, this supposed Prisoner disappeared.\"","WAA!","\"We didn't know much about that Entity, but that to this day, none of us could match him. His distinction...was The Prisoner. His distinction...was The Warden of the Antediluvian Leviathans!\"","...!"]},{"number":3334,"title":"Chapter 3334: Chapter 3333 Progression! I","paragraphs":["The Prisoner!","The Warden of the Antediluvian Leviathans!","Noah's eyes shone as he grasped this information.","The entity who disappeared from the eyes of the Commonwealth right before the white portals began to bloom.","Such an entity was likely the one to initiate the will of the Omnifather and cause the eruption of the white gates that led into the Tresorverse.","What sort of power was this? What level of complexity did one need to reach to achieve such a feat?","Noah's weavings churned as he thought about the actions of the Antediluvian Leviathans towards the Commonwealth.","They were more powerful, and yet they didn't wage war against the Commonwealth when they did attack.","This...should have been a binding left behind by the Omnifather as the question was why?","Why?","Noah's eyes pulsed with radiance.","The Omnifather.","If he was involved in the eradication of the Megalonians.","If he blamed himself for it.","He could have theoretically become despondent and laid rules upon the Antediluvian Leviathans to not willfully eradicate entire groups of people if they didn't have to!","It was a possibility, but it was one Noah's weavings found to be the most probable as he nodded to himself.","At this time, Old Man Eudemus shook his head as he closely looked at Noah while his hand went towards the whiteboard, picking up one of the singularities and raising it away as instantly, the two remaining singularities adopted different interactions with each other.","More stable when it was just the two bodies.","Less reactivity!","\"What about you, my young friend? What do you know? Of the Omnifather. Of these vast Megalos Ynnere?\"","The old man was testing him.","He wanted a favor in return for the information he just divulged as Noah smiled while replying.","\"The Omnifather...is likely a domino responsible for the eradication of the Megalonians. He was an Antediluvian Leviathan. The Reconstruction we are in is one that he formed out of guilt for what happened all those cycles ago, and likely the reason why the Antediluvians did not wage war against the Commonwealth when they are so much more powerful.\"","...!","His words were calm, but they caused the eyes of Old Man Eudemus to constrict as his beard danced wildly!","The Reconstruction of the Megalonians was done by the Omnifather, and the Omnifather was an Antediluvian Leviathan!","Very few had witnessed the scene on the first day of the Reconstruction on the Mountain that Pyrrhus was on, with many Possessed Megalonians being scattered across the 81 Mountains.","No Protector of the Commonwealth had yet managed to arrive within that particular mountain as none saw the scene that played out.","This was tremendous news to Old Man Eudemus as he scratched his beard until some hairs fell out.","\"The Reconstruction...\" His eyes carried a domineering light as he asked Noah.","\"How many days will this Reconstruction last?\"","How many days.","Noah shook his head at such a question.","\"This I cannot be sure of, but I believe there is less than a week before the Reconstruction ends. And once it ends, it will likely not appear again within the Tresorverse. If any Protectors have yet to enter the Tresorverse of the Omnifather, they should do so very, very quickly.\"","...!","He told Old Man Eudemus such words as his blazing gold eyes returned the singularity in his hands back to the whiteboard.","The whiteboard held three bodies once more.","And their interactions instantly became chaotic and unpredictable.","A factor of chaos rapidly arose as things became much more complex!","Three Bodies.","Old Man Eudemus stared at them without blinking as he couldn't arrive at an answer!","—","Within the Infinite Omniverse.","Inside of the Extremity Vein within the Infinite Omniverse.","The concentration of authority within was many times more potent than outside of it, and only a select few gained access to it as at this moment, atop a churning obsidian gold sandy sea of dreams, a monkey stood in front of a set of ancient instruments.","The obsidian sandy gold sea of dreams swirled around him like a galaxy as it was filled with the potent authority of the Dream Aletheian Haven, and there were dozens of other clusters of authority like this around him as there were no earth or skies- just a stellar Expanse of clusters of dense authorities of the Infinite Omniverse!","And on each cluster, was a person.","The monkey on the dense cluster of dreams with instruments all around him smiled as he took drumsticks in his hands and raised them, gazing towards a cluster that showed the main body of Henry...swirling with a golden Fabled Omniverse.","DUM!","The booming sound of drums could be heard as the hands of the monkey- nay, the Bard of Quintessence, began a beat!","He looked away from Henry and gazed towards the tanned visage of Athena, a royal purple Fabled Omniverse surrounding her.","DU! DU!","The Bard of Quintessence felt his beat quickening.","His colorless gold fur radiated excitement as his distinction as the Bard made him want to enact a symphony of grandiosity for what was happening right now.","The mass exist out of the Existential Dominium Realm and into the Omniversal Realm for the top tier powerhouses of the Infinite Omniverse!","DU! DU! DU!","His hands became faster.","The beat became fiercer.","He looked at other figures situated alone on their own separate clusters of authority in this space of stellar multicolored radiance.","Sona.","Kazuhiko. The Emperor Penguin. Piety. Lilith!","One after another, these beings showed their own single or multiple layers of a Fabled Omniverse as they each took a single concept and the boons of the Artificially Constructed Hearthrae Imitations to propel them into their own Fabled Omniverses!","It was a glorious scene that deserved to be recorded in the annals of history as, seeing it, the Bard of Quintessence couldn't help but howl.","\"WOO! WOO! WOO!\"","A booming symphony began as the monkey like Bard bopped his head while his hands and feet moved with rhythm and charisma.","The beat alone caused the surrounding essence to churn and increase in complexity as a terrific scene took place!"]},{"number":3335,"title":"Chapter 3335: Chapter 3334 Progression! II","paragraphs":["Such a scene was observed by Noah in the far distance as in a place only he and a few could enter, he smiled while observing it.","Atop the multicolored throne that all authority within the Infinite Omniverse seemed to be coursing through.","Noah watched his son and others attain the Omniversal Realm as he sought to have them gain an introduction to Psioneutrinos- to potentially increase their complexity with this mixture of Matter and Dark Matter as he sought to induce within them a sensation of at least becoming One With Existence.","None of them could be like him in transcending their existence as they did not have what he had to make it possible.","So they had to be creative.","If they could attain One With Existence before the reconstruction of the Omnifather ended, they would be able to make even more rapid progress with their complexity!","If possible.","Noah continued watching their celebration as he tapped his fingers at the tune of the Bard of Quintessence while speaking to the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse.","\"How is it?\"","|Six total Dark Matter Cores and Tainted Omniverses are being assimilated, with half of these already being fully melded with the Infinite Omniverse. All calculations show that complexity itself should be sufficient to attempt everything, but to increase the degree of certainty by another margin, the assimilation of even more Tainted Omniverses and their Dark Matter Cores would be beneficial.|","...!","The Infinite Omniverse felt like it was there.","But it wanted a higher degree of certainty.","So more complexity was needed!","And when it came to obtaining Tainted Omniverses after all of Savitar's were swallowed up...","\"Mmm, how about we take the established homes of our plotting enemy? We can also use them as the testing grounds for the next generation of the Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction.\"","His voice was heavy with malice as a cold smile hung on his face, Savitar having exposed all the Tainted Omniverses he knew The Great Ponderor to be a master of as Noah could unleash a set of wonders of his enemy before he went in to assimilate the scraps.","|Understood.|","And the Infinite Omniverse was fully on board.","|Beginning the deployment of the successor of Fat Monkey, the Tzar Versepiercer.|","...!","The Tzar Versepiercer!","A daring name!","A daring weapon developed and improved by the Infinite Omniverse from its tests as it became more and more proficient with Dark Matter, to the point that it packed over a million highly unstable miniaturized Fat Monkeys into a single Tsar Versepiercer.","A million!","Even Noah was entirely scared of this as a single improved Fat Monkey could even decimate the weavings of an early Omniversal Stage Entity.","A million of such horrors packed into a single one?","Very thin layers of weavings separated them as the smallest trigger could set them off.","And once they were set off...","Oh boy.","It honestly felt like an overkill.","Currently, only 11 Tzar Versepiercers had been built so far as they took a tremendous amount of authority for the Infinite Omniverse to focus, direct, and build them to ensure nothing imploded and decimated everything.","The first ones weren't even built in the Infinite Omniverse as the experiments were carried out in an Isolated Aletheian Haven that was thrown out into an empty area of Sector 1 that the Cartographer of Existence had mapped just in case!","And now, one would be put to the test.","\"Let's go.\"","The target had to be ascertained with his own eyes.","—","|O Dreamer of the Megalos...are you planning to act against the Great Ponderor right away? He has many friends...|","Across the Megalos Ynnere, Savitar led Noah's body across the relative positions of his now devoured Tainted Omniverses and towards a Tainted Omniverse under the banner of the Great Ponderor.","\"You don't worry about that. We should be close enough...\"","He stopped in a region of complete darkness as Savitar floated behind him akin to a loyal follower.","Above Noah, a dazzling golden eye unfurled that caused the calm Savitar some trepidation, but it wasn't even staring at him!","It stared off into an extremely far distance that they weren't remotely close to, and yet within moments, the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence covered this distance as a pulsating outline of a Tainted Omniverse became clear.","One of the Omniverses under the banner of the Great Ponderor!","Noah's eyes looked at it from afar as he waved his hands and caused the appearance of an obsidian gold statue that looked just like him.","It was adorned in royal purple Armaments over its golden sheen, and his hands were clasped on his chest while the face was one of sorrow as if he were saying a prayer for the poor souls about to be exposed to its wonder!","The Tzar Versepiercer- a Weapon of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction.","\"Go...and let me see your fallout.\"","WAA! Noah gave the command, and with it, an obsidian gold light flashed speedily!","Speed was one of the main components of this unstable construct, its sorrowful expression slowly flickering to cruelty as it thundered towards a Tainted Omniverse even faster than light.","Within the Tainted Omniverse.","A massive Outerversal Morphon bowed towards an obsidian veiled cluster that his master swam in as his deep voice echoed.","|Master, Bellerophon does not understand. What enemy could possibly make you wish to make a temporary retreat into the Megalos Beyond? Your might is endless, and your power is unfathomable...|","A Follower asked their Master, and their master shook their heads as if they wouldn't understand","|Sometimes, one must mak-...!|","The intent stopped.","It couldn't help but stop.","Because in the next moment...","BOOM!","A white light that seemed like it was erasing anything it touched flashed, the last thing this body of the Great Ponderor saw being the skeletal structure of Bellerophon literally melting as his Outerversal Authority was erased as if it didn't even exist.","And then, this blast of white light covered him as thereafter...there was nothing!","Inside the far distance, Noah was ready to observe when his eyes squinted, and his figure turned into a flash of light as even from this far distance, he retreated away rapidly!","Seeing such a scene, Savitar was shocked as he scrambled away as if his very life was on the line!"]},{"number":3336,"title":"Chapter 3336: Chapter 3335 Progression! III","paragraphs":["BOOM!","The heavy force reverberated out as this small part of this Sector within the Megalos Ynnere was lit up white.","The force was so heavy that even Noah was forced to move further away, his eyes bright as the Shockwaves of three Tzar Versepiercer reached him even during his retreat!","But at such a distance so many light years away...","The reverberations were only booming flickers on his body.","Even from this far distance, he still felt the shocking interactions of unstable Matter and Dark Matter as now, what was left to see were the results of his actions.","His retreat stopped as his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence looked ahead while he began to advance towards the Tainted Omniverse where the Tzar Versepiercer was deployed.","A distance away, the rough figure of Savitar could be seen as his outer body layers trembled with instability- his gaze ashen as he seemed to be traumatized while he thought of many things.","Feeling the attack that Noah had released and what effects it had from this far distance, Savitar felt relief.","But he also felt a great deal of rising fear towards this Entity who had bound his Megalos Regnum as he couldn't help but think what would have happened if such a weapon had been unleashed on him!","SAA!","Noah's figure passed by Savitar with a mere glance as he went toward the center of the explosion.","The whole area held a burning sensation of existence, with this sensation only becoming stronger the closer one came.","Noah was able to continue seamlessly as the unstable waves of Matter and Dark Matter did not cause him too many issues due to having both such types within the makeup of his body, but even he felt the distortion of heat!","And when his eyes landed on the Tainted Omniverse...","\"Oh my...\"","He drew a sharp breath.","His Sacred Primal Eye of Existence captured everything from afar as the circular obsidian Tainted Omniverse that used to stand grandiosely just moments ago...was splintered into multiple pieces as it burned with seething white flames.","These flames seemed to be interactions of unstable Matter and Dark Matter as they burned heavily, and Noah could ascertain that within this space...there were absolutely no weavings of existence or signs of life!","The only thing left behind apart from the splintered Omniverse was a Dark Matter Core that was ablaze with white flames- and it was even knocked light years away from the location of the Omniverse itself as the impact was that heavy.","The only other thing was an illusory scorching white visage that burned where the Tzar Versepiercer was initially detonated.","It was an innate design Noah told the Infinite Omniverse to add that would act as a marker- and it currently showed an illusory image of himself clasping his hands in front of his chest in sorrow as his face...held an expression of mocking prayer for all those affected!","If there were any survivors at all, this illusory image of himself would be the last thing they saw before their Existence continued to erode and became wiped out.","Apart from these aforementioned things, nothing else was left.","No bones.","No weavings of any existence apart from sparse tendrils of Outerversal Authority.","It was the result of a ridiculous weapon that there were only 10 more remaining at this moment until the Infinite Omniverse designed some more!","And seeing the horrific results they could achieve as well as how vast the stretch of its influence could be...","\"Take the Isolated Aletheian Haven Testing Site to the opposite of the explored Sector. As far from the Infinite Omniverse as possible.\"","|The process is already underway, Master.|","...!","He spoke towards the Infinite Omniverse itself to move the Isolated Aletheian Haven where these Tzar Versepiercers were being designed and held to an area far from anything else!","If any accidents were to happen and 10 or more Tzar Versepiercers were sparked to bloom...the catastrophe was one that even Noah did not want to bear witness to.","But the power of these new constructs expanded Noah's possible style of fighting as with them...he didn't have to be entirely fearful of enemies a stage or two higher than him as if they messed around...they would come to find out.","HUUM!","His weavings went past the scorching white flames of the Tzar Versepiercer as they wrapped around the remnant Tainted Omniverse and Dark Matter Core that were burning with white flames- all that remained of them being fuel for the Infinite Omniverse itself as they would be devoured and assimilated!","As Noah did this here, another one of his bodies was led by a reluctant Savitar towards another Tainted Omniverse known to be under the banner of the Great Ponderor.","Only a matter of minutes passed after the detonation of the Tzar Versepiercer in another Tainted Omniverse and when they arrived at a close enough proximity towards another Tainted Omniverse, and by the time Noah's gloriously gold Sacred Primal Eye of Existence began to open once more as he seemed about to repeat his actions...","\"Master, can I leave first before you attack? I don't want this body to be affected as well...\"","The One Who Walks, Savitar, wanted to walk far from this place before another Tzar Versepiercer was deployed!","But....","\"No need.\"","Noah's golden eye squinted as when he looked into the Tainted Omniverse in the far distance that should have been another base of the Great Ponderor...it was utterly empty.","It had been emptied out entirely as it seemed that in a matter of minutes since the last Tainted Omniverse was decimated, The Great Ponderor had already cleared himself and all those who belonged to him out!","He left behind an empty Tainted Omniverse for Noah to simply walk into.","Noah smiled at such a reality.","What was this?","It was power. It was a deterrent!","It was something that even a Great One feared as Noah could only laugh gloriously as he simply strode in towards another Tainted Omniverse!","Very likely, any other Tainted Omniverses that Savitar knew the locations of would have a similar presentation.","All of it...would be more than enough for the uses of the Infinite Omniverse to be ready for its unfathomable ordeal!"]},{"number":3337,"title":"Chapter 3337: Chapter 3336 Progression! IV","paragraphs":["Around this same time.","Within the Megalos Beyond- inside the Pantheon of Umbra.","Celebrations filled with the odd culture of eldritch horrors were underway as the followers of the Great Beyonder converged around the Instrument, which was currently being led by the Great Wheel and his forces.","In the depths of Umbra, the main body of Savitar floated in a chaotic region of purple flames, a mountain of bones underneath him as his Megalos Regnum was being expressed freely and without fervor.","His skull held many complex emotions as moments later, the flickering flames within his Sockets turned to see a figure manifesting above his mountain of bones.","It was none other than the Great Ponderor.","His body remained clouded by obsidian waves of darkness, but when Savitar looked deeply within, he could see the expression of contained rage.","The moment he arrived, his words were succinct.","|Tell him I want peace.|","WAA!","Peace.","Peace!","The Great Ponderor honed in on Savitar right away as how could his enemy know where his bases in the Megalos Ynnere were?","The only answer was the one he had sent to him through manipulation- Savitar!","So he came here after experiencing an extremely traumatic event of having the entire Records and weavings of one of his bodies erased by a Tzar Versepiercer.","Before everything had perished, he seemed to have captured an illusory humanoid figure blazing with white flames that was making a mocking prayer of sorrow while watching everything vanish!","|Peace? Haha, fucking peace?!|","Savitar's purple flames raged as he looked towards the Great Ponderor.","If they weren't in the Sacred lands of the Great Beyonder that forbid fighting, he may have just staked it out right here and now even if he was weaker!","Savitar looked towards the Great Ponderor as this being had put things in motion that made it so his own Megalos Regnum was under the banner of another.","That was his dignity.","His Honor.","His very essence of authority as an Outerversal Morphon.","And after all this, the Great Ponderor thought he could just call for peace?","|Motherfucker, there will be no peace for you! I've got nothing for you here so you can just roll all the fuck away.|","...!","Savitar let out all his grievances to another Great One as the two gazed at each other coldly!","|I have many allies who would answer my call quickly. We can make things very difficult for you-|","|Call whoever the fuck you want. But after you do, be sure to tell them about the scorching white flames that can instantly decimate the weavings of a Great One. Don't leave that part out, O Great Schemer.|","...!","Boldness was running rampant within Savitar as he spoke back against the Great Ponderor for the first time in what seemed like forever.","He saw that nothing could be gained here as after the white flames were mentioned, his gaze further changed as he waved his tentacles and disappeared!","Savitar was the only one left behind on a mountain of bones as he harrumphed.","He remembered the golden necklace on the Dreamer of the Megalos and the obsidian crown of his Megalos Regnum that it held.","He was now expectantly waiting for the obsidian crown of the Great Ponderor to be added to it!","—","An Increase in complexity.","A forging of thousands of layers of Fabled Omniverses through the hands of Pyrrhus within the reconstruction.","The abandoned Tainted Omniverses that the Great Ponderor left behind after he took a Tzar Versepiercer in the face, causing multiple Dark Matter Cores and the remnant of Tainted Omniverses to be swallowed by the Infinite Omniverse as it prepared for its own transcending of existence!","All of it seemed like pieces falling in place as the one thing that remained out of reach...was a solution for Noah's Ordinance of Existence and future Ordinance Amalgamation.","All of one's existence had to be synonymous with their decree.","If it was destiny, one had to proudly declare destiny as in the future, they would amalgamate with it entirely. If even a part of them was not loyal to destiny, their existence would collapse.","If even a single cell didn't live and breathe destiny, their existence would collapse!","And Noah...was not a loyal man.","He dipped his feet into far too many things as when the time came to make a choice, it could not be made so freely!","Since the usage of the first Tzar Versepiercer, three days had passed as no notable changes occurred within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain, with the reconstruction proceeding smoothly as all those lucky enough to enter were working to increase their Complexity of Existence.","Every now and then, terrifying auras would undergo a change from the 81 Megalos Mountains as the terrifying auras of Entities staking everything to undergo Ordinance Amalgamation flashed.","So far, no less than 55 of such auras bloomed!","A few were Simians of the Commonwealth or other races likely associated with them, and a few were from Omniversal Lineages born from other Omniverse within the Megalos Ynnere that were never brought under the banner of the Commonwealth.","The vast majority of those attempting Ordinance Amalgamation were the Antediluvian Leviathans!","But out of the 55 attempts in the last few days...only 10 managed to be successful.","Ten.","The rate was absolutely abysmal as 45 Possessed Megalonians would face the collapse of their existence, with the only saving grace being the uniqueness of this Tresorverse where since they were ultimately Possessed Entities, they wouldn't face a full collapse of their true existence outside of this reconstruction.","It was the reason why so many were bold enough to try.","Noah...had to also make the choice to, at the very least, make a decree and form his own Ordinance before this reconstruction ended!","But he knew that if he declared Quintessence, all others would fall behind even if he successfully decreed them afterwards.","The first decree would be the main decree.","All others would fall behind.","This...he didn't not want.","|The weavings of Cheats theorize a possible solution.|","|The weavings of the Protagonist theorize a possible solution.|","...!","Different parts of him were buzzing with possibilities!"]},{"number":3338,"title":"Chapter 3338: Chapter 3337 Osmont’s Decree! I","paragraphs":["Within the Reconstruction of the Omnifather.","Pyrrhus was surrounded by waves of golden radiance as he sat in front of Quintessential Megalonian Nu and Caretaker Nazal in a domain surrounded by hazy purple light.","The land below was sparkling with purple crystalline radiance while the skies above were covered by regal purple clouds- this place seemed like an isolated abode for Honored Megalonians to rest as further around it, golden celestial rivers flowed.","\"Caretaker Nazal had put you forward as One That Was Promised, so letting you know more about the intricacies and rules of Megalonians is a must. Currently, we deal with the judgment of Vayan who jeopardized everything we have just because she spent a single cycle with an Outsider...\"","Quintessential Megalonian Nu was surrounded by astral multicolored radiance as she spoke with an angry glare.","With every breath she took, Existence seemed to be changing around her as if she existed in her own separate world.","Existence Severing!","Unfettered from the bindings of Existence outside of themselves and others.","For any type of Existence to affect them...it had to be an extremely heavy one!","Such a being was speaking before Pyrrhus as she was imparting a lesson, and Noah only listened with half his attention as he was studying himself more than anything else.","He felt like all of his Systems had reached a critical step- with tens of thousands of layers of extremely pure and potent Fabled Omniverses surrounding him as they were saturated.","They needed a jump in complexity.","They needed a Decree.","An Ordinance!","And yet he didn't give it.","In front of him, Quintessential Megalonian Nu continued.","\"Our domains are anchored within the gaps of the Endless Expanse, sometimes close to the Megalos, sometimes not. We are lucky to be in a domain like this as our existence...is a wonder and a calamity.\"","WAA!","A wonder, and a calamity.","If they lived as normal, they would continue to be a wonder.","If anyone found out about them...it would be a terrifying calamity!","But, must we live in fear just because of what our Existence represents to others? We strive to be cautious but strong. To raise our heads high and live with dignity while ensuring that our existence forever remains veiled to others. Tell me, for someone who breaks that ruling established through dignity and honor of our whole Lineage, what should their punishment be?\"","Quintessential Megalonian Nu asked Pyrrhus.","And Pyrrhus mulled over this issue before replying coldly.","\"Putting their own interests above all others, recklessly endangering all weavings of Megalonians with exposure...the only viable punishment is Imprisonment, or death to ensure it cannot happen again.\"","...!","For love of a single cycle to be put above the well being of the whole race.","Pyrrhus believed such reckless actions were worthy of death!","Caretaker Nazal and Quintessential Megalonian Nu were shocked at these words, Nu smiling and shaking her head wryly soon after.","\"Imprisonment is viable, Execution...may be too far since even with her actions, nothing irreparable has occurred. If something irreversible had happened...ah\"","Quintessential Megalonian Nu thought wistfully while shaking her head.","She was about to continue when suddenly, her eyes turned incredibly somber as her change in gaze was followed by a voice descending.","|I am afraid that something irreversible has, in fact, been put in motion.|","...!","An intent.","An intent they recognized as they had felt and seen it days ago!","In the next instant, this intent converged to form a dazzling figure of existence- an Antediluvian Leviathan whose skin radiated a calm multicolored splendor while his Existence... gave off a shockingly oppressive feel that seemed to be many times more than Quintessential Megalonian Nu.","This...was this being not one who failed Existence Severing?","So why the hell was their existence currently more terrifying than even Quintessential Megalonian Nu, who was actually at the Existence Severing stage?!","|You dare come here again after the favor Vayan bestowed on you?! You dare?!|","The weavings of Quintessential Megalonian Nu burned heavily above this isolated astral purple domain; the Outsider came down with a complex gaze as he replied.","|I come to see if I can right the wrongs before it is too late. My entrance here was observed and tracked by my enemies. It was then shared with my allies. Both now know of your existence. They now know where you are. They seek what they believe to be an answer within your existence. You all...must leave.|","...!","The words were heavy as they were terrifying.","Quintessential Megalonian Nu had her gaze turn entirely ashen as she flicked her hands and sent out dozens of signals of light that flew out towards Megalos Mountains.","|How long?! How long do we have?!|","This Existence Severing entity asked frantically as at such a question, the Outsider titled their head down in shame as he spoke out.","|There isn't much time. Vayan, may I...|","He seemed to be filled with endless guilt as he asked, and Quintessential Megalonian Nu shook her head in rage and frustration as she waved her hands and formed a portal of astral brilliance that spat out the verdant figure of Vayan.","She looked around listlessly, her eyes brightening up when she saw the visage of the Outsider above as she smiled while flying towards him!","And yet...the only thing he had was sorrow as he held her body tenderly while voicing out.","|You are my everything...and my very existence aches that I have brought all of this on you.|","His words were tinged with countless complex emotions as light began to wrap around him and his lover, while Quintessential Megalonian Nu ragefully disappeared as alarms began to ring across this Megalos Mountain and beyond!","The gaze of Caretaker Nazal turned frantic as he appeared in front of Pyrrhus who was gazing coldly at the Outsider embracing Vayan.","\"Young Master Pyrrhus, we must go. Let us...\"","\"No.\"","...!","The gaze of Pyrrhus was firm as these weren't just the words of the Will possessing him, but the very intent and direction of Pyrrhus himself as he was filled with endless conviction. He turned away from the scene of the Outsider and took a few steps outwards, crossing light years as within moments, he arrived on top of the golden Sacred Primal Sea once more!"]},{"number":3339,"title":"Chapter 3339: Chapter 3338 Osmont’s Decree! II","paragraphs":["\"Young Master!\"","The cries of Nazal rang out behind him as all around this space, Megalonian were looking around frantically as before they could do anything, the visage of Quintessential Megalonian Nu could be seen in the skies making a snatching motion down below as if she were plucking stars, and hundreds of Megalonians disappeared on this Megalos Mountain as they turned into glimmers of light that were contained in cerulean crystals around the waist of Quintessential Megalonian Nu.","She seemed to see the intent radiating from the distant figure of Pyrrhus atop the golden sea as her gaze flickered, but she continued to take all those she could with her.","Atop the golden sea, Pyrrhus seemed to have come to a decision.","At the same time, Noah seemed to have come to a decision.","The Will of Pyrrhus should have long been extinguished over the vestiges of time and shattered records, and yet at this moment...","HUUM!","Noah felt a buzzing within his very soul as in its depths, he felt something rising.","Within the depths of a Reconstruction done by unfathomable means!","This buzzing...came in the form of an extremely regal voice.","[That day, they attacked.]","...!","BOOOM!","After this voice buzzed within him, the golden skies of the Megalos Mountain here split open.","The sound was heavy and unfathomably loud as the decibels reached a level where even those at the stage of One With Existence felt their existence buzzing as a sense of confusion would dawn on them!","From the split skies, two massive golden hands pulled on either side and ripped it further open, and from the opening...an extremely majestic face popped in.","A face shimmering with golden splendor as the moment it peeked into the Megalos Mountain and saw the Megalonians within, its eyes radiated profound glory!","Its pupils were shaped with an animalistic serpentine glow, and they shone with magnificence at this moment as when they observed the Megalonians, they smiled with ecstatic brightness.","|So it was true!|","BOOM!","Along with these words, the skies were split apart even more as the titanic entity that seemed to be spanning the size of an Omniverse tore open the golden skies of an entire Megalos Mountain, his upper body squeezing itself in as it fully radiated golden splendor.","Seeming like a celestial entity descending from the skies, the steely hands of this entity moved as their palms radiated a shocking suction force- such a force instantly caused Megalonians to forcefully rise to the skies at the speed of light towards them!","At the same time, the serpentine eyes of this being flashed as they spared a glance towards Quintessential Megalonian Nu who had a horrified expression on her face.","|Existence Sealing.|","...!","The terrifying power emanating from Quintessential Megalonian Nu instantly began to falter and reduce as if it were nothing.","The serpentine eyes of this golden entity the size of an Omniverse radiated beams of light that focused on the cerulean crystals around Quintessential Megalonian Nu as if it could see everything.","The cerulean crystals instantly cracked as thousands of Megalonians spilled out from it, astral light leaking all around as their bodies also began to be pulled towards this entity!","At such a time...","|THEODOSIUS!|","A booming bellow echoed out from the heart of the Megalos Mountain as the visage of the Outsider who was brought here injured just days ago appeared while staring dreadfully at the entity the size of an Omniverse above, the visage of Vayan by his side as the hands of this outsider chopped up!","HUUUM!","Existence trembled.","The hand of the Outsider chopping out enlarged and stretched maddeningly until its size became comparable to the massive invader above, and it went on to smash onto its body as the pull of Megalonians towards it was disrupted!","...!","It was a shocking show of power.","It seemed to exceed the bounds of what they knew to be Existence Severing.","|You...you truly thought you could keep this to yourself?! Against the vastness of Existence, this is one of the few viable options! You stupid fool, we should have never taken you in!|","The Invader voiced out with rage as the hands chopping towards him was rebuffed, his serpentine eyes looking down below as he pointed around him.","|Look around you, it is already too late. Stop this inconsequential interference.|","Around them.","On the other Megalos Mountains, scenes similar to this and even worse were occurring.","The skies were torn apart as entities brimming with heart shaking power descended, some the size of Omniverses as only half of their bodies peered through the cracks as they gazed down with looks that felt like they were observing untapped treasure.","They reached out towards the Megalonians as if they were dangling fruits, their eyes filled with an insatiable need!","Seeing this, the eyes of the Outsider showed tremendous pain as beside him, his beloved was trembling as her very existence seemed to age from the sheer emotion of understanding the consequences of what she had done.","The Outsider felt all of this closely as he couldn't help but release his pain upwards!","|CHOP!|","...!","An unbelievable battle bloomed.","On the golden sea below, the visage of Pyrrhus remained calm and unfettered as, at this moment, its eyes didn't seem to be one.","It was as if two beings were looking through the same lens, the shocking will of the complex entity who was born while attaining the state of One With Existence, and attained his Eye Of Existence a day after being extremely active at this moment.","[That day, they came and took everything. They treated us as if we were mere objects to be taken, and we...did not have the power to stop it. We were too weak. We were given too little time. Even I...had only been alive for days.]","He couldn't effect any change.","He couldn't do anything against those who came into his home!","The emotions of Pyrrhus were extremely active at this moment as his existence began to seethe, countless versions of himself appearing as he prepared a decree.","[What has happened cannot be changed, but I can't help but feel stifled.]","WAA!","[If I had more time.]","[If existence was not so cruel.]","Regrets.","They filled Noah's weavings as while Pyrrhus moved, he also moved!","His eyes radiated an endless blue light as he...also prepared his decree."]},{"number":3340,"title":"Chapter 3340: Chapter 3339 Osmont’s Decree! III","paragraphs":["Regret!","As Entities appeared and picked off his people and his home, the unique Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian that was Pyrrhus felt boundless waves of such an intent.","It was brazen.","His Sacred Primal Eye of Existence was open as he could see all the 81 Megalos Mountains, and on some of them, Invaders at the Existential Severing Stage and Ordinance Amalgamation stage appeared- their weavings mixed.","Some radiated waves of profound Matter.","Others pulsed with incandescent Dark Matter.","While others pulsed with glorious Anti-Matter.","Each held their own uniqueness as not all of them were the massive Omniverse sized entities who split open the golden skies above the Megalos Mountains.","But the entities smaller in size were even crueler as Pyrrhus saw.","He saw an Ordinance Amalgamation entity grab a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian who was moving others away while exploding with power; this Ordinance Amalgamation Invader...opened his jaws unnaturally as tentacles erupted from it that pulled this Megalonian in.","They devoured him whole.","Thereafter, the jaws of this entity closed as an ecstatic expression appeared on his face- his existence buzzing with resonance as he actually showed great astonishment and shock!","For a brief second, thousands of illusory versions of himself exploded outwards as they exploded in complexity, and all of this complexity merged into the central body as all others faded a moment later.","But the complexity of this Ordinance Amalgamation Invader...was at least 25% more.","...!","From devouring the records and weavings of existence of a single Megalonian!","The Ordinance Amalgamation Invader felt this change personally as his eyes turned crazed, his figure howling as he madly shot out towards other nearby Megalonians.","Others say his shocking eruption in complexity after devouring as even though they were given certain orders to mainly capture, they began to devour Megalonians on sight.","It was brutal.","On all 81 Megalos Mountains, such horrors only became more intense as on another mountain, three Existence Severing Invaders besieged a Quintessential Honored Megalonian, their power erupting out heavily as they cut the very existence of this Megalonian apart into thirds before they each swallowed any piece!","And their bodies instantly exploded with complexity as thousands of illusory versions of themselves appeared- their bodies burning with ever brighter complexity.","[They did it so freely.]","Pyrrhus continued to buzz within Noah's weavings.","[They did it without a care. As if they were plucking fruits or flowers that naturally deserved to be plucked by them, as if they were on a farm and simply enjoying the livestock there. Days after I was born, I had to watch all that I came to know be taken away. My existence was unwilling. My Source was unwilling. My Ordinance...was unwilling.]","HUUM!","The golden sea below Pyrrhus seethed.","As destruction and chaos unfolded all around, he seemed detached from it all as a third of the golden sea was instantly turned into streams that disappeared into his body.","[I know that none of this is real. I know that what has come to pass cannot be reversed. I know that I am dead, and merely part of the Reconstruction of the guilty conscious of an Outsider. But nonetheless, it is a Reconstruction of who I am. Of my Origin. Of my Decree.]","...!","An Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","[And even if it is a Reconstruction, in this, there lies a possibility.]","BOOM!","The body of Pyrrhus exploded with radiance as above him, a terrifying Banners that spanned across this Megalos Mountain and extended to the others bloomed.","It was so blinding that the Invader called Theodosius by the Outsider turned his gaze towards Pyrrhus, his eyes showing shock and elation thereafter as he moved his arms with fervor towards the golden sea.","|THEODOSIUS!|","A move that caused the Outsider to fight back with even greater fervor!","Pyrrhus turned his gaze up to stare at the eclipsed golden hand as his banner unfolded.","As his decree became clear.","As his Ordinance was made!","[I detected the Megalos that made these Invaders. But I was born out of the Megalos themselves. Gaps within the Expanse, but it was the Megalos regardless. So my decree...was a decree of the Megalos themselves.]","BOOM!","Megalos.","The Ordinance of the Megalos!","It stretched out madly all around as it seemed far too vast.","Far too glorious than if it was even declared by any other Megalonian.","This was because...","[My Megalos contains everything about me. What made me. My Origin. With it, the one capable of binding me in this Reconstruction should be able to withstand it. To obtain it. If you do, I simply ask...for carnage.]","WAA!","[I do not seek justice. I do not seek for wrongs to be made right. I seek the same carnage and destruction imposed on the Megalonians...by the Invaders.]","HUUM!","Pyrrhus' body radiated pure, unfathomable waves of wonder.","They stretched out to cover all Megalos Mountains with a blinding light that seemed to empower even the remaining Existence Severing Megalonians- their bodies burning ever brighter.","[I seek destruction and cataclysm on all those across the Expanse who rose ever higher from the Blood of the Megalonians. I seek carnage on these Invaders...and the one who brought them here, whether inadvertently or not.]","[I seek Carnage on the Outsider that made this very Reconstruction.]","...!","Noah's will pulsed at such words.","Pyrrhus sought the destruction of the Omnifather himself!","[With my Origin, you will not even need a cycle. With my Megalos, many things are possible.]","After he said these words, the will of Pyrrhus simmered and turned silent.","And at such a moment, Noah sighed as his eyes turned unfathomably bright.","Pyrrhus was making his decree.","He had to make his own.","But he couldn't make just a single decree, he had multiple decrees.","And he could not call even a single one before the others, otherwise it would all be for naught.","If he did this, he knew that when the time came for Amalgamation, he would very likely face the collapse of his existence!"]},{"number":3341,"title":"Chapter 3341: Chapter 3340 Osmont’s Decree! IV","paragraphs":["So a single decree could not be made, nor could they decrees be made one after another.","This only left behind the option...of making many, many decrees instantly.","All at once!","It wasn't feasible.","It was viable.","At any one point in time, only a single authority could be expressed.","Only a single decree could be made.","But he wanted to make over a hundred Decrees instantly!","The only possible pathway for this...lay in Mana.","HUUM!","His eyes radiated a truly unfathomable blue light.","A light so heavy and so pristine unlike any other time in the past!","Mana.","It was developed, forged, and reforged again countless times over the past days.","Through Infinity, endless waves of mana coursed through intricate Fabled Omniverses- upon hundreds of layers of such intricate constructs.","Through Manadynamics, it was interwoven with ever greater complexity!","But what Noah wanted it to do now was a task it had never done before.","Yes, it could change and transform from its Basal forms of mana into another authority.","What he was asking it to do now was to transform into...everything.","All his concepts.","All his weavings.","And not just transformed, but simultaneously express with extreme purity of all of these concepts as Decrees!","As Ordinances!","If it was the past him from days ago, his complexity may not have been enough for such an ordeal.","But his current weavings.","His current complexity.","The body he occupied of an Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","It should be enough.","It had to be enough!","HUUUM!","Around Noah, a sea of gorgeous cerulean mana unfurled and began expanding outwards for light years.","The golden sea below was reflected in its grandeur as, shockingly, similar to Pyrrhus, its light went on to bathe this Megalos Mountain and even began stretching out towards the other 81 Megalos Mountains.","It radiated such profound purity and a sense of infinity that it felt like it could endlessly stretch out to even flow within the gaps of the Expanse and continue expanding outwards!","It was unprecedented as such a pure light was not meant to bloom.","Not with such intensity, and certainly not within this Reconstruction.","This Reconstruction.","At this moment, the billowing visage of the golden titan-like entity who had split the skies of the Megalos Mountain above looked down with ever greater focus towards Pyrrhus.","The light within his eyes reflected a greater sense of cognizance and greed as, at this moment, his hands thundered down with even greater fervor.","As if he had to get his hands on this being!","In the skies, even the Outsider turned back and gazed towards the visage of Pyrrhus with bright eyes of melancholy.","Even the Sealed figure of Quintessential Megalonian Nu that was being pulled towards the Titanic Invader in the skies gazed over with a look of reminiscence and regret.","On the distant Megalos Mountains, many Rare and Quintessential Megalonians had their eyes flickering with a greater concentration of radiance as they looked at the cerulean brilliance spreading out towards them, their eyes gaining a sense of cognizance as if they understood what was happening right now!","Their eyes filled with hatred and regret.","They looked towards the Invaders around them as...even though they knew in their hearts that nothing would change.","Even though they knew they were merely whispers of themselves in a reconstruction, their complexity of existence seethed as they pulled towards this seemingly endless source of brilliant blue light!","And their bodies gave off brighter glows as they roared with ferocity while charging toward their enemies, the existence around them beginning to distort.","Causality began to distort.","During such a shocking phenomenon, the man at the center of it all had many things flashing across his mind.","Memories from what seemed like a distant world- a distant part of him who was holding onto a Fireball Skill Book on a small world.","The moment this skill book had disappeared, he tapped into something greater.","The first time that his existence dipped into Mana.","When he released fireballs again and again behind a dilapidated apartment complex, it was mana that flowed out of him and transformed into clusters of fire. That same mana had been with him all these many months as today, its purity was many times more than that point in time.","Its complexity even more so!","And just like all those many months ago, at this moment, Noah allowed this same Mana to flow out of him endlessly.","It didn't transform into fireballs, but his Existence permeated across every corner of this stretched out mana as he called out.","|O, Mana!|","...!","A single call.","A single Decree.","A single Ordinance of Mana!","But it wasn't alone.","Simultaneously, at the same time this intent arose, the word [Mana] seemed to be overlapping with many other words!","It didn't seem like a single word was uttered as at the same instant, many other words were uttered.","Many other Ordinances were called out at the same exact time!","|O, Quintessence!| |O, Infinity!| |O, Protagonist| |O, Loot!| |O, Cheats| |O, Manadynamics!| |O, Destiny!| |O, Entropy| |O, Kuklos!| |O, Ingeniare!|...!","Countless Decrees.","All contained in a single Decree.","It was unimaginable to even think of as this didn't just occur here.","Across countless weavings, in the depths of the Megalos Beyond, within the Pantheon of Umbra.","Ozymandias was sitting in the midst of thousands of Outerversal Morphons, enjoying the eldritch wonders and uniqueness of these Entities as in the middle of these festivities.","His stellar obsidian skin radiated glory as he lifted up a golden cup while gazing at the endless darkness of the Megalos Beyond.","|Hmm?|","Nearby, the Great Wheel and a few other Great Ones that had gathered felt something as their gazes came to lock on him.","With his gaze expressing calmness and serenity, Ozymandias lifted up the golden cup as he decreed.","|Outerversal.|","...!","HUUUM!","As if he were merely uttering out something so simple.","As if it were the most common thing in existence!","He made such a decree at the same time as in distant weavings of a Reconstruction, the Decree of Mana and countless others were laid down.","And an instant after, the skies above the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra that was ten times the size of a normal Omniverse shuddered, waves of unfathomably pure obsidian Outerversal Authority flowing down from all directions towards a single entity as above him, a heavy decree bloomed.","The Great Ones nearby looked at such a scene with sheer incredulity as it did not at all seem real!"]},{"number":3342,"title":"Chapter 3342: Chapter 3341 Ordinance! I","paragraphs":["Outerversal Morphons had a long lifespan as many lived for tens of Cycles.","This equated to millions upon millions of years as depending on their level of power, they could grow the complexity of their existence enough to live dozens more cycles.","But at the end, like all bodies of existence, everything fell towards disorder and collapsed.","There were rumors that if one was capable of severing their Existence, they would effectively break the confines of life span and live for an unknown number of cycles!","Mere rumors that many couldn't confirm with conviction.","But many Outerversal Morphons lived for a great deal of time as should many things!","Great Ones especially, with their vision being much more expanded.","At this moment.","|These old bones shouldn't be put to work this much, it goes against everything I stand for as the Observer.|","...!","The Observer of Old and Young walked into the Pantheon of Umbra silently as beside him, the tentacles forming an Infinity symbol that represented the Great Mother brimmed with life!","Her Tentacles let out vibrations as she seemed expectant to see the Instrument after their short separation, and both of these Great Ones quickly located the visage of Ozymandias in the depths of the Pantheon of Umbra as they saw him in the middle of a feast hosted by the Great Wheel. |Shouldn't the Elders put in more work to have the way for the juniors? Especially the one we have been waiting for this whole time. Part of me always had a sliver of doubt, but when that dusty wheel sent the message that he attained the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos and then his Eye of the Megalos right after...can it be anything but the Instrument? Hmm? Tell me, Observer, did you manage to become One With the Megalos and attain your Eye of the Megalos days after you were born?|","|...|","The Observer of Old and Young couldn't say anything as he seemed to be thinking about a great deal of things.","Everything about Ozymandias so far continued to exceed their expectations as he was everything promised by the Great Beyonder, and more!","|You are right. It seems that we only have to defend him for a little while longer before he can stand on his own two feet-...!|","They hadn't reached the area of the feast yet.","They had only neared it as they could see everyone there with clarity.","The Observer of Old and Young was forced to pause along with the Great Mother as from the distance, they saw the figure of Ozymandias, unprompted...nonchalantly raise his golden chalice as he made a decree.","Outerversal.","He made such a decree as moments later, the very Megalos above the Pantheon of Umbra trembled as they bent- their purest essence surging towards him as a terrifying banner began to unfold above him.","The tentacles of the Great Mother trembled with stupefaction as she had seen many things...but she had never seen such a scene before!","Beside her, the Observer of Old and Young had his body vibrating as he asked somberly.","|Any prophecy from the Great Beyonder that covers this?|","...!","A question that didn't have an answer.","It only bore witness to the shocking brilliance of Ozymandias as at this moment, an illusory...Pantheon began to form around him, his Megalos Regnum and Outerversal Physiology rapidly rising as after this, they would no doubt have tipped into the Seventh Echelon if not nearing the Eighth!","This was Ozymandias.","Another part of Noah that made a decree simultaneously alongside all of him as through coming changes would be grand!","Across the weavings of existence.","Back into the Tresorverse Sacred Domain, within the Reconstruction.","The endless sea of blue that spanned across the 81 Megalos Mountains pulsed as in the span of an instant, they flashed with countless other colors.","Countless other decrees all at once!","Quintessence.","Tyranny.","Loot!","Colorless, purple, golden waves were among the many colors that flashed with interminable purity and wonder as they all stemmed from a single being!","In this Reconstruction, it wasn't just the Megalonians.","The Possessed Megalonians, who didn't see the full intricate story behind the Outsider and the Invaders, only knew that the calamity of the Megalonians that had already come to pass was here.","They also saw the incandescent endless blue that flashed with multiple colors as the vast majority simply thought this was part of the reconstruction.","Actions of a particularly unique Megalonian!","It was only the Possessed Megalonians on the same mountain as Pyrrhus who could identify him as another Possessed Megalonian who saw things with much more clarity!","And they watched with appalling emotions as they saw under the banner of one being...there were dozens of Decrees.","Dozens of Ordinances!","This...this isn't feasible.","It wasn't possible.","And yet here it was!","Below them, the Sacred Primal Sea...entirely turned into massive rivers of golden light that were sucked into the body of the only Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian rapidly- all of this acting as the fuel to power this madness.","Concepts evolved.","Sources of Existence changed.","Kuklos pulsed as an intricate Wheel of Noah's own design began to be reconstructed, while Ingeniare began to construct violet-purple constructs burning with the illusions of both Omniverses, Megalos Pantheons, and Megalos Mountains!","The emergence of so many different Ordinances under one banner was far too different and unique as the sheer aura and complexity it carried...caused all nearby Possessed Megalonians who had declared their own Ordinances to feel inadequate.","They had one.","He had many.","And it was not just one plus one.","There seemed to be a compounding effect regarding the type of complexity brought through these shocking declarations as a terrifying aura of oppression instantly bloomed from Pyrhuss!","One that caused the entities who had already attained the Ordinance of Existence to feel a heavy sense of trepidation, while entities who had already spent millions of years nurturing their Ordinance and raised their complexity to a high enough level to perform the Amalgamation of their Ordinance...felt as if a sharp sword that could possibly threaten even them was forming.","...!","What?!"]},{"number":3343,"title":"Chapter 3343: Chapter 3342 Ordinance! II","paragraphs":["The sensation didn't feel real!","But Possessed Megalonians, whether they were Antediluvian Leviathans, stemming from the Commonwealth, or even across the myriad of undiscovered Omniverses out there- any who were already at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage or those who had attempted to do so and succeeded during this reconstruction, or even those who were not confident enough and were stuck at the Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation level.","They all instinctively felt like an extremely sharp sword that could even harm them was being formed!","And its edge...felt unfathomably sharp!","Many became somber at such an affirmation as the reality of an entity of a lower State of Existence ever threatening one of a higher state was an impossibility.","But this entity seemed far from the norm as above him, a multicolored banner that seemed to stand for multiple Ordinances blazed over others like a royal emperor of all Ordinances.","The banner of the Ordinances shone their purest light over the visage of Pyrrhus as the complexity of his existence began to transform, his existence carrying a signature of regality and majesty at this moment that when others felt it...their own existences buzzed with...greed.","The Megalonians were hunted to extinction because of the weavings of their Existence.","When devoured, even the weakest Megalonian could increase the complexity of even an Ordinance Amalgamation entity by 25%.","When other entities saw Megalonians, they felt a unique pull as they seemed like panaceas to the weavings of their existence! This sensation was even more amplified the rarer and more unique a Megalonian was.","An Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian that had made his decree, paired with a possessed will that had decreed over a hundred Ordinances...","His existence itself felt like a Panacea found in the rarest corners of the Expanse!","Above, the titanic golden Invader had his serpentine eyes blare with cognizance as he voiced out.","|What are you...|","Its eyes carried a hungry light as its left hand opened wide, Quintessential Megalonian Nu finally falling in his grasp as this Existence Severing entity...had her isolated existence that nobody should have been able to dirty entirely sealed.","No Existence Severing Entity would be affected by the weavings of Existence of another.","Any semblance of damage would be nullified, any causality would be destroyed, and any cause and effect, destiny, or karma would be severed!","They could distort how their existence experienced time. They could close their eyes as a Cycle passed outside, and only a moment would have passed for them.","If their existence was powerful enough, they could experience a whole cycle with their existence while only a second passed outside!","They wouldn't be affected by anything other than their own Existence.","They were not weak.","The only possibility for their Existence to be violated came when an opposing party far, far exceeding their level of existence and complexity appeared, and such beings could intrude and violate their Severed Existence.","But even if they were twice or thrice as powerful, it still wasn't easy to violate the bounds of an Existence Severing Entity- one had to be many times more powerful, or even having exceeded the stage of Existence Severing entirely!","Such...was the case that showed the Quintessential Megalonian Nu glaring with defiance and hatred towards the titanic golden Invader as he threw her in his mouth- an unfathomable grinding force pressing down like a milestone as her weavings were entirely shredded.","...!","And the titanic invader's eyes instantly radiated a terrifying light of complexity as this being seemed heavily energized, his voice booming out as he struck down with his massive hands.","|Good! Very good! This is a true answer to our current problem...so let it be done!|","BOOM!","The Outsider was pushed aside.","The Megalos Mountain cracked in half as with endless greed, the titanic golden Invader eyed Pyrrhus who stood stably while gazing up in defiance!","His hands began to burn with golden flames, and an instant later, the Megalos Mountain was also covered and burning with gold flames.","|NO!|","The Outsider cried out with rage and guilt, but his power was nowhere close at this moment as he was pushed aside.","The eyes of Pyrrhus and the titanic golden invader seemed to have locked onto each other, but nobody knew that Pyrrhus' eyes were observing waves of prompts calmly at this moment.","|All of your weavings perfectly and simultaneously attained their Ordinance.|","|The Complexity of your existence has risen and is continuing to rise in a way that cannot be entirely quantified.|","|Your existence itself is changing in quality.|","|The Origin Sacred Primal Existence of Pyrrhus is being inherited.|","|The Source of Existence of the Megalos is attempting to be bound.|","|The Ordinance of the Megalos attained simultaneously with Pyrrhus acts as the gateway!|","...!","The Source of Existence of the Megalos.","What allowed Megalonians, who had lived for an extremely short period of time, to gain tremendous power.","It was a Source of Existence that was entirely eradicated across the Megalos and the Expanse!","It did not exist anymore.","And yet...","BOOM!","|Give yourself to me!|","The titanic golden Invader that had already swallowed Quintessential Megalonian Nu raged maddeningly as the Megalos Mountain collapsed, the empty Sacred Primal Sea split into pieces as his massive hands were thrust towards Pyrrhus!","|...|","What had occured in the past.","The set events that would play out without fail.","On that day, when Invaders were about to get their hands on the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian...","|Know, O Harbinger of Carnage, that this is not over.|","WAA!","The voice of Pyrrhus rang out.","And in the next moment...","BOOM!","His stellar golden astral body exploded into tendrils of golden light that rapidly collapsed on themselves.","...!","That day, countless years ago, Pyrrhus had chosen to dissipate and collapse his existence over being devoured by the Invaders!","And the Will that was occupying him...","|Hoping for a future that had an extremely low chance of playing out, Pyrrhus collapsed his existence entirely while leaving behind a sliver of his Origin within his newly established Ordinance of the Megalos.|","|This sliver of Origin with the Ordinance of the Megalos across Cycles and countless complex weavings of Existence now blooms once more, connected to you by an unbreakable thread.|","|With it, the Source of Existence of the Megalos shall bloom once more!|","...!"]},{"number":3344,"title":"Chapter 3344: Chapter 3343 Ordinance! III","paragraphs":["The existence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian was a terrifying one.","He knew death was coming as instead of giving himself over to the terrifying invader, he willfully collapsed his existence while hiding traces of his Origin in his newly declared Megalos!","His existence collapsed, and yet a semblance of his Megalos lived on.","For a possibility that had a very low chance of happening.","If ever even a trace of the Megalonians was unearthed.","This Reconstruction...was one such possibility.","As the Astral body of Pyrrhus disappeared, the hand coming down for it raged as the serpentine eyes of the invader above seemed to be looking for something- honing in on the area where Pyrrhus had collapsed his existence as he bellowed out with heavy and undefiable greed.","|I will find you. I will find you, Possessor! I have marked your scent! I have marked your Ordinance!|","...!","BOOM!","Possessor.","Not Pyrrhus.","Not Megalonian.","Possessor!","At this moment, the terrifying eyes of the Invader gained waves of more cognizance as if he understood exactly what was happening, looking around himself as regal coldness and ancient complexity filled his eyes.","|In the middle of all this, you dare use my likeness for a reenactment? You still haven't left this obsession behind?|","HUUM!","The Tresorverse Sacred Domain began to tremble.","The Reconstruction began to tremble as the moment this cognizance from this being came...","BOOM","The reconstruction of the Megalos Mountains of the Megalonians was split in half and rapidly began to crumble.","As if a safety mechanism was triggered as events reached an unwanted level.","Instantly, all Megalos Mountain and reconstructed entities collapsed!","As it did, intents appeared in the eyes of every Possessor who was observing everything in shock.","[The timeline of the Tresorverse Sacred Domain has come to pass.]","[The gains in complexity and states of Existence will be inherited as soon, a pathway up the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence will open up once more.]","...!","After the collapse of the Megalos Mountains, heavy darkness descended before everyone found their bodies and wills as they were before, but they were submerged within...a sea of stellar purple sand where they couldn't see anyone else.","Noah's body was also in a sea of purple sand, but he wasn't fully paying attention to his location as he sensed the shocking changes within his Existence!","For him, he didn't even have to wait for the events to pass before he was inheriting the power of the Reconstruction.","This remained the same as at this moment, his main body took the brunt of the continued elevation in power and complexity, as well as the changes brought about due to his Decree and Pyrrhus!","Within the Infinite Omniverse.","Atop the multicolored throne connected to all weavings of the Infinite Omniverse.","|A Source of Existence with appalling complexity has been found within a recently bound Ordinance and sublimated with your existence.|","On the throne, his body trembled as his Atlas of Existence pulsed, an astral brilliance shining on the Fifth Mundi of Power as there, an extremely heavy Source of Existence that seemed to possibly overcome a few others under Noah's banner bloomed!","|The Source of Existence of the Megalos sees the light of day once more as it comes with an obsession.|","|An Obsession of carnage and apocalypse fills the Source of Existence of the Megalos, the signatures of its enemies who had descended upon Megalos Mountains many cycles ago bound to it.|","...!","Pyrrhus' Obsession.","It burned brightly within the inherited Source of Existence as hundreds of massive illusory Megalos Mountains stacked on top of each other bloomed within the Fifth Mundi of Power, this source representing far too many things as the instant it bloomed, Noah's existence underwent great changes.","From his eyes and then on his skin, astral brilliance began to leak out and increase in intensity as his Existence that was already rising up exponentially felt like it was gaining additional millions of pairs of wings to rise up ever faster.","He was reflective at this moment as the change took place.","\"Love...\"","He called out this word lightly as he thought about the Outsider.","The Omnifather.","His attachment to the Megalonian Vayan was the causality that brought about their destruction.","Vayan ignored every rule of the Megalonians and placed her entire lineage on a path of extermination...all because of her attachment to an Antediluvian Leviathan after a single cycle.","Millions upon millions of years.","He wondered.","If he were to spend millions of years with Adelaide.","With Barbatos.","With Athena...and many others.","Would his love for them exceed everything else to the extent that if a choice came between them and the Infinite Omniverse, the weight of his attachments would outweigh everything?","\"...\"","He didn't know.","HUUM!","Around his body, the transformation caused his hair to dance with an astral gold light as above his head, radiant multicolored banners began to stretch out.","A distance from his throne, the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse was looking towards Noah with calm eyes that held countless calculations and complex weavings, feeling as if her Master was thinking about something she could lend her aid to, but at the same time, she couldn't interfere.","Master and Construct were lost in their own thoughts as the former also thought of a critical piece from the Reconstruction.","The titanic golden Invader who had gained cognizance that he was in a reconstruction, and had looked at Pyrrhus' dispersed existence while affirming that he had marked Noah.","The Possessor of Pyrrhus!","Marked.","The truthfulness of this was unknown as Noah could only cautiously prepare- unable to erupt with indefatigable Tyranny and state that it was merely an Invader.","Talent and potential were great, but it wasn't everything.","Pyrrhus was a terrifying Entity who was already One With Existence at birth, awakening the Eye of Existence a day later, and establishing his Ordinance less than a week later.","By all means, he was his own protagonist.","Someone that could have etched their records across the Megalos and Expanse.","And yet...what happened to him?","No matter how terrifying the complexity of his existence was, he died!"]},{"number":3345,"title":"Chapter 3345: Chapter 3344 Ordinance! IV","paragraphs":["Forced to collapse his own Existence not to be devoured by another.","He wasn't given the time to shine.","Noah also needed time.","He didn't know everything and couldn't peer across all the mysteries, but he could take it step by step as he ensured that he and his people...did not end up like the Megalonians one day.","The reconstruction...was a cautionary tale!","And it was even more applicable at this moment as a golden banner of Megalos shone unfathomably bright above Noah, a terrifying sea of complexity burning into him from it as...","|Within the Blood of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer, the complexity of the extinct Megalonians flows once more.|","|Your Existence has seamlessly grasped the Origin Sacred Primal Existence of Pyrrhus.|","|Through you, the resurgence of the Megalonians is not an impossibility.|","...!","Seeing these prompts, Noah couldn't help but sigh.","In the past, he had unearthed the weavings of Lumen as they were a unique race that fell under the banner of the Conceptual System of Existence, but that was it.","A race born within an Omniverse in the Megalos Ynnere.","The Megalonians...were entities born within the Megalos Mountains contained within the gaps of the Expanse, their lineage being so terrifying that they were hunted down to extinction by a force that could even eradicate Existence Severing entities as if they were nothing.","And that was an unknown number of cycles ago.","Noah...now inherited the same complexity of such a lineage.","His existence would be akin to a Panacea that far exceeded the value of even an Existence Severing Entity like Nu as at this moment, he accepted the full weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- Pyrrhus!","How would his fate be different from the Megalonians?","\"...\"","He truly didn't know.","What he did know was the depths of his own complexity of Existence.","He closed his eyes as he felt the Banners above him.","His Ordinances.","As above, so below.","Within his body, he felt the Ordinances pulsing and interacting with each other across his existence, their interactions only prompting the emergence of even greater complexity as their power was truly unique.","At this moment, even without using his connection to the Infinite Omniverse or the Sacred Primal Eye of Existence, he felt like he could use his Ordinances to see everything within the Infinite Omniverse, and even Omniverse X-999.","Not just see, but act.","Not just see, but act.","He instinctively felt like he could impose his Ordinance instantly on a vast surface area, that he could be sitting in another corner of Omniverse X-999 as if an enemy appeared in an opposite corner, he would be able to release an Ordinance upon them and attack without ever having to move a step.","This...was the power of entities who had attained Ordinance of Existence.","They held such subtle control that they could use their ordinance to strike from an extremely far distance!","Noah felt like he easily covered Omniverse X-999, but even this was not his limit.","He didn't know what equivalent distance other entities could cover, but even when he thought about this, it didn't matter.","They could impose a single Ordinance of Existence when they made a move.","But what about him?","He smiled lightly as he opened his eyes and looked at the visage of the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse before him.","\"Are you ready for your own advancement?\"","He had made his jump as a shocking transformation and level of power bloomed.","The Infinite Omniverse was next as it had devoured and assimilated more than enough Dark Matter Cores and Tainted Omniverses that its chances of success in what it wanted to do nearly bordered on the absolute.","|I shall start soon, Master.|","Her intent came out brightly as she prepared.","Far from here, a body of his within a Blancverse in the Expanse was also ready to receive her!","\"Very well.\"","He gave a light nod as his thoughts moved.","In the next second, his eyes reflected the scene of a purple sea of authority as within the Tresorverse of the Omnifather, changes bloomed once more.","His body within disappeared and was taken to another location entirely as here, many, many other auras could be felt.","Tens of thousands of terrifying auras found themselves deposited in a new domain that was astoundingly vast.","Antediluvian Leviathans, Protectors of the Commonwealth, and other unique entities who didn't belong to any of these powers, but held their own shocking power from isolated Omniverses across the Megalos Ynnere!","They all appeared atop what looked like a golden inner bark of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence itself, this flat area extending outwards for light years as uniquely, all those who passed through the Reconstruction were deposited near each other.","Tens of thousands of Entities who had transcended their Existence!","The vast majority had at least attained their Eye of Existence, followed by rare geniuses at the One With Existence level who managed to raise the complexity of their existence enough to also arrive in the Expanse.","Then, the third largest group were entities at the Ordinance of Existence, and then the terrifying auras of Ordinance Amalgamation blared here and there!","Of course, mixed in were those at the Quasi-Ordinance of Existence and Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation level.","Then, there were those whose aura could not be felt as they hid it deep.","But the moment everyone arrived here, they all rapidly grouped up with their own forces.","The massive Antediluvian Leviathans circled around each other, the eyes of many being somber as it seemed the news regarding the Omnifather being the Outsider who inadvertently brought destruction upon the Megalonians began to spread.","The Simians and others belonging to the Commonwealth also rapidly found each other as many of them showed jubilation- thousands surrounding the Shield of the Commonwealth, Old Man Eudemus, who at this moment burned brightly with the terrifying aura of an Ordinance Amalgamation entity!","Many had made tremendous gains in the Tresorverse Sacred Domain as what they brought back with them was an astounding level of power.","As many entities gathered and grouped together, there were a few who remained where they were or probed around cautiously.","Then there was Noah.","Nobody around him, and no group to associate himself with.","He seemed to exude a sense of loneliness as at this moment, a part of his Origin was burning as the obsession of Pyrrhus was buzzing against the Antediluvian Leviathans- the lineage of the Omnifather!","He sighed as he had to take care of this obsession, but before he could think any further, his head rose up along with many others as they stared upwards.","There, an intent bloomed.","|Complexity of Existence alone is not enough, one has to also be proficient in weaving this complexity to achieve substantial results- to truly express their power exceptionally at their level, or even exceed it.|","|The Megalonians were eradicated even though many had attained high complexities of Existence. They were not able to fight back against those more powerful. This Tresorverse Prison Domain is meant to forge Entities with weavings of existence capable of standing confidently in their stage or exceeding it.|","...!"]},{"number":3346,"title":"Chapter 3346: Chapter 3345 Disregard! I","paragraphs":["The Tresorverse Prison Domain.","This was the distinction given to the area they were currently in as it was meant to hone the way they utilized the Complexity of their Existence!","The Megalonians were mentioned as one had to have lived through the reconstruction to truly understand what this was about.","But Noah knew that the weavings of that Reconstruction would never rise again within the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence.","It was a one time opportunity as this Tresorverse Prison Domain should be the major playing field for all those who reached the Trunk of the Primaltree of Existence!","A buzzing clamor of majesty echoed throughout as the entities here were those filled with extreme power and positions.","Among the throngs of thousands of Protectors of the Commonwealth, apart from those paying their respect to the Shield of the Commonwealth and the Sword of the Commonwealth who brimmed with shocking power, there were also many centered around another figure.","The distinguished Viceroy himself had made it into the Reconstruction who knew when, and he now stood amidst other Simians who protected his majesty.","His visage...radiated a unique power of the Ordinance of Existence level as there was a veiled Ordinance Amalgamation Simian standing behind him protectively!","The Shield and the Sword of the Commonwealth were also not far away from this entity.","The Symbol of Power of the Commonwealth.","Someone Noah had seen act within an Arena.","The Viceroy!","The Simians treated his status highly as they all continued gazing above at the blooming intents.","|The Tresorverse Prison Domain is a domain of combat, a domain that can be lethal to those weak or unlucky.|","...!","|Once the true Tresorverse Prison Domain is revealed, you will come across Tresorverse Towers of Existence the size of Omniverses. Each tower may only be led and occupied by a single Lead Existence who will get their hands on a Modus Operandi that shows unique means of weaving Complexity.|","|Different rarities of Tresorverse Towers of Existence flow abundantly, with ownership of the Towers decided by strength. The one who can occupy a tower for the time it takes a singularity to disperse will gain its ownership, with heavy gains and responsibilities falling upon them depending on which tower they occupy.|","|Each State of Existence will have their own unique Tresorverse Towers of Existence as only the strongest within a state of Existence will determine ownership. After a period of acclimation, those leading these Towers will have to withstand the assault of a Lineage that has been imprisoned here for the past 10 Cycles. For them, killing you is a condition for their freedom. Life and death will rely on your own Existence.|","...!","A Lineage...that had been imprisoned for 10 entire cycles?","Noah's gaze turned sharp at this as at this moment...","HUUUM!","The surroundings began to tremble as the golden bark they stood on fluctuated.","There were tens of thousands of powerful Entities standing atop it as at this moment, these golden lands seemed like they moved as all around them, reality began to change.","As if a veil was dropped, stellar astral obsidian radiance was seen all around, waves of golden light burning as massive wonder bloomed around them and stretched out for lightyears!","In comparison, their figures on the golden bark seemed like a grain of sand.","Radiant, different colored structures that were the size of Omniverses stretched out, and they seemed like huge monoliths suspended in space!","Each one pulsed with a unique aura of power as the majority didn't feel that oppressive, but there were 81 Multicolored Monoliths stretched out within this Trunk of the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence that felt extremely oppressive.","There were 9 that felt suffocating.","And then...there 3 that seemed to innately make others want to kneel in reverence.","There were all Tresorverse Towers of Existence!","At the same time that space unfurled around them, everyone also saw different colored strings appear above each of their heads.","|The Tresorverse Towers of Existence are free to contend for, simply choose the difficulty based on the complexity of your Existence and the confidence to withstand and rebuff others for the time it takes a Singularity to distinguish entirely.|","...!","A choice had to be made.","When Noah looked up at the strings, he couldn't help but think of the endless golden strings within the Expanse.","A momentary thought.","After it passed, his eyes that were looking closely at the strings saw some details.","|White String of Existence]:: Pulling upon it will designate one to vie for an Average Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi within an Average Tresorverse Tower of Existence. Of Average Quality, it can at most allow one to increase their output of weavings of Existence by 50%. Many of these towers are available.","|Blue String of Existence]:: Pulling upon it will designate one to vie for a Rare Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi within a Rare Tresorverse Tower of Existence. Of Rare Quality, it can at most allow one to increase their output of weavings of Existence by 100%. There are 81 Rare Tresorverse Towers of Existence.","|Purple String of Existence]:: Pulling upon it will designate one to vie for a Quintessential Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi within a Quintessential Tresorverse Tower of Existence. Of Quintessential Quality, it can at most allow one to increase their output of weavings of Existence by 150%. There are 9 such Quintessential Tresorverse Towers of Existence.","|Gold String of Existence]:: Pulling upon it will designate one to vie for an Origin Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi within an Origin Tresorverse Tower of Existence. Of Origin Quality, it can at most allow one to increase their output of weavings of Existence by 500%. There are 3 such Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence.","\"...\"","The Omnifather very clearly drew inferences from the tiers of Megalonians in designing this unique domain!","Average, Rare, Quintessential, or Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence!","Only a single Lead Existence could take hold of a single Tower- and they were exclusive to a single state of Existence!"]},{"number":3347,"title":"Chapter 3347: Chapter 3346 Disregard! II","paragraphs":["The numbers of Towers Noah gained information about seemed to only be prevalent to entities at the Ordinance of Existence, and he didn't know how many of such towers there were for those who only attained the Eye of Existence, or those at Ordinance Amalgamation.","It was a System that was meant to have the strongest entities of the same state of Existence take the lead!","Naturally, there was only one tier of a Tresorverse Tower of Existence that Noah could go for.","After all, his type of Existence had just inherited such a level of Complexity.","It could only be Origin!","With steady hands, Noah moved his hand up as he tugged on the golden string.","An instant later, this string came down and wrapped around him as a golden robe was adorned on his body, and on his back- runic words stating [Origin Pass] were inscribed!","Out of what seemed like hundreds of Tresorverse Towers of Existence, many were White and Blue, with nine massive Purple Tresorverse Towers of Existence and three largest Gold Tresorverse Towers of Existence that were floating on the fringes of the stellar obsidian astral domain they were in.","Compared to these Towers that were the size of Omniverses, the tens of thousands of transcended entities here on the golden bark were truly like insignificant grains of sand.","As more and more entities pulled on the strings above them, they were divided and split based on their level of power as with the vastness of this space, those at the state of One With Existence were sent towards the leftmost side of this region, those at the Eye of Existence level coming after them, those at the Ordinance of Existence following, and then to the rightmost side of this domain, the few terrifyingly powerful entities at the Ordinance Amalgamation Stage could be seen.","There were less than a hundred of these terrifying entities as the Shield and Sword of the Commonwealth among other Ordinance Amalgamation Protectors were sent here- along with Arguros of the Antediluvian Leviathans.","The Leviathans...who made up the majority of the forces of Ordinance Amalgamation entities as the scattered Existences not belonging to any group followed.","The four different groups demarcated by different states of Existence were divided with the length of over 50 Omniverses between them- being equivalent to the distance of an entire Sector of the Megalos Ynnere!","They could not interfere with others.","And as far as anyone knew, unless there was an exception made for them...nobody could see Existence Severing Entities here!","It was hard to believe that there weren't any in the Megalos Ynnere.","But nobody truly knew as such existences were too distant. Too pristine!","So their focus remained on themselves at this moment.","After the demarcations made due to the States of Existence, Noah found himself in a region surrounded by a thin golden barrier, with a few hundred terrifying auras of Ordinance of Existence entities actually contained in this domain.","Gold!","All of them were competing for the Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence- of which there were only three!","Outside of the thin golden barrier, thousands of entities at the Ordinance of Existence stage watched on with caution and interest- none of them having selected the golden string.","|The selection of the Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence shall be carried out first.|","HUUUM!","Within the golden demarcated area, three dazzling golden thrones appeared in the distant space- a calm singularity floating atop each one!","|The Ones who can remain seated on the throne for the length of time it takes for the singularity above to disappear shall gain ownership of the Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence.|","...!","Three thrones.","The powerful entities who had already transcended their existence all carried extremely deep records, history, and power as none made a move right away!","There were a few hundred of them here.","Each one at the Ordinance of Existence.","Whichever three were bold enough to try and claim the three golden thrones first...would become enemies of all others here as they had to defend for an unknown amount of time!","Just who would have such tremendous confidence in their power to be among the first ones to step forward?","As such a daring question arose, Noah's brows raised as among all Ordinance of Existence Entities here, two stepped out right away.","One was a cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan, his body vibrating with ecstatic power.","The other...was the Viceroy of the Commonwealth- the young leader of this power as behind him, there were close to 20 Protectors at the stage of Ordinance of Existence that followed behind him protectively!","He sought to take one of the three golden thrones while being protected by his forces!","His simian fur shone with a regal golden luster as he looked around all Ordinance of Existence entities here with a gaze full of majesty and power- his figure magisterially floating towards one of the thrones unhurriedly!","As if he was so confident in his power that he wasn't even worried that others here might shake him.","With a few steps, he arrived before the central golden throne and sat grandly- Protectors circling around him protectively as above the throne- the singularity began to burn!","On the other throne, the cerulean Antediluvian that had also stepped out arrived in no time, his body adorned with a golden robe similar to all others here taking a seat on the right throne with tremendous speed.","A flaming blue crown swirled above this Antediluvian Leviathan as he seemed like an ancient Emperor who could erupt with an unfathomable Ordinance at any moment- giving many here a sense of oppression!","Now, only a single throne was left.","Who would be bold enough to sit on it before chaos ensued?","Who-?","|Huh?|","Many gazes blinked as they only saw the golden robe of a devilishly handsome man step forward, his demeanor carefree and without any worries as in a few steps, arrived and sat on the leftmost throne.","After he sat, he stared at the throngs of Protectors, Antediluvian Leviathans, and other unique entities from across the Megalos Ynnere as he did not at all seem worried!","Who was that?","He dared to actually be among the first seated on one of the golden thrones?","Many eyes looked between his figure that they couldn't sense much threat of, then towards the seated Viceroy of the Commonwealth who was surrounded protectively by over 20 entities of the same stage, and then they gazed at the cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan who emanated extremely heavy and stifling complexity of existence.","And...their eyes returned back to Noah's visage as their expressions seemed sour, showing complete disregard.","Who was this complete nobody that actually dared to be among those seated up there?","His demeanor was filled with confidence as the dignity he carried seemed high enough, but so what?","Did he actually consider himself an unshakable power at the Ordinance of Existence stage?!"]},{"number":3348,"title":"Chapter 3348: Chapter 3347 Disregard! III","paragraphs":["The scene was a heavy one filled with tension, with faint banners rising and falling above many heads as they could erupt at any moment.","One of the things that made the situation even more tense was that nobody knew what the actual passage of time was for the singularities above the golden thrones to extinguish.","Depending on this period of time, even truly powerful entities can be bombarded by attacks on all sides by multiple combatants!","One had to move carefully or have absolute strength in order to be daring enough.","Three entities had gone to sit on the golden thrones as the singularities above began to burn, and many eyes became honed on a single entity on these thrones.","A devilishly handsome man who sat there freely, his gaze laid back as if what was happening right now wasn't a big deal!","He even met the gazes of those who were eyeing him on the throne as in this tense situation...","He actually blinked towards the few hundred entities as he spoke!","\"I'll save you all some time and tell you that your best chance is going to be one of these other two thrones.\"","Noah pointed towards the Thrones that the Viceroy of the Commonwealth and the unknown Antediluvian Leviathan sat on as many intents arose!","The golden furred Viceroy gazed towards Noah with calm eyes that flashed with distaste- as his words had made it clear that he put himself above him.","Him.","A Viceroy.","THE Viceroy!","|...| He gazed at this entity with a calm light of regality as he didn't even bother to reply.","His distinction and power would speak for itself as he waved his hand and declared.","|This Viceroy shall take one of the Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence. If anyone wishes to challenge me on this, they are more than welcome!|","WAA!","A declaration!","Along with it, the bodies of over 20 Ordinance of Existence Protectors exploded with terrifying auras of power as golden Banners of Wheels bloomed above them!","They looked like ancient soldiers currently with their adornment of the golden robes- soldiers who only moved under the banner of an even more ancient emperor.","Many eyes were pensive towards this throne.","On the other throne, the cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan was a seasoned warrior from the Primal Family of Oceanetheus, one of the four Descendant Lineages of the Omnifather as he was fearless!","And yet.","In the next instant.","PA!","The sound of a bubble popping echoed out.","In front of the Cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan seated grandly on the throne, the humanoid figure of an entity that seemed to be in his teens appeared.","The speed was ridiculously fast that the eyes of the Cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan constricted in alarm, but before he could do anything...","PA!","His figure on the golden throne disappeared.","He appeared where the young looking humanoid entity used to be, while this entity was right where he was just now!","With a calm gaze, he sat on the throne as above, the singularity reset before it began to burn again!","|...!|","These sets of actions caused caution to rise in the hearts of many as this young entity came into focus.","Dark hair flowing to his shoulders.","Gold robe like all others here, but his eyes...they swirled with what seemed to be millions of golden lines.","He had a calm expression on his face as he looked at the furious visage of the Antediluvian Leviathans meters away as he spoke out softly.","\"I do not wish to kill today nor make an example out of anyone. Turn back and fight for a Quintessential Tresorverse Tower of Existence.\"","...!","The words were heavy.","The words smashed into the honor and power of the Cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan!","His expression twisted as he bellowed out, a wife blue banner unfolding above him as it read- Aqua!","Gloriously blue, the moment he bellowed out, a terrifying sea filled with immense weight and complexity of Existence bloomed behind him- its effect even nearing the throne where the Viceroy sat on as three Ordinance of Existence Protectors stepped forth and erupted with golden banners to protect their Viceroy.","It was a heavy Ordinance filled with power as it seemed about to blanket the young entity before it!","And yet, this young entity actually shook his head.","\"A shame.\"","Two words.","Thereafter, a faint gold banner just briefly flashed above him.","In an instant, faint strings of light converged in front of him and smashed into the Cerulean Antediluvian Leviathan as....","BOOM!","His figure was smashed back mightily.","Flung back at such speed that he smashed into a spectator Ordinance of Existence Antediluvian Leviathan that he smashed into- the chest of that being caving in!","The endless blue sea behind him flickered and disappeared.","The front of his body...was entirely missing as one could see crystalline organs and skeletal structures shining with brilliance.","His weavings of Existence...were silent as shockingly, his eyes were dim.","He was...knocked out.","Not dead, as his existence still burned bright, but he was hit with such shocking complexity that he couldn't even remain conscious!","Over a dozen Antediluvian Leviathans quickly gathered around him as their gazes expressed shock and rage.","They knew the Leviathan before them was a powerful champion- his power even being equivalent to a few of them here!","For him to be treated like this...","They glared with deadly brilliance towards the calm entity on the throne.","\"I truly do not wish to kill.\"","...!","His voice echoed out as he sat back on the throne calmly.","\"Do not force me.\"","Above him, they barely saw a flicker of his unfathomable Ordinance.","It read...Stringere!","When Noah observed this Ordinance and the actions of this entity, his eyes flashed with surprise as silently, his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence unfurled.","Across the Megalos Ynnere, there were a wide array of entities and oddities who rose over the cycles.","The entity that seemed like a young humanoid teen did not belong to the Commonwealth nor Antediluvian Leviathans, and yet his power was so astonishing!"]},{"number":3349,"title":"Chapter 3349: Chapter 3348 Disregard! IV","paragraphs":["The Protectors of the Commonwealth.","The Antediluvian Leviathans.","These groups...were not everything within the Megalos Ynnere.","This reality was made clear at this moment as a young humanoid entity calmly sat on a throne!","Others may not be able to see, but Noah's Sacred Primal Eye of Existence could observe a twinkling of countless golden strings around this being.","Strings.","The Ordinance of Stringere!","The vast Expanse was filled with countless strings that bound together and weaved Existence, and this entity actually set an Ordinance related to this as it made Noah contemplative.","At this very moment, another part of him in the expanse was studying the Blancverse Domain he had bound while gazing at the countless golden strings that made up the Expanse.","If he could manipulate them like Bob could...","Many thoughts were burning within his mind as when he came across this Ordinance, her merely found it unique.","He knew that among his own Ordinances, there was one that could give him an answer and increased understanding towards strings.","Towards how they could all come together to weave existence.","But as for the oddity seated on the throne...","[Odyssion, the Wonderling]:: State of Existence- Ordinance of Existence. Source of Existence- Stringere. Lifespan- 5 Megalos Cycles/450 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- An entity unique in nature as he rose to prominence within his Domain at an early age. He has focused on nothing else but the blind obsession for higher states of Existence, and will do anything in his power to achieve his aims. Many of his records are inaccessible due to the complexity of his weavings...","'Hmm...'","Noah nodded at the feedback and details of this being as he lived less Cycles than even Great Ones like Nietzsche in the Megalos Beyond, and yet his power almost reached their level- and in fact far stripped Great Ones like Savitar.","He was an entity worthy of his power as after he showed it off, many eyes did not wish to test him again so quickly.","There was one entity alone on a throne that has yet to be tested on whether he even deserved to be sitting there.","Many eyes came towards the throne Noah sat on.","He sat there calmly as he gazed back towards these powerful entities, and he actually nodded as he waved his hands towards them!","\"You all can definitely give it a try.\"","WAA!","Bold words filled with confidence echoed out as at this time, some entities could not hold back.","An Antediluvian Leviathan wreathed in black flames stepped forward, a scorching banner blooming above him as others stepped back while frowning.","The banner of Onyxfire.","The Ordinance of Onyxfire!","|This opportunity of the Omnifather...we must all give it everything we've got. So, come off that throne for me.|","...!","The banner above him shone as he didn't move another step.","As an Entity at the Ordinance of Existence, he could attack anywhere in this small enclosed domain just by applying his Ordinance!","And he did just that as above Noah's throne, an obsidian flaming furnace bloomed and released apocalyptic lava-like tenebrous flames that could break down the complexity of existence itself.","They were so potent that they even burned and remained burning on the surrounding weavings of Existence!","They washed over the throne Noah sat on as...","|Huh?| Many of the observing Entities clicked their lips in disregard as if they had been fooled, because they didn't even see the being on the throne release his Ordinance to defend.","He wasn't even fast enough to activate his Ordinance, and they had actually been cautious of him?","And due to their exceedingly cautious nature...","SAA!","The obsidian flaming Leviathan already appeared meters away from the throne as he seemed about to sit on it after he scorched the overconfident entity who sat before him.","But...","\"What are you doing?\"","HUUM!","In the middle of the burning Onyx flames of the Ordinance of Onyxfire, the visage of Noah still calmly sat on his throne as the burning flames spilling all around...didn't seem to be doing anything to him!","...!","This eerie action instantly caused astonishment to bloom in the eyes of the obsidian flaming Leviathan as he rapidly moved back.","|You...my Ordinance is imposed around your existence, its will must be imposed! You...you..!|","At the words of the Leviathan, Noah raised his hands wreathed in the burning flames that did absolutely nothing to him as he voiced out calmly.","\"Why would your Ordinance have any effect on me?\"","HUUM!","He could see the eyes and very core of existence of the Leviathan shaking when he said these words.","His body.","His being.","His very existence was surrounded by over 100 Ordinances!","Even without activating any of them, just the regal brilliance of his many Ordinances could offset and ignore average Ordinances.","Only those with truly deep complexity or unique Ordinances could even force him to make a move.","He shook his head as he entirely denied the very Ordinance of Existence of this being.","\"The complexity of your Existence is far too simple to affect me. Don't even bother.\"","...!","He waved his hand dismissively.","And the terrifying obsidian flames around him were pushed away and extinguished as if they never existed.","|...!|","Immense silence descended in the surroundings!","The gazes of many changed.","They looked at this being who had a seemingly simple disposition as they became immensely serious!","On the other throne, the figure of the Viceroy turned his eyes extremely sharp as he voiced out his intent only to the Protectors around him.","|This entity...what do we know about him?|","He asked lightly.","If he probed his weavings just a bit more, he would have come to remember that he had actually seen this being before in an Arena!","But at that time, he had disregarded all those within the newly discovered Omniverse as nobody within was prevalent enough for him to even taint the memories of his records.","So he asked.","And a Protector around him opened his eyes in shock as he replied.","|I ran his physiology over our database just now! He...he is actually a newly ordained Protector from Omniverse X-999- Viceroy, a part of you gave them a visit recently!|","...!","A unique finding bloomed.","Apart from Old Man Eudemus, no other core power of the Commonwealth had known or bothered with Noah.","Today, he sat on a throne similar to its young Viceroy as his visage came under scrutiny!"]},{"number":3350,"title":"Chapter 3350: Chapter 3349 Unveiling Complexity! I","paragraphs":["An entity unbothered by the Ordinance of an Antediluvian Leviathan!","Unbothered to the extent that he didn't even unleash his own ordinance to defend.","Such a being sat on one of the three thrones competing for an Origin Tresorverse Tower of Existence that promised fantastical wonders.","Seeing such a scene, the calm coldness within the Viceroy shone as theoretically, he should be looking at his subject at this moment.","Someone under his banner.","As more information about him was discovered, and sensing his power, the calm Viceroy surrounded by Ordinance of Existence Protectors looked in the far distance where one could barely see the majesty of Ordinance Amalgamation Entities burning from afar.","In that place, he sent an intent towards the entity he was just told ordained this being near him as a Protector.","|Old Man Eudemus, is there anything to consider regarding the recently ordained Protector Osmont?|","...!","His commanding intent traveled vast distances as he sought to uncover who this creature that acted like a weakling in front of him mere days ago!","At the same time...","|Hmm?|","His gaze flashed with a chilling light as he saw the Protectors around him swirling with vibrance, their bodies showing radiant circling wheels as they looked ahead!","All others seated on the thrones were tested.","Only the throne the Viceroy sat on remained untested as at this moment, others could only have designs on them when the other gel thrones showed entities of high difficulty on them!","Seeing this, the Viceroy couldn't help but sneer.","They thought him weaker than two unknown entities? |I welcome you all to test me. Just know that I won't be as merciful.|","...!","His voice boomed out.","But the entities here would not be stopped so easily.","Each one had declared an Ordinance.","Each one held a wondrous level of Complexity of Existence!","They would not go without a fight as there were a few hundred here.","Even if a few of them were exceptional to sit on the thrones first...","|Brothers and Sisters...there are hundreds of us here and a few of them over there. Since they think themselves to be the most powerful, let us all attack together until we topple them, and then us average folks can have a go ourselves, yes?|","...!","From among the few hundred Ordinance of Existence entities, a woman adorned in a golden robe smiled mischievously as her blue eyes looked ahead, her words causing the surroundings to light up with brilliance as heavy chaos was about to unfold!","—","In the midst of the selection of Tresorverse Towers of Existence occurring.","Away from it, within the Infinite Omniverse.","Noah rose from the multicolored throne made up of countless authorities of the Infinite Omniverse as he disappeared.","When he reappeared, he was within the depths of the Extremity Vein of the Infinite Omniverse, within a stellar domain that had dense swirling clusters of authorities at terrifying concentrations and purity.","And within these massive clusters, his people were calmly cultivating within.","Inside a golden cluster of swirling authority, the Bard of Quintessence could be seen- his head bobbing back and forth as he played a glorious melody!","Unconsciously, his hands playing the drums became faster as his trance was broken while he looked around.","And there...he saw Noah's figure.","|Ah...|","DU! DU! DU!","The symphony he played became more ecstatic and glorious.","Many other eyes were roused from within the depths of the Extremity Vein as they came to land on Noah's figure!","Their Existence felt a sense of heaviness when they stared at him as he was surrounded by a regal astral light.","He looked at the many eyes that turned towards him and smiled.","He looked towards his son who rose up.","He looked towards Sona, Barbatos, Athena, and others.","He looked towards the Primogenitor of Steel, Cimmerian Architect, and Hyperion!","He looked at many beings as his voice echoed out.","\"The Infinite Omniverse is about to undergo a great change and step into an unimaginable place. You all...need to take a similar step as you cannot be left behind.\"","WAA!","As he spoke, his main body began to glimmer with astral light.","He was the Omniversal Archontes Engineer, but he was also the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","And even now, he was assimilating the boons of this terrifying resurgence of a lineage and source of Existence alongside his breakthrough into the stage of Ordinance of Existence!","All parts of him were advancing.","But nothing more so than his distinctions.","Nothing more so than his lineage.","\"Catch a glimpse of what I am talking about, as this is the power I will sacrifice a great deal to flow within your blood.\"","...!","The Source of the Megalos.","The Records of the Megalonians!","He was currently the only Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, as he could pave the way and give rise to other Megalonians.","But it wasn't free.","There was a cost to pay in terms of complexity of existence!","But when it came to costly things, was this ever a problem for Noah?","\"It is a terrifying power, and also a heavy one as others cannot know of its existence- with its records being entirely sealed by me. Glimpse...at the Megalos.\"","HUUUM!","His body buzzed.","For the first time since the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian fused with Noah, a System was used for the first time.","The System of the Megalos!","...!","A glimmer of multicolored radiance.","Soon after, Noah's lone figure was surrounded by hundreds of other illusory entities that looked just like him...but with distinct varieties.","Possible versions of himself that could have bloomed from different causalities!","They bloomed this time not just for the further increase of Complexity, nor just to show off in front of his people.","His people needed to see the weight of what they would soon gain, and he...he needed a better grasp of Complexity as he continued to become increasingly complex.","Complexity...just how could it be quantified?","How did it tie to the Echelons of Existence and the States of Existence?","Change in chap titles"]},{"number":3351,"title":"Chapter 3351: Chapter 3350 Unveiling Complexity! II","paragraphs":["The scene was an alarmingly heavy one.","Those watching it felt like they were being privy to secrets they had no job knowing, their existence feeling sheer astonishment at the scene portrayed by Noah!","A single body of his, and yet hundreds, and then thousands more illusory bodies unfolded.","Each of them seemed to be a variation of himself across the Megalos, as while part of their job was to increase complexity, Noah had already made it clear that he wanted to understand Complexity itself the most!","How could he define it?","How he could quantify it!","So at this moment, as tens of thousands of illusory possible versions of himself unfolded and only continued to increase, each of them looked at each other and...","HUUM!","Opened their Sacred Primal Eyes of Existence.","It was a terrifying method and usage of the Source of Existence of the Megalos.","If one of him would take a long period of time to gain a better understanding of Complexity, what if endless versions of him sought the answer?","The unfolding reality became an even heavier one.","Blinding multi-colored light suffused all around as his people turned their eyes away, but Noah's endless Eyes of Existence continued to open luminously and peer across layers of weavings as soon- there were results!","There had to be results after such a drastic action!","|The Complexity of Existence and all that it encompasses has been made clear to you.|","BOOM!","Boundless waves of information flowed into him.","The tens of thousands of variations of himself radiated shocking glory as their eyes shone, their mouths opening to release an intent at this moment that felt like thousands of ancient voices overlapped together.","|The most basic level of complexity of Existence has been distinguished to be Terrestrial Complexity.|","....!","A deep, inhuman voice that seemed to be steeped in mystery echoed out to his people- as if it were the words of a Sage coming down to enlighten others!","As he spoke, the surrounding reality flickered as blue lines converged to show the images of trees and animals.","An Ant. A Lion. A Human. A Dragon. An Antediluvian Leviathan. A Simian.","Myriads of races were reflected as Noah's intent continued!","|At the Terrestrial Complexity of Existence, entities ranging from the most basic life forms to those with increased complexity are included. Those who have not touched mana and those who have touched its existential authority are all included.|","|Terrestrial Entities constantly struggle against the ravages of time and adapt to their surrounding existence- gaining a semblance of control in the alteration of their immediate reality as they advance further, but little control and influence beyond their bounds of existence. Terrestrial Entities are forever confined to the Domains they were born in, never catching a glimpse of a Higher Weaving of Existence.|","...!","Terrestrial.","In the distance, Henry felt his body shake as he affirmed to himself that he and all others within the Infinite Omniverse...were Terrestrial Entities!","But his father...it seemed that surely, he had broken these confines and should no longer be at this level of complexity.","Henry gazed at the tens of thousands of illusory bodies of his father as the sagely voice of overlapping entities continued.","|Within the bounds of the Terrestrial Complexity of Existence, there are three distinctions one can be- A Basic Terrestrial Entity, An Intermediate Terrestrial Entity, or an Advanced Terrestrial Entity.|","|Basic Terrestrial Entities are Life forms with minimal complexity, lacking any influence or control beyond their immediate reality. Many have not touched mana and remain ignorant of it all their lives. Countless quintillions upon quintillions fill this distinction across the Megalos of Existence.|","|Intermediate Terrestrial Entities are those who have reached a higher level of adaptability, having interacted with mana, and enabling limited control within their own existence. They are capable of manipulating weak laws and edicts of the reality around them, transforming Mana into a tool that aids them in the advancement of life. At the peak of this level stands those who are seeking the Extremes of what they stand for.|","|Advanced Terrestrial Entities are those that have achieved significant complexity within Terrestrial Complexity, gaining substantial influence over their surroundings and maximizing their potential within the bounds of their existence. Those touching upon Existential Extremity Authority fall within this level, with some unique ones even grasping at the complex States of Existence if the potential of their being is high enough.|","...!","Thoroughly.","Clearly.","His people felt like their existence was defined in an extremely straightforward manner, their minds buzzing as the records of their lives flashed to when they were still only the most basic Terrestrial Entities!","In their reminiscence, they still heard the buzzing voice of utter majesty from Noah boom out.","|From the Basic level of Complexity known as Terrestrial Complexity, those who manage to grow their complexity to a sufficient enough level can transcend their own weavings and touch upon the Constellation Complexity of Existence.|","...!","Constellation!","From Terrestrial Entities to Constellation Entities- a mere gap existing in between as few manage to cross it!","|Constellation Entities have their existences unburdened, their struggle against time and other natural factors of existence lessening as they can live for many cycles. They can exert a much greater control and influence over their own existence and their surrounding existence. Such Entities greatly range in the type and level of influence they can exert, and they can seamlessly traverse across Higher Weavings of Existence outside of the limited domain they were born in.|","Above them.","Noah's people saw an image of...Noah himself.","His body surrounded with Astral light, spinning around like a model for others to see and follow!","Alongside him, images of an Antediluvian Leviathan, a Simian, and an Outerversal Morphon whose bodies radiated terrifying waves of power and complexity appeared.","|Within the bounds of the Constellation Complexity of Existence, there are also three distinctions one can be- A Minor Constellation Entity, A Greater Constellation Entity, or an Elder Constellation Entity.|","...!","Countless waves of information continued to flow into Noah from endless versions of himself, and he analyzed it all before he spoke about it as many things were made clear!"]},{"number":3352,"title":"Chapter 3352: Chapter 3351 Unveiling Complexity! III","paragraphs":["The words coming out from Noah were akin to words of sages from the distant past reverberating in their ears.","Among the many entities listening to Noah, Hyperion was sitting in a cluster of crimson gold radiance as his body was trembling while he listened.","When the demarcation between Terrestrial and Constellation Entities was made, his body couldn't help but tremble as this was something he could feel in his heart!","He could feel it so because he, along with many other Enders, were deeply connected to the Infinite Omniverse.","They could feel it.","They knew.","The Infinite Omniverse wanted to tackle this gap between a Terrestrial Complexity of Existence and Constellation Complexity of Existence not just soon, but it seemed like it would be at any moment from now.","For them, it felt like a moment of life and death as what would happen in the case of failure?!","They didn't know everything it knew.","They only wanted for it to succeed in its endeavor as at this moment, Hyperion could only listen.","He saw the tens of thousands of bodies of Noah floating around each other, their collective voices echoing out freely as they continued.","|Minor Constellation Entities are recently transcended entities who have minimal influence in their Constellation tier. They can traverse limited Higher Weavings of Existence and exercise moderate control over their surroundings. Some entities who fit this category include those who may have declared the Ordinance of their Existence or those who have reached the Eighth Echelon of Existence.|","|Greater Constellation Entities are more developed Constellation entities capable of living for many, many extended cycles. They can influence multiple domains of existence and exert considerable control over their environment with very little effort, unburdened by some existential limits. Some entities who fit this category include those who have undergone Ordinance Amalgamation, scales up to those who were capable enough to Sever their Existence- entities who have raised their Echelons of Existence to the Ninth Level.|","|Elder Constellation Entities are those with the highest level within Constellation Complexity, with substantial authority over the Higher Weavings of Existence. They wield significant influence and command across different weavings of existence- with the chance of others affecting their existence being extremely low. Elder Constellations can walk across the Expanse without fear of death as their very existence commands power. Such Entities are distinguished as Pioneers of Existence.|","...!","Minor, Greater, and Elder Constellations.","Uniquely, even Existence Severing entities were placed as Greater Constellations, with Noah himself only taking on the distinction of a Minor Constellation at this moment!","And past those who severed their Existence, there were the Elder Constellations.","Entities termed as Pioneers of Existence.","Noah thought of this word himself even though he was the one who spoke about it, with him only continuing to filter and organize the incoming information before he laid it out.","He thought of the Great Beyonder and the Omnifather.","He felt like these beings had long since become Pioneers of Existence, and that they shouldn't even be settled in this stage at this moment.","They were very likely away from the distinction of Constellations entirely.","As he thought of this, his mind focused on the next waves of information cascading down.","And he spoke of them freely.","|As far as can be inferred by the current level of complexity, the advanced level of Complexity of past Constellations is known as the Source Complexity of Existence. Very little can be inferred from this as it is too far away.|","...!","Source Complexity!","The Sacred Primal Eyes of Existence above each of the possible versions of himself opened ever wider, seeking to uncover even a little bit more knowledge on this as their golden pupils crackled with celestial lightning!","But some results came through.","|Within the bounds of the Source Complexity of Existence, there are also three distinctions one can be- A Lesser Source Entity, A Greater Source Entity, or a Prime Source Entity.|","Lesser Source, Greater Source, Prime Source Entities!","He knew too little of them.","He couldn't even infer what type of power each type of entity wielded.","The Great Beyonder and the Omnifather...were they within this stage?","And what about someone as mysterious as Bob who could seamlessly give a Blancverse Domain to another without so much as a thought.","Was he a Prime Source Entity, or something even beyond this in terms of Complexity?","Noah couldn't say.","HUUM!","But he had managed to achieve the goal of classifying and getting a deeper knowledge of Complexity, and the tens of thousands of illusory possible versions of himself began to disappear as the blinding light around each of them converged towards Noah!","In moments, only his figure remained as there was immense silence all around him.","Astral brilliance flickered around his body when his eyes opened, he seemed like a dazzling Constellation that others could only look to.","His eyes twinkled with Astral radiance as his hair danced like golden flames, the wings of Invictus Maximus spread out behind his back with colorless radiance covered by an astral gold glow.","At this moment, his eyes turned in a certain direction as he called out.","\"My son.\"","WAA!","A single call.","And the visage of Henry appeared in front of him.","Dark blue threads of hair.","A face filled with dignity and regality as if he were a young king from an ancient kingdom.","Noah smiled while looking at him as he continued.","\"My blood has always been heavy, but it is even heavier now as having it will implicate you. Having it will mean that in the future, Greater Constellations that have already Severed their Existence and even Elder Constellations who are Pioneers of Existence may be searching for you- seeking to devour your very existence. Do you want such a burden? Do you want this Lineage?\"","...!","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian Source of Existence he had obtained was tremendously powerful.","It was.","But it was also unfathomably dangerous as the Megalonians did not live long at all.","He was confident in shouldering the burden that came with this power, but he would not impose it on anyone else unless they understood what it truly represented!"]},{"number":3353,"title":"Chapter 3353: Chapter 3352 Unveiling Complexity! IV","paragraphs":["And yet, not even an instant passed before his son bowed his head towards him and spoke without a shadow of a doubt.","\"Let me share this burden with you, Father.\"","...!","He didn't even ask for the boons that would come with it.","He just asked to share some of the burden his father carried so that he wouldn't have to hold all that weight on his shoulders alone!","Noah smiled at such an answer as he nodded, his existence burning brightly as the gate he had placed within his lineage that stopped the flow of unfathomable weavings of existence opened.","His lineage began to burn with golden astral splendor as above him, an endlessly blue banner began to spread out for light years.","Mana.","It was a single banner, but it also represented the many other banners he had under him, as it could transform into any Ordinance and all Ordinances at once!","The transfer and emergence of his Megalonian Blood into others of his lineage required a level of such authority.","Mana burned freely.","But in the next moment...","|A unique type of complexity of existence is blooming with the chosen target under the influence of your lineage.|","|Variations of this complexity exist as depending on the level of purity of the lineage of the target compared to yours, they may have the emergence of an Average Sacred Primal Megalonian Bloodline, a Rare Sacred Primal Megalonian Bloodline, or a Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian Bloodline.|","DUM! DUM! DUM!","Henry's figure became ensnared with waves of astral brilliance as deep within his existence, his blood erupted with fervor.","His father was inducing a shocking level of complexity within him as at this moment, his voice echoed out.","\"During this process of emergence of complexity, you have a greater chance of attaining the state of One With Existence. Of achieving enough of a precipice in your complexity to go from a Terrestrial Entity and into a Constellation Entity that can roam the expanse. If anyone can do it, it should be you.\"","...!","He released everything of his Lineage freely to his son.","His cells that were made up of quarks, leptons, and Psioneutrinos of Matter and Dark Matter.","They wouldn't be exactly the same, but their weavings would be passed on.","They were much more complex than other entities with just this alone as with it, the induction of entry into the States of Existence and even the transformation of Terrestrial Complexity into a Constellation Complexity was possible!","Henry heard these words as his eyes illuminated with terrifying golden radiance.","Around him, layers of Fabled Omniverses began to swirl as the single greatest tool he could use at this moment to ensure success in this ordeal...was the authority of Nepotism.","Who was he? Whose son was he?","With these mere questions, his Existence surged up exponentially as his degree of complexity began to rise!","He didn't even have to rely on his own brilliance, with the weavings of Nepotism brilliantly pulling on the weavings of his father to achieve the most favorable result!","|The Weavings of a Quintessential Sacred Primal Megalonian bloom within the Existence of Henry Osmont.|","BOOM!","A refulgence of brilliance unfolded.","And an instant later...the body of Henry seemed to vibrate with such a shocking frequency that it began to meld with the surrounding Existence.","...!","The first sign of one attaining an existence complex enough to seamlessly understand and begin melding with the surrounding Existence!","One With Existence!","Such a phenomenon bloomed with the first entity that the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian passed down his weavings to, a shocking inheritance being carried out as others watched with open eyes.","This occurred within the Extremity Vein of the Infinite Omniverse that, at this moment, began to radiate a profound and concentrated light of complexity.","The Extremity Vein was something that stretched out the length of five normal Omniverses, and it was surrounded by stacks of Aletheian Havens all around in addition to the ones constructed within it.","The level of authority it contained far exceeded even one hundred normal Omniverses put together, and at this moment, all of it seemed to be rising and put to work for a specific purpose.","It was a unique oddity when one thought about it.","Entities increased their complexities, and domains of Existence remained relatively the same over the cycles- the increasing chaos only leading them towards eventual destruction after hundreds of Megalos Cycles, with some even withstanding thousands.","It was as if due to the fact that their weavings of Complexity were so stable at a certain stage, they could outlive entities who could increase their complexity to shocking degrees.","There seemed to be a demarcation between the two as one could not impose on the bounds of the other.","Megalos Ynnere would always be Megalos Ynnere, and had been this way for thousands of cycles past and thousands of cycles to follow.","The Megalos Beyond had always been the Megalos Beyond, nothing more, nothing less.","Megalos Nihilos was also the same!","Megalos Mountains that existed within the gaps of the Expanse also retained what they were, with nothing changing.","A World always remained a World.","A Universe always remained a Universe.","A Cosmos always remained a Cosmos.","The Infinite Omniverse had always violated this ruling.","It was merely a floating island, and yet it became much more than that- multiple times over.","On this day, it was about to violate this seemingly unbreakable rule yet again!","Within the depths of the Infinite Omniverse where a multicolored throne stood empty and mightily.","The Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse closed its eyes in front of this throne as it uttered out terrifying words- an influence of its master.","|Merely Complexity.|","HUUM!","|Who decided you could bind me to a certain state of Complexity?|","...!","Who decided it could only be a floating Spiritual Land?!","Who decided it could only be a slightly larger Omniverse?!","Who decided that?!","BOOOM!","With unburdened fervor and brilliance, the Infinite Omniverse took all the authorities it carried.","All the complexity it had raised.","It took all of it...and caused it to begin transforming as through the sheer force of countless intricate weavings of complexity and the influence of being bound by an oddity of unfathomable measure...it began its incursion towards a greater state of complexity.","Towards the Expanse!"]},{"number":3354,"title":"Chapter 3354: Chapter 3353 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! I","paragraphs":["Over endless stretches of the Expanse.","Over the Megalos and the countless light years they covered.","There were innumerable entities within as whenever every single one made a move that would tremendously alter their existence, there was always a shred of caution and doubt.","They always knew that something could go wrong.","But, it was different for the Infinite Omniverse.","It had planned and calculated.","From its countless calculations, it had even gone above and beyond what it considered enough- devouring more Tainted Omniverses and Dark Matter Cores than it even needed for its complexity!","The boundless weavings of the Megalos from Ozymandias that it had only stopped just now to ensure that there would be no interruptions.","The Existential Terraforming that greatly expanded its weavings.","It had already surpassed all the scopes it set for success in transcending existence by a terrifying margin as the possibility of failure...was infinitely close to zero!","This was because the Infinite Omniverse knew that it couldn't afford to fail.","|My Extremity Vein.|","HUUUM!","The fabric of existence that made the Infinite Omniverse was buzzing as the Extremity Vein was stimulated.","The Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse had a calm expression, but one could see immeasurable defiance in its eyes as it called out again!","|My Aletheian Havens.|","...!","Surrounding the Extremity Vein, the dazzling Aletheian Havens of Dreams, Apollyon, Elysium, Genesis, Helios, Oceanus, Prana...all these Havens pulsed with shocking valor as they contributed.","They were Havens, but they also had other identities.","|My Ordinances.|","WU!","One of the tools it had as a domain that others did not have.","Its Havens...were declared Ordinances under its Master!","And not just its Havens.","But also what made up the very foundation and pillars of the Infinite Omniverse were declared Ordinances!","Their level of Complexity was more than enough to induce transcendence within any Entity.","And yet the Infinite Omniverse held dozens of such Ordinances as its Pillars of support, along with their complexity!","So it asked again!","Who decided it would forever remain an Omniverse?","BOOM!","|Rise.|","Its voice boomed out across the Aletheian Havens and Extremity Vein.","All the countless areas of complexity it had so intricately prepared were ushered and moved at once, the connection towards Noah being focused on the most!","The connection towards a part of him that was not within these Megalos.","The connection towards the part of him within a Blancverse Domain inside the Expanse!","|Transcend.|","Commandingly.","Unquestioningly!","The Infinite Omniverse stated so as all the prepared Complexity...was to be used to directly traverse into the Expanse where Noah was!","This was what all the preparations were for.","For a single journey.","For a single jump!","The moment this journey was complete, the Infinite Omniverse would have transcended its past weavings of existence and be something else entirely once it arrived in the Blancverse Domain in the Expanse!","BOOM!","An unfathomable light wrapped around the Infinite Omniverse entirely- this construct buzzing as at this moment, within Omniverse X-999, an insignificant singularity blazed with terrifying brilliance.","A light so bright that the Omniversal Ankyra, who was currently in the midst of becoming One With Existence after his ventures across the Primalwater of the Primaltree of Existence, was shocked and blinded, barely catching a glimpse of this brilliance as an instant later, 99.999% of it disappeared.","A mere fraction was left behind within Omniverse X-999 as in part, this Omniverse that contained the Vacuous and Vitalis Domains were roots that were not abandoned!","But the entirety of the Infinite Omniverse itself had long since disappeared!","At this moment, the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse was gazing out as if it could see absolutely every grain of sand and any changes it experienced within this domain.","The whole Infinite Omniverse felt like a rapidly traversing body as it was surrounded by multicolored light, and a terrifying pressure was bearing down on it the further ahead it traveled!","But the more distance it covered, the closer it got to something grand.","To the Expanse.","And the closer it was to the Expanse, its complex weavings of Existence across its Aletheian Havens and Extremity vein began to undergo fundamental changes.","The complexity of the Infinite Omniverse began to rise above Terrestrial!","The closer it got to the Expanse, the closer it would be towards the next demarcation of complexity.","The closer it got to the Expanse, the more terrifying the pressure that was pressing down on it became!","As if the pressure was stating again and again, and with even more ferocity each time that the Infinite Omniverse should not do this.","It couldn't do this!","And yet...","|What are you to decide that?!|","The expression of the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse gained more emotion as heavy, unfathomable majesty erupted on it, livid defiance flashing on its face as it kneeled down near the multicolored throne of authorities and roared!","HUUUUM!","A deep, ancient roar of authorities.","It activated waves of countless weavings of existence of the Infinite Omniverse as instantly, the distance it covered and crossed exponentially increased as it only became faster!","—","Within the Expanse.","In an unknown region, between two golden strings, a miniaturized Blancverse Domain could be seen.","Within its depths, a golden robed young emperor with astral brilliance surging around him opened his eyes wide as he...heard a distinct roar.","A roar of endless defiance and regality.","He didn't hear it from the Infinite Omniverse, but from the depths of the Blancverse Domain that he had loosened the bindings of the most to welcome a new entrant!","For him to hear this roar...","HUUM!","His eyes turned down with a sense of ecstasy.","He looked at the center of the Blancverse Domain where a spinning white gold singularity had begun to bloom.","As if a pathway was being opened for something connected to him to arrive!","All this time, the Infinite Omniverse had calculated and planned as when it moved into action, there was only assured success!","BOOM!","The Blancverse Domain trembled","With the control and understanding that Noah had gained recently, he loosened its restrictions towards what was coming as the task of the Infinite Omniverse became even easier!"]},{"number":3355,"title":"Chapter 3355: Chapter 3354 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! II","paragraphs":["Were the Infinite Omniverse to try to reach the Expanse itself- at any random point, the difficulty would be extremely high.","But for it to reach a land in the expanse under the control of the Master?","HUUM!","With booming roars of defiance akin to an ancient steeds breaking past shackles to reach its Master, the white gold singularity exploded heavily as there, without a shadow of doubt, was a circular object glimmering with multicolored radiance.","...!","The moment it arrived, Noah felt the countless golden strings around the Blancverse Domain vibrate and radiate a terrifying light of pressure- as if it were trying to snuff out something that should not be here!","The pressure even caused Noah's existence to tremble as he looked around angrily, feeling this pressure be something that may even crush dozens of Ordinance of Existence Entities in an instant.","\"HO!\" He bellowed out while pulling on the authority of the Blancverse Domain, this domain itself trembling with a protective light as 80% of the terrifying force was mitigated!","By the time it reached the Infinite Omniverse, only a portion of it remained as it was withstood valiantly, the multicolored circular object only becoming more resplendent!","And then, the moment after the pressure was withstood, the Infinite Omniverse vibrated as it seemed to gain a sense of stability.","As it became anchored fully and without a doubt, Noah felt the surrounding Blancverse Domain vibrate- along with the innumerable golden strings all around them.","Thereafter, the pristine Higher Weavings of Existence of the Expanse began to converge towards the Infinite Omniverse- dazzling multicolored light flowing into it as it devoured everything hungrily as if it hadn't eaten anything for cycles!","The golden strings in the surroundings buzzed with ineffable glory.","Moments later, an illusory mountain of tremendous size appeared below the Blancverse- stretching out the length of over a dozen Omniverses easily.","Above, an iridescent tree bloomed as its sheer size was the same, with its ends seeming to stretch out endlessly as it gushed down multicolored radiance below!","A mountain gushing endless waves of authority below, a tree gushing down seas of authority above.","It was the appearance of the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse that had appeared when Noah first absorbed Hearthraes, but their sizes...were incredibly tens of times more!","Noah's eyes were luminous at such a reality, but also somber as this was far too showy.","His Manifestation of the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse had attracted a Nihilos Ordinance Amalgamation entity.","Such a massive change here...could draw in others as well!","His eyes shone with a dangerous light as he got the Blancverse Domain ready to leave if need be.","But at this time, dazzling prompts rose before him.","|An Unfathomable and Irreversible Causality has been achieved!|","|Crossing untold distances, the Infinite Omniverse has arrived within the Higher Weavings of Existence as its weavings are being fundamentally changed to match its surroundings.|","|It can no longer be designated as an Omniverse, its new designation being-|","\"Stop.\"","HUUUM!","A ringing sound bloomed as Noah's voice commandingly echoed out.","The prompt stopped in place as Noah gazed down at the seemingly small object being bathed by waves of dense and complex weavings of Existence, his voice extending towards it.","\"What do you wish to be? Nothing can dictate your direction and path for you!\"","...!","The Master asked.","And the Infinite Omniverse answered as shockingly...the visage of an illusory woman draped in multicolored splendor appeared in the Expanse.","Her expression was one filled with majesty and curiosity as she looked around the Expanse, and she spoke out decisively in the next moment.","||I shall no longer be the Infinite Omniverse...and shall advance to become the Infiniverse Megalos Seed!||","WAA!","A grandiose declaration was made.","A declaration of appalling power and wonder as the moment it was made, the authority gushing into the Infiniverse Megalos Seed became interminably denser.","Infiniverse!","They had seen Omniverses, they had seen a Tresorverse, and they had seen a Blancverse.","On this day, the beginnings of an Infiniverse began, its ambitions far, far too heavy.","Noah gave a light nod as moments later, the prompts resumed.","|Within the Blancverse Domain, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed has been born.|","|An intricate and unbreakable connection is being formed between the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain.|","|From the weavings of a Terrestrial Complexity of Existence, the components of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed are undergoing a metamorphosis into the weavings of a Constellation Complexity of Existence!|","...!","Appalling brilliance shone as heavy, heavy changes occurred.","But as always.","Every choice led to countless effects.","A small ripple could lead to countless confounding results.","A vast distance away from where the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain was.","An Entity was traversing across the Expanse as she was not alone, a congregation of beings following behind her and below her.","Uniquely, she radiated the aura of an Ordinance Amalgamation entity as behind her, three terrifying Ordinance Amalgamation entities followed closely, while she herself was on top of a mount that radiated the aura of an Ordinance of Existence!","A Constellation Entity...was being used as a mount as it had the form of a radiant Three-Eyed Goldflame Steed.","Regality and royalty emanated from it, and yet the woman riding on top of it seemed to be dripping with even more majesty as at this moment...","|Oh?|","Her eyes and the eyes of those around her turned towards a certain direction where the brilliance of a massive mountain and tree shone.","So bright that even from this far distance, they saw it all clearly!","The eyes of the woman lit up brightly as she laughed.","|And they said I wouldn't come across anything myself even if I traversed a whole Cycle. Hmph, let's go grasp this opportunity. If anyone else even dares to come near it- kill on sight!|","...!","Waves of terrifying power surged around these beings as they nodded, their figures shooting out towards the dazzling area in the distance!"]},{"number":3356,"title":"Chapter 3356: Chapter 3355 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! III","paragraphs":["A terrifying Three Eyed Goldflame Steed strutted across the Expanse, bringing with it a unique existence at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage who was followed behind by three Ordinance Amalgamation Entities and 10 attendants.","Attendants.","But even these Attendants were at the stage of Ordinance of Existence- their weavings brimming with power as they looked around like battle-hardened soldiers who would move to protect at any sign of trouble.","It was a terrifying force moving around the Expanse as within moments, they traversed across the golden strings and saw the phenomenon blooming out much more clearly!","|My goodness...|","The female entity couldn't help but shake her head incredulously at the sight, their figures slowing down when they were quickly able to pinpoint the source of this commotion.","The moment they did so, their eyes flashed as their gazes brimmed with excitement.","They saw that in between the massive Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse, an area of blank white that was made as small as possible could be seen!","Whoever had bound it was trying to hide it, but how could it escape from their eyes after such a commotion?","And all of these waves of Complexities were surging into this area of white- this Blancverse Domain!","|Haha, it is actually a Blancverse Domain! A Blancverse Domain! If I bring this back, what more could they ask of me?!|","The gaze of the regal woman on the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed was brilliant as she uttered such words, her eyes flashing with radiance as she was even able to observe the areas within the Blancverse.","And there.","She saw two figures surrounding a singularity of multicolored radiance- like the Manifestation of the core weaving of the Blancverse Domain that seemed to be elevating itself to another level.","|Hmph.|","She saw the figures within it as her eyes became sharp.","A terrifying purple eye opened above her as it was reflected in her actual eyes, its gaze far-reaching.","Observing the two Entities closely, she felt nothing from the woman that had an illusory body, and a level of Complexity that should be below hers from the man as he...","|Bah, an Entity at the Ordinance of Existence was actually lucky enough to bind a Blancverse Domain and even had enough weavings to miniaturize it? Very well, it is a good gift prepared for me!|","WU!","Her stance was made clear as the entities within who seemed to be discussing amongst themselves turned to also gaze towards them.","The woman held no emotions on her face, while the man...","Was able to even rouse the eyes of the entity on the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed in appreciation as his complexity of existence was a refreshing one.","It made one naturally feel goodwill and held a sort of a magnetic pull that attracted other weavings of existence, making one want to innately possess him for themselves!","The terrifying entity licked her lips towards such a man as after she had spoken...the three Ordinance Amalgamation entities behind her moved forward.","One waved their hands as the surrounding light years were instantly encased in a dome of purple brilliance- this dome doing nothing to the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse as they simply passed through it.","The central one had the figure of a human with a silver horn shining brightly on his forehead, his figure adorned in silver robes just like all others as he spoke coldly towards the entities within the Blancverse Domain.","|A Daughter of Existence graces you with her presence, and you do not come out to greet her?|","...!","A Daughter of Existence.","Sitting atop the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed, this woman had a figure that seemed to be carved from true treasures of the expanse itself.","Her dark hair shimmered with the light of stars, her fair skin vibrating with a layer of terrifying light.","Her curvaceous figure was wrapped in a simple gold dress that seemed made just for her, and she looked delicate as a flower while also shimmering with hardened brilliance that made it clear absolutely nothing could hurt her!","Her eyes were clear and tranquil as they radiated a terrifying purple light, their gaze looking over everything as if it should naturally be bowing towards her.","A Daughter of Existence.","Her Followers.","The moment they appeared, Noah felt a part of himself buzzing and shaking- deep within his existence, it was the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian Bloodline!","His eyes radiated a mighty level of power that wanted to erupt by itself, his stern will controlling his existence and communicating with the weavings of records left behind by Pyrrhus.","His obsession!","|The signature of the Complexity of Existence of one of the forces that descended onto the Megalos Mountains cycles ago to devour and extinguish Megalonians is felt within the weavings of the targets above.|","...!","The Weavings of Pyrrhus.","They would resonate whenever the enemy of this obsession arose as with the Antediluvian Leviathans, there was a level of animosity purely due to the Omnifather who had been the first domino in all this.","But the hatred felt towards the signature of these beings ahead...was immeasurably vile as they had to be descendants or direct followers of those who greedily devoured Megalonian all those cycles ago!","A Daughter of Existence.","Sensing the terrifying level of complexity around her, as well as the three Ordinance Amalgamation Entities accompanying her, Noah frowned.","He was of the Ordinance of Existence.","But he was a terrifying entity at this stage as he instinctively felt...that there was a possibility to even withstand an Ordinance Amalgamation entity with the tools at his disposal!","But it had to be tested.","Fighting against a single Ordinance Amalgamation entity would have given an outlook and allowed Noah to gauge his power, but four of them?","He shook his head as it seemed just like before when he met the massive, silver-furred spider with thousands of eyes and limbs- he may have to relocate the Blancverse Domain once more.","As for the obsession of Pyrrhus...it would be achieved in time as Noah would mark all these enemies and find them later!"]},{"number":3357,"title":"Chapter 3357: Chapter 3356 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! IV","paragraphs":["Seeing his frowning gaze and even disregard, the three Ordinance Amalgamation Attendants of the Daughter of Existence became stern as their power roiled out, causing the surrounding weavings of Existence to vibrate!","|You dare not show respect to a Daughter of Existence? Are you not aware of what she represents? Are you not aware of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse?!|","HUUM!","Each of his words were like shocking decrees as all of surrounding existence near the Blancverse Domain rapidly changed color.","Instantly, purple chains bloomed and covered everything- thousands of them covering all surrounding landscape as they only curved and did not apply their oppressive effects on the other Ordinance Amalgamation Entities and around the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed behind them!","But everything else.","All weavings outside of the Blancverse Domain were under his control.","\"The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse?\"","Noah raised his brows at such words, the obsession of Pyrrhus further buzzing as if it were telling him one of the culprits...were either within this Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, or made up this power entirely.","Seeing his nonchalant expression, the Attendant of the Daughter of Existence let out a laugh of surprise.","|You really do not know of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse? Did you just recently begin roaming the Expanse? And you even attained a Blancverse Domain?|","Such a phenomenon was rare as this had to be a person of great luck!","On the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed, the Daughter of Existence smiled as she tapped on the gold fur beneath her.","|Young Man, come out and give up ownership of this Blancverse Domain to me, and I will expand your gaze to the wonders of the Expanse. You won't even know what to truly do with it anyway. Do this, and I can even consider making you my Prime Concubine. You will enjoy resources within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse that will allow to to fearlessly amalgamate your Ordinance- and even Sever your Existence!|","...!","Her eyes were bright as she couldn't help but look at this defiant man with favor.","She didn't know why, but his very existence emanated an attractive force that made her want to put him under her!","|The Daughter of Existence, Sentara, Third of her Name, has shown you have favor. Are you still not coming out to receive it?|","The Attendant with the silver horn on his head had an ugly expression at this moment.","A Prime Concubine!","The Daughter of Existence actually favored him so much to offer him this in exchange for the Blancverse Domain!","This was something that even he could not attain as if he did, his status within the Immovable Sacred Palace would be cemented for cycles to come.","The status of the Daughters and Sons of Existence were that high!","Yet this buffoon before him didn't even seem to know favor from calamity as he shook his head.","\"I do not need to be a Concubine, and I think I will keep this little Blancverse to myself.\"","...!","|You...!| The Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation Attendant turned furious.","But Noah waved his hands dismissively towards these beings as he waited for the transformation of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed to finish, and then-","||Master.||","HUUM!","Beside him, the Manifestation of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed stepped forward, her illusory form pulsing with multicolored radiance as ever so slowly, it began to become very, very real.","The curves of the figure became distinguished.","Multicolored strands of hair formed from terrifying authorities cascaded past her shoulders.","Fair skin that shone with a bronze golden luster formed, and eyes filled with endless light of trillions of singularities came to being!","A multicolored robe pulsing with shocking authority draped over her as she looked like an ancient queen gracing the common lands with her presence, her bright eyes illuminating everything!","She didn't seem like a Manifestation any longer- she seemed unfathomably genuine.","||I wish to try something, Master.||","...!","Noah gazed towards the Manifestation- nay, could it still be called a Manifestation?","\"This is?\"","He asked with bright eyes as the reply came while this dazzling visage of a woman raised her scintillating hand up, seeing the trillions of layers of reinforced authority underneath.","||My Infiniverse Megalos Body. With it, I wish to test some things.||","Authority crackled around her madly.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body!","Noah looked at this wonder with bright eyes as prompts flashed over his eyes.","|The limitations and bindings of the past are being rewritten.|","|The potential and possibilities of the complexity of existence of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and what weavings it can accomplish are unknown and endless.|","Such prompts flashed within Noah's mind as he gave a nod of dazed affirmation, and in the next moment...","PA!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body took a single step and instantly appeared outside the Blancverse.","Outside!","Any Ordinance Amalgamation or Ordinance of Existence Entity did not need to personally use their bodies to attack their enemies.","Some could attack the distance of an Omniverse away, and terrifying Ordinance Amalgamation entities could fight and exert their Ordinance the distance of multiple Omniverses!","By all means, the Infiniverse Megalos Body had no need or reason to appear outside of the protection of the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain.","And Noah knew she was far from being stupid with its calculations.","So he didn't call her back or doubt her, only watching with a sense of amazement as the moment she arrived outside the Blancverse, she was faced with the terrifying altered existence filled with layers of purple chains!","All of the surrounding Existence- under the banner and control of the Silver Honed Ordinance Amalgamation expert.","Yet when she arrived, her body shimmered with a seemingly appalling radiance- a radiance of weight.","Of Mass.","Of Tonnage!","Her body seemed to carry ancient and unbearable weight that tyrannically pressed down over everything at this moment!","The dense purple chains in the region she appeared...vibrated and quaked before they were actually shattered an instant later- leaving behind a gold region of golden strings of the Expanse once more.","...!","|...!|","The eyes of the Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation Entity opened wide with incredulity!"]},{"number":3358,"title":"Chapter 3358: Chapter 3357 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! V","paragraphs":["Incredulity.","Such an emotion flashed past the eyes of the Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation entity as it knew its power well.","Currently, its Ordinance of Dignity was covering this whole region as for him, it was akin to an extension of his body.","As if this whole region was now a part of him.","And Dignity could be expressed thoroughly and absolutely in this space!","For it to be denied, an equally imposing authority had to be laid down as even then, the two Ordinances would fight for supremacy.","The better and more unique Ordinance would win.","The more complex Ordinance would triumph!","As someone who did not only express his Ordinance, but also amalgamated with it entirely through his existence- denying him was that much harder.","Another Ordinance Amalgamation entity would have to be more complex than him by a factor of two or more to be able to even deny it!","This was the truth.","And yet...","Without using an Ordinance.","Without any superfluous means.","This woman shimmering with multicolored radiance actually denied and broke his Ordinance by what seemed like sheer mass of complexity alone!","|Mass? Your Amalgamated Ordinance is mas-|","HUUM!","The Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation Entity had begun to speak with an ugly expression, but the Infiniverse Megalos Body paid him no heed as she moved towards him.","With every step she took, the dazzling purple chains laid out shattered and disappeared- her figure looking like a runaway train that could not be stopped no matter what as in an instant, she arrived before her enemy!","Such an action caused alarm to rise on all those here as hastily, the Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation Entity waved his hands as his figure became encased in a crystalline purple exoskeleton of dignity- unbreakable in nature.","Above him, a banner of purple Dignity unfurled as it burned with endless majesty, and behind him, the outline of a grand celestial palace began to form imposingly!","With all of this unfolding, a terrifying feeling of undeniable royalty flowed out as the Daughter of Existence in the back, along with her other Attendants, nodded and breathed easily once more.","Yes.","This was how their might should be.","In front of this endless grandeur of Dignity, all enemies would find the complexity of their existence to not be enough as their Ordinance would gain a feeling of inferiority until it was ultimately suppressed!","Yet in the next moment.","The dazzling figure of the Infiniverse Megalos Body balled her hands into fists before she swung them down like hammers.","BOOM!","Appallingly, the radiant exoskeleton and forming Manifestation of a scared palace instantly shattered, the fists of the Infiniverse Megalos Body shattering the swirling Dignity around her enemy as her hands actually smashed on top of the head and caved it in!","Purple gold blood gushed out from the eyes and nose of this regal Ordinance Amalgamation Entity, his eyes fully bulging out of their sockets from the blow!","The expression of the Infiniverse Megalos Body was cold as her right leg was flung out right after, going up towards the groin mercilessly as any shred of complexity was destroyed by sheer mass alone, a horrific sound booming out as her leg deformed the groin to the extent that her leg extended all the way to his stomach.","...!","Unbearable, unfathomable waves of pain echoed out within the bulging eyes of the Silver Horned Ordinance Amalgamation Entity, his existence feeling as if the heaviest thing in its whole life had knocked into it as at this moment- he couldn't even retaliate.","All of his complexity felt dazed and denied entirely, his Dignity utterly shredded as it couldn't find itself rising again from the sheer tonnage pressing down!","And in such a state...","WUU!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body raised her hand up and chopped down as if she was a sharp sword, purple gold blood bursting in abundance in the next moment as like a jagged blade, the unfathomable complexity of her sheer weight alone tore the body of an Ordinance Amalgamation entity top to bottom.","It wasn't just the tearing of the body.","It was also the decimation and tearing of the weavings of Existence of this entity fully as in the next moment, no manifestations of purple chains remained active anymore.","Only the golden strings of the Expanse surrounding a small Blancverse remained, along with the bloody and wild figure of the Infiniverse Megalos Body fully tore in half an Ordinance Amalgamation entity, their deep and dense weavings of existence being turned dim as she grabbed the halves of his body and flung them towards the Blancverse Domain.","Her figure then vibrated as purple gold blood and pieces of organs drifted off her body, her cold eyes staring ahead towards the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed, the one atop it, and those around it who looked towards her with rage and small traces of fear!","This was because they just watched an Ordinance Amalgamation expert be literally ripped apart in seconds.","What kind of monster was this?","What-","BOOM!","Her figure was relentless as it flung itself forward, being even faster with no laid out Ordinances around as she actually reached the front of the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed in an instant, this horse jumping back in fright as the figures of the other two Ordinance Amalgamation Entities appeared in front of it while crying out.","|Protect the Daughter of Existence!|","|You dare to do this?! Understand that behind us, there is the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!|","Two shouts.","All with self-explanatory purpose, but there was a sense of fear in each shout!","After all, they had just observed their colleague literally be ripped apart.","Their bodies had begun to erupt with signature complexities of Dignity, a massive palace beginning to manifest behind each of them when...","PANG!","The hands of the Infiniverse Megalos Body swung left and right like hammers, smashing into their bodies and shockingly causing their emerging Ordinances to forcefully retreat in their bodies, and the head of the Infiniverse Megalos Body flung itself forward to smash into the Three Eyed Goldflame Steed that the Daughter of Existence sat on!","BOOM!"]},{"number":3359,"title":"Chapter 3359: Chapter 3358 Infiniverse Megalos Seed! VI","paragraphs":["The two Ordinance Amalgamation Entities to the left and right had their Ordinances suppressed and flung away, one being smashed on the chest as he heaved, while the other had their head fully twisted with a huge dent.","They were Ordinance Amalgamation entities.","The Three Eyed Goldflame Steed...was merely of the Ordinance of Existence.","It faced the terrifying complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Body head on- literally, as when the head of the Infiniverse Megalos Body smashed into its own head, the appalling scene of the horse-like head being pulverized into a cloud of golden blood emerged.","Up to the long neck, everything was turned into a cloud of blood.","A terrifying power and complexity seemed to be carried along with this strike as the brightness of any Ordinance and life of the now headless Three Eyed Goldflame Steed dimmed greatly, its weavings entirely shutting down!","Such a scene...now caused waves of rising horror.","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed moved rapidly and savagely.","She seemed like a celestial child of the wilderness who tore everything with brute force, her body flinging her arms and legs as their force alone tore everything apart!","The Three Eyed Goldflame Steed dead, the Daughter of Existence atop it was utterly livid and filled with trepidation.","At this moment, the angered Daughter of Existence finally moved from her dead steed and appeared right before the Infiniverse Megalos Body, her hands rising up as behind her, the manifestation of a purple mountain the size of half an Omniverse already appeared.","It supported her small figure as she exploded with terrifying strength, her hands swinging like hammers and with tremendous speed to smash onto the head of the Infiniverse Megalos Body as she wanted to overpower just like it- give it a taste of its own medicine!","...!","BOOOM!","The strike and force was heavy, and yet...","The radiant head of the Infiniverse Megalos Body was only forced to turn sideways slightly.","Her hands reached out to grasp both arms that had swung down on her face- slight redness on her cheeks slowly fading away as she came to stare at the Daughter of Existence coldly- horror rising on the face of this woman.","When she stuck down, she didn't even feel like she had hit a living, complex being! What was this?","What was this?!","RIIP!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body savagely pulled down the arms it held, muscle and bone tearing apart as all of these physical actions carried heavy implications of the weavings of existence.","It was like the very complexity of existence of the Daughter of Existence was being denied and ripped apart, her arms actually becoming torn from her shoulders as golden blood overflowed!","The hands of the Infiniverse Megalos Body then swung towards the neck of the Daughter of Existence like scissors as...","SNIP!","The head was cleaved clean off.","The gorgeous head of the Daughter of Existence that was filled with appalling horror.","It wasn't just her head, but it felt like all of her existence was being cleaved off by the terrifying complexity the Infiniverse Megalos Body possessed!","The shadow of death came for the Daughter of Existence.","|No...!|","The two flung-back Ordinance Amalgamation entities cried out in shock and horror as their Ordinances whipped out again from afar, but it seemed like everything was all done!","At such a moment.","HUUM!","A unique power rose within the headless body of the Daughter of Existence- bursting with a terrifying radiance that shockingly emitted a Severing light that struck out towards the source of the deathly damage dealt to the Daughter of Existence.","BOOM!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body was flung back like a ragdoll, only coming to a stop a distance away as her hair whipped around her head maddeningly.","A huge gash split open her body top to bottom as if it was seeking to bisect her, but her body was shockingly far too sturdy!","In the gash that was rapidly healing, one could only see multicolored astral radiance within- not any blood or organs.","As she healed, she looked ahead to observe the scene of the bisected head of the Daughter of Existence going back towards her neck along with her ripped hands- her dying existence instantly returning to its previous state due to a shocking power!","A power that wasn't hers.","Likely a safeguard placed on her by her people!","In an instant, she was healed and back to her prime as she had a savage look on her face, her eyes and intent betraying her fear as her two remaining Ordinance Amalgamation Attendants appeared beside her.","|Escape!|","...!","Escape.","They could do nothing else as their enemy was too dominating!","Behind them, the Ordinance of Existence attendants scrambled away rapidly as all of them turned into streaks of light.","HUUM!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body had finished healing as her gaze was unfathomably cold.","She raised her hand and formed a fist.","Instantly, for the distance equivalent to three Omniverses, a sandy gold domain emerged rapidly.","Its sands were filled with the authority of the Ordinance of Dreams, and it wrapped around everything while making it clear that nobody would leave!","The hearts of these terrifyingly powerful Ordinance Amalgamation Entities began to fill with terror as at this moment, they began to burn their existence, going all out!","But the Infiniverse Megalos Body was relentless.","With the emerging sandy gold domain, she finally stayed still as her body...began to shimmer with the grandeur of Ordinances.","Plural.","Instantly, a violet purple light flashed in her eyes as dazzling flames of Entropy burned around her.","In the far distance, sandy gold waves surging around the two Ordinance Amalgamation Attendants instantly changed to become filled with heavy Entropy- its imposition causing their own Ordinances to tremble as the Complexity of their existence slowly began to erode!","And an instant later, in addition to the light of entropy, a blazing white banner of Genesis flashed above the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","Instantly, above the fleeing figure of the Daughter of Existence, a sharp white sword manifested and cleaved down as if it sought to return everything to its initial, basal state!"]},{"number":3360,"title":"Chapter 3360: Chapter 3359 Savage! I","paragraphs":["An Ordinance could strike out an equivalent distance of an Omniverse or even more depending on the level of complexity.","At this moment, the Infiniverse Megalos Body was targeting the Daughter of Existence light years away who was seeking to escape!","BOOM!","The white sword of Genesis transformed from the golden sand all around and struck down above the Daughter of Existence, her expression maddened as she continued rushing out.","The moment the white sword reached her...","BZZT!","The invisible but terrifying power that had reversed her very death seemed to still be present as it Severed away the descending Genesis- the whole nearby region of a single light year having the sandy gold domain also dispersed as the Daughter of Existence continued to run.","But it was like running in an endless region of dreams as the Infiniverse Megalos Body knew that she wouldn't be able to escape!","And the authority protecting her...it would run out soon enough.","So in the meantime...","Her gaze turned towards the two Ordinance Amalgamation Attendants, as well as the remaining Ordinance of Existence Attendants.","While scrambling away, their skin felt an undeniable chill of death as they didn't even turn around, each step they took traversing light years as all around them, only golden sand blazed around!","Each one shot towards another direction to increase their chances of survival, and when the Infiniverse Megalos Body saw this, her eyes became even colder as another Ordinance bloomed around her.","The Ordinance of Cloning blazed around her as instantly, ten Versions of her appeared.","...!","All the attendants felt a chill as their observation still saw what was happening behind them.","What occurred next was simply a sequence of catastrophes.","WAP!","All the clones of the Infiniverse Megalos Body dispersed and melded with the golden sand nearby, and in the next instant, they crossed vast distances to appear above or in front of the Attendants- their bodies reforming from the golden sands themselves!","...!","Above one of the Ordinance Amalgamation Attendants.","His white hair fluttered in his head as he was aged, and yet his unfathomably deep complexity of existence made him seem like he was in his prime.","Amalgamation.","Reaching such a stage was truly difficult as any wrong step, and they would have their very existence collapse!","Such complexity was truly hard to overcome.","But the Infiniverse Megalos Body seemed to defy all of these truths, her sheer complexity of existence bulldozing everything.","One had to understand just what type of Existence she was right now to be able to grasp why she could thrash the Ordinance Amalgamation Entities here.","The representative of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Her scale was something that these beings couldn't even fathom as when she appeared above them, they only felt terror as their existence howled out in defiance!","|OOH!|","The Existence Amalgamation Attendant bellowed upwards a purple banner of an Ordinance sought to bloom above him, but the Infiniverse Megalos Body came with its legs swinging down as if it were giving a beat down.","BOOM!","The forming banner dispersed before it could even be formed.","This man wasn't even able to bring out his complexity as the legs of the Infiniverse Megalos Body felt like hundreds of Megalos Mountains smashing unto him, the pressure causing his existence to buzz as golden blood leaked out from all orifices!","In his daze, the Infiniverse Megalos Body slapped down, her palm lightly landing on his body.","Lightly.","And yet, as if tremendous tonnage was applied internally, the weavings of the existence of this Ordinance Amalgamation entity became scrambled entirely- the light of his existence dimming as if something far too heavy extinguished it!","His body went limp moments later.","Another Ordinance Amalgamation Entity, dead.","Simultaneously, in another direction, another clone of the Infiniverse Megalos Body had appeared above the third Ordinance Amalgamation Attendant, her body clad in the Ordinance of Helios as her skin and everything about her turned clad into fiery golden flames!","The whole temperature within that area turned to an unbearable octave as the Infiniverse Megalos Body burning with Helios swung her hand down- a stanchion of golden flames smashing down as the Ordinance Amalgamation Attendant roared out and sought to use his complexity to fight it, but...","Any roars stopped seconds later as the golden stanchion of flames disappeared.","It all happened simultaneously.","In other directions where the 9 escaping Ordinance of Existence Attendants were fleeing to, bodies of the Infiniverse Megalos Body had appeared there as well.","These Entities died in even less time than those more powerful than them as in a matter of seconds, only their bodies remained.","And the golden sand formed into tendrils that wrapped around their lifeless bodies as they were speedily flung towards the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain.","Of the party that had been attracted by the appearance of a dazzling tree and mountain in this region, only a single one now remained.","SAA!","As if she was surfing across the sandy gold waves of dreams, the Infiniverse Megalos Body appeared right in front of the path of the Daughter of Existence.","|...!|","Moments later, her clones also appeared around her, each one coldly staring at the Daughter of Existence before their bodies turned into golden lights that merged with the singular figure.","Soon, only one Infiniverse Megalos Body was present as she looked at the Daughter of Existence who was surrounded by a terrifying light of existence that was gradually fading away.","Towards such a being, the eyes of the Infiniverse Megalos Body were filled with calculating light that observed the rate the unique power was fading around her as her intent echoed out.","||You will not live.||","...!","A few words.","But they were akin to a decree.","As if the Infiniverse Megalos Body was stating the most common fact!","As if she had decided that at this moment, the life of this Daughter of Existence was severed!","|...|","The Daughter of Existence glared hatefully towards this terrifying existence.","Hatred and fear permeated her every pore as she looked ahead, but she didn't plead!"]},{"number":3361,"title":"Chapter 3361: Chapter 3360 Savage! II","paragraphs":["She didn't voice out that she came from the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse again.","She didn't voice out regarding her status as a Daughter of Existence, nor that she should refrain from killing her due to it. She could see that this...thing did not care at all.","Even if she was the next Successor of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, this creature wouldn't care- she would kill regardless!","The Daughter of Existence realized this as in this moment of sheer terror for her life, she actually laughed.","|I hope my death makes things very, very difficult for a monster like you. For the possibility that you will feel what I feel now.|","...!","The fear of death could not be entirely erased in her voice as she spoke out, the power protecting her continuing to fade away as she saw the Infiniverse Megalos Body come closer and closer- her voice devoid of any emotion!","They were warned while growing up within the Megalos Seas of their homes.","That the Expanse was vast and filled with countless unknown wonders and terrors.","They came hand in hand as the biggest thing they had to be careful of...was to not come across a creature that could extinguish their Existence!","She was even given a Protection Charm from an Existence Severing Entity, and yet...nothing could be changed.","|I truly hope for it, you monster!|","She spat out spitefully as the last shred of protection around her faded, and the Infiniverse Megalos Body moved instantly- her figure akin to a released arrow as her hand pierced the chest of the Daughter of Existence savagely!","A multicolored beating heart was held in her hands that punctured through the back of the Daughter of Existence whose weavings were entirely oppressed and extinguished, her body slumping forward as her lifeless head even landed on the shoulders of the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","|...|","As if something dirty had landed on her, sandy gold tendrils grabbed the corpse of the Daughter of Existence and pulled it towards the Blancverse Domain, her own figure warping and appearing within the domain with a multicolored heart in hand!","Her body buzzed with savagery as she looked towards her Master, who gazed towards her with a sense of fascination and incredulity, her voice echoing out.","||The test is half completed, Master.||","...!","She didn't ask for any praise, and she even stated that what she wanted to try was only halfway completed!","Just what more frightening things did she wish to do?","Her gaze went towards the corpses of Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence entities, the latest one of the Daughter of Existence arriving as she looked at all of them and gathered them together before her.","||Their Sources of Existence are more inclined towards Matter, with their Systems of Existence being nothing significantly different. Their complexity of existence still remains even after their weavings of who they are were extinguished...||","Bloodied and beaten, the corpses of Ordinance Amalgamation entities glowed with a dim radiance of complexity as if to show just what terrifying state they had reached even in death.","The ones at the Ordinance of Existence stage glowed just a little less brighter as after they were lined up, the Infiniverse Megalos Body swung her hand down commandingly!","|Existence Derivation of the Megalos has been utilized by the Infiniverse Megalos Body.|","With a wave of her hand, her entire body became covered with the incandescent gold light of loot, the corpses in front of her becoming cut up and broken down as they became bathed with a golden light that compressed everything about them!","From their bodies filled with heavy complexity, a unique authority altered everything as they were broken down and compressed- golden singularities being made from their bodies as they emanated a heart shaking allure when one stared at them.","Not just this, but behind the broken down corpses, golden light emerged to form the outline and framework of illusory figures of these beings- their arms and legs in fetal positions with their eyes closed!","|The Complexity of Existence of the selected targets has been broken down into 36 Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities and 90 Ordinance Hearthraes Singularities, with the remaining weavings of their existence utilized to induce the formation of the Blanc Illusory Weavings of Existence.|","...!","|The Complexity of the Blanc Illusory Weavings of Existence can be filled and nurtured by any Ordinance, and once a critical amount of complexity has been infused, they will become Illusory Weavings of Existence specialized towards a certain Ordinance of Existence.|","The Infiniverse Megalos Body said she wanted to try something.","But she was truly going above and beyond as her transformation into a Constellation Complexity was something that had far exceeded anything imagined!","With a wave of her hands, only dazzling golden circular gems floated where the bodies of the Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence entities used to be.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body grasped a golden Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity in her hands as behind her, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself continued to radiate a shocking light of complexity as it devoured the deluge of authority all around the Expanse.","Its advancement was a heavy one.","An unfathomable one!","And there was something even more astounding.","Effectively, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed was now in the Expanse.","But it was not alone.","Within, there were countless quintillions of entities who were now inadvertently exposed to the Higher Weavings of Existence, with the levels of atmospheric authority they could take in their bodies being something that others couldn't even imagine!","For those whose complexity was intricate enough, how little time would they need for them to entirely transcend the weavings of their Existence and be able to freely step out of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and into the Expanse?","||There are many changes to grasp and understand with the entry into the Expanse, but my gifts to Master will start with this- if that girl can also come out and increase the number.||","The Infiniverse Megalos Body waved her hands as all the Hearthraes Singularities floated towards Noah, and she called out for a girl to come out and increase the number.","A girl.","Naturally, who else could it be other than Ruination who was able to arrive in the Expanse within Noah's weavings of existence even faster than the Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself?!"]},{"number":3362,"title":"Chapter 3362: Chapter 3361 Dominoes I","paragraphs":["Inexplicably linked and bound to the Omniversal Archontes Engineer- to the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","Ruination!","A unique complexity tracing its origins to Noah's earliest beginnings.","Someone who had provided a spark that made many things possible today. Noah smiled when he heard the way that the Infiniverse Megalos Seed referred to Ruination as that girl, noting the unique relationship these two had over the months.","A second later, a light glimmered around Noah as from him, a streak of crimson gold radiance came out to form into the body of none other than Ruination.","Currently, radiant crimson hair flowed down her shoulders as her skin shone with a tan bronze hue.","A gold dress flowed down her body as on her ears, she had crescent earrings that looked eerily close to her old form as a weapon!","She appeared in the Blancverse- in the Higher Weavings of Existence that was the Expanse, and there was no sense of rejection.","As if she was a Constellation Complexity Existence who naturally belonged here!","And of course, being with Noah's Forge that was hidden in the depths of his existence meant that when Noah transcended his Existence, so did she.","But her change was gradual.","Influenced by the one she was inside the weavings of!","Until at this moment, she came out in a grander form than ever before as she was in her prime.","She gazed towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body and nodded towards it gently, her gaze then focusing elsewhere. Always within Noah's weavings, her body currently carried a shocking sense of complexity as she stared at the wonders of loot around her.","And she then waved her hands towards an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity as its details rose up for her and Noah!","[Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity]:: A Singularity containing part of the complexity of the collapsed weavings of existence of an Ordinance Amalgamation Entity. Devouring this Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity allows one to increase their own complexity- easing the path across the three demarcations of the complexity of Constellations. If taken and assimilated by those who have yet to step into the Complexity of a Constellation, these singularities are capable of inducing change forcefully for a sufficient amount.","The round gold gems pulsing with heart shaking pressure were of tremendous value, and Ruination grasped one before she turned towards Noah as if she was asking for permission!","And Noah nodded with a smile as around Ruination, dazzling crimson gold light bloomed.","A grandiose capability born within Ruination after she attained higher weavings of existence was utilized for the first time.","[The Feature of Randomized Existence Proliferation has been activated.]","|Randomized Existence Proliferation has been utilized on an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","Brilliant crimson gold light bathed the golden gem. But...","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was unsuccessful, resulting in the collapse of the Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","...!","The unfathomably bright gold gem instantly lost its luster as moments later, it turned to ash!","A distance away, the Infiniverse Megalos Body raised her brows questioningly towards Ruination.","There were only 36 of them, and one had already perished.","Randomized Existential Proliferation.","Just what mysteries did it hold?","It wasn't a set multiplier.","Not by a factor of 2, 4, or even 10!","It was Randomized.","This was one of the terrifying gifts that Ruination currently held as even after failing the first time, her gaze didn't change as she moved to the next one.","|Randomized Existence Proliferation has been utilized on an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","The crimson gold light flashed once more.","This time, it did not turn dim!","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was successful, a factor of 10 being triggered and resulting in the emergence of 10 Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities.]","...!","An incandescent gold gem filled with heavy complexity instantly had 9 others appear beside it.","9 more!","It was a terrifying result that caused Noah's eyes to shine, while Ruination raised her head as her crimson hair fluttered brilliantly, gazing calmly towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body that remained calm while watching everything- looking like an unfettered celestial queen!","Thereafter, another wave of crimson gold radiance ensued as truly, results were not guaranteed.","|Randomized Existence Proliferation has been utilized on an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was unsuccessful, resulting in the collapse of the Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","The third Randomized Existence Proliferation was unsuccessful as the complexity of this terrifying ability seemed to have a high chance of failure, but Ruination utilized it regardless because when there was success, the results could potentially be maddening.","But...","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was unsuccessful, resulting in the collapse of the Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.]","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was unsuccessful...]","The third, fourth, and fifth tries all ended with the bright golden gems collapsing, with only 31 left among the 36 original ones that Randomized Existence Proliferation could still be used on!","Noah watched on calmly as he didn't feel any pain from these three failures, and in the next instant, his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence trembled as it was faced with the emergence of a vast crimson gold sea of loot after another Randomized Existence Proliferation was utilized.","[Randomized Existence Proliferation was successful, a factor of 1,000 being triggered and resulting in the emergence of 1,000 Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities.]","HUUM!","The surroundings of the Blancverse vibrated as instantly, hundreds of extremely heavy and complex Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities appeared! Hundreds!","To obtain them naturally, over a hundred Ordinance Amalgamation entities had to collapse.","And yet...","\"Hmm...\" Noah hummed happily at the results as under the allure of golden brilliance, he noticed the faint smile of achievement on Ruination that quickly faded as she returned to her seriousness, ignoring the flood of golden gems of complexity that emerged behind her as she simply reached out for the other Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities!","Such a shocking weaving unfolded as, at the same time, an Infiniverse Megalos Seed continued to bathe in the Higher Weavings of Existence, subtle changes beginning to unfold in the expanse.","Subtle changes.","Cause and effect.","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed came into the Expanse as its entry caused the appearance of the shocking phenomenon that drew in the gazes of a Daughter of Existence and her Attendants.","A conflict ensued due to greed- due to wanting something that wasn't theirs to begin with!"]},{"number":3363,"title":"Chapter 3363: Chapter 3362 Dominoes II","paragraphs":["But who would come across a Blancverse and observe that a mere Ordinance of Existence entity found it, and simply just wave goodbye and bid them good will?","Thus, causality continued to distort.","Terrifying power bloomed from the Infiniverse Megalos Body as the Daughter of Existence was wiped out along with her people!","One domino after another fell.","And after the latest domino fell, its reverberations stretched out really far.","Within the Expanse.","An extremely far, far distance compared to where a certain Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain was.","The countless golden strings of the Expanse flowed in complex manners, giving off a sensation of endlessness as they stretched out all around.","And yet in a certain region, these golden strings twisted and made way for a circular white domain the size of over a dozen Omniverses.","It was a Blancverse Domain.","It stood serenely and caused the golden strings to part ways for it, a white light covering it up entirely as what was within could not even be observed!","Behind this Blancverse Domain though, one could see an even more unique phenomenon that seemed to be overlayed with the Expanse itself- the appearance of a dazzling body of water that stretched out far too many light years.","Dazzling blue as if every drop was made from astral brilliance.","A Sea.","A Megalos Sea!","It radiated a shocking splendor of power while it stood behind the Blancverse Domain.","Within the depths of such a sea, blue waters filled with sparkling golden radiance flowed.","Inside its depths, in a small area where the sea tapered off its blue radiance and became more gold in color, the body of a massive creature slumbered.","HUUM!","At certain intervals, it seemed to be rhythmically breathing as its golden scales absorbed tendrils of complexity all around, shining ever so brighter with every passing second!","The massive body of water was all around him, and yet an invisible field seemed to exist around this massive body for miles that isolated even a single drop of water from touching it.","It seemed as if this being existed in their own weavings.","As if they were cut off and severed entirely from being affected by surrounding weavings of existence!","Existence Severing!","Such a being was slumbering within the depths of a Megalos Sea next to a Blancverse as in the next moment...","|Palace Master! Palace Master! Sentara...her Life Scale! Her Life Scale!|","A hurried voice filled with pain came out as a woman with a face filled with shocking beauty appeared- this face currently filled with pain that very few could emulate.","The pain of a mother losing something closest to them.","The woman looked towards the golden scaled entity that was isolated from the surrounding weavings of Existence, seeming frantic and hurt at the same time as golden tears fell around her.","|I know.|","WUU!","A deep voice carrying heavy brilliance boomed out before it continued.","|I just felt the power I left within her fade away. She is gone.|","The voice stated everything as if it were a matter of fact.","As if it was simply how things were!","The woman had a frantic expression as she ground her teeth while voicing out with Great pain.","|She is gone? She is gone?! Why do you speak of her as if she was nothing? That was your daughter too! That was your...|","...!","Astral crimson gold tears fell down on the woman as her weavings of Ordinance Amalgamation trembled.","Before her, the massive golden scaled entity sighed as a bright light shone, a human figure appearing that looked towards the grieving woman with a calm gaze.","|She could not yet escape the confines of Existence, and Existence ground her down before she could manage to escape. Of course, I care. But there is nothing that can be done. In a moment here, I will know her cause of death as thereafter, I will do what I can to allow her to rest.|","...!","His words carried age and power as if nothing could shake him.","His wisdom felt unfathomable as seeing his expression, the woman felt aggrieved as she shook her head.","|I told her. I told her she didn't need to prove herself. So what of the other Daughters and Sons of Existence? The Expanse is cruel! The Expanse does not care about a mere Ordinance Amalgamation Entity! And now...ah!|","The surrounding weavings of existence half as her manic state, and yet when her tendrils of power lashed out nearby, they broke into nothingness the moment they got near the Existence Severing Entity.","His gold hair flowed serenely as his bronze skin shone with light, his expression placid as his eyes flickered with brilliance at this moment, gazing to the left as there- illusory weavings began to manifest.","They showed the image when the power of Existence Severing was first triggered within the Daughter of Existence.","The illusory weavings showed the image of their daughter with her head cleanly sliced off, the scene causing the woman beside the Existence Severing entity to turn ashen as thereafter- the existence of their daughter reversed entirely.","And the culprit behind all of this showed herself!","The figure of a woman She was covered with hazy multicolored radiance as one couldn't truly see her face.","Looking at her, the Existence Severing Palace Master spoke succinctly.","|She is capable enough to veil her weavings, and the emergence of my residual power did not kill her. There are no other signatures of existence involved as she acted alone. Her alignment...should be that of Matter, but she does not fit the weavings of any other power. If we seek to right this wrong, I would have to set off myself...|","...!","His words only caused the expression of the Concubine beside him to become hysterical as she screeched out.","|Set off! Set off! Right this wrong for our daughter!|","She wanted an avenue to release her hate.","But there seemed to be something holding the Existence Severing entity back as he sighed.","|What was it that even caused this conflict...|","As he sighed, he panned around the illusory weavings where his authority had erupted.","And thereafter, his calm eyes opened wide.","Because he saw the glimmer of a white space that isolated the strings of the Expanse itself!"]},{"number":3364,"title":"Chapter 3364: Chapter 3363 Dominoes III","paragraphs":["|A Blancverse...|","The eyes of the golden haired Existence Severing Entity gained a dim luster as he found out the source of what causes events to unfold the way they did.","He could see the Blancverse and nothing else as seeing his pause, the Concubine beside him gained a sense of fervor and hope for retribution.","|Will you avenge our daughter now? You can obtain a Blancverse alongside vengeance!|","...!","She wanted to set off right away. She wanted murder to be met with justice!","But...the man in front of her shook his head even as he continued to stare at the last illusory weavings his authority was privy to.","|Haste and unknown have led to the Calamities of even Existence Severing entities. If not careful, it matters not how talented or how powerful one is- they can always fall. It would do you good to remember this. Palace Master Bizmo, at the Existence Severing stage, perished half a cycle ago with nobody knowing why. The twin Sons of Existence under Palace Master Naku who were getting ready to sever their Existence perished to the forces of the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse not too long ago. The Megalonians of cycles ago...over a hundred Existence Severing entities and countless others below them- dead. The blood of Megalonians even acted as the fuel for me to Sever my Existence, but where are they now? What vengeance and retribution can they seek now? If not careful, we may all end up in similar situations!|","WAA!","The face of the Concubine became ashen.","She breathed out slowly and kneeled down, even going as far as to have her dress fall off her body as she bowed her head down.","|Forgive me for my weaknesses, Palace Master. I merely seek retribution, however you choose to bring it.|","She gave herself completely as looking at her, the Palace Master couldn't help but sigh.","|Get up. I will consult with the other Palace Masters to send out an Immovable Sacred Legion being led by someone just slightly off Existence Severing. In this cycle and the cycles to come, you will find that very few Existence Severing Entities and those Pioneers above are roving about the Expanse anymore. Too many perilous things are unfolding as even Existence Severing entities can fall.|","...!","The face of the Existence Severing Palace Master was grim and filled with somberness as he spoke- his surroundings feeling separated from him and cut off entirely!","|We know that a great change is coming. A change that nobody can escape as alongside it is great peril- especially for those with tremendous complexity. Thus, many of us choose to lie low. Unless absolutely necessary, we won't move. But the Expanse always has a way of pulling us out. The death of a daughter. The appearance of another Blancverse Domain. Anything and anything can arise from the Expanse and enact a pull as its countless strings remain ever so abstruse. So no, I will not personally move, but I will oversee the deployment of those who can bring back that Blancverse while avenging Sentara, okay?|","His expression softened in the end as he looked at this Concubine of his.","The gorgeous woman nodded as she wiped away her tears, her gaze burning with a vengeance as she thought of her late daughter!","—","Within a certain Blancverse Domain.","The illusions of a massive tree and mountain gradually began to fade after a significant time passed, unknown volumes of authority having been funneled into an Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","At this moment, the multicolored globe swirled slowly while radiating silent waves of complexity.","Outside of it, Noah's eyes were bright as he stared at a few 3,233 Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities and over ten thousand Ordinance Hearthraes Singularities!","3,233 from the initial 36 Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities.","Over ten thousand Ordinance Hearthraes Singularities from 90!","This was the result of Ruination utilizing Randomized Existence Proliferation, with the highest randomized multiplier being 1,000 that was only triggered once for an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity.","Apart from the failures that led to the collapse of loot, other multipliers weren't as exaggerated, but the results were astounding regardless.","For the Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities, it was akin to the initial ones being multiplied by a factor of 100- and just relatively higher for the Ordinance Hearthraes Singularities.","After completing such a task, Ruination only nodded towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body before she disappeared into Noah's body once more- undoubtedly to continue whatever terrifying project she was working on in his Infinite Forge!","Noah grasped an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity in his hands as its brilliant light began to be absorbed by him, and he could very clearly sense the observable advancement of his complexity of existence that was evenly spread out across all Ordinances.","The weavings of a Constellation were extremely deep.","Noah was merely a Minor Constellation Entity as he hadn't even become a Greater Constellation nor Elder Constellation who would have entirely exceeded even Existence Severing.","His complexity was still far, far too long.","And to reach the distinction of a Greater Constellation, one such path was to undergo Ordinance Amalgamation.","This...he was in no way ready for due to his obscene number of Ordinances and the fact that this junction represented a time when the unfavorable result of a collapse of existence was a possible reality.","He couldn't jump on this path just yet as there were too many unknowns.","But there was no harm whatsoever in increasing his complexity as is- where he expected that even as a Minor Constellation, he could raise his Complexity to exceed even the common Greater Constellations who had undergone Amalgamation!","They raised their complexity through a single Ordinance and amalgamated with it.","He...had to raise the complexity of over a hundred Ordinances.","Make each one just as complex.","It was over 100 times more difficult.","He would require over a hundred times as many resources!","So these Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities and Ordinance Hearthraes Singularities were many after the Randomized Existence Proliferation, but they would be just enough to feed Noah who was akin to an inexhaustible black hole.","And even then, it would only be a fraction of what he needed for his Complexity!"]},{"number":3365,"title":"Chapter 3365: Chapter 3364 Dominoes IV","paragraphs":["It meant he had to find even more sources of Loot.","\"Hmm...\" A devilish smile bloomed on his face as he thought about a certain hairy spider he had marked- the first entity to discover him within his Blancverse Domain.","Naturally, he had to keep his promises.","He thought he would still be some ways off before he could confidently challenge an Ordinance Amalgamation entity, but with the advancement of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed- his strength had undergone a great change!","Around his body, faint illusions of Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltrees and Primordial Mountains of the Expanse flashed ever so often as he continued to devour the golden gems around him.","In the depths of his existence, Pyrhuss' obsession seemed to be dancing and reveling in the blood of its enemies as the descendants of those who massacred and devoured his people were getting the same treatment!","Carnage.","Violence.","This was what Pyrhuss sought.","In the very beginning, he had told Noah that he wasn't seeking justice!","Because where was the Justice in killing the descendants of entities responsible for actions cycles past?","It was Carnage by sheer association- along with the fact that such descendants chose to be enemies due to greed.","And if Noah understood anything regarding causality...","'Will the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse be on my tail now? Will the brother of this Daughter of Existence come for me? Then the Father, Forefather, and any ancestors behind them after that?'","Noah mused to himself as the only thing he could control was himself and his actions, his gaze going towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body at this moment when his mind veered towards a certain hairy spider.","\"There's another enemy that is already marked- let's make our way towards him. Your transformation...\"","||Is effectively done in the short term as I now quantify the extent of the changes apart from the Infiniverse Megalos Body. Everything is undergoing a thorough alteration.||","...!","The changes already seemed immaculate as even more of them were being carried out!","All aspects of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed would get revamped, but the biggest change remained what this unbound complexity could do now compared to before.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body flashed with multicolored radiance and appeared in front of Noah, her eyes pulsing with waves of complexity as she continued.","||The strength of the Infiniverse Megalos Body had been affirmed, with the only remaining part of this test being its transference and usability.||","Noah smiled as an Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularity melted in his hands, thinking of the power wielded by the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","In the past, he could wield an Atlatl- a Spear that contained the very weight of the past versions of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","So what type of power could he wield now as its limitations became unbound and its complexity reached shocking heights?","The Infiniverse Megalos Body raised her hand as multicolored light swirled around it like a storm.","||The utilization, cost, and integration of authority between us have fundamentally changed. The complexity in power I displayed can theoretically fully be integrated with you and maintained for a low cost. Shall I start the Integration now, Master?||","The Infiniverse Megalos Body asked for permission.","Noah grabbed more Amalgamation Hearthraes Singularities as he nodded, his eyes expectant of what was to come!","In the next moment, the hand flickering with swirling multicolored storms of complexity prompts on Noah's chest, a blinding light of integration blooming as extremely complex weavings of existence began to sink into his body.","They delved under his skin and wrapped around every cell within his body!","|A unique process of the integration of complexity with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed has begun.|","|The product of this process, distinguished as the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology, is now underway.|","HUUM!","Brilliance unfolded between them.","The savage strength that the Infiniverse Megalos Body displayed to beat down 4 Ordinance Amalgamation entities.","Who said it would only be limited to her?!","Noah's eyes were luminous and filled with tyranny as he looked around, a large part of his authority erupting out as well as it wrapped around the Inviolable Sacred Blancverse Domain- this domain only trembling slightly before in the next moment, it disappeared!","After all, he couldn't stay at the location where he had just slain 4 Ordinance Amalgamation entities.","The Blancverse, containing a terrifying Infiniverse Megalos Seed, crossed the Expanse as at this moment, the marker of a certain Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation Spider was being followed.","—","Within the endless stretches of the Expanse.","Thousands of eyes without pupils burned brightly- each one radiating a horrific obsidian brilliance that felt like it could devour everything.","They were attached to a massive silver furred spider that had over nine thousand spiked silver limbs emerging from its body.","Currently, these eyes held a hint of caution and they looked towards two Ordinance Amalgamation Entities beside it!","One was a massive gray Necrotic Nest-Slug, its body dripping with ectoplasm as appalling serpentine eyes appeared all over its body- the illusion of gray stellar bodies flickering in and out of existence all over it.","The other was a Nihilos Shelled Snail that had a pure white shell over its body that radiated an unbreakable light.","|Nobody ever lets go of an opportunity or shares it with others...why did you two pull me along?|","The intent of the Silver Furred Spider, The Ancient Phrike- Vujun, was a cautious one as it asked the two beside it.","The slimy skin of the Necrotic Nest-Slug vibrated as a feminine voice came out.","|Naturally, it is because we alone can't grab what's right in front of us. Putting both of our complexities together, we didn't manage to reach even miles near this wonder before us.|","...!","Wonder.","What lay before them?","The Ancient Phrike took another look at the heart shaking body that was ten thousand miles long.","Its weavings of existence were dim and without a will, and there even seemed to be a process of decay starting!","And yet, its surroundings pulsed with storms of a shocking complexity that could wipe out weak Ordinance of Existence entities.","|It is the body of an entity that recently failed Existence Severing. Its will has collapsed as the rest of its body will follow, but if we can devour it...|","The eyes of the three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities blazed with brilliance!"]},{"number":3366,"title":"Chapter 3366: Chapter 3365 Corpse! I","paragraphs":["A body that was ten thousand miles long!","It looked slender with tout muscles, its skin gray and cracking as the head showed long white hair and pointed ears.","The corpse floated in the Expanse with its eyes entirely dimmed, but one could see an expression of defiance and resignation written on the face of this being even in death.","It's eyes.","The pupils were cracked and splintered as all they left behind were residues of what this being used to be.","This was the body of an entity that had failed Existence Severing!","The Ancient Phrike, Vujun, became contemplative as he looked at it.","|Its alignment is matter, but...look at its expression.|","...!","He couldn't help but observe that gaze of defiance.","That look of a being that had strove for success and toiled away for who knew how many cycles","|Even in its collapse of existence, it was defiant. And yet it still could Sever its Existence. What happens when we arrive at such a point ourselves? If we face the collapse of our own Existence?|","|...|","The Nihilos Shelled Snail and the Necrotic Nest-Slug looked at each other in silence before the eyes of the slug-like entity flickered with brightness.","|What the fuck, Vujun? We invited you here just to combine our complexities and get near this body to devour it. Why the hell are you becoming a philosopher? Worry about your own Existence Severing when you get to it. You have even fewer worries than us being connected to that honored personage.|","The voice flickered with emotion towards the end as the many eyes of Vujun blinked as he nodded.","|Let's go.|","Their bodies flickered with heavy radiance as the light of chilling banners wrapped around them seamlessly, staying close together as they shot towards the floating body!","HUUM!","The moment they even came close, crescent waves of a terrifying authority lashed out towards them- an authority that did not want its owner to verify desecrated even in death.","It radiated a verdant allure as it was the Ordinance of Vitality.","It still brimmed within the corpses that had tried to sever itself away from Existence- where even though it failed, this Vitality was still potent enough to hang on until now!","BOOM!","It smashed onto the bodies of the three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities as they withstood it easily from this distance.","But the closer they went to the corpses.","CAAA!","The more verdant storms erupted and struck out against them, but they withstood and made their way over slowly!","Around this same time.","Many light years away, a distance of about one Omniverse.","A white space silently flickered into existence.","Within it, a man floated in a meditative position while the figure of a multicolored woman was finishing an infusion of a shocking process, her hand having moved from his chest and on his back.","When one took a closer look, one could see the very reality surrounding this man vibrating as his skin rumbled and roiled as if giant snakes were coursing underneath!","An unfathomable crimson gold radiance flashed over his skin as it seemed like quintillions of sheets of singularities were stacked on top of each other to reinforce it.","Colorless gold wings stretched out behind his back as the feathers made of pure colorless gold light seemed to be sharper than the blade of a common Ordinance Amalgamation entity.","Golden tattoo like bands covered his body, the largest one being on his chest as it seemed to hold within it the reserves of endless weight and tonnage.","At this moment.","|The Infiniverse Megalos Physiology has attained a state of awakening within your weavings of Existence.|","A prompt flashed over Noah's eyes.","Behind him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body released her hands from his back as her tremendous eyes stared at him- and within their depths, one could almost see a flash of pride.","Almost.","Feeling the unique complexity coursing within his body, Noah moved from the meditative position and stood up as this simple motion...","HUUM!","Caused the surrounding space to tremble.","As if something far too heavy was moving about!","\"Hmm...\" He raised his hand and clenched his fist as he felt the equivalent force of millions of singularities imploding just from the motion of his fingers.","It was all purely a complexity of his Physiology as even he felt extremely heavy, as if every step to take would be effortful!","But once he acclimated and was able to move freely...he could easily wield this tonnage of complexity that was the equivalent of the complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","||Any force you apply is now equivalent to the Infiniverse Extremity Vein, the Infiniverse Aletheian Havens surrounding it, and the vast complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself. Its advancement in complexity has allowed you to utilize it for a fraction of the previous cost, to the extent that only a tenth of your reserves of authority will be kept at bay to manage the utilization of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology.||","The Infiniverse Megalos Body released its intent and looked over Noah up and down as if she was looking at a weapon born from an unfathomable Forge.","Before, Noah could only borrow the strength and weight of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed at a high cost and only utilize it a few times, but its jump in complexity to become a Constellation now made it possible for him to utilize its sheer tonnage and complexity constantly, at a cost he could bear with ease!","The higher up in complexity one became, the simpler things seemed for them.","As he felt the complexity and weight of the power coursing through him, he knew he had to get acclimated to it as wondrously enough, there were targets not too far from here!","He came for the Ancient Phrike, Vujun, and yet this spider did not seem to be alone as alongside it, there were two other Anti-Matter entities!","Their power was not small as the moment that Noah appeared even a distance of an Omniverse away, he saw them, and they saw him!"]},{"number":3367,"title":"Chapter 3367: Chapter 3366 Corpse! II","paragraphs":["The two sides saw each other as not just that, Noah also observed the ten thousand miles long corpse that they were going towards!","\"Oh?\"","His eyes lit up brightly as he sensed the shocking aura of this corpse- and the weavings of collapse that covered its whole existence.","Above him, a golden eye opened up as he found that wondrously, due to his new Infiniverse Megalos Physiology, his eyes seemed to hold even greater weavings of complexity as well as it seemed like a massive gate was flung open when its lids emerged!","And its gaze landed on the massive corpse in the far distance.","[Corpse of Vital Fist Emperor- Taran]:: State of Existence- Failed Existence Severing. Source of Existence- Omniseed. Lifespan- 125 Megalos Cycle/126 Megalos Cycles. Records of Weavings- The corpse of an entity that felt the end of its lifespan nearing and took the gamble to Sever their Existence and change its fate. The gamble was unsuccessful as their complexity of existence was not sufficient enough, and their Weavings have entered a state of decay and collapse. Within their weavings, their amalgamated Ordinance has since then bloomed an obsession, releasing the wonders it has remaining in it to pull in any Entities that it can devour the life cycles of- a capability that the Ordinance of Vitality only glimpsed past the gate of Existence Severing. Any creature that seeks to devour the body of the Vital Fist Emperor will instead find themselves ensnared by an ordinance with an obsession that instantly absorbs their weavings of existence, rapidly depleting their lifespans in an effort to resurrect the weavings of the Vital Fist Emperor himself...","...!","Noah's eyes vibrated with power and astonishment at such a description as it seemed that this corpse with his very weavings collapsing was still so dangerous!","It showed that any entity that had lived for enough cycles could potentially hold extremely dangerous capabilities- even as they died.","The issue here stemmed from the obsession of the Ordinance of Vitality that this being had amalgamated with.","\"An obsession...\" Noah's eyes radiated a luminous light as he thought of this word.","Pyrrhus died, and he also bore an obsession that made shocking things possible.","This entity who failed Existence Severing had his own Ordinance develop an obsession after it glimpsed a shocking ability had it managed to Sever Existence- the ability to devour the lifespans of others!","It was a ridiculous turn of events as it also made Noah think of the Omnifather.","How had that being survived the failed Severing of his Existence and attain the power that he did?","\"...\"","No answer presented itself as Noah refocused on the corpse in the distance looking for a target.","And now, three Anti-Matter entities were ensnared.","A potentially dangerous situation unfolded as in front of it...Noah did not back down!","He had to grasp the extent of complexity he could now unleash with the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology anyways.","A distance away.","The bodies of three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities were now only a single mile away from the corpse as it seemed like a grand prize was right before them.","And yet their expanded senses that could cover the equivalent length of a few omniverses observed the appearance of a Blancverse veiled with dazzling white brilliance- with the visage of a devilishly handsome man and a woman with a cold expression that could cause one trepidation being seen within.","Their expressions instantly soured with shock.","Any new entrants here complicated things greatly, and they were alarmed and shocked to see a moving Blancverse with these new entrants!","But...","|Him?!| The Ancient Phrike was even more shocked than the other two as he recognized the being in the far distance and his Blancverse.","The other two instantly honed in.","|Vujun, you know this entity?! You invited someone else?!|","Suspicion ran rampant among those in their stages as Vujun shook his limbs to deny while replying.","|No, he is an Ordinance of Existence entity who was lucky enough to bind a Blancverse. He is somehow able to displace it with his flimsy power as when he left, he made the threat that he would find me. But I never thought he would actually be stupid enough to do so...|","Confusion and caution were apparently in the eyes of Vujun as in the next moment, such confusion became amazed shock as Vujun and the two other Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities saw...the body of this being flickered and actually came out of the Blancverse Domain.","...!","An Ordinance of Existence entity, in front of three Ordinance Amalgamation Entities, actually left their protective domain and came out?!","The three entities looked at each other with shock and elation as in the next moment...","BOOM!","The bodies unfurled with waves of brilliant Ordinances.","A silver light erupted from Vujun and shot out to cover the distance of one Omniverse in an instant, appearing right above Noah as it sought to take this chance to kill and make the Blancverse owner less!","He wasn't the only one as from the Necrotic Nest-Slug and the Nihilos Shelled Snail, extremely sharp Obsidian and White lights also shot out to arrive in sequence.","Entities at their stage held tremendous power as they could exert the influence of their ordinance extremely far away.","So at this moment, three blazing Ordinances seeking to impose their weavings on Existence descended towards Noah.","His head was raised as he looked at them.","The silver light alone was filled with the heavy complexity of Annihilare- seeking to impose utmost decimation on anything it touched.","This level of complexity would cause Noah to normally release multiple of his Ordinances- and he estimated maybe a few dozen of them all at once, to be able to deny its imposition!","Normally.","But now...","SAA!","He raised his hand up and grasped onto the descending light of decimation.","BOOM!","It struck down like the cataclysm of multiple Omniverses, and yet when it smashed into Noah's hand, it was as if it struck an Inviolable diamond.","He grasped the authority of the ordinance in his hands as when he clenched his fist, it became dispersed in a shower of silver brilliance!","As for the two other authorities of Ordinances that came down after...","BOOM! BOOM!","He allowed them to hit his body as wondrously, as if there was an unshakable layer of defense over his skin- the brilliance of these authorities only hit and dispersed into flickers of radiance afterwards!","...!","The Ordinance Amalgamation entities in the distance stopped in place and looked at such a scene in a stupor.","This...was an Ordinance of Existence entity, right?"]},{"number":3368,"title":"Chapter 3368: Chapter 3367 Dominance! I","paragraphs":["Near the corpse of an entity that failed to sever their Existence, three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities watched with incredulity as the imposition of their Ordinances...were withstood and dispersed by the body of their target alone!","Withstood.","Dispersed.","For any such actions to occur, the complexity of the other side had to be that much more complex.","The Nihilos Shelled Snail felt its shell vibrating at such a reality as it roared out towards Vujun.","|You fucking donkey, that's an Ordinance of Existence entity? What the fuc-|","HUUM!","In the far distance, the entity they couldn't even fathom took a step.","A single step.","And the weavings of all three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation Entities buzzed as they felt his savage aura bloomed meters away from them an instant later.","He crossed the vast distances equivalent to an Omniverse in such a short period of time as he appeared, quite literally, right before them!","...!","A grave sense of danger befell these powerful entities.","They had seen many things.","They had lived for many cycles.","They heard stories time and time again of oddities observed across the Expanse that did not conform to common sense, and many had fallen prey to this.","Ordinance Amalgamation Entities have fallen to such oddities, and even Existence Severing entities have fallen every now and then!","So when these three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities experienced the ridiculous entity that they dubbed an oddity before them...","BOOM!","|We have no qualms with you!|","|Your enmity is with Vujun, we will not interfere!|","...!","The bodies of the Nihilos Shelled Snail and the Necrotic Nest-Slug erupted with graying mushroom pores and clouds of smoke as they distanced themselves rapidly, even moving away from the treasured corpses they all came here to devour.","They valued their lives far too much as, after living for so many cycles, they knew that their existence was paramount before anything else.","Pride? What the hell could they do with that?","Shame? Did it allow one to increase in complexity?","Friendship? This wasn't a fairy tale where the power of friendship was all that was required to overcome an exceedingly overpowered force.","The Necrotic Nest-Slug even threw Vujun under the bus as the Ancient Phrike looked towards them with maddened rage, his many eyes twisting as he didn't even probe the enemy he definitely knew to be an Ordinance Amalgamation entity, and he instead took another risk as he burst force with silver brilliance to get even closer to the Corpse before them!","If it could devour the remnant weavings of Existence of an entity that had almost severed their existence...there would be many more pathways before it.","Thus, three entities made their choices.","And the enemy they faced, the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, had also made his!","His visage was a pondering one as he sensed all the complex changes around him.","How many intricate ways could the power of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology be used?","It could be used as brute force like he did before, to overcome Ordinances due to its sheer complexity.","But Noah felt like it was far too unique to only be applied this way as he felt like its complexity could also be channeled elsewhere.","He felt it.","And so he did it.","At this moment, Noah tested many things as he utilized the terrifying complexity of tonnage and weight of this Physiology, and applied it towards the Ordinance of Gravitation.","Just Gravitation.","The application of the Complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology through a concept.","BOOM!","Terrifying stellar purple waves erupted around him as instantly, the Ancient Phrike, Vujun, who was infinitely close to the corpse before him...felt a terrifying and undeniable force pull on his body and fling him away.","The Necrotic Nest-Slug and the Nihilos Shelled Snail roared out as while moving away, they suddenly felt a terrifying force pull them back as waves of unknown gravity began to spin them through a chaotic sequence of rotations!","Even the massive corpse of the Vital Fist Emperor began to buzz as it also began to slowly rotate.","The three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities were initially dismayed at such a scene as Vujun roared out, a terrifying amount of authority being released by him at this moment.","|Annihilare's Boundless Favor.|","...!","Silver brilliance bloomed.","All around, decayed silver strings began to defend as they carried with them the authority to annihilate anything they touched.","It was the imposition of the Ordinance of Annihilare in its true sense, and-","|Huh?|","The many eyes of Vujun buzzed as he saw the silver strings coming down to impose his Ordinance tremble before they were cut up and ground down by the already existing waves of gravity all around.","His Ordinance...failed to establish its complexity against an already existing Ordinance.","For this to happen, the other Ordinance had to have much greater levels of Complexity!","And if this entity truly was of the Ordinance of Existence level, how could that be possible?!","Vujun's Ordinance could not be established, and the Necrotic Nest-Slug and the Nihilos Shelled Snail also realized the same thing as the terrifying complexity of the gravity currently spinning them around without their permission left them helpless to do anything.","What was the change of existence based on one's Ordinance?","What was the imposition and change of the very rulings of the surrounding reality based on one's own concept?","This was it!","A single entity laid down his rule of law, and nobody else could erase it or deny it!","Such a reality was one that rarely played out unless the two sides were truly on different landscapes of complexity entirely.","Their differences in the compositions of their existence- whether Matter or Anti-Matter, did not hold importance at this moment precisely due to the sheer gap in complexity granted by the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology.","The complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that rose from the Megalos Ynnere and into the Expanse!","A sense of awe and trepidation blazed from the product of such a wonder as at this moment, a single entity stood at the center of heavy waves of gravity that scrambled even Ordinance Amalgamation entities!"]},{"number":3369,"title":"Chapter 3369: Chapter 3368 Dominance! II","paragraphs":["It was a scene that even Noah had not expected to bloom so quickly.","With over a hundred Ordinances, he felt like he could stand against Ordinance Amalgamation entities.","But he didn't feel like he could thrash them as he was currently doing with these Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities!","\"Come!\"","He motioned towards the Nihilos Shelled Snail that had now retracted its whole body into its shell, terrifying mechanisms being put in place as an ancient air leaked from it- an intent now choosing to cover itself entirely if it couldn't do anything to the surrounding existence, it would at least be able to reinforce its amalgamated body!","All of its complexity.","All of its cycles of brilliance.","It all gathered within its shell as its ancient eyes dimly observed from within.","It analyzed the terrifying strength this new enemy released as in an effort to overturn it, its gray eyes pulsed as its intent began to weave out.","|Friend, a fight to the death is not always the only solution in the Expanse! I have knowledge, I have my existence, I can trade even my allegianc-|","BOOM-CRACK!","Its Nihilos Shell.","Everything that it had built its Ordinance into- the culmination of cycles of its achievements!","It fractured and broke at this time as a blindingly bright fist came through, its snail-like eyes shaking as it felt a shocking level of complexity descend into its existence!","First, it felt completely suppression.","Then, the heavy weight that it's weavings of existence could not bear whatsoever cascaded down as they extinguished anything about it, its records, its weavings!","BOOM!","It was only a small fist, and yet the weight it carried was enough to collapse every molecule of work it had put in these dozens of cycles!","|...|","Its intent watched in silent horror as its weavings dimmed rapidly, all the way to the extent that it could no longer think, and infinite darkness came.","...!","A horrific gravity continued to spin their bodies in defiance of their own wishes as Vujun and the Necrotic Nest-Slug saw the weavings of their compatriot collapse with a single punch.","The visage of Noah was surrounded by golden radiance as his fist retracted, his gaze going towards them as they felt a rising chill that told them this was the same fate waiting for them if nothing changed!","Vujun's eyes twisted into terrifying slits at this as above him, a terrifying Eye of Existence opened.","It radiated a shocking silver radiance as at this moment, trillions of webs seemed to sprout from it as this Ancient Phrike bent its legs down, its ancient voice echoing out.","|Save me, O Great Mother.|","...!","Noah's eyes became stern at such words as he looked towards the forming eyes and the trillions of spider webs that seemed to be blooming within it- the pressure of Gravitation being focused by him to press down and crush this forming complexity called out by Vujun!","Great Mother?","Megalos Nihilos had someone with a similar distinction to the Great Mother of the Megalos Ynnere?","And why did it seem like almost every Ordinance Amalgamation entity had a backer they could either call for or were already protected by?!","The Daughter of Existence had the remnant authority of an Existence Severing entity that protected her, and now...","WUU!","An ancient cry emerged from the Eye of Existence that Vujun conjured as it resisted Noah's complex pressure, trillions of webs sprouting out as from this Eye, a will that wasn't Vujun's emerged.","A will that seemed to be gazing at everything through this terrifying eye as an utterly apocalyptic pressure leaked out of it.","Noah became unfathomably serious at such an eye that seemed to quickly gaze over everything before it locked onto him.","It was a pupil that seemed to be made out of endless layers of webs.","It instantly caused the massive body of Vujun to no longer be affected by the shocking complexity of gravitation all around, its massive body coming to a halt as if anchored in space.","It gazed at him coldly before an intent leaked out from it.","|How about you stop here? You will earn a favor from the Great Mother Weaver of Nihilos for sparing one of her children.|","...!","The voice was feminine in nature and filled with shocking poison and beauty.","The Great Mother Weaver of Nihilos!","Noah was firm even against such a voice and identity as he couldn't help but smack his lips.","He had met a bit over 7 Ordinance Amalgamation entities in the Expanse, and two of them managed to either have the aid of a big boss far more powerful protecting them, or they could call upon one to come to their aid.","Meanwhile, which big boss did he have to call for help in case a truly terrifying enemy appeared?!","|...|","He glanced towards the distant Blancverse and the visage of the Infiniverse Megalos Body that was watching coldly within as he shook his head with a smile.","There was no one to rely on but himself and the tools he had on hand!","BOOM!","His body erupted with complexity as he parted towards the massive body of Vujun, utterly ignoring the terrifying authority that had made its brief entry here.","|What a foolish course of action. Have I been low-key for too long in the Expanse that my name is ignored like this?|","The cold voice erupted out with malice and power as, shockingly, the limbs of Vujun began to shrivel as his complexity greatly reduced.","As this occurred, a terrifying power gathered on the eye filled with webs as it seemed like to make a move against someone else through this method, Vujun had to pay a great cost!","But if it could save his life, it was a cost he could bear.","If it could save his life.","HUUM!","Noah's body flickered with radiance as around him, over 100 Ordinances unfurled with multicolored radiance.","And the weight and complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology was then infused unto all of these ordinances as he shot forth like an undeniable Constellation!"]},{"number":3370,"title":"Chapter 3370: Chapter 3369 Brilliance Across the Megalos! I","paragraphs":["An eye filled with countless layers of webs emanated a shocking intent, borrowing from the complexity of Vujun himself as a horrific gray flower made up of trillions of webs bloomed!","The moment this flower appeared, all of the surrounding weavings of existence dimmed as the golden light of the Expanse itself felt a little less brighter.","The flower felt demonic and filled with malice as it had a devilish face filled with countless eyes, and it radiated a chaotic light as it smashed towards Noah!","He blazed with multicolored radiance.","The complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology was applied equally to all Ordinances!","All of this power went towards the impact against the heavy cost that the Ancient Phrike, Vujun, bore to have a sliver of the Great Mother Weaver make a move.","...!","The impact was a silent one.","This area of the expanse vibrated intently as against the clash of maddening gray brilliance and multicolored radiance, an inestimable force emerged between both sides were flung back for thousands of light years!","A flower had its petals dissipate one by one as its devilish glare stared out light years away, the body of Vujun shriveling up noticeably as above him, an eye began to close.","Before it did, it turned down to observe the weary Vujun and released an intent.","|Run as far as you can, and you may still have hope of survival. He should be near death and not capable of chasing after yo-...!|","The gradually closing eye of the terrifying entity reflected a sharp light while looking ahead as shockingly, from the direction Noah was flung to, his figure reappeared grandly.","His body had cracks as stellar gold blood flowed calmly like astral lava, his right hand missing all the components of skin and muscle as only a shattered multicolored skeleton could be seen!","Yet his face retained its coldness and regality as around him, the vibrant Ordinance of Genesis was already blooming.","Life and Vitalis were burning brightly!","Infinity, among others, blazed with radiance as his unfathomably tough body...was healing and regenerating in real time.","His gaze carried unbound tyranny as even in the face of this terrifying Entity, his voice echoed out.","\"No, Great Mother, I am not near death.\"","...!","\"And I am afraid to say that one of your children has arrived at the end of their journey.\"","HUUM!","As his body healed, the wings behind him shone.","Invictus Maximus.","For the first time, the terrifying complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology was applied to his wings as he voiced out like an ancient Emperor passing forth a decree.","\"Fatality.\"","...!","Causality trembled.","The fate of The Ancient Phrike, Vujun, was already set in stone as at this moment, Noah only finalized it!","\"Matter Immolation.\"","His voice carried heavy weight and coldness as the body of Vujun trembled with rage and terror, feeling the very fundamental makeup of his existence beginning to burn and explode as very quickly, all parts of his existence were aflame with silver radiance.","His makeup itself was immolating as above him, the closing eye gazed towards Noah coldly.","|I won't forget this. I won't forget you.|","...!","A heavy threat, especially from an Entity that may be cemented at the stage of Existence Severing!","And yet against it, Noah only shook his head while he turned around to the only remaining Ordinance Amalgamation entity here who was still bound down by his gravitation.","The Necrotic Nest-Slug.","Noah began floating towards it as he replied to the blatant threat of the Great Mother Weaver without looking back.","\"You, like many others that have made threats against me before, will definitely come to forget me. After all, when your weavings collapse, what more can you remember?\"","Blatant disrespect flowed out from him as the sliver of the Great Mother Weaver within the eye crumbled while beginning to pulse with rage!","As Noah floated towards the Necrotic Nest-Slug, its slimy body trembled as its intent echoed out.","|Hold on, please. Just...!|","Actual fear arose in the heart of an Ordinance Amalgamation entity in a region of the Expanse as Noah blared his brilliance heavily!","But he didn't just express such brilliance here.","Far from here, within the weavings of a Tresorverse, another body of his sat on one of three thrones that would decide the ownership of Origin Tresoverse Towers of Existence.","Above him, a singularity continued to extinguish as the other Ordinance of Existence entities could no longer stay still- throwing attacks towards all three thrones!","The Viceroy of the Commonwealth was surrounded by Protectors as he had others to defend for him, his own power not even needing to be put to use!","The unknown entity that looked exceedingly young on the other throne had a stern expression, his Ordinance erupting out to reject any others that sought to impose themselves unto him.","And then, there was Noah.","At this moment, he didn't radiate any shocking allure of even a single Ordinance as he simply sat on the throne.","Above him, one Ordinance after another flickered.","Kuklos.","Light. Death.","Fire.","Fate.","One after another, powerful entities shot them out in order to knock him from the throne he sat on!","And yet...","BZZT!","Every single Ordinance striking down fizzled the moment it came inches away from his body, with him not even making an active effort to defend whatsoever.","It was simply that his complexity was too far above what any of them could compare to.","This included Antediluvian Leviathans, Protectors, and other assorted races and Lineages of Entities that had attained the stage of the Ordinance of Existence here!","Seeing Noah's absolutely unbothered look as nothing phased him, the many entities here turned their attention towards the other two thrones while expressing their shock and dismay.","As for Noah himself, he only turned his head above to stare at the fading singularity that was nearly extinguished.","With its disappearance, he would gain access to a Modus Operandi that promised a great deal of things regarding complexity!"]},{"number":3371,"title":"Chapter 3371: Chapter 3370 Brilliance Across the Megalos! II","paragraphs":["As his brilliance shone in the Expanse and in the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather, another one of his bodies stood within a vessel that crossed the Megalos Ynnere.","Beside him, the figure of Command Protector Valeria continued to turn to him every few seconds with a gaze of doubt as she couldn't help but ask.","|We are really going to face the Outerversal Morphon behind all this right now? The Great Ponderor?|","She asked as it truly didn't seem real.","They were able to take down a weak body of Savitar, but all other Outerversal Morphons, especially the Great Ponderor, they knew very little of and was extremely dangerous!","Her power that was just grasping the Eye of Existence would likely not be able to do much as all three reliance would be on him.","And he gave a light smile in reply.","\"Yes. I've already nuked his homes as he has made the choice to gather all forces in one place in the Megalos Ynnere. He can't bring himself to cut off his reach here entirely due to me, as he is likely plotting to get help from others or a myriad of other means. But at the end of the day, no schemes will make up for sheer strength.\"","WAA!","His words vibrated with confidence as Command Protector Valeria couldn't deny them!","She could only listen and choose to believe for the sake of her sister.","And as they neared whatever location Noah was bringing them towards, he said one last thing.","\"I do this only to wrap up what I've started. After that, I will leave as you can make the choice of staying as Protectors of the Commonwealth, or follow me.\"","...!","Words that caused the face of Command Protector Valeria to flicker in shock echoed out as she had a strong reaction to them, but before she could even relay her shock...","\"We are here.\"","The Omniversal Voyager slowed down as it neared an Omniverse.","Not tainted.","Not even half-tainted.","Just a normal Omniverse.","The location where the Great Ponderor retreated with all of his forces as he planned his next course of action after all his Tainted Omniverses were wiped away!","Noah was still a terrifying distance away, but his body released a golden flicker of sandy gold light that silently went on to cover a distance equivalent to three Omniverses.","It was to ensure that today, nobody would be able to even leave this perimeter.","It was time to begin the dissadulation of the one who actually made himself an enemy of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian and thought he could scheme freely behind the scenes!","As for how Noah had located this hiding spot of the Great Ponderor?","There was a body of this entity within a certain Pantheon of Umbra in the Megalos Beyond that Ozymandias could observe freely this whole time, and with the rise in complexity...many more droves of information were capable of being obtained.","The rise in complexity of Ozymandias.","This alone caused an unfathomable brilliance to bloom across the Megalos Beyond as Ozymandias...had a direct link to the Infiniverse Megalos Body!","—","Within the Megalos Beyond.","The Pantheon of Umbra!","Ozymandias sat amidst throes of eldritch horrors as his terrifying banner had covered Umbra and even stretched out beyond it when he declared his Ordinance, and he had the resurgence of the Great Mother and the Observer of Old and Young appear once more as they joined the Great Wheel with their heavy support of the Instrument of the Beyonder!","Little Aspasia sat by the side calmly as the tentacles of the Great Mother in the form of an infinity symbol wriggled while relaying an intent of great expectations for Ozymandias. |O Instrument of the Beyonder, you may have not begun traversing the Expanse since you just declared your Ordinance...but I have a possible path for us to take to quickly wade across the Megalos Beyond onto the Pantheons holding the Crucibles of the Beyonder. Without being delayed or battling Heretics who do not wish to see you succeed. We can traverse the Megalos Beyond...through the Expanse.|","...!","Her intent was a ridiculous one as it caused the Great Wheel and the Observer of Old and Young to almost scoff.","Enter the Expanse in one area of the Megalos Beyond, and traverse across the Expanse and make an exit in another area that would grant you an exit in an entirely different space within the Megalos you were in!","|I am confident in this, O Instrument, and in this manner, you can even observe one of our bases in the Expanse- where Outerversal Morphons from countless cycles past have made their home as they wade through that endless land of weavings. You will get to see the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse where Outerversal Morphons who have transcended their Existence occupy.|","A grandiose plan was laid out as beside the Great Mother, the Observer of Old and Young couldn't help but interject.","|Is it not too hasty? He has just declared his Ordinance as his complexity should have reached a level for him to transcend his existence and enter the Expanse, but...it has only been days since his birth. This...|","They had been alive for cycles.","Thousands of years could pass from a deep slumber for them.","Moving so rapidly in just a matter of days...","At such an intent, the tentacles of the Great Mother wriggled in a smile as she looked towards Ozymandias.","|What say you, Instrument of the Beyonder? Are you able to make the jump into the Expanse with your current complexity? I will even provide you with a marker that will draw you towards where my body is there.|","The Great Mother held tremendous confidence in the Instrument of the Beyonder.","For him to be able to enact change across the Megalos Beyond, he had to be exceptional.","He had to confound and amaze them!","Were to be merely a genius Outerversal Morphon or a distinguished Great One like them, would he be able to achieve anything? There were many Great Ones, yet none of them could say that they could change the whole Megalos Beyond!","The Great Mother looked at Ozymandias expectantly.","And Ozymandias felt the trembling connection with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that just waited to be unleashed and course through his unfathomable brilliance, the singularities within his eyes beginning to ebb with a golden light as he replied nonchalantly.","\"Merely an entrance into the Expanse, nothing major.\"","...!"]},{"number":3372,"title":"Chapter 3372: Chapter 3371 Brilliance Across the Megalos! III","paragraphs":["Merely.","Ozymandias spoke with such confidence that the Outerversal Morphons listening to it felt a thrill course through them.","This was especially so for the Great Mother who fanatically believed in the Great Behonder!","|Haha, then let us do it. If you ascend from here, I will cover this area with a marker that will pull you toward my location in the Expanse.|","She continued to be expectant towards the Instrument of the Beyonder.","For him to truly effect change, he had to be and do what others could not even imagine!","Ozymandias gazed at the eldritch horrors around him who looked towards him with many hopeful gazes for the future","They believed him to be someone he wasn't, but he had no qualms about taking this identity as he had already come this far.","So he would simply take it a step further and enjoy the boons that came with it.","\"Open.\"","HUUM!","He uttered out a single word as if he was commanding the Expanse to open up its doors to him.","At the same time, he truly did open a door as the vastness of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...he allowed it to flow into him.","...!","Stellar obsidian radiance flourished with maddening splendor.","An instant later, unfathomable waves of Complexity emerged from Ozymandias, his stellar obsidian body vibrating as it lifted off the dark earth of the Pantheon of Umbra and began to rise up!","From all directions, the Megalos Beyond itself twisted as it seemed like its very surrounding space was flowing into Ozymandias, his complexity rapidly shooting upwards.","The Great Mother looked at this with alarm as her body instantly pulsed to ensure that any weavings from here would head towards a certain point in the Expanse, not expecting the process to be so rapid and so tyrannical!","As if he was making a jump.","As if his complexity could be spurred at any moment, and he was now simply activating it all.","BOOM!","His body became warped with obsidian light as it seemed like a part of it left him- turning into a brilliant burst of light that disappeared above!","|...|","Outerversal Morphons watched the scene somberly.","The main body of Ozymandias remained floating grandly, the weavings of the Megalos Beyond surging around him and forming a cocoon as a transformation continued- the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology blooming within him as well. Far from here.","Within a point in the Expanse.","Golden strings glowed faintly as a stellar obsidian body emerged between them, an entity opening his eyes and observing his surroundings to see the shimmering of three countless golden strings...that gradually transformed into obsidian purple strings of light in the distance.","The distance.","There, he saw a massive Blancverse the size of an Omniverse that rejected everything else, billowing purple smoke burning around it so intensely that it even influenced the surrounding strings of existence!","Within the Blancverse, the intricate weavings of countless massive obsidian and purple tentacles could be seen along with structures floating grandiosely within- the complex weavings unique to Outerversal Morphons radiated outwards.","At this moment, an aura seemed to lock down on Ozymandias from within this Blancverse, the aura of powerful entities crossing vast distances in a short time as quickly as they neared his position!","At the forefront, light flickered to reveal an entity in the form of an infinity symbol, her tentacles vibrating with anticipation.","Behind her, auras of Outerversal Morphons burning with the power of Ordinance of Existence entities followed as her intent radiated out grandly.","|I am honored to welcome the Instrument of the Beyonder to this Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse. The Great Beyonder made many homes for us in the Megalos Beyond, and he did the same in the Expanse as there are multiple junctions like this where we can live free. Come.|","The Great Mother appeared and gave a grand Welcome in the Expanse.","Ozymandias followed as all around, his body was absorbing wisps of the power of complexity here as he observed everything.","|A Palace of the Expanse such as this is protected by what is known as a Blancverse- an inviolable domain that even Pioneers sitting above Existence Severing have a hard time making a forceful entry in. Within, there are a few Elder Morphons that have been living for far too many cycles at the Existence Severing stage that oversee many things. We will get you acclimated here first before we begin making moves elsewhere. You have only been alive for days, and should at least show you the joy that all Morphons seek to protect in the Megalos Beyond and in the Expanse...|","The Great Mother, filled with anticipation, led Ozymandias into a domain filled with highly complex Outerversal Morphons!","—","As Ozymandias made his entry into the Expanse and arrived in the bounds of the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse.","Far from such a place, within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Inside a radiant Blancverse, many domains within domains were set up.","Inside one such domain.","Here, a Palace Master was making his way towards the last Existence Severing Palace Master he had to talk to in order to form the strongest coalition of a force that could achieve his aims with surety.","A force filled with powerful Ordinance Amalgamation entities that had successfully been given and utilized a Complexity Modus Operandi that made the way they utilized their power reach multiple octaves higher.","|Palace Master Antiope, sorry for the intrusion.|","His intent radiated out as he descended onto a small domain the size of a world within this Blancverse.","Palace Masters were granted various positions to take within the Blancverse, each one being an Existence Severing Entity as they were given forces under them to command and identities with weight across the Expanse.","When one joined a force like the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, they gained access to a vast array of information accumulated over countless cycles- the locations of unique areas that increased the rate of Complexity of Existence, unique Blancverse Domains, treasures like Hearthraes...and more!"]},{"number":3373,"title":"Chapter 3373: Chapter 3372 The Wheel Turns As The Wheel Turns! I","paragraphs":["Most of all, it was the sense of protection.","Because in any Palace of the Expanse, there was likely a Pioneer.","Someone that had gone ahead step further after Existence Severing!","Someone who could walk across the Expanse with a level of confidence.","With entities like these behind them, there was a level of confidence in surviving the calamity to come.","|Hmm? Palace Master Evrin? What brings you here?|","Inside the domain as small as a world.","Thousands of white lotuses bloomed, a terrifying Existence Severing entity seated atop one Lotus as she raised her eyes calmly towards the descending golden figure of Palace Master Evrin.","The woman seated on the lotus carried a terrifying sense of charm, her eyes being pure white with no pupils as they held unfathomable waves of complexity.","Even Palace Master Evrin always felt a sense of trepidation towards this being, and it was why he left her for last.","Palace Master Antiope...she did not seem like any other Existence Severing entity!","Palace Master Evrin gave a light nod as he spoke.","|A minor matter. A Daughter of Existence I sired was killed today as the enemy is a peak Ordinance Amalgamation creature. I do not wish to have any others fall to them as I wanted to send off a few select forces under us that would ensure quick and smooth success. I just wish to borrow one of your Immovable Sacred Legion- or a few combatants from it.|","...!","He wanted to ensure success and that no others in their Palace fell to this enemy.","Palace Master Antiope raised her eyes at such a request before she replied while tapping on the white lotus below her.","|Which creature is so bold as to not care about the identity of a Daughter of Existence?|","|Ah, just a minor character that may not even know about the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse...| Palace Master Evrin waved his hands and conjured the hazy image of the woman surrounded by multicolored radiance.","Her face was hazy, but one could barely see the flash of apathy and utmost confidence within.","Palace Master Antiope raised her eyes languidly as they came to rest upon the illusory figure shown by Evrin, and...","BOOM!","Her white eyes instantly blasted open as a shocking complexity bloomed from it, Palace Master Evrin becoming stern as his body that was entirely severed from any outside existence but himself floating amidst this eruption of complexity calmly while probing what caused such a sudden change!","He saw...the figure of Palace Master Antiope covered by trillions of compressed sheets of complexity all over her body, a terrifying white eye blooming behind her as if she was ready for battle!","Her whole figure emanated a terrifyingly sharp light that even caused Palace Master Evrin to turn somber, and he looked around as he thought they were under attack.","But...","|...|","There was nobody here.","The only thing that Palace Master Antiope was still staring at while shocked and panting was...the illusory image of the target he sought to kill to avenge his daughter.","This...this illusory image caused Palace Master Antiope to react in such a way?","|Palace Master Antiope?|","Evrin called out slightly.","And...","Antiope only continued to stare at the illusory image ahead, her eyes finally regaining their focus as her body, which had moved impulsively based on cycles of intuition, finally calmed.","It was just an illusion.","Just an illusion!","But...","|How could she be here? This is...|","Her eyes held a trace of fear.","An Existence Severing entity- fearful!","Palace Master Evrin only looked at this scene with greater and greater shock as he didn't know what was going on!","Did Palace Master Antiope know the veiled entity that had killed his Daughter? And why would she be reacting this way?","|Antiope.|","He called out again.","And Palace Master Antiope snapped out of it and stared at him, her gaze then returning towards the illusory image ahead as she waved her hands and caused it to disappear.","|Hold on. Don't do anything yet!|","Her voice held a sense of clear alarm and shock within it as shockingly, a lotus bloomed where she was as she instantly disappeared.","Before she did, in a whisper nobody could hear, she seemed to be talking to herself as she asked.","|How could she be here? How could the Infiniverse Dowager be in these Weavings of Existence?!|","...!","With a flicker, she had disappeared, leaving behind a dazed Palace Master Evrin!","—","In the depths of the Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","A lotus flickered in and out of existence as it went deeper and deeper into this Blancverse, entering a region that even Existence Severing entities were barred from entering most times.","She flickered through such areas rapidly before she came to slow down as she neared a domain filled with a blue sea, multiple serene floating islands anchored above this blue sea as she went towards the central one.","On such a floating island, in a field of green gold grasslands and trees, a man was talking with a woman as they both raised their heads up at this moment to observe the frantic entrance of Palace Master Antiope.","The woman emanated a terrifying air of another Existence Severing entity, while the man...his dark hair and blue eyes would cause trepidation even in an Existence Severing entity as he seemed to have exceeded such a stage.","A Pioneer!","Existence Severing were Greater Constellations in terms of Complexity.","Pioneers of Existence...were Elder Constellations as they could walk across the Expanse without fear!","Palace Master Antiope landed on the green gold grasslands as her frantic voice echoed out while she waved her hands.","|She is here. Within this timeline of the Wheel! Within these Weavings of the Wheel- she is here!|","...!","The image of the veiled multicolored woman that was just shown by Palace Master Evrin bloomed once more.","The moment her image was shown, the blue eyes of the Pioneer became stern as the Existence Severing Entity beside him took a step back instinctively.","As if a fear of this being was deeply ingrained within her!","|The Infiniverse Dowager...the Existence Devourer!|","...!","They all recognized her.","The slight veiling, her multicolored radiance- they recognized it all too well!"]},{"number":3374,"title":"Chapter 3374: Chapter 3373 The Wheel Turns As The Wheel Turns! II","paragraphs":["This entity had given them and countless others nightmares for far too long.","At this moment, the blue eyes of the stern Pioneer asked quickly.","|What is the context? What is she currently embroiled in?|","Hearing this voice of calm, Antiope also calmed down as she spoke clearly.","|The death of an Ordinance Amalgamation Daughter of Existence- a Daughter of Existence.|","...!","The moment she repeated these words, there was immense silence.","Even after she said them, she also seemed to have realized something.","|Wait...|","Countless weavings clicked.","|This...this is a time before she attained her unshakable power. We've come across her before she even Pioneered her own path! If she is dealing with Ordinance Amalgamation entities now...|","Her heart beat wildly.","Her eyes began to shine with hope!","She looked towards the Pioneer of Existence before her as his blue eyes were contemplative, seeming as if he had come across a truly difficult problem!","|Nobody had ever been successful in finding out the Source Weavings of Existence that the Infiniverse Dowager stemmed from. But you forget. If she is here, then likely...so is he.|","WAA!","Words that caused the gaze of Palace Master Antiope to flicker and change rapidly as she became somber.","The other Palace Master, also an Entity at the Existence Severing stage, shuddered as if she recalled a terrifying memory!","|You mean...the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian could also be within this Weaving of Existence? That...|","A chilling and fearful light flashed in the eyes of this Existence Severing entity.","The Infiniverse Dowager alone was dreadful.","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian? He was a nightmare!","|...|","An immense silence ensued the moment his name was mentioned as they felt like the very air became that much more oppressive.","|Heracles...|","Palace Master Antiope looked towards the blue eyes of the Pioneer of Existence.","Someone with such terrifying complexity that no Existence Severing entity could even understand his depth.","Antiope looked at this being as she spoke slowly.","|Nobody- Nobody has ever discovered anything relating to the history of these beings. The Infiniverse Dowager. The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. His Instrument. There are other Calamities that come down the line for multiple Weavings of Existence- for multiple Weavings of the Wheel, but these are among the top. Can you imagine...actually taking them out early? Before they attain their dreadful power? Before they can even use the Turns of the Wheel of Existence?|","...!","Her eyes were truly hopeful.","She thought of all those that could be saved.","All the lives that could be spared.","The destruction that could have been avoided!","Even after hearing her words, the Pioneer of Existence only gazed at her with solemnity.","He seemed to be lost in thought as he looked at far too many things, until he eventually spoke.","|They weren't always Calamities. If that hadn't happened, if the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian was not hunted down. If-|","|What has happened and what will happen across different Weavings of Existence cannot be changed.|","...!","Antiope stopped the reminiscent regrets of the Pioneer of Existence, Heracles.","What happened could not be changed.","What was bound to happen in the future...could not be changed even more! Things had to unfold the way they should unfold.","Heracles shook his head as he thought about many things while Palace Master Antiope continued.","|Imagine it. A future free of at least those Calamities. Timelines of Existence not decimated by them. If we have truly found their Source Weavings of Existence here...you should do well to remember how we all came to be lost in another Weaving of Existence apart from our own. Thrown into weak bodies that are barely allowing us to reclaim our power. You've jumped ahead of us, but you are still bound to our collective goals, Heracles. To protect the Weavings of the Wheel of Existence. Please...tell me we can at least act on this. You have already Pioneered your path once more as if the Infiniverse Dowager is only dealing with Ordinance Amalgamation entities now, your power- our power, may just be sufficient.|","She yearned for hope.","Something.","Anything!","And yet Heracles still shook his head with thought.","His blue eyes shimmered as he spoke calmly.","|Do not forget the capabilities of the Infiniverse Dowager and, even more so, the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. The Tyrant that seeks to eclipse all of Existence...he is someone far too many have underestimated, and they had all fallen to him. Common sense means nothing to that being as unless it is a sure kill- unless there is 100% Absolute certainty, anything less than that will be a failure. If we expose ourselves to him here, things could become catastrophic.|","His words poured a cold sea over their hopes and dreams as he reminded them of the other Calamity.","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","An entity all of them thought to be of ancient nature- having stemmed from the oldest weavings of Existence itself!","A survivor of the extinction of the Megalonians cycles ago. In all possible Weavings of Existence, the Megalonians always perished due to their brilliance.","None survived.","None but the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","|If we make a move and fail- destroy a body of his but not everything. Leave any trace of our weavings...he will gradually come to find out about us. His nature defies the weavings of existence entirely as just imagine he gets his hands on any of us. Our weavings. Our memories. Would that not result in an even greater Calamity? If he knew what we know?|","|...|","Immense silence came down.","They calculated and just thought of the mere possibility of failure as their gazes turned ashen.","In this point of immense silence...","|But, your words have merit.|","...!","The Pioneer of Existence, Heracles, voiced out with a sigh.","He crouched down and touched the green gold grass below him as his blue eyes calculated countless possibilities.","|Maybe the turning of the Wheel led us all here. We escaped from our Weavings of Existence to run from the decimation of the Infiniverse Dowager, only to be lost through time and weavings. For us to come into these weavings that may very well be the Source Weavings of so many Calamities...|","...!"]},{"number":3375,"title":"Chapter 3375: Chapter 3374 The Wheel Turns As The Wheel Turns! III","paragraphs":["Heracles didn't finish his last words as the two women beside him looked at each other.","Antiope had been speaking this whole time, but in the next moment, the other Existence Severing Palace Master, who hadn't said much, opened her mouth.","|We do not even necessarily have to try and expose ourselves in erasing his weavings. All we need to do is cut off his pathway and the pathway of the Infiniverse Dowager to advance. Remember, our existence in these Weavings of Existence itself is an anomaly, with much of our weavings and memories blocked off. If any of us were to die or be captured by the Infiniverse Dowager or the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, they wouldn't be able to gain too much. The Wheel would not allow such an imbalance- and you can just look at us and how we've had to struggle here as an example. If we could pull upon all that we knew, if critical parts of ourselves were not completely blocked off, would we not have reached the stage of those cruel beings simply observing all of this chaos from above after all these cycles?|","WAA!","Bundles of what seemed like extremely important pieces of information leaked out from this being, and she continued calmly!","|Everything comes at a cost, we know this. So we can move slowly. We need to gather much more information and not just go from conjecture. We need to confirm the sighting of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, we need to confirm their current stage of power. And from there...the possibilities of what we can do are endless.|","...!","Antiope looked at the red haired Palace Master, Nisa, who stated such an intent as she nodded.","She slowly paced around the green gold grasslands as she also added on.","|And let's not count our complexity of Existence out just yet. We fear the future Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, yes, but the current ones here...may not be as existence defying as the ones we know.|","She sought to bolster their confidence as the moment she said these words...","|Never think like that again.|","Heracles raised his head and corrected her sternly.","Palace Master Antiope paused and turned around as Heracles continued.","|Even here, treat them with the same level of caution and fear. Many underestimated them in the past and future, we cannot do the same. First, let us gather more information. And only after we have absolute certainty in any move we choose to make, and then two or three fallback plans just in case that absolute certainty turns out to not be so absolute...only then do we move. Understood?|","He laid his words down with an undeniable pressure that even caused their complexity at the Existence Severing stage to quiver as the two nodded.","Palace Master Antiope rose up as she voiced out sternly.","|I will mix my forces with those that Palace Master Evrin is amassing. I will advise him to only monitor and understand the one who killed his daughter first and not yet make a move.|","|Mmm, and keep it strictly other forces. Do not impose your will to possess any of them for you to observe yourself, nor mix any trace weavings of your existence. Cut yourself out of the process entirely as our weavings cannot get discovered.|","...!","The words of Pioneer Heracles rang out again as Palace Master Antiope paused and nodded, her figure flickering out of existence.","She left behind only two beings who raised their gazes to observe the illusory image of a veiled woman that reminded them of too many things.","Looking at it, Heracles couldn't help but sigh as he thought of what could have been!","|The Wheel turns as the Wheel turns...nobody can stop it. Nobody can predict it...we can only do our best.|","Countless profundity and emotion lay within these words as among those here, only someone like him could truly understand what they meant.","A distance away from here, Palace Master Evrin had been thoughtfully pondering recent actions as he replayed the reaction of Palace Master Antiope again and again.","For her to react like that...had he stumbled onto something that could even frighten an Existence Severing Palace Master?","It didn't make sense.","But moments after...","WAP!","Palace Master Antiope returned with a calm gaze and spoke to him.","|You can have the Lotus Immovable Sacred Legion under me. I will advise you to first monitor everything regarding your target and those around it before making a move as I suspect they may be connected to another Sacred Palace of the Expanse- or a force that could trigger the dominoes of war. I'm heavily interested in this as I'll work with you hand in hand...|","Her eyes carried a chillingly sharp light as Palace Master Evrin couldn't help but be cautioned by such a rapid change!","—","Far from the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","In a region filled with endless golden strings, a man floated silently as four massive corpses surrounded his illustrious figure.","The corpse of a massive Ancient Phrike, a Necrotic Nest-Slug, and a Nihilos Shelled Snail.","There was also the Corpse of the Vital Fist Emperor, whose last shred of weavings was actually just lying in wait to see if they could deny the weavings of existence itself.","Three Ordinance Amalgamation Entities, and one who was on the cusp of Existence Severing and had failed!","These were the bundles of loot lying before him as moments later, space fluctuated around him as the Infiniverse Megalos Body appeared.","||I shall analyze and prepare them for you, Master.||","As if she was telling someone she would prepare food for them.","Her voice was succinct as Noah gave a nod of affirmation, watching this brilliant cluster of complexity that somehow all came from a small Spiritual Land go forward and appear inches away from the corpse of the Vital Fist Emperor.","Within the depths of this Corpse, a silent Ordinance was aroused as it felt like its chance had finally come, and it got ready to pounce the moment that any weavings made contact with it!","And...!","HUUM!","The calm visage of the Infiniverse Megalos Body pressed forward with a perilous and heavy burst of complexity that burst across the corpse of the Vital Fist Emperor- decimating any remnant weavings within it and collapsing them entirely.","|...|","What had remained of the Vital Fist Emperor watched this scene with shock and despair at the failure of resurgence as it wondered before it disappeared entirely.","Who the hell strikes against a corpse with such callous cruelty?!"]},{"number":3376,"title":"Chapter 3376: Chapter 3375 The Wheel Turns As The Wheel Turns! IV","paragraphs":["In a nondescript point of the Expanse, a uniquely complex entity collapsed the last weavings of another that had failed Existence Severing.","Her hands then began to move as she dissected and cut open this entity along with three others, studying their Physiology and makeup before they were turned into threads of weavings under her own unique design.","Quite a distance away from here, there was another complex entity just recently arriving in the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, being led by an infinity symbol pulsing with tentacles as his journey there had depended on legends passed down from eons past.","Legends of an instrument that would come and change the landscape of the Megalos Beyond- legends that this entity grasped for himself whether they truly represented him or not.","Another tremendous distance away from here, Immovable Sacred Legions were already dispatched to catch the scent and obtain weavings of information about a certain entity.","At first glance, these events may not have any correlation whatsoever, and yet the weavings of every single action and reaction pushed the spokes of the Wheel further!","Far from these interactions of complex weavings.","In an area of weavings carrying much greater complexity- an area that Terrestrial Entities nor Constellations Entities would ever be capable of entering unless they utterly transformed everything about themselves.","Within such an area of complexity, a humanoid entity whose body was formed from solid white astral radiance was looking out into an area filled with immense waves of complexity while raising an object in his hands.","The object...seemed to be a clock.","And yet this clock held nine hands that seemed to constantly be moving chaotically, making it very hard to discern anything!","This Entity sighed while he looked at the area of immense complexity while voicing out lightly.","|Even after everything we know, you still interfered, Sir Bob.|","His voice was only for himself, and it seemed to be one of melancholy and helplessness.","Bob.","This white solidified astral entity was gazing towards the weavings of such an entity as the only thing that could be seen currently were hundreds of sharp lines that seemed to be extending from a single singularity.","No, not lines.","Spokes.","Spokes that stemmed from nothing else other than a Wheel.","As this entity thought of this, it counted all the different Spokes of the Wheel that Bob had visited recently.","The different Weavings of the Wheel!","The weavings of the Wheel of Existence came in different forms.","Different variations that held entirely different flows of time and existence itself.","Each Weaving of Existence held a different type of complexity- a different type of Frequency.","Different types of spokes!","In simpler terms, a spoke was a singular rod that extended from the center of a wheel to its rim, with many spokes coming together to support the whole structure of the Wheel and allow it to rotate seamlessly.","To allow countless intricate weavings to flow together.","Countless variations of existence.","Any Wheel had many Spokes holding it up, with some lines of spokes being much more critical than others.","Bob had visited some truly critical Spokes of the Wheel.","The things he did within each were veiled even to this being, but he had heard from others.","Bob wasn't the only one that had moved.","Others had as well.","This made this entity and many others maddened as they knew Bob and those like him held tremendous knowledge- far more than any of them could have over countless lifetimes.","They should know that any interference to any Frequency of the Wheel- to any Weavings of the Wheel they were only supposed to ensure the flow of, would only muddy the waters and cause the rise of more chaos.","They all knew something was coming.","They all knew that it was unavoidable.","So why?","Why did they still muddy the waters while knowing what they knew?!","|...!|","This entity did not have the answer.","So he could only sigh once more.","|The Wheel turns as the Wheel turns.|","...!","|At the end of the day, even we are powerless against it, Sir Bob. Even we cannot stop what is coming. We-|","|Are you talking behind my back ?|","HUUM!","The solidified white astral entity trembled as his words came to a stop, feeling the sensation of the shocking complexity that was Sir Bob behind him as he swallowed hard.","He could feel the round head of this complex entity even without turning around as he heard the serene voice.","|Don't worry too much about the flow of things, little guy. None of us can change much. The individual power any single being can wield is incomparable to the countless complex weavings of the Wheel. If even I tried to fight it, I would be crushed instantly as I would never be able to stop the Weaving of the Wheel for even an instant, much less reverse or alter things within it. Whatever I did won't do much at the end of the day.|","|Haha, the Wheel turns as the Wheel turns...you all have been whispering that so much that a lot of kids are saying it nowadays. Even referring to those they do not understand as cruel. Cruel...do I seem cruel to you? I am just Bob, a harmless little thing on the scales of everything, and you don't see me constantly whispering about the turns of the Wheel. What do you all even know about the Wheel? Simplify things for yourselves and do not worry so much. Come, there is work to be done, and you cannot slack off.|","Brilliance unfurled.","Inside the far distance, hundreds of massive Spokes flowed with order and serenity.","There was one particularly massive Spoke that subtly flashed with a silent radiance.","Nobody saw such a flash of radiance.","Nobody would even know what it meant.","Inside of this Spoke of the Wheel.","Inside of this Weaving of Existence- this Frequency of Existence.","Boundless brilliance was contained within it as in an insignificant corner of it, a Great One in the form of a tentacled infinity symbol led Ozymandias through the gates of a Blancverse radiating seas of Outerversal Authority!"]},{"number":3377,"title":"Chapter 3377: Chapter 3376 The Wheel Turns As The Wheel Turns! V","paragraphs":["|I brought you to this Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse not just to localize you here and lead you to different regions of the Megalos Beyond from here, but also to see if it would be viable for you to grasp an opportunity.|","The Great Mother radiated her intent as Ozymandias listened closely, delving into a Blancverse shimmering with obsidian radiance as massive pulsing tentacles stretched throughout, and obsidian Nests and singularities could be seen anchored in different regions as terrifying auras of Outerversal Morphons were contained within.","In the short while that they had been moving, a figure of an old man appeared in front of them as it was none other than the Observer of Old and Young.","He nodded towards Ozymandias and the Great Mother as he came to follow beside them calmly.","As if he merely wanted to continue being an Observer!","The Great Mother laughed at this and continued.","|In this Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, there is an Existence Severing Great One whose body allows for unique means of increasing complexity. Inside her, the shackles of the slow grind of complexity are loosened greatly as she severed them to a tremendous degree, and any methodology of increasing complexity carried out inside her for the first time will yield terrifying results. If she allows you to step inside of her Severed Existence, we may be able to give you yet another bump in your elevation of complexity to welcome you to the Expanse.|","...!","Her words were shocking ones as Ozymandias listened closely while moving forward.","The murky obsidian region of this Blancverse was slowly showing the massive tentacles flowing like roots at this moment, and the Great Mother floated down to land on a particular tentacle while the rest followed.","Thereafter, a tentacle emerged from her body to form into a horror inducing palm- a palm that touched the massive tentacle below as she spoke!","|The Great Mother seeks an audience with the Great Segregator.|","WAA!","A simple intent that traversed across the tentacle!","And a few seconds after...","HUUM!","An obsidian light flashed that wrapped around their bodies and began pulling them forward- their figures sinking deeper into the pulsating Blancverse thereafter.","Weavings of Outerversal Authority embedded and flowed like a deluge of a black sea as within seconds, their figures slowed down and appeared in an isolated domain.","At the center of this domain, an oscillating obsidian flower floated calmly, the bud of this flower showing an ancient face with filled solemnity as millions of tentacles budded off of it like rose buds.","Its aura was a heavy one as it seemed to exist on its own volition of existence, with its ancient eyes gazing forth at those before it.","|You rarely seek others out, Great Mother. For you to be here...this is for the supposed Instrument of the Beyonder you have found?|","...!","News traveled fast.","Especially when it was related to myths and legends as from one Pantheon to another!","The tentacles of the Great Mother swirled with power as they bent down in slight respect.","|Great Segregator, Netherflower, I came to bid for the Instrument of the Beyonder to increase the level of his complexity for a time within your Severed Domain. Given his accomplishments, I have no doubt that the Great Segregator will also benefit greatly from it.|","...!","Yes.","Her Severed Domain was a unique one as after she tested it cycles ago, it was found that any other entity undergoing great change in their complexity within her Domain faced much fewer restrictions within their existence, and there was a feedback of complexity to the Great Segregator as well!","All she had to do was allow entry and provide the space, and she even stood to benefit from it. And yet...","|What if it is not what you say? What if the gains are minimal for me having to spend a decent amount of effort to open up that Severed Domain?|","A cruel light passed in the eyes of the swaying obsidian flower as the Great Mother answered as if she had expected this part of her nature.","|If I am wrong, the Great Segregator can devour half of my Complexity of Existence.|","...!","A terrifying cost!","But the Great Mother was that confident as beside her, the face of the Observer of Old and Young changed while Ozymandias became stern.","A jagged, cruel laughter erupted from the flower ahead as its face began to open, revealing an endless obsidian stretch of radiance as its intent echoed out.","|I will take that offer. But I am not cruel- I look up to the Great Beyonder as well. You can both enter- if his weavings are as explosive as you say, then even you will be able to benefit from his rise in complexity. If it is nothing to talk about...then I will move to honor your offer.|","Half of her complexity was on the line.","And yet the Great Mother was unfettered as she beckoned to Ozymandias, the two of them being pulled towards the unfurled obsidian flower and flowing into it as they entered a terrifying space.","The moment Ozymandias passed through the mouth of the flower, he felt as if a buzzing weight and noise that was there the entire time faded away.","He felt lighter.","As if there were many things that bogged him down, and this space he was in isolated all of that!","Not entirely, but by a great deal.","|The unique Severed Domain of the Great Segregator. Here, a rise in complexity is many times more potent and faster than outside of it. Just do what you would normally do without worries.|","Beside him, the Great Mother seemed to be smiling with her tentacles as she spoke, Ozymandias gazing at her and the great lengths she was willing to go as he began to think.","When it came to a rise in complexity of the weavings of existence, there were a few means.","But at this moment, he could only think of one thing.","Inside of him, a certain rune was shimmering with brightness once more as, after all this time, the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was ripe once more!","He could dream.","But he didn't know how terrifying the dream would be if it was being done in a space that Severed the weavings of the outside existence entirely!"]},{"number":3378,"title":"Chapter 3378: Chapter 3377 A Dream of a Different Tune! I","paragraphs":["The Great Segregator.","An Existence Severing Eldritch entity in the form of a massive flower.","Currently, the figures of the Great Mother and Ozymandias were within her unique Severed Domain as she had many musings flowing through her.","Many had always paid a great cost to utilize her Severed Domain, with this space being something she uniquely discovered years after she Severed her own existence to be free and unfettered.","After devouring a few entities into this space, an Ordinance Amalgamation creature that struggled and tried to make a breakthrough before his weavings were ground down and collapsed, and this entity was shocked to find that his progress that always seemed stalled and heavy became light and free-flowing!","The last bouts of complexity that evaded him before he could sever his own existence seemed to be coming to him rapidly as he began to increase his complexity, seeking to sever his existence and break out of the Domain of the Great Segregator.","When this entity did this, the Great Segregator discovered her own slow ebb of weavings beginning to move- as if catalyzed by the new weavings advancing within her.","Even though they weren't as complex as hers, the variations and uniqueness in weavings allowed her own to experience a significant advancement.","But of course, she couldn't have an Ordinance Amalgamation entity actually sever his existence with her, no matter if he would be successful or not, so this being who allowed her to initially see the usage of her Severed Domain was decimated by her moments later as he never stood a chance.","Since then, she had made her weavings known as for a cost, genius Outerversal Morphons could step into her Domain and cultivate!","She made gains from it in complexity, and made even further gains once a cost was made for use.","But out of all beings to utilize her Severed Domain so far, only three were truly memorable to her for the extent of advancement they provided.","The first entity who almost Severed his existence.","A Great One that had risen cycles ago whose name was now feared across the Megalos Beyond- the Great Ruler.","And an Outerversal Morphon who advanced from attaining their Eyes of the Megalos all the way to Ordinance Amalgamation in a single year.","A year.","Such an event had caused a shocking commotion to the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, with that Entity having long exceeded the Great Segregator in complexity as he had even Pioneered his own path!","A legend among Outerversal Morphons.","The Great Nexus.","These three beings were the main memorable ones as the Great Nexus cultivating within her Severed Domain had allowed her to cement her position as an Existence Severing expert- very few Outerversal Morphons being able to shake her within this same stage.","After all these cycles, she could tell the moment an entity started increasing their complexity whether they would provide a significant enough boon for her, or whether it would be minimal.","Her own Severed Domain would show a tell purely depending on how much complexity and the degree of freedom an entity gained after escaping the outside weavings of the Expanse or Megalos Beyond. If her Severed Domain vibrated, she was always in a good mood as this meant she could expect a somewhat significant boost in her own complexity.","If an obsidian radiance of the megalos shone within it, even more so!","The Great Nexus had even shown the Manifestation of the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse the moment any sense of shackles were unbound from him as the Great Segregator had made tremendous gains then.","So...what would the supposed Instrument of the Beyonder bring?","'If half of the things they've said about him are true, then I should make suffic-'","RIIP!","A massive, interminable tear instantly bloomed and caused her Severed Domain to vibrate and tumble chaotically.","|Ah....!|","Her intent began to rise in incredulity and confusion as above Ozymandias, a rune of Amarantos flashed with shocking radiance before it released Shockwaves of brilliance- a phenomenal reaction occurring as the simple reality that this rune was activating in a space free from the weavings of existence of the Expanse and Megalos seemed to have triggered a shocking reaction!","Free from the weavings of existence. Free...from the weavings of the Wheel, by a certain extent.","A dream was initiated in such an environment.","And the Great Segregator did not know this, but for the initiation of this dream, the terrifying complexity of an Infiniverse Megalos Seed quite a distance from here was allowed to flow freely to power up this dream!","The complexity of something that had never before emerged.","The ability passed down from the Great Beyonder.","The unique environment brought forth by the Great Segregator.","And Ozymandias himself.","Multiple factors came together to produce an unimaginable result as above Ozymandias, the rune of Amarantos blared with heavy radiance- this entire space fluctuating as stellar obsidian weavings of the Megalos Beyond unfurled around it!","Below, a massive obsidian Primordial Mountain of the Expanse bloomed as above, a Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree emerged and gushed down waves of complexity!","But this wasn't all.","From all around, illusory golden strings of the Expanse itself began to manifest.","Uncountable in number, brilliant in their Manifestation.","Strings of Existence. Strings of the Expanse!","A terrific convergence and recipe for disaster seemed to be blooming here as the rip that had bloomed within this Severed Domain became even more massive, as if it wasn't meant to isolate and sever such a shocking degree of complexity as it was almost collapsing!","Shocked and infuriated, the Great Segregator bellowed out as terrifying droves of her own unique Severed Existence erupted out, flowing voraciously into the Severed Domain and holding it steady as if it collapsed, a large part of herself would collapse as well.","Steadiness came into the domain as she looked with rising rage and incredulity within, wondering if this was a plot from the Great Mother to kill her in their very own Blancverse!"]},{"number":3379,"title":"Chapter 3379: Chapter 3378 A Dream of a Different Tune! II","paragraphs":["But the Great Segregator could see the shock and confusion on the Great Mother herself as her body began pulsing with obsidian light, her form of an infinity symbol beginning to glow as if even she was affected by this rising complexity.","After the brief period of impending doom of her Severed Domain, the moment of stability allowed the Great Segregator to feel a sense of rising horror and shock as from the depths of her weavings, she felt ridiculously complex weavings of Existence arise and begin to proliferate in a way she could have never imagined.","A type of complexity of existence that she seemed far away from.","It rose and began to seethe within her as the moment she stabilized her Severed Domain, she began to feel the boons that came with the ridiculous weavings unfolding within her.","At this moment, she felt like she finally understood as her Severed Domain...seemed to only be getting utilized as a conduit.","It should have merely allowed others to explode with complexity outside the influence of the Expanse and Megalos, but the Instrument of the Beyonder within had enacted enough of a change that now, her Domain was used akin to a passage to allow something that should have theoretically not been possible!","As for what it was, even she didn't know.","All she knew was the rousing complexity that didn't seem to only benefit her, but even the Great Mother within her Domain seemed to be benefiting as her body in the form of an Infinity symbol seemed to be coursing with boundless obsidian waves of brilliance- influenced by the shimmering rune of Amarantos spinning above Ozymandias as at this moment, it let out a blinding light that almost seemed like it wanted to pause everything!","As if this moment would forever be halted in its weavings of time.","Above the blaring rune of Amarantos.","Ozymandias was only able to stare at it for an instant before his vast consciousness buzzed into oblivion, feeling his existence pulled in a way that never occurred before as he came to understand the Dream he initiated this time around...would be an utterly incomprehensible one!","Within the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse.","On this day, many auras within were aroused as near the center of the Blancverse this power belonging to the Megalos Beyond was situated, a glaring obsidian light filled with heavy complexity bloomed for an instant.","Only an instant!","But its complexity was enough to alarm even Existence Severing entities.","—","A dream.","An Outerversal Morphon seemed to be waking up from an endlessly long dream, his weavings feeling fractured and out of sorts as he gathered himself and set his will outwards.","As if he was regaining his vision, he saw that he lay on a field of swaying black gold grass.","He rose as his hands passed through this grass, seeing a humanoid obsidian stellar skin as when he looked at himself fully, he found that he was entirely humanoid in nature- but his body was simply made up of the vastness of the Megalos Beyond itself as he glowed with a dim obsidian stellar radiance.","He rose as his hands passed through this grass, seeing a humanoid obsidian stellar skin as when he looked at himself fully, he found that he was entirely humanoid in nature- but his body was simply made up of the vastness of the Megalos Beyond itself as he glowed with a dim obsidian stellar radiance.","A single wing burning with obsidian flames stretched out behind his back, and a halo of obsidian radiance floated above him.","Soon, he regained more of his cognition as he realized he was not alone.","To his left, there was an entity letting out serene waves of Ordinance Amalgamation and those of Matter, her skin tanned and shining with a bronze hue as her hair glowed with bright gold radiance.","She seemed to be sleeping at this moment, with his gaze on her waking her up at this moment.","Her eyes fluttered to show gold pupils that looked towards him with a happy smile, her exquisite figure rising up at this moment and coming closer to him as she came to rest her head on his lap.","\"We can't keep hiding in this little dream of ours, Archimedes. The Great Instrument of the Beyonder has already made a Decree for all those at Existence Severing and below to gather and prepare for the Incursion into Megalos Nihilos. We cannot delay this any longer.\"","...!","An Entity made of Matter. A human.","She currently looked towards him, Archimedes, an Outerversal Morphon, with love and care.","She wasn't bound to him.","She wasn't a Delegatus.","And yet, they were together.","His head felt a splitting pain as if weavings of memories were about to erupt, scattered and everywhere all at once!","\"Are you okay? I told you not to mess around with the techniques of the Great Beyonder. Only his Instrument is able to use them to perfection as the rest of us cannot compare.\"","In his scattered state, the woman before him grabbed his head tenderly and asked as he blinked and cleared his weavings, some memories returning as he looked around.","He turned his gaze above and spread his will out as he found himself in a massive Omniverse, and outside of it...he could see the start of an even more massive Pantheon in the distance!","An Omniverse and a Pantheon close together.","When his will spread further out, he saw weavings of both Matter and Dark Matter leaking into each other as it seemed like the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Ynnere were mixed together chaotically!","\"Archimedes?\"","The woman before him grasped his head with concern as he shook himself out of his reverie and smiled.","Some memories came back.","Memories of this place.","He forced a smile as he floated up.","\"I'm okay, Lacana. Come on, let's get going.\"","His voice was magnetic as Lacana nodded with hesitation, their figures rising up and shooting out of the small planet within the calm Omniverse where Outerversal Morphons and Lineages linked to Matter could all be seen mixed together.","The two of them went towards a certain sector where the Great Instrument of the Beyonder was gathering all forces under his command as he sought to stretch out his influence across all Megalos!","'The Great Instrument of the Beyonder...'","Archimedes thought this as scattered memories came and went, a rune of Amarantos shining brilliantly within him as his sense of cognition slowly returned.","What he knew of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder also flowed in freely.","An entity of great reverence and power that had managed to expand the Megalos Beyond into the Megalos Ynnere.","He had only glimpsed his brilliance once when this entity was decimating Existence Severing Antediluvian Leviathans.","Moving on four limbs, a massive body radiating brutality and brilliance.","The Great Instrument of the Beyonder, Kurai!","It was not Ozymandias.","It caused Archimedes, who was accepting many fractured memories to wonder.","Exactly where was he?"]},{"number":3380,"title":"Chapter 3380: Chapter 3379 A Dream of a Different Tune! III","paragraphs":["Archimedes!","An Ordinance Amalgamation powerhouses- an Outerversal Morphon that was known as the Great Titan.","This was his identity as among the Ordinance Amalgamation Entities, he was a renowned one.","Finding companionship in a human Ordinance Amalgamation Entity aligned with Matter had caused many to talk behind his back about his preferences, but none dared to say anything to his face.","Under the banner of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder, Kurai, both the forces of the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Ynnere now fell and moved under his command as Outerversal Morphons and Lineages of humans and beasts intermingled!","Gradually over the last thousand years.","And now, a thousand years after the conquest of Megalos Ynnere, the Great Instrument of the Beyonder moved for Megalos Nihilos.","All forces would answer his call and participate, or have their weavings marked for decimation by the Great Instrument of the Beyonder and his Champions.","This, Archimedes and his woman, Lacana, moved towards a Sector that held a portion of the forces of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder- led by an Existence Severing Champion!","\"It's certainly not quiet...\" Lacana raised her brows as they arrived near a bustling Pantheon.","On it, terrifying auras converged as with a single glance, Archimedes could sense a bit over 100 Existence Severing Entities here, a few thousand at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage, tens of thousands of Ordinance of Existence entities, and hundreds of thousands of others below them who had attained the state of Eye of Existence or One With Existence!","It was a terrifying cluster of forces, but it was only a portion of those under the banner of the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Ynnere.","Archimedes could see that at the center of the Pantheon, a massive obsidian Tiger Whale floated with a horrific aura of power, obsidian tentacles leaking from its body as this was the Existence Severing Champion leading forces from this Sector- The Great Demolisher!","Near him, the calm visage of a multicolored Antediluvian Leviathan could be seen as existence itself seemed to be parting ways from him.","Other Existence Severing entities converged around these beings as they waited for the command of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder.","Uniquely, as Archimedes continued to look around these beings, he found a very scant amount of Simians of the Commonwealth!","Not just scant, but none of them really.","He frowned at this as he and Lacana arrived near a cluster of Ordinance Amalgamation entities within a Bazaar, his voice unconsciously leaking out.","\"The Simians of the Commonwealth...\" He had scattered memories regarding this as Lacana stared at him in surprise before replying with a look of pity.","\"Why mention that extinct race? They enraged the Antediluvian Leviathans during the early stages of the Megalos War which eventually led to their defeat. Under the Origin Leviathan, the Commonwealth and all Simians were decimated and erased across history.\"","...!","Simians- extinct!","Such a reality caused Archimedes' mind to buzz as he felt that this Dream...became more and more foreign!","It didn't feel right.","It didn't feel like what he knew.","Outerversal Morphons and Lineages of Matter passed around them in this Pantheon as more and more forces were gathered, until one day- the order came from above to set off.","Above the Pantheon, Existence weaved and split apart as if paper was being torn.","The Great Instrument of the Beyonder had inherited a shocking Transcendental Technique of the Beyonder as his means were too mysterious, allowing for him to open up pathways across the Megalos!","On that day, pathways were opened above multiple Pantheons and Omniverses where the forces of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder were clustered, and the war against Nihilos began.","Archimedes followed the throngs of forces as, with Lacana by his side, they delved across the torn pathway to arrive at a region of white-gray blank space.","A space seemingly filled with emptiness and nothingness, and yet the moment they entered...","SCREE!","From the white blankness, massive gray spiders appeared with spikes, legs, and thousands of eyes, Existence around them having been severed as they bore down towards the coming armies as if they knew exactly where they would appear!","Behind the Existence Severing gray spiders, Legions of obsidian worms also rose and surged out like an endless sea as a terrifying battle started.","A war with Existence Severing entities in the lead, Ordinance Amalgamation Entities taking on a somewhat critical role, and all those below them acting like cannon fodder!","It was long and bloody.","A year passed since the war began, and Archimedes gained a thorough grasp of knowledge on a few regions of the Megalos Nihilos and those that moved within it as he decimated Ordinance of Existence and Ordinance Amalgamation entities while studying their bodies and makeup.","Those who knew of the Great Titan, Archimedes, said behind his back that he had gone crazy after spending so many days in the soft thighs of a human.","The Great Titan merely continued with his research as the war waded on, coming to understand quite a bit regarding the Systems of Existence of those within the Megalos Nihilos!","Another unique point he came to grasp during all this...was his search for those he knew of before.","The Observer of Old and Young.","The Great Mother.","The Great Wheel.","The Great Ponderor.","The Great Segregator.","No weavings of such beings were discovered, and months ago he had grasped onto weavings of the Great Mother in another regiment as when he went to go see...he only observed the visage of a massive octopus with thousands of tentacles at the Existence Severing stage.","Not an entity who was countless tentacles in the form of an infinity symbol.","It was another oddity that made Archimedes realize this dream was far too different, along with the fact that unlike the other Amarantos Dreams of the Megalos he had before, this felt far, far too real!","As if even though it was musings of a Dream, it was actually weavings of existence that seemed to be undeniably occurring all around him.","It was not based on the Megalos that he knew.","It was based on something else entirely as the weavings he found himself in...felt like those of an entirely different frequency of Existence than what he knew!"]},{"number":3381,"title":"Chapter 3381: Chapter 3380 A Dream of a Different Tune! IV","paragraphs":["Archimedes affirmed a terrifying truth as he had been out of it for a whole day, his mind coming to as he found himself on a soft bedding made from the feathers of a dead Phoenix, the visage of Lacana snuggled up beside him while covered by a seam of feathers as she slept peacefully.","On the bedding, he raised his stellar obsidian hands to look at himself as at this time, he felt a sense of disconnect.","As if he knew this body wasn't his, and that it was very real somewhere else entirely.","His eyes became unbearably cold at such a distinction!","Years continued to pass after Archimedes confirmed the state of things, and the war reached a critical juncture.","On a certain day.","10 years into the Megalos War against Nihilos.","In a region of white, gray flames burned all around as massive winged Nematodes led by titanic Nihilos Poxviridae faced the armies of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder.","The Nihilos Poxviridae looked like massive round blobs burning with gray flames, white wings expanding behind them as there were hundreds at the Existence Severing stage looking coldly towards the cluster of Outerversal Morphons, Antediluvian Leviathans, and other races of the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Ynnere!","Archimedes and Lacana were in the middle of their army as Lacana's gaze was cloudy on this day, her voice light.","\"I've heard some weavings about this battle, if...if I do not make it, know that you have my heart with you, always.\"","She raised a foreboding flag right before the battle began as not even seconds later...","CAA!","The white space behind the massive Nihilos Poxviridae split as an aura far exceeding Existence Severing bloomed!","A terrifying Nihilos Marburg worm-like creature appeared- its aura rising to terrifying levels as even the Great Demolisher and other Existence Severing entities on the armies of Ynnere and Beyond turned pale.","This...was a Pioneer!","|Insatiable Ants!|","HUUUM!","|I curse you with endless decay!|","...!","A ring of terrifying gray brilliance erupted from it and spread out towards the army, the Existence Severing entities roaring out with shock and hatred as above them, the skies split again as a stellar obsidian hand stretched out.","It smashed away the oncoming gray brilliance, but some still turned into tendrils of gray lightning that smashed chaotically across the Legions of Ynnere and Beyond!","Any entity that was touched by this terrifying gray brilliance roared out in terror and shock as an Existence Severing Antediluvian Leviathan whose skin shone with purple splendor saw his body shaking as bubbles of pus began to erupt all over him, his weavings rapidly deteriorating.","He had severed his existence as very little could affect him, and yet the tendrils of gray flames bypassed his natural barrier that isolated his existence, jumped onto him, and now he felt like his very weavings were unraveling!","His skin split open as he began to bleed gold blood, this blood turning vile and gray as it became pus moments after.","His mental state rapidly began to deteriorate as his vision gradually faded- utterly horrific events unfolding just seconds after a Pioneer of Existence made a move- even when a large part of its attack was blocked!","The few tendrils that managed to pass through affected everyone alike, whether they were Existence Severing Entities or those that were One With Existence!","A sliver of a tendrils shot out among many as its tremendous speed clashed with multiple entities, until the last shred of it flashed before Archimedes.","It radiated a vile brilliance that would take down at least one more entity, but the moment it was about to strike...","SAA!","The visage of Lacana appeared before Archimedes as her back was slashed open by the gray flames.","\"Ah...\"","Her expression was one of sadness and resignation, her skin rapidly beginning to peel as her existence broke down from a mere residual attack of a Pioneer of Existence!","In the middle of all this, Archimedes bent down and held the body of Lacana while billowing out, seeing her rapidly dissolving existence as in her last moments, she held a smile.","\"You've...been different these last few years, but they were among the happiest I've had...\"","WAA!","Her Ordinance that was fused with her was dismantled and decayed as in a short few seconds, her whole body turned into gray sludge.","\"...\"","Archimedes held what remained as he felt a sense of desolation, raising his head above and roaring as there, in the distance, terrifying entities were facing off.","Every time they came in contact, existence tumbled and shook as if behemoths were treading through it!","The Nihilos Marburg Pioneer roared out with brilliance as it faced a titanic humanoid obsidian Pioneer of Existence, their battle holding mysteries and profundities others could even easily discern as at times, they seemed frozen in place, and at other times, their figures were only flickers of light that couldn't even be seen by the eyes of Existence Severing entities!","But the results of their clash were known far too quickly, a gap in power existing between the two as shockingly, a cry split apart the space of Nihilos, the titanic body of the Outerversal Pioneer briefly appearing in the skies with its obsidian chest cracked.","BOOM!","Pristine globules of blood bloomed from it that the terrifying Nihilos Marburg devoured, but a few globules of blood rolled out and scattered.","One smashed onto an enraged Archimedes as the pressure and weight of this globule of blood alone nearly shattered his existence, his figure thrown far back before he came to a stop.","When he came to, he only found himself grasping and holding a single globule of stellar obsidian blood that trembled with shocking complexity, and above...","The body of a Pioneer was entirely split open as a Nihilos Marburg fed on it rapidly!","The scene left the armies of Ynnere and Beyond in shambles as they all roared to retreat, with the terrifying Pioneer of Existence above not allowing such a thing to happen as it was about to move to massacre!","At such a time.","HUUM!","Existence shook and tumbled as it came with a heavy symphony, space becoming torn open as the terrifying pressure of a creature unheard of in the Megalos bloomed.","The escaping Outerversal Morphons stopped and became elated as they called out.","|The Great Instrument!|","|The Sword of the Beyonder!|","They called out with hope and fervor as terrifying weavings erupted out.","The Nihilos Marburg gazed up with a sense of somberness and trepidation as amidst the billowing eruption of weavings, the visage of Archimedes shook uncontrollably when they appeared as his consciousness became extremely heavy.","The appearance of the coming aura seemed to have triggered something as the moment it bloomed, it actually didn't even focus on the opposing Pioneer of Existence, but instead in the far back Legions where the body of Archimedes held a drop of blood of a Pioneer!","|YOU...!|","A terrifying intent of the Great Instrument bloomed with immense rage as if it recognized something within Archimedes, but before anything else could occur...","BOOM!","The lids of Archimedes that were already far too heavy closed, and a heavy dream came to an end!"]},{"number":3382,"title":"Chapter 3382: Chapter 3381 Appaling Complexity! I","paragraphs":["Inside a certain Dream.","BOOM!","The moment the lids of Archimedes closed, a unique weaving was forever lost within him.","Inside that moment, an expression of relief and sadness overcame Archimedes as near him, the globule of blood of a Pioneer shockingly warped and disappeared from existence entirely!","And an instant later, the terrifying will of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder wrapped around Archimedes- an unfathomable light of pressure and complexity cascading down as the body of Archimedes became crushed into obsidian paste.","The Will within it was decimated, with the weavings of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder seemingly searching for something inside these collapsed weavings as it couldn't find it!","HUUM!","Its weavings shook with interminable complexity as in the distance, the Nihilos Marburg, a Pioneer of Existence became stern as ever so cautiously, it backed away.","The Nihilos Marburg held terrifying weavings of power as a Pioneer, and it regarded the visage of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder with Great caution- even gazing around it as it kept its eyes peeled!","This creature had to have the support of other Pioneers to be able to do what it did with Ynnere, and now the war it was waging against Nihilos.","So the body of the Pioneer of Existence, Nihilos Marburg, looked around cautiously while a large part of its intent was still focused on the veiled visage of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder!","The aura of that entity that was for some reason enraged with someone on its own side was stifling, and it didn't even pay attention to the Nihilos Marburg at this moment as above its massive veiled obsidian visage, the barely observable body of the Great Instrument of the Beyonder vibrated as a terrifying rune swelled up above it.","It was a rune radiating intense fervor and power that read...AMARANTOS!","Amarantos.","But it was extremely solid and filled with complex smaller runes that constantly shifted and changed, with its radiance being so luminous as if it could be used to dream of a terrifying number of things!","It radiated terrifying complexity above the Sword of the Beyonder as at this time, barely a glimpse of its intent could be discerned.","|I will find you.|","|I will find you!|","BOOM!","The massive Rune of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos flashed again and again rapidly as if it were seeking a specific direction- for a specific dream, but it wasn't able to find it.","Terrifying weavings of complexity erupted as a certain Dream...supposedly continued to unfold long after the weavings of Archimedes perished!","—","|Ah...|","The Great Segregator felt her Severed existence trembling as it continued to support the storm of weavings around the Instrument of the Beyonder these past few minutes.","With every passing second that she stabilized her Severed Domain, a burst of complexity erupted from it that reinforced her weavings again and again in ways she didn't know were possible!","The reinforcement felt entirely unique and new as if she had never come across it before in all her cycles of life.","She could feel her degree of complexity increase substantially with every passing second, her emotions unable to jump from alarm to euphoria as she felt like if she didn't focus for even a moment, everything would collapse.","And now...","HUUM!","A burst of obsidian light flashed as the dazzling rune of Amarantos above the Instrument blared with brilliance.","The Great Segregator wanted to curse as she could feel complexity building up again- almost as if for one last burst.","What the hell was happening now?!","Within the Severed Domain.","Eyes alongside a Will fluttered with brilliance as an array of words rose.","|Even with the initial low level of proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, an unsurpassable dream of unique weavings of Existence was experienced due to a convergence of multiple factors.|","|This Unsurpassable Dream has been brought to an end after weavings potentially harmful to you made themselves present.|","|Your proficiency in the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos has been elevated to the Fourth Echelon, with your Proficiency at 88%.|","|Based on this, the weavings of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos you can obtain are somewhat exceptional.|","|All memories of the Unsurpassable Dream are retained.|","...!","The memories of Archimedes flashed within the mind of Ozymandias.","His weavings.","His love for the tragically lost Lacana!","His ambition.","All of it came and went far too quickly. And in the end, all of it collapsed.","Thinking of this, Ozymandias couldn't help but feel melancholic as he knew that Dream...was far too real!","There was a Lacana. There was an Archimedes. And now, their weavings were forever collapsed and gone.","His weavings vibrated brightly as the prompts continued.","|The Weavings of this single Dream can be retrieved, with two out of three components viable for retrieval due to the current Proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.|","|The Components of the Dream capable of being chosen are as follows.|","|Outerversal Physiology Echelon VIII, Megalos Regnum Echelon VIII. 3 Billion Pure Delegatus Channels.]","[Weavings and Research of dozens of Source Complexity of Entities from the Megalos Nihilos. The Full Sword of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability.]","[A Single Globule of Blood of a Pioneer.]","...!","Three dazzling singularities wondrously rose before his eyes as he had to choose between them.","Ozymandias only glanced at them for a moment before the choice was made.","[The full weavings of a Single Globule of Blood of a Pioneer have been retrieved]","[The Full Weavings and Research of dozens of Source Complexity of Entities from the Megalos Nihilos and The Full Sword of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability have been retrieved.]","[Part of the Dream of Outerversal Morphon Archimedes, the Great Titan, has been forever lost.] ...!","Choices were made.","And from these choices, came consequences!","BOOM!","Within the Severed Domain, the voice of the Great Segregator rose up as it felt tumultuous waves of complexity erupting out- a terrifying aura briefly flashing within her space that caused even her to feel trepidation!","It was an aura that far exceeded Existence Severing- its brief flash of brilliance causing her to shudder as just as quickly as this brilliance appeared...it faded!"]},{"number":3383,"title":"Chapter 3383: Chapter 3382 Appalling Complexity! II","paragraphs":["A brief appearance of a truly complex brilliance!","Within the Severed Domain, the Great Mother was closest to Ozymandias as she felt it the most, her visage that was benefiting greatly from this phenomenon standing powerfully at Ordinance Amalgamation as she was able to catch a glimpse!","She saw.","She saw the appearance of a heavy and bright globule of blood that could not belong even to an Existence Severing entity, and it had to be the blood of something far more pristine than that.","Her existence seethed as her tendrils turned blood red- blinded by an intense greed and want that almost made her voraciously surge towards the Instrument of the Beyonder and obtain this globule of blood for herself!","She was horrified by such a thought as she quickly controlled her existence and regained her lucidity.","She almost wanted to bellow out towards the Instrument of the Beyonder for him to reap the rewards of whatever that was before too many eyes turned towards their direction!","That drop of blood.","It caused her to remember the sensation she felt many, many cycles ago when she caught a brief glimpse of that man.","The Great Beyonder himself.","The inkling she got when she gazed at that Great being from afar!","Yet as soon as that flash of a globule appeared, it disappeared just as quickly.","And the body of the Instrument of the Beyonder began to pulse and hum as if trillions of ancient beasts were rioting under his skin, bursts of terrifying pressure and complexity erupting around him as his weavings became utterly intense!","Intense and so bright that the tendrils of the Great Mother observing everything and siphoning off some of the gains within this space were forced to pull back.","BZZZT!","The spare around him flickered as his erupting complexity was reigned in, as if a titanic beast that had unleashed its aura was being closed off in a deep space and sealing everything momentarily.","Only then did his eyes open wide as above, the dazzling rune of Amarantos faded!","|An Impossible boon is coursing across your weavings of Existence.|","|Stemming from a distant Dream, a drop of blood that contains the scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer flows within you and is becoming assimilated into your existence.|","|Your own complexity is rising by a large amount, your Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum advancing within tremendous leaps.|","...!","His Megalos Regnum and Outerversal Physiology.","There was a reason why he didn't choose those of Archimedes that had already attained the Eighth Echelon!","He had an inkling that the assimilation of the drop of Blood of a Pioneer may just get him there.","There was that, but it was not all.","Something he entirely did not expect.","|The scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer have been determined to belong to the Great Pioneer, Ashandus. On the 100th Cycle of his life, he severed all attachments and weavings that bound him, attaining a Severed State of Existence. On the 200th Cycle of his life, he finished roaming the vast Megalos Beyond and finally Pioneered his own weavings above Severing. A drop of his blood has generated the capability for you to Sever a single, small aspect of your own weavings, including but not limited to Individual Concepts, Individual Values, Individual Techniques...|","...!","|Anything Severed will be unshackled from the common norms of existence, even allowing you a sense of definition for the individual severing.|","\"...\"","Ozymandias gazed at the brilliance of the blood coursing through him as his Regnum buzzed with grandiosity.","He could choose to sever a small, individual part of himself.","Not something as major as the soul or origin.","Not something that made up a core part of him.","Something individual.","Something small.","But even this was utterly insane as what did it mean to Sever?","This was something only possible after one had their entire existence amalgamated to a single thing- with their complexity raised to a terrifying level as only then could they have the chance to sever their entire existence","The single Drop of Blood of a Pioneer...actually granted such an obscene capability!","HUUM!","As the weavings of Ozymandias buzzed.","The space they were in flickered and trembled as they felt a rejective force taking them out.","The Great Mother and Ozymandias alike were spat out of a massive swaying flower whose face was panting at this moment, tendrils of stellar obsidian authority surging around it as its complexity had experienced a major jump!","Yet its expression was ashen and filled with alarm at this moment as its face stared towards Ozymandias somberly.","It had to eject them.","Because at this moment, in her small domain within the Blancverse, dozens of eyes had appeared and were staring towards her.","Towards them!","The auras terrifyingly raged from Ordinance Amalgamation to Existence Severing- multiple Great Ones appearing in this region as they were all drawn in by the shocking amount of complexity exploding here.","And they were further pulled in by the flash of a brilliance that came and went for the span of an instant!","But at this moment, it all faded.","The Great Segregator panted as at this moment, she realized just how tremendously her complexity had risen as she looked towards the calm visage of an obsidian humanoid Outerversal Morphon and spoke out.","|What brings so many faces to my domain? We are merely aiding the Instrument of the Beyonder in his rise of complexity!|","She could sense their voraciousness.","So she spoke out with a burst of complexity to remind them where they were, while her massive swaying body appeared in front of Ozymandias!","At this moment, as she felt her elevated complexity, she had thoroughly become a believer.","He was the Instrument of the Beyonder? Sure, why not!","If he could do what he just did within her domain again- and this time she would be even better prepared to ensure her Severed Domain did not come to a risk of collapse, then she would believe any status he was giving himself.","At her words, half the crimson eyes peering here pulled back and faded.","Another half remained a little longer, as a few began to come forward- their auras not showing any hostility.","|Great Segregator, Great Mother, why did we not get alerted that the Instrument of the Beyonder was here? We would have joined in the celebrations.|","...!","A massive obsidian Deep Pantheon Octopus floated forward, others coming forward alongside it as they wanted to understand just which Outerversal Morphon had walked into the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse!","As for the being in question, 90% of his weavings weren't even focused on the pleasantries of Ordinance Amalgamation and Existence Severing entities- they were on the musings of the drop of Blood of a Pioneer coursing through him!"]},{"number":3384,"title":"Chapter 3384: Chapter 3383 Appalling Complexity! III","paragraphs":["A single dream held too many implications.","Ones that Ozymandias had to take into account and think of deeply.","Through this Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, he had discovered different weavings of existence that opened up a whole new avenue of possibilities.","A whole new world he needed to understand.","The Rune of Amarantos shone with a brighter hue than ever as he knew it was the key to those different Weavings of Existence, in addition to the complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the unique environment of the Severed Domain provided by the Great Segregator.","All were required!","So when the drop of blood of a Pioneer coursed through him, and he had the chance to sever something individual and something small, he was currently leaning towards the only key he currently had to explore weavings he didn't know existed!","As he thought of this, the small domain of the Great Segregator became filled with Outerversal Morphons, the Great Mother and Segregator doing all the talking as Ozymandias made it seem like he was still acclimating to his elevated complexity.","It gave him time to organize everything as he thought of Pyrrhus.","The weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, and all other Megalonians for that matter, cultivated in a way where they utilized possible versions of themselves across the Megalos.","Possible versions born from their choices.","But all of them stemmed from the same Weaving of Existence.","A single body, simply utilizing possible variations of this body by sheer possibilities across the Megalos.","Meanwhile, the Amarantos Dread showed that in other Weavings of Existence, one may not even exist to have any possibilities!","Ozymandias wasn't able to find the Great Mother or the Great Wheel, and the Simians were actually extinct with the Commonwealth not existing in those Weavings of Existence.","But, the Great Instrument of the Beyonder was there.","And before Archimedes collapsed, weavings of that entity had surged towards him as this Great Instrument...was not kind towards Ozymandias!","Someone who was taking over its distinction.","Did this mean that at this moment, there was another Great Instrument of the Beyonder that had risen in the Megalos Beyond, but was just yet to be discovered?","Ozymandias thought of this as his weavings cycled rapidly, the choice in what he had to sever becoming more and more firm.","For the different weavings of existence, only a single thing was there to stabilize everything.","Something many looked up to as all states of Existence were connected to getting ever closer to it, gradually becoming unbound and forging one's own path in relation to it!","It was none other than the Wheel of Existence.","He recalled all the many things he had heard and experienced regarding this.","The Commonwealth.","The Simians.","The Outerversal Morphons.","All of them spoke about the turning of the Wheel. About the purity of existence in relation to the Wheel!","For him to better understand what he had just experienced in the most recent Amarantos Dream- what it truly was and how he could get into it again...he had to gain a bit more information on the Wheel of Existence!","And so.","\"Sever.\"","While the Great Mother was exchanging pleasantries with others.","She swore that she heard a terrifying word that made her tentacles begin to tremble, her gaze going towards Ozymandias as she wanted to make sure she heard right!","Sever?","Sever?!","He had just declared his Ordinance as he hadn't even amalgamated with it, what did he mean sever?! He wasn't actually trying to sever his existence even before undergoing Ordinance Amalgamation, right?!","With trepidation, the Great Mother turned her will to focus on Ozymandias as apart from his brimming complexity...she didn't feel anything else.","No heavy eruption of weavings, and no crazy complexities suddenly breaking out.","|...|","Was she wrong?","Nothing shocking boomed out from Ozymandias even after he had uttered a heavy word, but it wasn't because he truly wasn't Severing something at this moment.","He did use the power of the drop of blood of the Pioneer to sever an individual thing. An individual concept.","But the source of this concept lay in another part of him!","So through the unshakable connection with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed. Through the intricate weavings between his souls shared between them.","The terrifying weavings of the Blood of the Pioneer that could sever a single, small part of himself flowed from Ozymandias and went towards another part of the Expanse!","What he severed was not the rune of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.","It was a key, yes.","But he needed a door.","And the door was the one thing that contained all weavings.","The Wheel of Existence!","Across the Expanse.","Far away from the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse where a portion of the Outerversal Morphons lay.","In a region where a Blancverse floated serenely behind, a man and woman radiated heavy waves of complexity were looking at the broken-down weavings of the existence of three Anti-Matter Ordinance Amalgamation entities and the remnant corpse of the Vital Fist Emperor!","It had been a moment of research to grasp the weavings of Anti-Matter, and all of this research was elevated to another level when the rewards of the life of Archimedes flowed into Ozymandias.","Years worth of dissection and understanding of the Source of Existence of Anti-Matter.","What he found was the initial study that allowed him to see the fundamental makeup of Anti-Matter beings' weavings of fundamental particles he termed Positrons, Antiprotons, and Antineutrons.","And from all the tests conducted, whenever these fundamental particles of Anti-Matter came in contact with Matter or Dark Matter, there was only a single conclusion.","Annihilation.","Not an unstable explosion or rejection between the two sides, but sheer Annihilation as everything regarding the involved particles became destroyed and released energy in the form of gamma rays- throwing out heavy and terrifying swathes of unstable complexity of existence in the form of unstable radioactive decay of the most fundamental makeup of Matter, Anti-Matter, and Dark Matter!"]},{"number":3385,"title":"Chapter 3385: Chapter 3384 Appalling Complexity! IV","paragraphs":["It meant any inclusion of Anti-Matter into Noah himself at this moment would simply result in the breakdown of his existence.","Any Source of Existence he added to his Atlas at this moment would not be supported, as the only thing it would lead to was a shocking collapse and terrifying release of complex radioactive decay of weavings of existence themselves!","The Three Body Problem.","It wasn't so easy to solve as two bodies may have been easy to mix and stabilize, but the moment a third body came, everything went haywire.","The Shield of the Commonwealth, Old Man Eudemus, had been stuck here trying to understand for eons and nothing came of it.","To this day, there was no solution to the Three Body Problem.","Even in the different weavings of existence where Archimedes was in, the Great Instrument of the Beyonder was seeking to solve this Three Body Problem as he had already laid siege and conquered the Megalos Ynnere, and he had begun his incursion into Megalos Nihilos!","And yet by the time Archimedes perished, there were no solutions.","When he arrived here, Noah wasn't daunted nor did he feel like he faced a major setback.","Because he thought of the Fat Monkey.","He thought of the Tzar Versepiercer!","He thought of his Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction and wondered just how terrifying they would become if he could incorporate Anti-Matter into them in addition to the already impressive mix of Matter and Dark Matter!","||I'll start on this project, Master. And-||","HUUM!","An explosion of terrific power erupted through the Infiniverse Megalos Body and through Noah at that moment, the weavings that Ozymandias sent forth arriving as they carried with them the unique power to Sever.","And the target of severing was something that was held deeply within Noah- within his Atlas of Existence!","It coursed through him with indomitable splendor and focused itself on none other than the Source of Existence of Kuklos.","Of the Wheel!","...!","Inherited from the Simians.","From the Commonwealth that said they stood to protect the Weavings of the Wheel.","The purity of the Wheel.","They lived their lives seeking to emulate the Wheel of Existence in their structures and their systems as they sought greater control- which only meant a smoother advancement across the states of Existence as they got closer and closer to the Wheel of Existence!","Noah did not doubt that once reaching a sufficiently high enough state of existence, one may be able to look at the Wheel with great clarity.","Maybe beings like Bob, who came and went with ease, were at this stage.","But at this moment- deep within him, something was cleaved.","Cut.","And the closest and most accurate description he could state to describe what this cleaving truly did...was that this whole time, he only held a counterfeit golden wheel in his Atlas of Existence.","And after this cleaving, this counterfeit Wheel had its fake layer decimated, and something real within it arose.","A true Wheel.","A True Source of Existence of Kuklos!","As if what the Commonwealth chased and sought to emulate this whole time was only a shadow of the Wheel, and Noah was, at this moment, actually looking at a genuine one.","HUUM!","The nearby golden strings of the Expanse pulsed.","As if it were the norm for Noah, a dazzling mountain appeared below and gushed out waves of authority while a dazzling tree appeared above.","He nearly sighed with the over-the-top absorption of energy that always occurred in the Expanse as if every time, it wanted to alert and let others know that someone else was making great gains within it.","But with the appearance of the dazzling mountain and tree, Noah's existence was able to feed the terrifying complexity rising within the Source of Existence of Kuklos- his surroundings beginning to be painted gold as with his body as the center, dozens of spokes began to erupt around him.","Spokes.","Lines that made up the core part of a Wheel.","They constructed with him at the center as after extending a certain distance, they stopped as a ring of golden light formed around and connected the Spokes of this blooming Wheel!","It emanated terrific power as the absorption of the authority of the Expanse only became more intense, with Noah's weaving pulsing maddeningly.","|The System of Existence, Kuklos, has been Severed by the power carried in the Drop of Blood of the Pioneer of Existence, Ashandus.|","|Something was Severed, but the tool used for the Severing was anothers. Due to this, a small Weaving of Causality has formed between you and the Pioneer of Existence, Ashandus.|","|The Source of Existence of Kuklos has been elevated to become the Severed Source of Existence of Kuklos. The limitations and bounds of what it could achieve under weavings of Existence have greatly changed, with the extent of what these changes are requiring analysis and practice.|","...!","Many prompts came and went, but there was one that Noah did not like.","An Entanglement with the one that this Severing power originally belonged to- the Pioneer of Existence, Ashandus!","But he watched this being die.","Decimated by the terrifying Nihilos Marburg worm.","And yet at this moment, he was entangled with it as the effects of this were unknown. He proceeded forward cautiously as he now had to try the reason for Severing Kuklos to begin with, his existence radiating a terrifying light as above him, a radiant rune of Amarantos began to manifest.","Ozymandias had his Dream, and Noah was also due for his.","But unlike Ozymandias, Noah did not have the Severed Domain of an Existence Severing Entity.","He instead...had a Severed Source of Existence of Kuklos at this moment!","So he initiated the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.","He put the complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology into it.","He put the complexity of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian into it. And around him, the extremely real golden Wheel began to spin.","\"Dream...\"","He whispered gloriously as all of these factors came into play!","And the Wheel around his body vibrated with terrific radiance as above him, the rune of Amarantos flashed- its light landing on one of the many spokes of the Wheel around Noah as moments later, his consciousness faded away as he fell into a deep slumber!"]},{"number":3386,"title":"Chapter 3386: Chapter 3385 Appalling Complexity! V","paragraphs":["Light years away from Noah's current position.","Where he used to be when the Daughter of Existence, Sentara, was decimated by the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","|Here?|","An intent echoed out as groups of tremendously powerful Ordinance Amalgamation entities floated in the golden strings of the Expanse.","There were a dozen in each group, with there being 4 groups here as each one was being led by an Ordinance Amalgamation entity that far exceeded others in that same group.","Immovable Sacred Legions of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","They exceeded the power of any other entities of the same stage as they were successful in doing something very few even had access to.","Modus Operandi for the weavings and utilization of their complexity of existence that allowed them to erupt with power multiple times greater.","The one who had spoken was a man with vibrant blue hair and eyes, his gaze steady as at this moment, his body lit up with intricate lines that looked like...circuits.","Circuits!","They flashed over his body in intricate ways as they seemed to originate from a single point at the center of his body- a point that if one looked truly close, they would observe a shimmering rune!","As if a heavy engine was being turned on, the bustling complexity of this being pulsed before he looked in a certain direction.","|The Blancverse moved in that direction. Follow steadily and alert the other groups. We are only at the observation stage as we will not engage with the enemy.|","|Understood!|","The Immovable Sacred Legions moved with order and power.","In the Expanse, even if they came across an Existence Severing entity, they didn't hold fear of perishing.","They tracked the scent of a certain being while under orders of other entities that they didn't even know the true aims of, events being put in motion as nobody knew just what they would lead to!","—","As if one was waking up from a long slumber.","The fluttering of the eyes was rapid as a slumber ended, and an entity opened their eyes.","They saw...the appearance of a gigantic multicolored tree that rose up endlessly, and they were seated in a meditative position atop a flowing river of clear water that gravitated around this area!","Hundreds of other tendrils of vibrant rivers floated serenely around this massive tree, the bodies of entities pulsing with vibrant radiance of purity also being seen as they were all in seated positions as if they were patiently waiting for someone.","Memories came and went.","As the awakened beings looked at the surroundings and even further beyond, he confirmed he was in a special domain that seemed like an Omniverse, but his awareness could not spread outside of it!","And in this domain...the vibrant life forms that were Antediluvian Leviathans filled it with abundance.","In the area they were in, the massive tree that looked suspiciously close to the Tresorverse Primaltree of Existence, albeit smaller, was surrounded by Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence Antediluvian Leviathans.","The Awakened being felt the vibrant Ordinance of Moirai coursing through his being, not yet amalgamated, and yet shining with complexity as he didn't seem too far away!","He was...Boros. An Antediluvian Leviathan whose very being was aligned with Moirai as he thought to understand the profundities of fate and causality.","He was waiting like all others here as the long wait that all Ordinance of Existence and Ordinance Amalgamation Antediluvian Leviathans were experiencing came to an end as at this moment...","HUUM!","An austere aura emerged from a singularity and floated at the midpoint of the trunk of the massive Primaltree of Existence- this visage shining with multicolored radiance as it was none other than...","|Omnifather.|","|Omnifather!|","The Antediluvian Leviathans called out respectfully and with fervor as they all looked up towards this being!","He smiled with astral radiance as his whole body emanated terrifying waves of power, his appearance acting like a signal as in the next moment, multiple Existence Severing auras also appeared in the surroundings.","The Omnifather.","Boros, waking up in these weavings and affirming his identity, confirmed that similar to a previous dream that Ozymandias had, this dream of his was something far too put together and real!","He kept his gaze down and didn't focus on the Omnifather himself out of an abundance of caution, and this entity began to speak as soon as he appeared.","|After cycles of wading across the Expanse, I can expand a bit on all that I've learned. Those at the Ordinance of Existence level have barely reached the qualifications to understand this and get a head start, but do not be deterred if you cannot pick up anything, okay?|","...!","The voice of the Omnifather was magnetic and filled with tremendous confidence, every single word causing one's weavings to buzz!","Looks of reverence spread out from all around as the Antediluvian Leviathans looked up to him with fanaticism.","Even the Existence Severing Antediluvian Leviathans in the background had looks of respect and somberness towards this being as he smiled and continued!","|Since the earliest records of weavings of existence, all beings rise and reach out towards the Source of Existence itself. They start off by increasing the complexity of their existence- their body, origin, and soul as a variety of means can be used towards this. The Rules that allow for existence to flow are grasped as their understanding takes one ever closer. Life, Death, Light, Dark, Entropy...anything that allows the flow of existence can be grasped to bring one ever closer, until...one follows their selected extremes and understands its complexity so much to become one with it. To become One With Existence.|","WAA!","The eyes of the Antediluvian Leviathans were bright as they felt like they were listening to the order of existence- listening to a lecture that could very well outline their path for the future!","|Attaining a State of Existence allows one to truly start understanding the nature of things, with the realization of the distant and unfathomable Wheel of Existence becoming their main goal. A goal that everyone has been running towards for many cycles now. But...when one gets closer and closer to the Wheel of Existence, they came to understand that they were also further and further away as there still existed a huge chasm they could never cross. As if there was a huge barrier between them and the Wheel that could never be crossed. Ordinance Amalgamation entities felt this, and even those lucky enough to Sever and establish their very own Weavings of Existence felt this. An unsurpassable and uncrossable rift!|","HUUM!"]},{"number":3387,"title":"Chapter 3387: Chapter 3386 Appalling Complexity! VI","paragraphs":["The weavings of all listening Antediluvian Leviathans began to tremble as they felt like they had arrived at a precipice.","The reason that the Omnifather gathered them all here today!","This multicolored being smiled as he looked around the Primaltree of Existence, gazing at the myriad of individual Antediluvian Leviathans as he posed a question.","|Runes...what do you all know about his concept?|","...!","Runes.","The moment he asked this, many Antediluvian Leviathans were confused while some Ordinance Amalgamation and Existence Severing Leviathans began to radiate a terrific light of brilliance.","Receiving no answer, the Omnifather continued.","|Runes...actually became a solution to the unsolvable problem of an uncrossable chasm. Over time, many came to learn that it was entirely a barrier of communication that existed between them and the Wheel of Existence, where no matter how far they traversed across the states of Existence, they still felt far away. The Wheel of Existence seemed to have an entirely different methodology of communication as, after eons, a few Great entities came to understand a type of language to breach that chasm and better communicate with the Wheel of Existence- Runes.|","WAA!","As he spoke.","His hand twirled as within it, a singularity filled with extreme heaviness bloomed.","It looked like the strokes of ancient letters coming together as just its appearance caused a stifling sensation to those in the surroundings!","|That is what Runes are- what they were discovered to be. A type of language. Something that made it easier to communicate and grasp the profound weavings that keep Existence flowing. They can seem small, but they are unique because they can compact a tremendous amount of weavings and complexity...into a single small letter. A Single Rune.|","...!","As Boros listened, the will within him was pulsing with brilliance as Noah thought about many things.","Runes.","The Transcendent Megalos Abilities designed by the Great Beyonder.","After one inherited the Transcendent Megalos Ability, a rune formed within their existence as any time they sought to activate it, they simply had to infuse complexity of existence into it!","This...was even what Noah had done to arrive in this Dream.","He had activated the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos by infusing terrifying droves of complexity of existence...into the AMARANTOS Rune.","Paired with the Severed Source of Existence of Kuklos and the terrifying Complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, he arrived here.","In this supposed dream.","In these different Weavings of Existence.","All from the utilization of a single Rune!","A single rune made many things possible. The Rune of Amarantos Dream of the Megalos made it possible to attain the Blood of a Pioneer by someone who was only in the Ordinance of Existence stage. And the utilization of this Blood to sever a part of himself!","A drop of blood...to sever a part of oneself.","Wait.","\"...\"","His weavings buzzed for a small moment of realization.","As the Omnifather showed the terrifying complexity of a single rune he conjured up, Noah took a moment to reflect on a single rune and the terrifying thing he had done due to what he obtained through it.","He had Severed a Small Part of himself.","A small part for him was a single concept- Kuklos.","A single Source of Existence.","This was small for him, and he had been able to Sever it with the drop of Blood of Pioneer that was somehow able to be brought back to him from Archimedes and cross unknown distances to enter his weavings of existence through the Amarantos Rune.","And then, a small part of him- a single Source of Existence which he held multiple of, was Severed due to it.","But this small part of himself...if Old Man Eudemus was put forth on his behalf, this was everything to him!","He only had the single Source of Existence of Kuklos as, at this moment, Noah had managed to sever it even before he underwent Ordinance Amalgamation with Kuklos.","He Severed it before his existence Amalgamated with it.","He hadn't even stopped to ask whether it was possible, and simply did it after taking the boon that was the Drop of Blood of a Pioneer that stemmed from a journey in other weavings of existence...initiated by a Rune.","A rune designed by the Great Beyonder!","|Being such an intricate language, Runes of Existence can be utilized to do a great deal of things, with one only truly able to speak this language and understand it themselves when their complexity gets close to Ordinance Amalgamation. And even then, if one seeks to design their own Rune for any unique purpose, they may only be able to design the lowest tier of a Rune of Existence- like the one in my hands. It is merely a type of a Terrestrial Rune of Existence.|","...!","The words of the Omnifather continued as he looked around and then pointed towards an Ordinance of Existence Antediluvian Leviathan who was looking towards him with awe.","|You. Strike against this broken Pillar of the Expanse with as much strength as you can.|","WAP!","The surroundings flickered as instantly, a massive gray stone-like pillar appeared and floated before their eyes. The Antediluvian Leviathan picked by the Omnifather adopted a solemn expression as his body was aflame with a crimson light of none other than the Ordinance of Destruction- and it struck out heavily while crossing Great distances to smash onto the broken Pillar of Existence as...","BZZT!","A single white scratch appeared.","...!","The eyes of the Antediluvian Leviathan trembled as in the distance, the Omnifather nodded.","|Mmm, sufficient. That can be considered a peak power of an Ordinance of Existence entity. Now, Destruction is not my Ordinance, nor is it a path I've been following. But...|","HUUM!","His hand tapped out once more.","And with the tap, utterly appalling waves of complexity of existence erupted as a blinding white singularity bloomed- its outline being hazy to many as it was a Rune!","|Even without truly understanding Destruction, if I can lay out a single rune that is able to communicate with it, I can command this Weaving of Existence to act on behalf of my complexity and...|","The White rune flashed with radiance as it instantly burst into crimson brilliance that shot towards the pillar that an Ordinance of Existence entity had only managed to leave a scratch on, and....","BOOM...CRACK!","The entire pillar was decimated as debris flew about everywhere.","|Runes.|","The voice of the Omnifather was heavy.","|If you can learn this advanced language. If you can begin communicating with the Wheel of Existence in a frequency actually acceptable towards it, you will come to find many things deemed impossible...a mere reality.|","...!"]},{"number":3388,"title":"Chapter 3388: Chapter 3387 Runes of Existence! I","paragraphs":["The Antediluvian Leviathans were stupefied.","They gazed towards the Omnifather as if they were looking at a prized treasure, and out of the corner of the Primaltree of Existence, a voice echoed out.","|How do we get started, Omnifather?|","It was the voice of an Existence Severing Antediluvian Leviathan.","They radiated a blue radiance all over their bodies as expansive cerulean wings extended behind them, but their eyes seemed to be those of someone greatly seeking to learn at this moment!","At the question, the Omnifather only smiled before replying.","|Like anything that had come before, you learn with practice. Others had no teacher as they had to figure the path out themselves, while you all have someone who can provide guidance. Once your complexity approaches Ordinance Amalgamation and beyond, you will be able to more easily understand the intricacies of Runes of Existence and eventually become capable of designing simple runes yourselves. To get you all familiar with Runes, I will impart a rune I've been designing that has exceeded the bounds of Terrestrial Runes and stepped forward to become a Minor Constellation Rune of Existence. I call it...The Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence. A single rune that contains within it a methodology to aid one in increasing the output of their weavings of existence by at least 150%. You will have this in your weavings as you should familiarize yourselves with it and its mysteries. Its design, its flow...if you can decipher and analyze any of these, it will make the next few steps even easier. There will be some of you with talent in this, and there will be others without. Do not falter, and keep trying.|","...!","The eyes of Boros became extremely sharp as Noah's will within observed the Omnifather tap his finger out hundreds of times in an instant, and dazzling purple runes carrying heavy brilliance formed and shot out towards every single Antediluvian Leviathan here.","A Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence!","Was this not the same as the Quintessential Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi that Entities were fighting for at this very moment in his weavings of Existence?","For them to gain control of Quintessential Tresorverse Towers of Existence, of which there were only 9 of!","Yet here, the Omnifather freely gave hundreds of such runes to hundreds of Antediluvian Leviathans.","At this moment, within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather, a singularity was extinguishing as Noah would gain control of an Origin Tresorverse Tower of Existence that would grant him the Origin Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi- it turned out this inheritance would have been a type of Rune of Existence even more advanced than the one that at this moment....","SAA!","Bloomed before him.","Gloriously purple as it showed off its unbound tyranny, and yet waves of deep and intricate Complexity flowed around and within it.","Boros, like all other Antediluvian Leviathans, raised their hands forward and grabbed onto this dazzling rune as it became a streak of light that shot into their bodies!","And the moment it did so...","HUUM!","Their weavings of existence buzzed.","The Constellation Rune of Existence settled into the center of their being as it flashed with power and automatically activated the first time, instantly causing brilliant circuits to bloom and settle in the weavings of existence of every single entity containing this Rune of Existence!","Circuits.","Meridians!","Lines that divided and set up roads across weavings of existence- roads that glow across one's weavings to form a system of circulation akin to an empowered engine coming to life.","When the Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence settled within Noah, he felt his complexity utilized to automatically activate it as a dense number of Meridians stretched across his existence- 64 to be exact!","64 dazzling circuits- dazzling meridians that looked like vibrant vessels that were there purely for the purpose of the rapid acceleration and increase in output of weavings of existence.","They hummed like an ancient engine waking up as seconds later, Boros felt his body brimming with twice as much potency compared to before.","His complexity remained the same...but what he could release was increased by more than a factor of two!","Over the skin of his body, the purple Meridians flashed and made the golden light of Moirai seem even more penetrative, its complexity seeming a notch higher.","|Study this rune. Familiarize yourselves with as much of it as you can. It exceeds the boundary of Terrestrial Runes of Existence, but its complexity will make it so that if you understand even a percentage of it, you can already start deciphering and designing Terrestrial Runes of Existence thereafter. I will be back in a year to continue.|","A year.","This was how much time they were given to grasp and understand as much as they could.","Boros, an Ordinance of Existence entity whose body was filled with Moirai placed his whole focus and weavings into this Rune and the dazzling meridians it allowed to course through him.","His input of weavings was taken off moments later as he couldn't sustain and power up the rune constantly, but it remained within his weavings of existence as he studied every single angle and form he could- trying to decipher its complexity and mystery!","Inside these weavings of existence- inside this dream, he didn't have the weavings of the Protagonist, Infinity, Mana, Quintessence, or even the terrifying complexity of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed. He only had his Will.","But this alone wasn't enough to recreate his overpowered sense of being as progression within this Dream, within these weavings...were always slow.","So he would take as much time as he had to analyze the shocking rune that presented itself, and at the same time...the Amarantos Rune that glowed calmly within him!","This Rune was one of the few things still retained within this dream as it lay there silently until the time came for the dream to end.","It felt...even heavier and more complex than even the Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence.","Noah began studying them both in conjunction.","How they were different. How they were the same. Whether they were both Constellation Runes of Existence- just a large gap existing between them.","All these questions and more buzzed within the weavings of Boros for the next weeks and months!"]},{"number":3389,"title":"Chapter 3389: Chapter 3388 Runes of Existence! II","paragraphs":["A new language!","The methodology to communicate with the Wheel of Existence was that of Runes of Existence, with entities of higher power utilizing them to achieve unimaginable feats.","The Great Beyonder and his Transcendent Megalos Abilities.","The Omnifather and his Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi.","All of them and more had delved into the Runes of Existence as now, Noah began to study their shocking complexity as well.","In the dazzling dream, a year passed relatively quickly under the perception of the Antediluvian Leviathans who lived for cycles.","And as promised, the figure of the Omnifather blazed with brilliance and reappeared on the midpoint of the trunk of the Primaltree of Existence, many Leviathans rousing to look at him while his multicolored figure smiled!","|A year has gone by as the gauge of whether you have any degree of ease in the Runes of Existence is done. Embarking on grasping this language seems to have many unknown factors around it, but one's own complexity of existence is one thing, and the type of Source of Existence is another, with some even saying the purity of existence allows one to forge Runes of Existence with greater success, ease, and complexity. Do not despair if you did not grasp too much in the last year- we will put things into practice today.|","...!","The Antediluvian Leviathans were roused as they looked ahead with anticipation.","|Let's start off with the lowest Terrestrial Rune of Existence, the Rune of Blanc that can change to take on any weavings. Its complexity isn't as much as the Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune due to what it seeks to achieve, and this is how one would draw it.|","Everyone watched with bated breaths as they saw the potent weavings of the Omnifather leak from him and transform into small, intricate fine strokes that showed off the construction of a Rune.","It wasn't easy.","With every fine stroke, a sense of balance and harmony had to be maintained. With every stroke, one had to converge a tremendous amount of complexity in an extremely small area and continue to do so for another thousands of strokes.","The Rune of Blanc- one of the lowest Terrestrial Runes of Existence...held more than a few thousand strokes simply to bring to existence as after the Omnifather was done, a blinding white rune floated before everyone's eyes.","Whoever looked at it would see it read- Blanc!","After many intricate weavings of existence made it, one could now take it and choose any weaving of existence to fill this Rune of Blanc.","A few thousand strokes.","The Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence they had been studying this past year had at least a million strokes that all came together intricately to form this rune, while the Amarantos Rune of Existence...held at least 10 million unique strokes all around.","This was a guess from Noah based on what he had seen so far as he had not managed to understand all the strokes contained in the Runes he studied- just roughly an approximation!","But the Rune of Blanc...seemed much simpler as every Antediluvian Leviathan here tried to duplicate what the Omnifather had just done- to follow all the few thousand strokes he made.","Nobody was able to succeed on their first try.","Not the Existence Severing Entities, and certainly not the Ordinance of Existence Entities!","For many, even starting a few strokes with their vibrant and heavy complexity didn't allow the strokes to remain still as everything fizzled out even before a hundred strokes could be made.","|Failure results in the depletion of your weavings of existence, but with every failure, your understanding of the Runes of Existence will increase.|","Nobody had succeeded on their first try, but over the next day...","HUUM!","Multiple blinding white singularities bloomed on the periphery where the Existence Severing entities were, a few of them managing to complete a single Terrestrial Rune of Existence due to their own sheer depth of complexity!","When they did so, their weavings pulsed with a serene light of brilliance as the complexity they held this whole time seemed to increase slightly just from this recent practice of Rune formation.","The Omnifather nodded towards the Existence Severing Antediluvian Leviathans and continued.","|If successful, continue forming as many more Runes of Existence as you can and increase your rate of success and understanding. You will come to see that the familiarization of Runes of Existence and even forging them is a tremendous practice in increasing the complexity of your own weavings of existence. But for variation, here is another Terrestrial Rune of Existence, The Rune of Erasure...|","Vibrant lights formed around the Omnifather as he constructed another Rune of Existence under the watchful eyes of all.","With their spirits invigorated, the Antediluvian Leviathans delved into the practice of Runes fully!","In the ninth week, Boros was the first Ordinance of Existence Entity that managed to successfully construct a Rune of Blanc.","Not just the first Ordinance of Existence entity to do so, but also the first Antediluvian Leviathan after the Existence Severing entities who managed to form a Rune of Existence!","And how could he not when even though the talents of Boros were poor, he held the Rune of Amarantos that was even more complex than anything that the Omnifather had shown them so far for him to study?","His accomplishment caught the eyes of the Omnifather in the distance who nodded towards his direction, an imperceptible light flashing briefly in his eyes as he locked onto Boros before he looked away.","He continued to show more and more simple Terrestrial Rules of Existence as he systematically taught the powerful Antediluvian Leviathans, and the years passed.","Five years.","Ten years.","Fifty years!","The surroundings of the Primaltree of Existence were now filled with a shocking array of complexities as thousands of Runes of Existence floated around it, causing the concentration of weavings of Existence nearby to be enriched and pulse with activity.","A few dozen Ordinance Amalgamation Entities had also managed to embark on the path of Runes of Existence, with very few Ordinance of Existence entities succeeding in any Runes so far!","Boros remained one of the astonishing ones as at this moment, many different Terrestrial Runes of Existence surrounded him.","In the 50th year, the Omnifather gave another demonstration as he looked at the progress around him.","|Those with the ability have managed to forge a few Runes of Existence, and from them, you should feel a unique link. Every rune is unfathomably unique as it shares the signature of the one who made it, with its complexity and design being so intricate that it is forever bound by the one who forged it. Other people can be given access to the complex workings of a certain rune- a certain word that they can then utilize, but it will always belong to the single being who forged it. They may even be able to know every person utilizing the word, the rune that they forged.|","...!"]},{"number":3390,"title":"Chapter 3390: Chapter 3389 Runes of Existence! III","paragraphs":["The most recent words to be uttered out from the Omnifather didn't cause a whole lot of tumultuous waves on the vast majority of Antediluvian Leviathans.","But within the weavings of Noah, his eyes pulsed with a terrifying light.","The Rune of Existence carried the signature of the one who designed it- to the extent that their forger of a Rune could know just who was utilizing something they designed!","Noah looked within the depths of his weavings where the Amarantos Rune of the Great Beyonder and the Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence of the Omnifather lay.","Both...were not his.","The moment that he began using the Transcendent Megalos Ability of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, did his name get added to a long list that the Beyonder could easily see as the one who designed this Rune?","The thought didn't entirely sit right with him as he already began to think about how he could change this in the future!","|I tell you this because from now on, I have shown you enough variations of Runes of Existence that you can design your own unique Runes. There is a region in the Expanse that holds dense variations of scattered weavings of Runes for you all to gain more ideas from, and that will be the next location of study. Come.|","...!","The words of the Omnifather echoed out as many Antediluvian Leviathans rose with expectant eyes to follow the Omnifather!","They trusted him with their very weavings of existence as they would follow and do anything he told them.","Boros rose up as well, but at this moment...","|Not you.|","HUUM!","Silently.","Other Antediluvian Leviathans didn't even sense anything!","But the voice of the Omnifather boomed within Noah's ears as he found his body anchored in space, unable to move!","As others began to be teleported, his figure silently disappeared as well.","A flash of an instant.","Thereafter, he found himself standing on a starry blue sea of plasma, dazzling Omniverses spinning in the far distance as their sheer size and stature made one feel unfathomably small.","Above this starry blue sea of plasma, the figure of Boros appeared as behind him, the visage of the Omnifather was adorned in a multicolored robe- his arms folding behind him as he stared out at the spinning Omniverses!","|Traversing into different weavings of existence is dangerous. Unnatural. For you to appear in the weavings of Antediluvian Leviathans must mean you are connected in some way within your own weavings, thus, I allowed you to move freely and learn in the last decades. But were to keep following any further, it would become dangerous for you.|","...!","The Omnifather spoke to Boros.","No, not Boros, but the will residing within him!","Noah turned his head to stare at the terrifying entity that was the Omnifather as his will was calm, his mouth opening calmly.","\"When did you find out?\"","|The moment I first laid eyes on you. Anyone above Existence Severing may be able to notice some things if they are focused on you, with more complex beings sensing even if their attention didn't just happen to fall on you. I tell you this while keeping hope that you will heed my warning. One's own Frequency of existence is more than sufficient. You can spend your entire lifespan and not be able to scour every single bound of Existence in the Weavings you were born in. Delving into others could aid in your complexity in the short term, but you will start causing changes and fluctuations not meant for those weavings of existence. And if you begin affecting a big enough change...you will fall under the eyes of those beings soon enough. Beings who can more clearly see the Wheel of Existence more than anything else as they ensure their steady flow!|","...!","Unfathomably complex words echoed out from the Omnifather.","Words that caused Noah to turn silent as he mulled over them again and again!","The biggest thing being falling under the eyes of Entities that ensured the steady flow of Weavings of Existence.","He had just heard of this, and yet he had a great deal of questions!","Who? Why?","He had many questions, but he knew that he would very likely not receive any answers here as he looked at the Omnifather and asked about something else entirely.","|What do you know of the Megalonians?|","HUUM!","The Megalonians.","Were they destroyed in these weavings of existence as well? The moment he asked this question, the gaze of the Omnifather flickered with a tremendous amount of emotion as his gaze changed, and he waved his hands with a booming voice!","|Leave!|","...!","The Amarantos Rune of Existence within him blared with light as he instantly felt unfathomably sleepy.","Gazing at the visage of the Omnifather and the brilliance around him, Boros closed his eyes and fell into a deep slumber- a unique complexity leaving him as an Amarantos Rune of Existence faded away!","Yet even after this occurred, the Omnifather continued to stare silently as the figure of Boros woke up soon after.","|Huh? Omnifather...!|","Seeing the visage of the Omnifather, Boros instantly rose to his feet with reverence as the Omnifather merely nodded and waved his hands, Boros disappearing from his eyes right after.","|...|","His gaze was a unique one as he seemed to be faced with a great deal of difficulty and confusion.","At a certain point...","|Why did he not appear in the other weavings of himself? Why possess another if traversing the weavings of existence?|","...!","A query that the Omnifather had not been able to answer.","The Wheel of Existence was unfathomable, but more often than not, if there was a being capable of traveling across its myriad Spokes of Existence, they were likely to be of renowned stature and complexity across the Spokes of the Wheel.","So why not do the easy thing and traverse into another version of oneself, and instead go for the much harder possession?","Unless...a version of himself did not exist in these weavings.","But this...was highly unlikely, right?","Not receiving any answers, the Omnifather's gaze flickered with many emotions before he also disappeared!"]},{"number":3391,"title":"Chapter 3391: Chapter 3390 Runes of Existence! IV","paragraphs":["Within certain Weavings of Existence, inside the Expanse.","An Amarantos Rune of Existence flashed brilliantly above Noah's figure as the Infiniverse Megalos Seed watched it with bright eyes in the distance.","The prompts that appeared before his eyes were ones that coursed through her, their unshakable connection carrying their memories and more together!","|A unique Dream exceeding the bounds of Weavings of Existence was experienced due to a Severed Source and intricate Complexity of Existence.|","|An Unsurpassable Dream has been brought to an end after weavings potentially harmful to you made themselves present.|","|Your proficiency in the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos has been elevated to the Fourth Echelon, with your Proficiency at 44%.|","Ozymandias and him were the same, but also different.","His weavings held an Amarantos Rune of Existence, and so did the weavings of Ozymandias as they both had their Proficiency with it.","And now that he was able to take a closer look, he could see that this so called Proficiency was only how familiar he became with the Amarantos Rune of Existence the more he used it as more and more of his own weavings entered its gaps of complexity- which allowed him to bring out more of its power next time!","|The weavings of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos you can obtain are sufficiently exceptional.|","|All memories of the Unsurpassable Dream are retained.|","|The Weavings of this single Dream can be retrieved, with one out of two components viable for retrieval due to the current Proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.|","|The Components of the Dream capable of being chosen are as follows.|","|Source of Existence of an Antediluvian Leviathan as the Ordinance of Existence. Ordinance of Moirai. Cycles of refinement of the purity of an Ordinance of Existence.|","|Weavings and Research of Runes of Existence spanning decades, profundities prompted by the Omnifather of the Antediluvian Leviathans. A Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence, and many other uniquely designed Runes of Existence.|","Two dazzling singularities rose before his eyes as he made the choice between them rather quickly.","|The full Weavings and Research of Runes of Existence spanning decades, profundities prompted by the Omnifather of the Antediluvian Leviathans, a Quintessential Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence, and many other uniquely designed Runes of Existence have been retrieved.|","[Part of the Dream of the Antediluvian Leviathan, Boros, has been forever lost.] Decades of research of weavings of the Runes of Existence.","Such wonders began to flow within him as at the same time, dazzling Runes of Existence began to manifest around his figure!","Tremendous gains were made in this dream as they were mainly clustered around Runes of Existence.","Feeling the decades' worth of knowledge and familiarity, Noah spoke succinctly to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","\"How is it?\"","||I've sifted through all memories and proficiency pertaining to Runes of Existence. I can begin setting aside a significant portion of complexity in their study and design, and even begin utilizing some of the commonly learned Terrestrial Runes of Existence right away to further elevate the Complexity of Existence of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.||","...!","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed was efficient if nothing else.","They knew the Runes of Existence to be a potentially existence altering form of weavings, and if it was the language that many used to get ever closer to the Wheel of Existence, they would do so as well!","It was unique because this wasn't the first time Noah came across Runes, with his own weavings having come across them a few times as he went towards Extremity.","But not in this way.","Not in their complexity of how many thousands or millions of strokes a single rune could have- and the effect it could impose on the surrounding weavings of existence.","For example.","At this moment as the weavings of Runes flowed between the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and Noah, the Infiniverse Megalos Body waved her hands with an eruption of complexity as a massive white rune began to form out of a singularity.","Requiring a total of ten thousand strokes, it was the Terrestrial Runes of Existence- the Amplification Rune!","Its purpose was nothing else but to amplify the surrounding weavings of existence.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body finished it in a few seconds, her gaze sharp as she looked at the glow of this rune and how it had caused the surroundings to become brighter and more active.","||I will begin with the mass production and placement of the Amplification Runes of Existence throughout the Infiniverse Megalos Seed first. I estimate that within a few days, I should be capable of designing them as Constellation Runes of Existence with much greater effects.||","Words brimming with confidence echoed out as Noah nodded, Noah's eyes briefly turning towards a certain direction and observing there momentarily before their figures disappeared into the Blancverse along with their Loot!","Towards the area Noah had observed before he left.","A distance equivalent to five Omniverses away, Immovable Sacred Legions were wrapped up in a light of veiled brilliance as their intents moved silently around each other.","On their bodies, dazzling Meridians- Circuits that vibrated with radiance, were flowing intricately as their sources were vibrant Runes at the center of their weavings!","|Target confirmed. Accompanied by an unknown male. Seemingly human at the Ordinance of Existence level, with a possible glimmer of Runes of Existence around him. All collected weavings have been sent back to the Immovable Sacred Palace. Continuing observation from afar.|","A report was made as multiple Ordinance weaved around the Immovable Sacred Legions- their weavings masked with shocking complexity as they observed their targets that disappeared into a cloudy Blancverse!","Their report traveled far and soon reached the weavings of the Palace Master Antiope and Evrin within the very Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse itself.","When Palace Master Antiope saw the illusory images of the Infiniverse Dowager and the man beside her, her eyes trembled tumultuously as she confirmed the sighting of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian beside her!"]},{"number":3392,"title":"Chapter 3392: Chapter 3391 How to Kill an Existence Defying Being? I","paragraphs":["Palace Master Antiope stared at the scene of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian with extremely stern eyes.","They had, at times, been seen together.","They had worked together multiple times as they were believed to be extremely complex entities whose goals aligned, and so they worked together!","But...they actually had such a history? Even before they Severed their Existence and Pioneered their own paths, they were always together?","This information caused different parts of her mind to light up as the Infiniverse Dowager was terrifying enough.","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian...this Tyrant one one that many beings feared!","|The one responsible for your daughter is truly no ordinary being. If Palace Master Evrin holds trust in me, we will continue doing this my way, where we observe and follow for the next few days. After that...we will make a move that will ensure to give you closure.|","She kept her voice calm as she spoke to the Palace Master whose murdered Daughter of Existence was the root cause of this whole unfolding reality.","And Evrin only nodded as even though he knew there was something much more there, he didn't ask!","---","Within another area in the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Palace Master Antiope portrayed the same scene she observed from the Ordinance Amalgamation Entities currently observing a certain Blancverse- the illusory image that showed the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","|They obviously have a greater history than we came to know, but yes. He is here too. In these weavings. This chance...|","|It is not a chance as much as what we need to do has become twice as hard- nay, ten times as hard. One Infiniverse Dowager is terrifying enough, but adding the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian?|","...!","Before Palace Master Antiope.","The only Pioneer of Existence amongst them spoke out as his gaze was one full of thought and caution.","Heracles!","Palace Master Antiope gazed at him and the only other entity to come here with them- Nisa, her gaze currently a somber one.","Palace Master Antiope breathed calmly as she spoke once more.","|I am not underestimating them, really. But again, we have a Pioneer and Existence Severing entities on our side while they have the power of Ordinance Amalgamation currently. Ordinance Amalgamation! Besides fearing so much of who they might become in the future, let us come up with ways to kill these beings that seem to defy Existence itself!|","WUU!","Her words were resonant.","Around the three of them, dazzling green leaves flowed and wrapped around everything as above Pioneer Heracles, a vibrant green rune rotated calmly.","A Constellation Rune of Existence that read- Quarantine!","It was spinning with a vibrant glow, but the level of complexity held within this single rune exceeded the complexity that all the weavings of Existence Severing could radiate.","It isolated everything about themselves and what they talked about here as with it, even a terrifyingly perceptive entity wouldn't be able to feel an inkling of a bad feeling or sensation about them being plotted against, or even the threat of death.","All possible weavings of existence were quarantined!","Pioneer Heracles gazed at the fluttering stellar green leaves around them as he spoke out with an ancient voice.","|The Wheel turns as the Wheel turns. Maybe...we shouldn't do anything at all. Maybe this is how events are supposed to flow. Our entry into these Weavings of Existence already violates enough. If we make truly significant moves...|","|We are in these weavings of existence because we ran away! From beings like them!|","Palace Master Antiope felt immense rising frustration as she pointed towards the illusory pictures of Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","|Please, Heracles. We have already gone through this and arrived at this step. And when it comes to killing...there are many ways for it that are not just purely killing.|","...!","|Oh?|","The brows of Heracles arose as beside him, Nisa looked towards Antiope questioningly.","|If these are the Source Weavings of Existence of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, we simply have to ensure they do not continue. Apart from seeking to kill them- something we are taking many precautions for, we can also do something a step below in difficulty while achieving the same result. We can...imprison them.|","WAA!","Imprisonment?","This word caused the eyes of Nisa and Pioneer Heracles to gradually shine before they radiated a terrifying light!","Nisa even rose up as the leaves around them fluttered while she asked.","|You don't mean...that place?|","That place.","Something they had only heard about, and their biggest fear before they gave up a tremendous amount of their power to take the risk of jumping into a different frequency of Existence!","The eyes of Heracles pulsed with brilliance as he also seemed to be thinking. He thought of legends from cycles past that were inherited as horror stories regarding the vastness and immensity of the Wheel of Existence! Horrors not meant to terrify children, but any entities who dared to think of traversing the different Weavings of the Wheel of Existence.","|A place feared by even the most complex beings that have communed with the Wheel of Existence. Any entities who sought it forever disappeared from any records...you think that Frequency of the Wheel we nearly fell into was it?|","...!","Something that made even the most complex of entities fearful.","At their level of power, very few things, if any, could make such entities fearful!","Yet those who truly knew spoke in hushed whispers about a place that was part of the Wheel...and also not.","About a frequency that existed and did not truly exist as there were no weavings of it. And yet when those with weavings fell into it...they never returned.","Antiope looked at her two compatriots as her eyes didn't hold any hesitation.","Before all of this, in the past, they were all equals. She looked at Pioneer Heracles who had pulled ahead now as she spoke with confidence!"]},{"number":3393,"title":"Chapter 3393: Chapter 3392 How to Kill an Existence Defying Being? II","paragraphs":["|It wasn't just us who made the jump. Others did not make it. That flash of frequency that nearly took us out as well...I say it is worth the risk to backtrack and find that frequency once more. But not for us...we simply direct it towards our targets. Towards the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian who have yet to mature. They won't be able to avoid the pull as if we are somehow wrong and we fail, then they will fall into another Spoke of the Wheel and be deterred from their original path. If that does occur, they will be out of these weavings and give us time to grow. But if we succeed, and they truly are sent into that place where even the most complex entities fear...|","HUUM!","The three entities surrounded by swirling leaves of a Constellation Rune of Existence breathed heavily!","Pioneer Heracles had bright eyes at this moment as they seemed to flicker with countless stars.","|This...may just be feasible. But the cost we will pay is going to be extremely heavy.|","To backtrack.","To find that sliver of weaving, not just for themselves, but to direct it towards a certain location and targets!","It was going to be unfathomably difficult.","But...","Antiope's expression showed a crazed madness at this moment as she remembered how helpless she felt at the terror of the Infiniverse Dowager.","|I am prepared to pay any cost. Any cost at all!|","One was filled with conviction.","The other two looked at each other and also became firm as Heracles rose up grandly.","|We'll get started. This may take some time, and the more time passes, the more variables arise.|","...!","Veiled in powerful complexities, a terrifying scheme unfolded within the depths of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","—","Within the Megalos Ynnere.","In an undefined Sector.","Noah gazed at the vastness of Megalos Ynnere as the Cartographer of Existence, and what he could see was getting more and more complex.","The changes began when he traversed into the other weavings of existence as Ozymandias, and then as himself.","The Map of Megalos Ynnere he was looking at...seemed to be constantly shifting and overlapping as the areas he covered seemed the same- but not.","It required more time and utilization to understand, but he felt like these changes were leading to a tremendous product as the thought in the back of his mind was...what if he could map out the Megalos of different weavings of existence entirely? Would he be able to find and traverse into specific ones with ease?","There were many possibilities, but...","|Now what?|","The voice of Command Protector Valeria echoed out beside him in the Omniversal Voyager as Noah shook his head and spoke calmly.","\"Let's go say hi. Only you and your sister can come as we don't need too many extras for this.\"","He waved his hands calmly as he looked at the Omniverse he had entirely blocked the weavings of- where nobody could go in or out without his permission!","Everything was covered by the hazy golden light of the Ordinance of Dreams.","|Sis Valeria, what is this?|","Protector Lucretia came up behind them as Noah only waved his hands, the three of them disappearing from this Omniversal Voyager and instantly transferring into the massive Omniverse he had locked down!","With his current weavings, the figures of Command Protector Valeria and Lucretia could be considered beneath him in complexity, but he didn't want to become someone who only used others when he needed them and then threw them away thereafter.","The least he would do was Sever any points of karma between them and wrap up something that to the current him...was a minor matter.","HUUM!","They appeared atop the peak of a massive stellar black mountain the size of a Cosmos that floated in the center of this Omniverse- amidst many other mountains of similar size.","Around them, thousands of Reapers of Existence turned towards their direction, and hundreds of titanic Outerversal Morphons wriggling with tentacles surrounded them even further out.","And further ahead, the visage of a clouded figure seated on a throne of wriggling tentacles had a somber expression while looking at all of them, and Noah only nodded simply towards him.","\"Hey man.\"","...!","Towards the Great Ponderor.","Nietzsche!","Noah nonchalantly called out while teleporting right into the center of his forces!","Around, there were at least a dozen Outerversal Morphons that had reached the stage of One With Existence, and two that had attained the state of the Eye of Existence!","All of them were followers of Nietzsche as this was his last bastion.","And now, the man he was scheming against and seeking to make an enemy had come knocking, even when he had discussed with Savitar that he wanted things to be over!","Besides Noah, the figures of Command Protector Valeria and Lucretia were trembling as they looked around them and sensed the stifling auras of Outerversal Morphons, with Lucretia even shaking when she felt the connection towards the Great Ponderor as she looked at her sister- as if wanting to ask her. When did she know?","But she couldn't even focus on this as it felt like their very lives would end in the next moment.","Even Command Protector Valeria was barely grasping the state of One With Existence as around them, there were multiple, along with even more terrifying auras!","Why...did Protector Osmont bring them to their deaths?!","Even as such despair settled in.","None of the terrifying Outerversal Morphons made a single move.","The only one who did move was Noah as he walked forward calmly, looking around while speaking.","\"I hate very little of these grand weavings of existence, but something I hold in great distaste are schemes in the dark. People thinking they can plan and plan, and then use convoluted plots to somehow win against me. You, my dear Nietzsche, thought you could do this.\"","WAA!","He strolled across the stellar black earth of this mountain as he went towards the throne of tentacles the Great Ponderor sat on.","At this moment, the gaze of the Great Ponderor was extremely twisted as his form gradually became clear.","He had the head of a devilish goat with tentacles wriggling beneath his chin, his body humanoid and filled with obsidian roiling tentacles as he sat on his throne.","And when he looked around all the forces he had gathered.","All the Outerversal Morphon with high echelons of Megalos Regnum and Outerversal Physiology.","Every single one...seemed to currently be frozen and unable to move moments before this being even appeared.","Faint particles of gold could be seen as the complexity of the Ordinance of Dreams filled with the weight of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology pressed down on everything!","Noah had just ripped apart Ordinance Amalgamation entities- so what danger could there possibly be against a Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation entity such as the Great Ponderor and the few entities under his banner that were even weaker than him?","This whole thing...was a walk in the park for Noah as the entity who was more powerful than him just a matter of a few days ago and had set his sights on him...had given him too much time.","A few days.","This was far too much time to give Noah!","Now, he came to collect with unfathomable ease!"]},{"number":3394,"title":"Chapter 3394: Chapter 3393 Tyrannical Oppression! I","paragraphs":["The whole situation was utterly surreal.","For Protector Lucretia, it even seemed like a nightmare!","The one she was bound to.","The one she felt stifled by even just thinking about! He now stood before her, his bodies layered on top of each other to show the culmination of terrifying power.","With multiple powerful Outerversal Morphons that seemed to come close to Savitar, they were entirely surrounded!","Yet...","Yet...!","Not a single movement was felt from the Outerversal Morphons even as Lucretia and Command Protector Valeria pulsed with trepidation.","Every passing millisecond that they waited for the eruption of shocking complexities, nothing happened!","They couldn't help but turn ahead towards the man walking forward and talking as if he was only taking a stroll.","He seemed to know everything that was going on as he walked across the stellar dark earth, eventually beginning to float up as he came to the eye line of the massive visage of the goat-headed Outerversal Morphon- the Great Ponderor!","Was it all him? This was all his doing? His sheer brilliance stopped the movements of all Morphons as he now stared directly at the most powerful one that gave the Commonwealth a great deal of trouble?!","\"All the plotting has come to this point right here. All the twists and turns of causality since you set your eyes on me in that Half Tainted Omniverse. Is there anything else for you to say?\"","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian had a calm expression as he asked the Great Ponderor.","And Nietzsche...had his weavings silently churning as his intent weaved out.","|One knows when to take a step back. I am willing to take this step back. I won't even fight back as you can consider this Body the price I am willing to pay to close off and sever the entangled weavings between us.|","...!","A Great One took a step down.","And yet...","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian shook his head!","\"You do not fight back because you cannot. I care not for your body. I want what you first want to give out. Your dignity. Your honor. Your Megalos Regnum. And don't waste too much of my time either as the more time that passes, the more I will be inclined to collapse your weavings here and in the Pantheon of Umbra as well.\"","...!","His words caused the eyes of Nietzsche to vibrate and tremble!","He could see the words were not lies. Somehow, this being could legitimately reach out to even the Megalos Beyond- he could cover such a vast distance!","How? Through Savitar? No, that didn't make sense- he wasn't aura enough. Then who? Through who?!","These questions buzzed in the Great Ponderor as he listened to his weavings of danger once more.","They were overloaded in defeat at this moment as even with his terrifying complexity, even with his planning and plotting...he found that without making a single move against his enemy, he was defeated.","|Haha...|","He laughed with madness and self-deprecation while shaking his head.","|Even if I present you my Megalos Regnum-|","\"I will take it.\"","WUU!","Noah waved his hands nonchalantly as a golden necklace lifted from his neck, showing the dazzling stellar obsidian Megalos Regnum Crown of another Great One on this necklace!","Seeing it, Nietzsche trembled while giving Noah an extremely difficult look.","With every passing second, he felt like extremely oppressive weavings of complexity would close down all around him at this moment, he closed his eyes and accepted it.","Even without a fight, he had lost!","HUUM!","His body pulsed with luminous obsidian light that all flowed to form a dazzling black crown- all of his dignity and regnum flowing into it as at this moment, Noah reached out and grasped it!","With a terrifying force, it flowed into the thread of the golden necklace as of this moment on...another Megalos Regnum Crown of a great one was bound to Noah.","He stared at the two stellar black crowns without any emotion as he spoke.","\"Release that girl behind me. She is no longer your Delegatus.\"","...!","Nietzsche gazed behind Noah at the stupefied visage of Lucretia and Command Protector Valeria as his eyes flashed.","|Yes...err, how should I refer to you?| With his very dignity and honor bound by another, Nietzsche adapted quickly as he asked.","\"Dreamer. Dreamer of the Megalos.\"","|Yes, Dreamer.|","Brilliance flashed within Nietzsche's eyes as instantly, a line was cut.","In the distance, Lucretia felt a sense of weightlessness as she breathed heavily, checking deeply in her heart as truly...the connection she was bound to was gone!","This...!","She held no words as all of this seemed like a pure dream!","Yet the visage of Noah took a single step to appear before them and nodded lightly, a golden necklace with two obsidian crowns settling on his neck.","\"You are forever cut off from the Great Ponderor. What you do now depends on you. Will you head back to the Omniverse of the Protectors- to the Commonwealth, or will you follow me?\"","He spoke about heavy choices calmly as the two sisters gazed at each other, their buzzing minds gradually calming as Command Protector Valeria looked at her sister and then back to Noah.","She then gazed at the eerie Outerversal Morphons frozen all around them and the distant Great One that Noah had tyrannically suppressed, and she...shook her head.","|Thank you for helping me achieve something I thought would be the death of me and my sister. I cannot repay you enough for this action but...I will go back to the Commonwealth.|","A choice was made.","And Noah only nodded calmly before he flashed a smile towards these two women.","\"Then everything between us can be considered closed. Until we meet again...\"","WAP!","He waved his hands as the figures of the two sisters disappeared- sent back to the Omniversal Voyager that would be heading back to the lands of the Commonwealth!","While Noah himself...","He turned back and gazed at the Great One, who was much more powerful than even Savitar, as he spoke out nonchalantly. \"Alright big guy. Let's see your Records and memories. From when you were born until now...\"","There was much to learn and understand about the Megalos Beyond and the Megalos Ynnere, and these entities that had lived for many millions upon millions of years had a great deal of knowledge and answers!"]},{"number":3395,"title":"Chapter 3395: Chapter 3394 Tyrannical Oppression! II","paragraphs":["As Noah gained another Megalos Regnum Crown in one area within the Megalos Ynnere.","In the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather, a Singularity was extinguished as entities seated upon three thrones attained the right to the Origin Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi contained within an Origin Tresorverse Tower of Existence!","The Selection here was the fastest compared to the Quintessential, Rare, or Average Tresorverse Towers of Existence.","Seated on the thrones that began to move towards three different directions, the Viceroy of the Commonwealth looked towards Noah with a sharp gaze.","They left behind weaker call Ordinance of Existence beings who gritted their teeth and scrambled away to fight for the lesser Tresoverse Towers of Existence!","Within this vast space where all those that had entered the Trunk of the Primaltree of Existence were sent to, the throne Noah was on rapidly shot out into a distant golden tower.","The golden tower itself looked like a massive monolith that opened up and swallowed him whole- his body direction through layers of weavings before the crown settled itself in the center of the tower.","From the inside, the walls were transparent and vast as Noah could see what was happening outside, but the most important thing was the dazzling allure of gold light that was spinning in the very center of this tower!","As he arrived, so did the monotone intent that was ringing out this whole time arrive.","|Familiarize yourself with the Origin Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi and prepare to defend against hordes of prisoners put in a position just below you, with their freedom contingent on defeating you and destroying the towers that you and others occupy.|","The spinning golden singularity was the promised Origin Sacred Complexity Modus Operandi.","When its hazy glow finished, Noah clearly saw an extremely complex rune that held a profound complexity similar to the Amarantos Rune of Existence!","Similar- but not all the way at its level as it still seemed a level off.","But this Rune of Existence was a terrifying one that allowed one to increase their output of weavings of Existence by 500%!","Noah didn't like that it was another person's Rune of Existence, and they would know every single entity who was utilizing their Rune- but he knew this was a temporary measure.","Once he broke down the components of each Rune of Existence and understood it entirely, he could engineer his own and make it even better than before.","HUUM!","He reached out and grasped the golden Rune of Existence as it settled into his weavings- coming to settle near his chest as it pulsed with a dim gold light, asking to be activated!","Above Noah, a dazzling Sacred Primal Eye of Existence opened as he observed the intricacies of this Rune of Existence while allowing a dense amount of his weavings to flow into it, instantly causing it to spin and radiate circuits- meridians all across his body as there were 81 in number.","81 dazzling gold meridians that looked like Ethereal rivers of gold stretched out across his weavings of existence!","When his weavings flowed into them, they increased in power and potency every time they completed a cycle across all these Meridians.","The more of his weavings he put in, the more this output of power increased as his body began brimming with pressure many times more powerful than before!","This...was what a single powerful Rune of Existence could achieve.","The Great Beyonder had put out Crucibles of the Beyonder that contained things like the Amarantos Rune of Existence, the Defy Rune of Existence, and the Sword Rune of Existence.","The Omnifather took a different route and put out different variations of Runes of Existence that increased the output of one's weavings of existence!","Different methodologies, but the same results of strengthening their respective Megalos in the end.","Noah knew there had to be an equivalent entity similar to the Great Beyonder and the Omnifather on the side of Megalos Nihilos, and he felt sour missing whatever boons it had prepared for the entities within Nihilos!","'Hopefully, that guy is enjoying some of it at least...'","His eyes twinkled as he thought of the Great Usurper who had crossed Megalos Ynnere and into the Megalos Nihilos before the boons of the Omnifather had bloomed.","Alongside his thoughts, he sat down and analyzed the Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence, being lost in his own weavings for some time!","Unknowingly, a few hours passed.","In the surroundings, other selections were completed as those who had enough strength to obtain ownership of Quintessential, Rare, and Average Tresorverse Towers of Existence received them. Noah's attention only came to when he felt the buzzing of the Tresoverse Domain and a booming voice that spread out all around.","|The selection of the Towers of Existence is completed. Within the next few moments, the Prisoners dwelling in this Domain will be released. Defend against them and hone the complexity of your Weavings of Existence. Be defeated, and be lost in the cycles of endless weavings.|","...!","The voice was cold as if it was letting a dangerous reality be known- that if they faltered, they could very well perish here!","Noah spread his will out as he heard this booming voice, the landscape of this domain having rapidly changed as he found that the 3 Origin Towers of Existence were stationed extremely far apart, while Quintessential Towers and other Towers were scattered throughout. Almost as if they truly were in defensive positions and they needed to ensure that nothing bypassed them!","One region had entities at the Ordinance of Existence level, while much further ahead, Entities at the stage of Ordinance Amalgamation were stationed.","Behind and around in a circular formation, those with lesser weavings at the Eye of Existence and below were also stationed as the whole domain seemed filled with dazzling Towers of different colors, all of them together spanning and covering a region equivalent to the length of over 200 Omniverses!","They had their own battles to fight as the region a single Ordinance of Existence entity covered where they could exert their power may just be the equivalent of a single Omniverse or less.","It would be a war of expansive scale!","WU!","In the distance, terrifying auras began to leak out as in the dark void of this domain...","Far, far ahead, space ripped apart as if an endless prison was finally being opened, and those within could not wait to charge out!","From the blooming cracks in space, golden limbs stretched out and split apart the space even further- showing the appearance of Titanic golden humanoid existences.","Existences that were very reminiscent in the eyes of any entities that were lucky enough to enjoy the Reconstruction of the Megalonians!"]},{"number":3396,"title":"Chapter 3396: Chapter 3395 Unbound Obsession! I","paragraphs":["Those who had been present in the Reconstruction of the Megalonians would be able to observe that the golden titans coming out of imprisonment were eerily similar to the massive golden titan that had begun the assault on the Megalonians long, long ago. At the moment these auras arose and spread out, Noah's own will buzzed with magnificence as a terrifying obsession lying within the depths of his being blazed out- the obsession of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian howling out at the release of entities with Lineages linking back to a certain massacre!","The obsession was heavy as it called for cataclysm and blood- for destruction of utmost depth to fall on these enemies!","Noah frowned at such strong waves of obsession flowing out of the past weavings of Pyrrhus as he looked ahead at the waves of Golden Titans that were ripping apart space and coming out.","The Omnifather had jailed a whole lineage belonging to someone who led the eradication of the Megalonians? Just what power had this being attained to allow him to carry out such an action to rectify his mistakes?","There were no answers freely hanging by.","At this moment, the maddening aura of these Golden Titans continued to spread out, their wills and intent roaring out alongside their surging power.","|OMNIFATHER!|","|You will pay for this!|","|Blood for blood!|","A cacophony of noise and intent erupted out as it was unknown how long these entities were jailed for.","Among them, there were abundant auras of Ordinance Amalgamation by the hundreds, and Ordinance of Existence by the tens of thousands- and a few hundred thousand auras of those below them in the states of Existence that were surging out like waves!","It was a force that was enough to cause even Old Man Eudemus and other Ordinance Amalgamation entities to turn somber- even if they had just attained the Sacred Modus Operandi within their own Towers of Existence that amplified their weavings.","Because the level of complexity and brutality displayed by the Golden Titans as they came out...was utterly overwhelming.","Their eyes blazed with golden flames as they looked out at the cluster of Defense Towers.","Past them, they seemed to see their freedom as they howled out while moving forward with indomitable splendor!","|Progeny of the Jailer!|","|ENSLAVERS!|","The Jailer.","Another distinction of the Omnifather based on his actions as the rest of them were branded with the titles of enslavers.","Alongside these bellows, booming waves of complexity also began to arrive as an Ordinance Amalgamation Golden Titan took great strides to arrive near a multicolored Tower of Existence.","Multicolored representing Ordinance Amalgamation.","The gaze of the Golden Titan was livid as his hand reached out, enlarging for countless light years to nearly become as big as the multicolored tower that was the length of an Omniverse!","|You keep us enslaved for Cycles in order to repent? To repent for the sins of the Father?! And now, you think we will be target practices for your own Lineage?! You motherfucker!|","BOOM!","The enlarged golden hand carried interminable power as the Defense Tower it reached blazed gloriously.","Around the Defense Tower the size of an Omniverse, the illusory image of an Antediluvian Leviathan appeared- as dazzling multicolored Rune of Existence buzzing at the very center of his being.","A rune of existence that caused over 100 Meridians to shine brilliantly over his massive figure, crimson flames wrapping around this Ordinance Amalgamation entity as he was fire personified.","With his weavings enhanced by a terrifying Rune of Existence that seemed to exceed even an Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence in power, along with the granted defenses of the Tower of Existence he remained inside of- he could face multiple Ordinance Amalgamation entities!","These were the preparations of the Omnifather.","To ensure that his people could overcome everything in the end, and use these Prisoners who shared a deep history and shame of his past to forge themselves into powerful combatants.","To prepare for what was to come!","HUUUM!","Crimson galaxies of flames seethed and formed in front of the Defense Tower, the heat being so potent that it could be felt from afar.","It was multiple times more powerful and complex compared to what a normal Ordinance Amalgamation entity could unleash, but in the face of all this...","|Haha...you fuckers!|","The forefront Golden Titan laughed with crazed madness.","|All these cycles of isolation. Unable to even enter the Expanse. Unable to call for help. Unable to know whether those we loved were alive or dead....we wanted to die. I wanted to die!|","...!","The aura of this Golden Titan began to subtly change.","|I wanted to die, but my hatred kept me going. Against the one who really believed himself to be above others, as if they were some force of good for the Wheel of Existence! Throughout all of it...death was only an arm's length away as I have learned to not fear it. We...have learned to not fear death.|","HUUM!","The illusory gaze of the Ordinance Amalgamation Antediluvian Leviathan defending the massive multicolored Tower rapidly changed as he began to pant.","Ahead of him.","Towards the Golden Titan that had stated it did not fear death.","A horrid aura was rising as this creature yelled out with eerie calmness.","|Sever.|","...!","BOOOM!","|I sever the hatred I felt during all these cycles. I sever the pain. I sever my obsession. I sever all emotions...and I sever my Existence entirely.|","A horrid progression of events.","All Ordinance Amalgamation entities and below participating in the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather had their gazes rapidly changed as they felt a terrifying aura bloom ahead- this Golden Titan actually disregarding life itself and not even worrying about the collapse of his existence as he went ahead and performed Existence Severing on the spot.","Not secluded in cultivation.","Not while carefully protected by others.","Mid battle, this entity sought to Sever his existence as none knew whether he would be successful or not, but what was abundantly clear...was the level of power this entity expressed as his golden hand now carried ten times as much heaviness and complexity.","It smacked down and crushed the stellar crimson flames of millions of swirling galaxies and smashed onto the multicolored Defense Tower- causing it to tremble before a crack appeared on it and it was smashed backwards!"]},{"number":3397,"title":"Chapter 3397: Chapter 3396 Unbound Obsession! II","paragraphs":["A disastrous set of events unfolded as one of the foremost Defense Towers was knocked back.","Around it, the illusory visage of the Antediluvian Leviathan showed great pain as it trembled, as if their very weavings of existence had experienced a great shock!","It was the complexity of an entity that was halfway into Existence Severing!","Quasi-Existence Severing!","It was a stage barely anyone would experience or battle against as no madman would do it in front of others unless there were absolutely no options for them.","But this being...was driven by hatred and obsession to the point that they carried out such drastic actions!","But that wasn't all.","|You Peons of the Omnifather do not know our pain. Our history. Our Lineage. Today, you will know what it feels like to be judged and tossed aside. Today, you will know pain.|","HUUM!","Other Golden Titans gathered behind and around this being.","Multiple Golden Titans at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage...radiated a light of madness as their existence warped.","|Sever.|","|Sever!|","|Existence...Severing!|","One after another.","In a terrifying display of obsession and conviction, multiple Golden Titans at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage Severed their Existence- but luckily, it wasn't all of them.","After all, to even attempt to sever one's existence, one had to reach a prerequisite level of complexity.","If one's complexity was still far too low, even if they wanted to Sever, it was an impossibility.","If they forcefully did so while their complexity was far too low, their weavings would collapse within nanoseconds!","But so far, those watching counter over a dozen Golden Titans radiate the terrifying aura of Existence Severing as they stepped on a path of no return.","If they succeeded, a genuine Existence Severing entity would be born. If they failed, they would have had time to massacre the lineage of the man who imprisoned them here all these cycles at least!","This was the price for their obsession.","BOOM!","They weren't the only ones.","As Ordinance Amalgamation Golden Titans did this, those at the Ordinance of Existence level...erupted with heavy might as many proceeded to amalgamate with their Ordinance right away.","Disregarding the risk of the collapse of their existence if they weren't entirely in tune with their ordinance- they proceeded ahead!","And those below them...sought to declare their Ordinance for the first time!","It was a heavy and shocking scene as at this moment, all those who had entered the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather wondered...did the Omnifather account for all this?","For the obsession and hatred of the ones he imprisoned over the cycles to be this high?!","The weaving of existence ahead of them caused them to feel a sense of trepidation, with these beings moving with crazed power as, even in their state of Severing, they charged toward the Defense Towers!","WUU!","As if the weavings of Existence themselves were moving against them.","The entrants who should have been experiencing a rapid period of growth within the Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather fell into unprecedented peril.","The area where the multicolored Tower of Existence was smacked away from now held no protection of an Ordinance Amalgamation entity, and a Quasi-Existence Severing Golden Titan moved forward.","|Time Snap.|","HUUM!","His intent radiated outwards.","Full of malice and wild abandon, it targeted the towers manned by the Ordinance of Existence entities and below, in addition to the knocked away multicolored Tower that held a flickering illusory radiance of the beaten back Antediluvian Leviathans.","The Ordinance of Time erupted from the Golden Titan. He was amalgamated with it, and he now Severed himself outside the scope of existence with this Ordinance at his core!","A circular purple radiance spread out around him and covered an equivalent length of 10 Omniverses- an illusion of a massive round purple clock blooming and holding everything in place.","It was filled with heavy complexity as all those within the scope of this illusory clock...found themselves frozen and unable to move their weavings!","As if they were stuck in a weaving of time that they couldn't move back or forward against, with everything being frozen.","Thereafter...","|AOUU!| The Golden Titan bellowed while throwing out a simple fist into the illusory purple clock.","The instant the golden Fist was thrown into the illusory clock, multiple illusory purple Temporal Fists formed in front of all frozen Towers of Existence.","They tumbled forth with interminable power of extinction and malice as they smashed onto every single tower- no matter whether the tower was the size of an Omniverse or less!","The moment the impact occurred, there was no conflict.","No fight.","No opposition.","The smashed Towers of Existence shattered and broke apart into purple shards influenced by the shocking Severed Ordinance of the Golden Titan, the entities within these towers who were brimming with possibilities minutes ago....they felt their own weavings of existence smashed with the Existence collapsing Temporal Fists as everything about themselves began to shatter into shards of purple light!","The multicolored Tower of Existence that had the dazed Ordinance Amalgamation entity was the first to shatter- along with its owner inside it.","All other Towers in the area affected by the illusory purple clock followed such a fate as horrifically, it seemed like there wouldn't be any survivors in this single strike of a Golden Titan!","It seemed that way.","But.","In the affected area glowing with purple radiance.","There was a single Golden Origin Tresorverse Tower of Existence.","One that had an entity who had an Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence swirling within him, but he also held much more.","Oh, so much more!","Faced with the Temporal Fist that was extinguishing all other Towers of Existence without even a fight, his Tower of Existence radiated a tremendous light of complexity.","It even seemed to tremble at the sheer complexity being released by him that it had to support!","Against the unstoppable light of a Quasi-Severed Ordinance of Time- one that was in the process of being Severed anyway, a dazzling golden wheel bloomed around the Tower of Existence.","Kuklos!","Ignoring the shackles of Time.","This golden wheel radiated an ancient air of complexity as...it seemed to be defiantly Severed.","Severed?","Why would a Severed Source of Kuklos appear in a Tower of Existence occupied by an Ordinance of Existence entity?!"]},{"number":3398,"title":"Chapter 3398: Chapter 3397 Unbound Obsession! III","paragraphs":["The scene was a disastrous one.","Merely one of the Quasi-Existence Severing Golden Titans made a move, and yet an Ordinance Amalgamation Antediluvian Leviathan and the Tower of Existence he protected was shattered alongside a dozen Towers of Existence that Ordinance of Existence entities occupied, including a few dozen towers manned by those less powerful!","By all means, it was a scene of devastation.","And yet!","Among this devastation, there was a single tower that was untouched!","Around it, a dazzling golden wheel formed and spun as it radiated a light of Severed Existence.","It was the only thing capable of moving in this domain of frozen time!","When it bloomed, many found themselves questioning with emotion.","Was there actually an Existence Severing entity on their side hiding this whole time?","It was a question for many- the wonder if there were multiple Existence Severing entities that entered the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather.","At this moment, they would truly be needed as these terrifying Golden Titans could become genuine Existence Severing entities at any moment!","If their weavings didn't collapse.","If many were successful in their Severing.","The Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather would turn into a land of bloodbath!","HUUM!","The Severed golden wheel of Kuklos spun with heaviness and indisputability.","The Golden Titan looked towards this wither with crazed eyes as he bellowed out.","|Break for me...Break for me! Temporal Decimation!|","His words were those of a maddened entity.","But his power was very real as all around, the purple brilliance brought with it a light of extinction that made its descent on the golden Tower of Existence!","But...","WU!","The wheel continued to spin heavily as around the Tower of Existence, the hazy illusion of a devilishly handsome Emperor manifested.","An Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence spun rapidly at his center as 81 Meridians lit up brightly, his gaze currently exceedingly cold!","But his eyes.","His eyes stared towards the Golden Titan as they held...a hint of an undeniable obsession. An obsession that showed complex rage and hatred that didn't entirely fit the calm face!","But such eyes looked at the Golden Titan as if they already considered him dead.","When his figure made an appearance, many were astonished as some had seen his face before when they were climbing the roots of Primaltree of Existence.","Those belonging to the Commonwealth were even more astonished as they had seen the face and details of this being after the Viceroy asked about him- even more so when he was able to attain one of the three Golden Origin Tresorverse Towers of Existence!","His figure was shrouded in mystery as he should be a Protector of the Commonwealth, and yet he wasn't. He should be weak, having barely entered the states of Existence, and yet...he wasn't! The only reason he wasn't labeled an enemy was that until this point, Old Man Eudemus vouched for him.","And now, he showed a Severed Source- and it was Kuklos nonetheless?!","In a far distance, the Viceroy of the Commonwealth was in his tower as he looked towards this direction with blazing eyes!","Amidst the Antediluvian Leviathans, there was one burning with waves of Entropy around a multicolored Tower of Existence at this moment who stared over in shock.","Wasn't this...that young friend he had been racing on the roots of the Primaltree?!","There were many gazes and reactions.","But the man in question didn't bother with all of this as he focused on the enemy before him, the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian buzzing as if that scene of decimation all those cycles ago was playing in front of its face again and again.","His very blood burned as his Meridians pulsed.","His weavings were amplified as through them, he carried the weight of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology and cycled it through the buzzing weavings of Kuklos!","\"Time is merely a part of the weavings of the Wheel.\"","HUUM!","His voice reverberated out with seemingly just as much hatred as the Golden Titans. \"Why would your time hold any significance before the Wheel?\"","...!","A blinding light of gold pressure and weight blasted out of the spinning wheel that seemed far too solid.","The light blazed and actually fractured the purple brilliance and the illusory clock that had formed into a domain that could cover an entire Omniverse, and it formed into trillions of smaller golden wheels that surged to smash onto the massive Golden Titan like a halcyon sea!","BOOM!","Like an unstoppable tide, it smashed forth and illuminated everything as it was far too fast.","It was heavy, and yet so fast!","The countless golden wheels smashed onto the body of the Golden Titan mightily, imposing a tremendous weight and pressure that seemed to be asking again and again...","|What is Time before the Wheel of Existence?!|","|What is Time before the Wheel of Existence?!|","|What is Time before the Wheel...!|","Again and again, his body was bombarded with such an intent along with the sea of golden wheels.","|OOOH!|","He roared out with maddening purple fervor as the clash dispersed, but his expression was livid as even though he didn't take heavy damage...his body was currently trembling with instability.","The reason why many would seclude themselves when Severing their existence.","Any heavy interruptions that could sow any seeds of doubt to what one was Severing could be deadly!","And after facing a bombardment of trillions of Wheels while having his Ordinance questioned...his weavings now trembled with instability and began collapsing!","Collapsing!","|OOOH!| The Golden Titan bellowed out with unfathomable wrath towards the illusory figure watching him coldly, other Golden Titans arriving beside him as their expressions were heavy. Their eyes were filled with malice as they all turned to gaze toward the interminable visage of the one responsible.","The gazes of all Quasi-Existence Severing Golden Titans and those behind them!","The single man on a lone Tower of Existence took their gazes and stares without backing down, an obsession in his eyes even rising as his illusory visage was seen breathing in waves of authority, his roar billowing out!","\"Let's go!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":3399,"title":"Chapter 3399: Chapter 3398 Unbound Obsession! IV","paragraphs":["Golden Titans on one side.","A single Golden defense Tower on the other.","The image of an illusory emperor within this tower staring at the shocking number of forces of the Prisoners all by himself etched itself in the minds of many- as if he alone would shoulder this burden!","But they knew.","The moment he fell, a disaster would bloom.","So in the next instant...","|Charge!|","|Defend!|","The Tresorverse Towers of Existence stretched out across this space buzzed and moved, with the Ordinances of the Ordinance Amalgamation Entities shooting out across the equivalent length of 5 Omniverses or mortuary forming a tide that surged towards the Golden Titans.","They saw that they didn't necessarily have to have the power to overcome and defeat the Golden Titans- they only had to disrupt their weavings significantly enough to ruin their Severing or Ordinance Amalgamation and cause the collapse of their Existence!","So they moved.","The Golden Titan that had initially faced Noah and now held collapsing weavings of existence roared out, turning into a streak of purple gold brilliance as even while his Ordinance and weavings collapsed...there were still waves of purple radiance trying to reverse everything.","|Death, I do not fear!|","He roared maddeningly as he came before Noah's massive tower once more; Noah's eyes honed in on him and the other auras that now moved alongside him as he let out a harrumph.","In terms of Complexity, he wasn't far off.","In terms of Runes of Existence, he was even putting himself above them!","And to take care of this burning obsession of Pyrrhus...bathing in the Blood of these Golden Titans didn't seem bad as he once more pulled upon the heaviness of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology!","In the surroundings.","|Defend!|","Other Towers of Existence arrived as in one, the illusory visage of a seated old man could be seen.","It was none other than Old Man Eudemus who was looking towards Noah's Tower of Existence with an extremely somber gaze that seemed to hold millions of questions and no answers.","Alongside it, dozens of other multicolored Towers of Existence holding the terrifying weavings of Ordinance Amalgamation also arrived and erupted out towards the Golden Titans!","It felt like two roiling seas of weavings would soon clash, and no side wanted to lose as every single entity joined in.","Whether they were at the Ordinance Amalgamation stage or merely One With Existence.","They all released their attacks that joined in together to form a startling sea of brilliance!","And Noah, at the center of all of this, let loose entirely to satiate and give way to an obsession for the last time.","After this, he could keep this obsession repressed as he moved without listening to its blazing wrath, merely having it in the background as a tool of recognition of the enemies around him!","But at this moment, it was free.","He could feel the unbound obsession within the very blood of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian as time seemed to slow down to a minute, incomprehensible level.","The Severed golden wheel of Kuklos that was spinning slowly began to speed up as countless waves of authority flowed into it.","Infinite waves of authority!","The weight of the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology was terrifying, yes, but there was also the weight of infinity.","It may not carry as much tonnage, but it had the genuine weight of endlessness that at this moment, Noah let loose freely.","Countless concentrated waves of immense complexity flowed into the rapidly spinning wheel- his whole Tower beginning to radiate a terrifying Golden light as at such a moment...his massive illusory body channeled all of this power into his fists.","An obsession wanted carnage.","He was granting carnage.","In slow motion, his right fist struck out once as his hand burned like a scorching Golden sun.","His left fist then followed with a similar presentation as it seemed unfathomably slow!","But in this slow pacing, his hand pulled back as he punched out again, and again, and again!","The stopped time only seemed to be for him as if the weavings of Kuklos deemed it so.","And his golden fists that seemed like slow bombs of power...gradually began to seem extremely rapid as they turned into a barrage of golden fists composed of trillions of small golden wheels.","The moment the span of an instant passed, what bloomed in front of Noah's tower were thousands of massive golden outlines of his fists shooting out, each one equivalent in size to a tenth of an Omniverse as they covered absolutely everything.","They caused the sea of attacks on their side to shine with golden brilliance as many were only able to catch a glimpse of it before the impact bloomed on both sides.","...!","BOOOM!","It was an unfathomably heavy cluster of complexity coming together all at once as every single entity was swept up in it!","As this heavy impact of two seas occurred.","Outside of the Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather.","Within the Megalos Ynnere.","An unkempt entity that was floating in the blankness of the Megalos Ynnere with multiple Omniverses circling around him raised his head and looked far above- as if there was something only he could see that others could not.","His eyes were starry and filled with brilliance, with an aura far exceeding that of Existence Severing silently bubbling under his skin!","The entity that had disappeared from the throngs of the Commonwealth just before the portals leading to the Tresorverse Domain bloomed.","An entity that Old Man Eudemus and others had never been able to truly understand or grasp the true extent of his power.","At this moment, his gaze seemed to be crossing untold distances to see what was happening within the trunk of the Primaltree of Existence, his eyes filling up with ever increasing brilliance as he sighed.","\"Is this truly the right path, Omnifather?\"","...!","Words of doubt and longing at the same time.","This being wondered of such weavings as he rose up- intently gazing up and ready to move in case he needed to!"]},{"number":3400,"title":"Chapter 3400: Chapter 3399 Carnage! I","paragraphs":["Within the Megalos Ynnere, a being wondered whether the path he was on was the right one.","Around him, dozens of Omniverses rotated as the complexity required to keep them all miniaturized and in such a state was utterly unfathomable.","Even the strongest of entities with immeasurable complexity of existence experienced doubt, much less those who were weak.","It was general. It was unavoidable.","Across countless weavings.","Outside the scope of the vast Megalos Ynnere, Megalos Beyond, and even Megalos Nihilos.","Within a unique frequency of Existence.","Within an extremely unique Spoke of Existence!","Inside a region of the Expanse filled with a mixture of black and white strings.","There was a shadow of a woman who was sitting on a white string, her hands holding an Omniverse as she seemed utterly engrossed in it.","Her entire figure seemed to be made of a cluster of shadows that existed and didn't exist at the same time, her complexity being utterly frightening as it was not at the level of a Terrestrial Entity nor a Constellation Entity!","Even a Pioneer of Existence that stood above Existence Severing...was still a Constellation Entity.","Above that...was a Source Complexity.","Source!","The complexity of this entity could only be at this stage as, at this moment, another shadow flashed near her.","She didn't even turn towards it as she flipped the weavings of the Omniverse in her hands and asked lightly.","\"What is it now? At least tell me it is local.\"","Her voice was sweet and commanding at the same time, its intent firm and undeniable.","The other shadow was a man with an equally terrifying aura who spoke calmly.","\"Sadly not local. A mission of high priority in another Spoke of the Wheel.\"","\"Oh?\" The shadow of the woman frowned at such words as she looked up.","\"Yes. A few kids are planning on carrying out an action in a unique frequency of the Wheel. We just need to ensure it succeeds.\"","\"Oh? Any more details? Any reason why?\" Using the same word, the shadow of the woman replied again.","The shadow of the man was still calm as he paused at these questions momentarily before he replied.","\"The only details I was given are that a little Pioneer and two Existence Severing Constellations seek to impose the weavings of...THAT Spoke of the Wheel to ensnare a target. No details were given on who they are or why they are doing what they are doing. We just need to ensure they succeed. As for why...we do not question orders. We merely follow. You know this by now.\"","\"...\"","The shadow of the woman was briefly silent before it continued.","\"Who is the target that even deserves our attention to ensure they end up in that place?\"","A heavy question.","Yet the reply was heavier!","\"Mission parameters did not include their details either. Nor are we to probe the weavings of the target. Even those above us do not subjectively look at the identities of all those involved as we are supposed to stay away from any Entanglements. We are only supposed to ensure the weavings of the target are ensnared and pulled into that place, that is all. Barbatos...your position may be unique, but you are not above all of us. You cannot operate differently from us. Our job makes it so that we only do what we are told without tainting the Weavings of the Wheel. We only exist-\"","\"Yes, yes.\"","The shadow of the woman waved her hands dismissively.","Her shadowy figure was short and vibrant, her eyes sharp and filled with endless light as she continued with her interruption.","\"I know. We only exist to ensure the flow of the Wheel. I just...find it odd that we are supposed to never question. Who are they to say that supporting or denying a certain event in some frequency of the Wheel is what allows the smooth turning of the Wheel to continue? We move covertly to make sure our actions aren't observed by THEM, who also stand to watch and ensure the flow of the Wheel. So really...who is right, and who is wrong? Have you ever stopped to consider this, O Amalthos?\"","\"...\"","Her reply caused the other dark shadow, another Source Complexity entity, to frown before he replied!","\"Barbatos...your father sits among those who gaze across countless weavings and see which screws need to turn in order to keep the flow. If you question him, you can do so yourself. I remain here speaking to you because I was ordered to undertake this mission with you. Simply because I am supposed to be here at this moment, in this Weaving. Otherwise, I would not bother.\"","WAA!","His words were cold.","Barbatos put away the Omniverse in her hands and looked at him closely as she sighed.","\"Supposed to be here...you truly believe such a thing? The flow of the Wheel...\"","Her surroundings began to buzz.","As if she was about to say something truly dangerous and profane.","She wanted to say that since she was born, she felt like nobody could truly read the flow of the Wheel.","Nobody could really understand where and what was supposed to happen!","Those who tried to take control, like her father and others, and said what they did was all for the continued flow of the Wheel... may very well be in the wrong.","There were others who took an entirely different approach and simply monitored, preventing any other forces from interfering or jumping between different weavings of the Wheel!","At the end of the day, everybody believed themselves to be right.","As for her? Maybe even she was wrong.","\"Haa...never mind.\" She sighed once more as she rose up.","\"Lead the way. I merely exist to follow orders too, yes?\"","\"...\"","The other shadow, Amalthos, looked at her silently before terrifying power and complexity began to bubble around him.","Within the span of an instant, they disappeared right after.","Their disappearance wasn't just to another location, but towards another Spoke of the Wheel entirely!"]}]);
